{
  // ==============================================================================
  // CS2 Workshop Tools FGD 实体定义待翻译字典 (fgd_extracted.jsonc)
  // 自动从游戏原版 FGD 文件中提取的描述与显示文本
  // ==============================================================================
  //
  // 【译制提示】
  // - 格式为标准键值对: "英文原文": "中文译文"
  // - 未翻译项的值保持为空字符串 ""，翻译完成后可填入对应译文。
  // - 翻译完成后可直接合并至 fgd_translations.jsonc 中使用。
  // ==============================================================================

  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // 1. 实体类说明 (Entity Class Descriptions) (共 813 条)
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  "A navigation node for ground moving NPCs. Navigation nodes are baked into the nodegraph so that NPCs can move ": "供地面移动 NPC 使用的导航节点。导航节点会被烘焙进节点图，使 NPC 能够移动",
  "to them. Ground nodes fall to the ground when they spawn.": "到节点处。地面节点在生成后会落到地面上。",
  "A navigation node for ground moving NPCs that includes some context information for NPCs that are interested in it. The hint might ": "一种供地面移动 NPC 使用的导航节点，其中包含感兴趣的 NPC 可用的上下文信息。该提示",
  "indicate a window that could be looked out of, or an item of interest that could be commented on. Many hint nodes are NPC-specific, ": "可能指示一扇可以观察外面的窗口，或一个可以评论的感兴趣的物品。许多提示节点是特定于某种 NPC 的，",
  "so it's helpful to use naming conventions like 'Crow: Fly to point' in the hint choices list. The angles of a hint node indicate what direction ": "因此在提示选项列表中使用诸如 'Crow: Fly to point' 之类的命名约定会很有帮助。提示节点的角度指示了",
  "It's important to understand the distinction between scripts, such as scripted_sequence and scripted_schedule, and info_hint entities. Scripts summon ": "重要的是要理解脚本（如 scripted_sequence 和 scripted_schedule）与 info_hint 实体之间的区别。脚本会把",
  "NPCs to specific cue points to play their parts, while hints provide context information to the AI that they use to perform their ": "NPC 召唤到特定的提示点来演出它们的戏份，而提示则为 AI 提供上下文信息，供其用于执行",
  "behaviors. Hints require code support in the NPC, while scripts are generic and may require only animations to play. Use a hint if the behavior is driven ": "行为。提示需要 NPC 中的代码支持，而脚本是通用的，可能只需要播放动画即可。如果行为由",
  "by the AI, use a script if the behavior is driven by the map.": "AI 驱动，就使用提示；如果行为由地图驱动，就使用脚本。",
  "A navigation node for flying NPCs. Air navigation nodes are baked into the nodegraph so that NPCs can move ": "供飞行 NPC 使用的导航节点。空中导航节点会被烘焙进节点图，使 NPC 能够移动",
  "to them. Air nodes do not fall to the ground when they spawn.": "到节点处。空中节点在生成后不会落到地面上。",
  "A navigation node for flying NPCs that includes some context information for NPCs that are interested in it. The hint might ": "一种供飞行 NPC 使用的导航节点，其中包含感兴趣的 NPC 可用的上下文信息。该提示",
  "indicate a window that could be looked into, or an item of interest that could be commented on. Many hint nodes are NPC-specific, ": "可能指示一扇可以望进去的窗口，或一个可以评论的感兴趣的物品。许多提示节点是特定于某种 NPC 的，",
  "the NPC should face to perform the hint behavior.": "NPC 在执行提示行为时应当朝向的方向。",
  "A hint that is not used for navigation. They don't go into the nodegraph, nor do they fall to the ground. Use these to provide ": "一种不用于导航的提示。它们不会进入节点图，也不会落到地面。使用它们可以为",
  "some spatial context for NPCs, such as 'look here if you can't find the player' or 'throw rocks at this spot'.": "NPC 提供空间上下文，例如 '找不到玩家时看这里' 或 '朝这个位置扔石头'。",
  "An entity that controls all connections between nodes that intersect the controller's volume. ": "一种实体，用于控制与其体积相交的所有节点之间的连接。",
  "This allows for mass enabling/disabling of all node connections through a volume.": "这允许通过一个体积批量启用/禁用所有节点连接。",
  "This entity automatically severs node connections that pass through its radius. If it moves, it will restore those connections.": "此实体会自动切断穿过其半径的节点连接。如果它移动，则会恢复这些连接。",
  "A climb-node for AI navigation. Only usable by NPCs that can climb.": "供 AI 导航使用的攀爬节点。只有能够攀爬的 NPC 才能使用。",
  "NPC used to drive a target vehicle.": "用于驾驶目标载具的 NPC。",
  "NPC Spawn Destination. (Consult npc_template_maker help for more info)": "NPC 生成目的地。（更多信息请参阅 npc_template_maker 的帮助）",
  "Indicates items in the world that some NPCs may operate upon": "标记世界中某些 NPC 可能操作的物品",
  "NPC Maker": "NPC 生成器",
  "AI Relationship - Sets relationships between groups of NPCs in the AI.": "AI 关系 - 设置 AI 中各组 NPC 之间的关系。",
  "A goal used to make the target NPC lead the player to a location in the world. It will move ahead of the player, pausing if the player lags behind, and moving back to retrieve the player if necessary.<p>\n\t<img src='game:tools/images/hammer/ai_goal_lead_distances.png' />": "一种目标，用于让目标 NPC 带领玩家前往世界中的某个位置。它会走在玩家前面，如果玩家落后则暂停等待，必要时会返回接应玩家。<p>\n\t<img src='game:tools/images/hammer/ai_goal_lead_distances.png' />",
  "AI Goal Follow": "AI 目标：跟随",
  "AI Goal Injured Follow": "AI 目标：跟随受伤者",
  "Battle line": "战线",
  "AI Goal Act Busy": "AI 目标：忙碌表演",
  "AI Goal Act Busy Queue": "AI 目标：忙碌表演队列",
  "Change Hint Group": "更改提示组",
  "AI Script Conditions": "AI 脚本条件",
  "An entity that can be used to control the idle speech patterns of a set of NPCs.": "一种实体，可用于控制一组 NPC 的空闲语音模式。",
  "Manages a choreographed scene of one or more actors.": "管理一个或多个演员的编舞场景。",
  "Manages a list of logic_choreographed_scene entities. Store choreo scenes in them in order that they will be played by other inputs. Whenever a scene plays, the manager will remove all scenes before that one in the list. The name of another logic_scene_list_manager can be entered in a slot instead of an invididual scene, which will cause all scenes in that manager to be removed when a later scene in this list is played.": "管理 logic_choreographed_scene 实体的列表。按这些场景将被其他输入播放的顺序把它们存入其中。每当一个场景播放时，管理器会移除列表中位于该场景之前的所有场景。也可以在槽位中填入另一个 logic_scene_list_manager 的名称而非单个场景，这样当此列表中较后的场景播放时，该管理器中的所有场景都会被移除。",
  "This entity makes sounds or smells that can be sensed by NPCs, but not by the player. This can be used ": "此实体产生 NPC 能够感知到、但玩家无法感知到的声音或气味。这可用于",
  "to cause reactions in nearby NPCs.<br><br>": "引发附近 NPC 的反应。<br><br>",
  "<b>Event Types</b><br>": "<b>事件类型</b><br>",
  "- Combat: Will cause most NPCs to become alert<br>": "- 战斗：会使大多数 NPC 进入警戒状态<br>",
  "- Danger: Will cause most NPCs to move away from the position of the sound<br>": "- 危险：会使大多数 NPC 远离声音位置<br>",
  "- Bullet Impact<br>": "- 子弹撞击<br>",
  "- Thumper (HLX): causes antlions to run away briefly<br>": "- Thumper（HLX）：会使蚁狮短暂逃散<br>",
  "Puppet entity that mimics the animations of a target NPC.": "模仿目标 NPC 动画的木偶实体。",
  "Detects AI events at a point, and outputs the sound level as a value between 0 and 1. It only detects events that match the specified event type.": "在某一点检测 AI 事件，并将声音强度以 0 到 1 之间的值输出。它只检测与指定事件类型匹配的事件。",
  "AI Attached Item Manager - manages the items attached to one or more NPCs / ragdolls.": "AI 附挂物品管理器 - 管理挂在一个或多个 NPC / 布娃娃上的物品。",
  "A meshless model you can use as a speaker location for vcd's": "一个无网格模型，可用作 VCD 的说话者位置",
  "Bullseye": "靶标",
  "Scripted Target": "脚本化目标",
  "Grabs an NPC and makes them play a specified set of animations. The NPC can be told to move to the scripted sequence position or can ": "抓取一个 NPC 并使其播放一组指定的动画。可以指示 NPC 移动到脚本序列位置，也可以",
  "be told to play the script wherever they currently are. ": "指示其在当前位置直接播放脚本。",
  "Multiple scripted sequences of the same name (or sync group, if specified) will frame-synchronize in the action animation once all the actors have moved to position. ": "多个同名（或同一同步组，如果指定）的脚本序列会在所有演员就位后在动作动画中逐帧同步。",
  "This allows tight interaction between actors (one actor grabbing another, hitting them, etc.) The flow is as follows:<br><br>": "这允许演员之间紧密互动（一个演员抓住另一个、击打对方等）。流程如下：<br><br>",
  "1) Move to position using the specified movement animation. If 'Move to Position' is set to NONE, skip to step 2.<br>": "1) 使用指定的移动动画移动到位置。如果 'Move to Position' 设为 NONE，则跳到第 2 步。<br>",
  "2) If forced to wait for another actor to move to position, play the pre-action idle animation, otherwise skip to step 3. If there is no pre-action idle specified, ACT_IDLE is used.<br>": "2) 如果需要等待其他演员就位，则播放动作前的待机动画，否则跳到第 3 步。如果未指定动作前待机，则使用 ACT_IDLE。<br>",
  "3) Fire the OnBeginSequence output.<br>": "3) 触发 OnBeginSequence 输出。<br>",
  "4) Play the action animation. If no action animation is specified, skip to step 5.<br>": "4) 播放动作动画。如果未指定动作动画，则跳到第 5 步。<br>",
  "5) Play the post-action idle animation. If none is specified, skip to step 6. If the 'Loop in Post Idle' spawnflag is set, keep playing the post-action idle until the script is cancelled. If no post-action idle animation is specified, ACT_IDLE is used.<br>": "5) 播放动作后的待机动画。如果未指定，则跳到第 6 步。如果设置了 'Loop in Post Idle' 生成标记，则持续播放动作后的待机动画，直到脚本被取消。如果未指定动作后待机动画，则使用 ACT_IDLE。<br>",
  "6) Fire the OnEndSequence output.<br>": "6) 触发 OnEndSequence 输出。<br>",
  "7) If a next script to play is specified, hand the NPC to the next script and repeat this process for that script.<br><br>": "7) 如果指定了下一个要播放的脚本，则把 NPC 交给下一个脚本，并对该脚本重复此过程。<br><br>",
  "The MoveToPosition input runs steps 1 and 2, then waits while playing the pre-action idle animation until the BeginSequence input is received.<br><br>": "MoveToPosition 输入会执行第 1 步和第 2 步，然后播放动作前待机动画并等待，直到收到 BeginSequence 输入。<br><br>",
  "If the sequence has motion extraction in it, set the 'Don't Teleport NPC On End' spawnflag.": "如果序列中包含运动提取，请设置 'Don't Teleport NPC On End' 生成标记。",
  "Forces an NPC to idle (optionally at a specified location), allowing you to control what will interrupt it.": "强制 NPC 待机（可选择在指定位置），使你能够控制什么会打断它。",
  "Forces an NPC to move to a specified destination entity.": "强制 NPC 移动到指定的目标实体。",
  "Forces an NPC to perform an ability at a specified target.": "强制 NPC 对指定目标执行一项能力。",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Player Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪/玩家裁剪",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/NPC Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪/NPC 裁剪",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Nav Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪/导航裁剪",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Teleport Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪/传送裁剪",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Control Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪/控制裁剪",
  "Tool Brushes/Nodraw": "工具画刷/不绘制",
  "Tool Brushes/Skybox": "工具画刷/天空盒",
  "Tool Brushes/Trigger": "工具画刷/触发",
  "Tool Brushes/Block Light": "工具画刷/阻挡光线",
  "Tool Brushes/Lightmap Space": "工具画刷/光照贴图空间",
  "Tool Brushes/Vis Blocker": "工具画刷/可见性阻挡器",
  "Tool Brushes/Invisible": "工具画刷/不可见",
  "Tool Brushes/Ladder": "工具画刷/梯子",
  "Tool Brushes/Markup Volume AI": "工具画刷/标记体积 AI",
  "Tool Brushes/Skip": "工具画刷/跳过",
  "Tool Brushes/Occluder": "工具画刷/遮挡体",
  "Tool Brushes/Precipitation": "工具画刷/降水",
  "Tool Brushes/Block LOS": "工具画刷/阻挡视线",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Bullets": "工具画刷/裁剪/子弹",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Nav Space Clip": "工具画刷/裁剪/导航空间裁剪",
  "Lighting": "光照",
  "Sound": "声音",
  "Logic": "逻辑",
  "Filter": "筛选器",
  "Info": "信息",
  "AI": "AI",
  "NPC": "NPC",
  "Choreo": "编舞",
  "Trigger": "触发",
  "Particles": "粒子",
  "Physics": "物理",
  "Overlay": "覆盖层",
  "An entity to control a global game state, with an optional associated counter, that persists across level transitions.": "一种实体，用于控制全局游戏状态，可带一个关联计数器，并在关卡切换时保留。",
  "Universal ambient sound. Use it to play and control a single sound.": "通用环境音效。用它来播放和控制单个声音。",
  "Plays a sound event from a point. The point can be this entity or a specified entity's position.": "从某个点播放声音事件。该点可以是此实体或指定实体的位置。",
  "Plays a sound event from the closest point on a sphere to the player. The origin can be this entity or a specified entity's position.": "从球体上距玩家最近的点播放声音事件。原点可以是此实体或指定实体的位置。",
  "Plays a sound event from a point, passes along the min and max positions of its AABB. The point can be this entity or a specified entity's position.": "从某个点播放声音事件，并传递其 AABB 的最小和最大位置。该点可以是此实体或指定实体的位置。",
  "Plays a sound event from a point closest to the player on the box.": "从长方体上距玩家最近的点播放声音事件。",
  "Plays some number of soundevents (up to max) along segments of a path corner network": "沿路径拐角网络的各段播放若干（最多 max 个）声音事件",
  "Set a public parameter of a playing soundevent.": "设置正在播放的声音事件的公共参数。",
  "Sets an opvar value on a library stack": "在库堆栈上设置 opvar 值",
  "Analyzes a mostly enclosed space and defines walls and doorways within that space. Sets an opvar value on a library stack based on distance from the doorways": "分析一个基本封闭的空间，并定义其中的墙壁和门口。根据与门口的距离在库堆栈上设置 opvar 值",
  "Creates a spherical Sound Area": "创建一个球形声音区域",
  "Creates a box Sound Area": "创建一个盒状声音区域",
  "An entity that allows you to change the textures on other brush-built entities.": "一种实体，可用于更改其他画刷构建实体的纹理。",
  "An entity that creates a splash effect at its origin. If the 'find water surface' spawnflag is set, it will instead trace down below itself to find the water surface on which to create splashes.": "一种在其原点产生溅水效果的实体。如果设置了 'find water surface' 生成标记，它会改为向下追踪以找到水面，并在水面上产生溅水。",
  "An entity that controls the HDR tonemapping for the player. Think of it as a method of controlling the exposure of the player's eyes.": "一种控制玩家 HDR 色调映射的实体。可以把它当作控制玩家眼睛曝光度的方法。",
  "An entity to control the number of ragdolls in the world, for performance reasons.": "一种用于控制世界中布娃娃数量的实体，目的是提升性能。",
  "An entity to control the number of gibs in the world, for performance reasons.": "一种用于控制世界中碎块数量的实体，目的是提升性能。",
  "An entity that spits out a constant stream of smoke. See particlezoo.vmf for sample usage. You can place up to two env_particlelight entities near the smoke stack to add ambient light to its particles.": "一种持续吐出烟雾的实体。示例用法参见 particlezoo.vmf。你可以在烟囱附近放置最多两个 env_particlelight 实体，为其粒子添加环境光。",
  "An entity that controls screen fades.": "一种控制屏幕淡入淡出的实体。",
  "Changes tonemap controllers for players touching the trigger.": "为接触触发器的玩家更改色调映射控制器。",
  "A Half-Life 2 ladder. Handles player auto mount/unmount, as well as +use to get onto the ladder.<br><br>": "半条命2 式梯子。处理玩家的自动上/下梯，以及用 +use 爬上梯子。<br><br>",
  "See also 'info_ladder_dismount', used to specify ladder auto-dismount points.<br><br>": "另请参阅 'info_ladder_dismount'，用于指定梯子自动下梯点。<br><br>",
  "<b>Note:</b> This entity is non-functional in Counter-Strike: Source. Use func_ladder instead.": "<b>注意：</b>此实体在 Counter-Strike: Source 中不可用。请改用 func_ladder。",
  "An entity to handle endpoints for multiple ladders that are too close to each other.": "一种实体，用于处理彼此距离过近的多部梯子的端点。",
  "Legacy support. Use func_brush instead.": "旧版兼容。请改用 func_brush。",
  "A brush entity that is conditionally solid based on the interaction layer specified.": "一种画刷实体，根据指定的交互层有条件地变为实心。",
  "An brush built entity with various features.": "一种画刷构建的实体，具有多种功能。",
  "Slideshow Display": "幻灯片显示屏",
  "Movie Display": "视频显示屏",
  "An entity that creates a visible beam between two points. The points can be attached to entities to make the beam move around.": "一种在两点之间创建可见光束的实体。这些点可以附着到实体上，使光束随之移动。",
  "HL1 Legacy: Beverage Dispenser.": "HL1 旧版：饮料售卖机。",
  "An entity used to spawn blood effects.": "一种用于生成血液特效的实体。",
  "An entity that creates an explosion at its origin.": "一种在其原点产生爆炸的实体。",
  "An entity that creates a smoke trail.": "一种产生烟雾尾迹的实体。",
  "An entity that creates an explosion at its origin. If the no-damage spawnflag is set, the explosion won't be visible, but will apply force to any physics objects within its radius.": "一种在其原点产生爆炸的实体。如果设置了 no-damage 生成标记，爆炸将不可见，但会对其半径内的物理物体施加作用力。",
  "An entity that will cause a physics impact on another entity.": "一种会对另一个实体造成物理冲击的实体。",
  "An entity that handles a single flame at its origin. The flame causes heat 'damage' to other env_fire entities around it, and will eventually ignite non-flaming env_fire entities nearby, causing the fire to spread.": "一种在其原点处理单团火焰的实体。火焰会对周围其他 env_fire 实体造成热量 '伤害'，并最终点燃附近未燃烧的 env_fire 实体，导致火势蔓延。",
  "An entity that provides heat to all nearby env_fire entities. Cannot be extinguished.": "一种为附近所有 env_fire 实体提供热量的实体。无法被扑灭。",
  "An entity that detects changes in heat nearby.": "一种检测附近热量变化的实体。",
  "An entity that catches a target entity on fire. If the entity is an animating model, it will have sprite flames attached to its skeleton. Otherwise the entity will emit particle flame puffs.": "一种点燃目标实体的实体。如果该实体是动画模型，其骨架上将附着精灵火焰；否则该实体会喷出粒子火焰团。",
  "An entity that controls the fog and view distance in the map.": "一种控制地图中雾效和视距的实体。",
  "An entity that controls the postprocess settings in the map.": "一种控制地图中后处理设置的实体。",
  "An entity that creates a laser beam between itself and a given target.": "一种在自身与给定目标之间创建激光束的实体。",
  "An entity that draws a text message on player's HUDs.": "一种在玩家 HUD 上绘制文本消息的实体。",
  "An entity to control screen shake on players.": "一种控制玩家屏幕震动的实体。",
  "An entity to control screen tilt on players.": "一种控制玩家屏幕倾斜的实体。",
  "Causes a view punch on players.": "使玩家产生视角后坐。",
  "Creates rotorwash.": "产生旋翼气流。",
  "An entity that shoots out gibs. Style of body part depends on language type.": "一种喷射碎块的实体。身体部位的样式取决于语言类型。",
  "An entity that shoots models, or sprites, out of its origin.": "一种从其原点射出模型或精灵的实体。",
  "An entity that creates gibs when it's within the influence of a helicopter's rotor wash.": "一种在处于直升机旋翼气流影响范围内时产生碎块的实体。",
  "An entity that acts like a soundscape but gets all of its sound parameters from another env_soundscape entity.": "一种表现类似声音景观（soundscape）、但从另一个 env_soundscape 实体获取所有声音参数的实体。",
  "An entity to control sound in an area. The active soundscape at any time is the last one that had line-of-sight to the player, and was within the radius.": "一种控制区域内声音的实体。任一时刻生效的声音景观是最后一个与玩家有视线连接且位于半径内的声音景观。",
  "An entity that works like env_soundscape except that it works in conjunction with trigger_soundscape to determine when a player hears it.": "一种工作方式类似 env_soundscape 的实体，不同之处在于它需要与 trigger_soundscape 配合来确定玩家何时听到它。",
  "An entity used to create sparks at its origin.": "一种在其原点产生火花的实体。",
  "An entity that controls the drawing of a sprite in the world.": "一种控制世界中精灵绘制的实体。",
  "A env_sprite that allows orientation.": "一种支持定向的 env_sprite。",
  "An entity to control wind in the map.": "一种控制地图中风效的实体。",
  "An entity used to control the 3D Skybox. Its origin is used to determine the 3D Skybox's position relative to the map. Place this entity, in the 3D Skybox, at the point where the origin of the map should be.": "一种用于控制 3D 天空盒的实体。其原点用于确定 3D 天空盒相对于地图的位置。请将此实体放置在 3D 天空盒中地图原点应处的位置上。",
  "An entity used to limit the number of a particular weapon type in the world. Useful in places where NPCs are spawning rapidly, dying, and dropping weapons.": "一种用于限制世界中特定武器类型数量的实体。在 NPC 快速生成、死亡并掉落武器的地方很有用。",
  "An entity that gives equipment to the player who activates it. To use, add new keys to this entity, where each key is the classname of a weapon/item, and the corresponding value is the number of those weapons/items to give to the player who uses this entity. If the 'Use Only' spawnflag isn't set, then players can just touch this entity to get the equipment.": "一种向激活它的玩家发放装备的实体。使用方法是为此实体添加新键值：每个键为一件武器/物品的类名，对应的值为向使用此实体的玩家发放的该武器/物品数量。如果未设置 'Use Only' 生成标记，玩家只需触碰此实体即可获得装备。",
  "An entity that displays text on player's screens.": "一种在玩家屏幕上显示文本的实体。",
  "An entity used to move a motion-disabled prop when it enables motion. Parent this entity to the prop, and when the prop has its motion enabled, it will immediately teleport to the origin of this entity.": "一种实体，用于在禁用运动的模型启用运动时移动它。将此实体设为该模型的父级，当该模型启用运动时，它会立即传送到此实体的原点。",
  "An entity that displays a text message in the world, at its origin.": "一种在世界中（位于其原点处）显示文本消息的实体。",
  "An entity that issues commands to the client console, as if it was typed in by the player (if activator is a player, or the local player in single player).": "一种向客户端控制台发出命令的实体，就像由玩家亲手输入一样（当激活者为玩家，或单人游戏中的本地玩家时）。",
  "An entity that issues commands to the server console.": "一种向服务器控制台发出命令的实体。",
  "An entity that issues commands to each valid client's console, as if it was typed in by that player locally.": "一种向每个有效客户端的控制台发出命令的实体，就像由该玩家本地输入一样。",
  "An entity that will find an entity and pass it along as the !Caller with the OutEntity output.  Requires using !Caller as the parameter on the input.": "一种查找实体并通过 OutEntity 输出将其作为 !Caller 传递的实体。需要在输入的参数中使用 !Caller。",
  "An entity used to count the number of players within a zone.": "一种用于统计某个区域内玩家数量的实体。",
  "This entity indicates the position and facing direction at which the player will spawn. Any number of ": "此实体标示玩家将生成的位置和朝向。地图中可以放置任意数量的",
  "info_player_start entities may be placed in a map for when working in cordoned-off portions of the map. ": "info_player_start 实体，以便在地图被屏蔽区分隔的部分中工作时使用。",
  "When multiple info_player_start entities are present in a map, set the 'Master' spawnflag on one of them ": "当地图中存在多个 info_player_start 实体时，在其中一个上设置 'Master' 生成标记，",
  "to indicate which one should be used when running the entire map.": "以指明运行整张地图时应使用哪一个。",
  "An entity that defines an intermission spot where dead players will float until they respawn.": "一种定义中场休息点的实体，死亡的玩家将漂浮在那里直到重生。",
  "An entity that acts as a local coordinate frame for transitions to another level. There should be a corresponding info_landmark entity in the next map. ": "一种实体，作为切换到另一关卡时的局部坐标系。下一张地图中应有对应的 info_landmark 实体。",
  "Entities will transition to the next level at the same relative offset from the info_landmark entity.<br><br>": "实体会以相对于 info_landmark 实体相同的偏移量切换到下一关卡。<br><br>",
  "Note that only entities in same the PVS as the info_landmark are considered for transitioning, so it should generally be placed inside the transition space.": "注意，只有与 info_landmark 位于同一 PVS 中的实体才会被考虑进行切换，因此它通常应放置在切换空间内。",
  "Logical entity that starts async loading or unloading a level.": "开始异步加载或卸载关卡的逻辑实体。",
  "An entity that's immediately removed on spawning. Useful as a spotlight target.": "一种在生成后立即被移除的实体。适合作聚光灯目标。",
  "An entity that does nothing. Very useful as a positioning entity for other entities to refer to (i.e. the endpoint of an env_beam)": "一种不做任何事情的实体。非常适合作为供其他实体参照的定位实体（例如 env_beam 的端点）",
  "An entity that does nothing. Not networked.": "一种不做任何事情的实体。不进行网络同步。",
  "An entity that is a target for particle system control points": "一种作为粒子系统控制点目标的实体",
  "An entity that spawns a particle system built using the particle editor.": "一种生成用粒子编辑器构建的粒子系统的实体。",
  "An entity that acts like a magnet for ragdolls. Useful for crafting exaggerated ragdoll behavior (i.e. guys falling over rails on death). If the ": "一种表现类似磁铁、可吸引布娃娃的实体。适用于制作夸张的布娃娃行为（例如角色死亡时翻过栏杆）。如果",
  "Bar Magnet spawnflag is set, the magnet works like it was a cylindrical magnet i.e. it attracts ragdolls to the nearest point on a line.": "设置了 Bar Magnet 生成标记，磁铁的工作方式就如同圆柱形磁铁，即把布娃娃吸引到一条线上最近的点。",
  "An entity that can be used to change the lighting origin of a prop_static. Set the prop_static's Lighting Origin to point at this entity to ": "一种可用于更改 prop_static 光照原点的实体。将 prop_static 的 Lighting Origin 指向此实体，",
  "make the prop_static light as if it was at the info_lighting's origin. Good for prop_static entities that are embedded in world geometry (like rocks/windows/etc).": "即可使 prop_static 在 info_lighting 的原点处接受光照。适用于嵌入世界几何体（如岩石/窗户等）中的 prop_static 实体。",
  "An entity that does nothing itself, but can be used to specify the destination for a trigger_teleport entity. An info_target can be used instead.": "一种自身不做任何事情、但可用于指定 trigger_teleport 实体目的地的实体。也可以改用 info_target。",
  "An invisible lightsource that changes in some way over time.": "一种随时间以某种方式变化的不可见光源。",
  "An entity to control the color correction in the map.": "一种控制地图中颜色校正的实体。",
  "A brush entity that moves linearly along a given distance, in a given direction.": "一种沿给定方向、按给定距离做直线移动的画刷实体。",
  "A rotating brush entity.": "一种旋转的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity that moves vertically, and can rotate while doing so.": "一种垂直移动、且可在移动过程中旋转的画刷实体。",
  "Animation KeyFrame": "动画关键帧",
  "Keyframed Move Behavior": "关键帧移动行为",
  "Track Move Behavior": "轨道移动行为",
  "A node entity that marks a point in a rope. The first node in the rope should be a move_rope, followed by 1 or more keyframe_ropes.": "一种在绳索上标记某个点的节点实体。绳索的第一个节点应为 move_rope，其后跟 1 个或多个 keyframe_rope。",
  "The first node in set of nodes that are used to place ropes in the world. It should connect to 1 or more keyframe_rope entities.": "一组用于在世界中放置绳索的节点中的第一个节点。它应连接到 1 个或多个 keyframe_rope 实体。",
  "A brush entity that's designed to be used for a player-useable button. When used by the player, it moves to a pressed position.": "一种设计为供玩家使用的按钮的画刷实体。被玩家使用时，它会移动到按下位置。",
  "A brush entity that's designed to be used for a rotating player-useable button. When used by the player, it rotates to a pressed position.": "一种设计为供玩家使用的旋转按钮的画刷实体。被玩家使用时，它会旋转到按下位置。",
  "A brush entity that's designed to be used for rotating wheels, where the player can rotate them to arbitrary positions before stopping.": "一种设计为旋转轮盘的画刷实体，玩家可将其旋转到任意位置后停下。",
  "A brush entity for use as a player-useable door.": "一种用作玩家可用门的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity for use as a rotating player-useable door.": "一种用作旋转式玩家可用门的画刷实体。",
  "An entity that has special animation events that can be fired by a model with an animation inside its .qc designed for": "一种具有特殊动画事件的实体，这些事件可由模型的 .qc 中专为",
  "use by this entity.": "此实体设计的动画触发。",
  "Logic Auto": "逻辑自动",
  "Fire an output on map spawn": "在地图生成时触发一个输出",
  "Fires outputs when a map spawns. ": "在地图生成时触发输出。",
  "If 'Remove on fire' flag is set the logic_auto is deleted after firing. ": "如果设置了 'Remove on fire' 标记，logic_auto 会在触发后被删除。",
  "It can be set to check a global state before firing. This allows you to only fire events based on ": "它可以设置为在触发前检查全局状态。这使你可以只根据",
  "what took place in a previous map.": "上一张地图中发生的情况来触发事件。",
  "Compares an input value to another value. ": "将一个输入值与另一个值进行比较。",
  "If the input value is less than the compare value, the OnLessThan output is fired with the input value. ": "如果输入值小于比较值，则携带输入值触发 OnLessThan 输出。",
  "If the input value is equal to the compare value, the OnEqualTo output is fired with the input value. ": "如果输入值等于比较值，则携带输入值触发 OnEqualTo 输出。",
  "If the input value is greater than the compare value, the OnGreaterThan output is fired with the input value.": "如果输入值大于比较值，则携带输入值触发 OnGreaterThan 输出。",
  "Logic Branch": "逻辑分支",
  "Tests a boolean value and fires an output based on whether the value is true or false. ": "测试一个布尔值，并根据该值为真还是假触发输出。",
  "Use this entity to branch between two potential sets of events.": "使用此实体可在两组可能的事件之间进行分支。",
  "Contains a list of logic_branch entities and fires outputs when the state of any of the logic_branches changes.<br><br>": "包含一个 logic_branch 实体列表，并在任意 logic_branch 状态变化时触发输出。<br><br>",
  "This entity is used to fire an event when a set of conditions are all satisfied.": "此实体用于在一组条件全部满足时触发一个事件。",
  "Logic Case": "逻辑分支选择",
  "Compares an input to up to 32 preset values. If the input value is the same as ": "将输入与最多 32 个预设值进行比较。如果输入值与",
  "any of the preset values, an output corresponding to that value is fired.<br><br>": "任一预设值相同，则触发与该值对应的输出。<br><br>",
  "For example: if Case01 is set to 2 and Case02 is set to 5, and the input value is 5, ": "例如：如果 Case01 设为 2、Case02 设为 5，而输入值为 5，",
  "the OnCase02 output will be fired.<br><br>": "则会触发 OnCase02 输出。<br><br>",
  "This entity can also be used to select from a number of random targets via the ": "此实体还可通过",
  "PickRandom input. One of the OnCase outputs that is connected to another entity will ": "PickRandom 输入用于从多个随机目标中进行选择。一个已连接到其他实体的 OnCase 输出",
  "be picked at random and fired.": "将被随机选取并触发。",
  "Compares a set of inputs to each other. If they are all the same, fires an OnEqual output. ": "将一组输入相互比较。如果它们全部相同，则触发 OnEqual 输出。",
  "If any are different, fires the OnNotEqual output.": "如果有任何不同，则触发 OnNotEqual 输出。",
  "Fires an activity event of the specified type. ": "触发指定类型的活动事件。",
  "Primarily a pulse interface for examining game_state. ": "主要用于检查 game_state 的脉冲接口。",
  "Does calculations based on the number of a specified type of NPC in a specified region.": "根据指定区域内指定类型 NPC 的数量进行计算。",
  "An entity that acts as a container for scripts": "一种用作脚本容器的实体",
  "Logic Relay": "逻辑中继器",
  "Forwards events to other entities": "将事件转发给其他实体",
  "A message forwarder. Fires an OnTrigger output when triggered, and ": "一个消息转发器。被触发时触发 OnTrigger 输出，",
  "can be disabled to prevent forwarding outputs.<br><br>": "并且可以被禁用以阻止转发输出。<br><br>",
  "Useful as an intermediary between one entity and another for turning ": "适合作一个实体与另一个实体之间的中转，用于开启",
  "on or off an I/O connection, or as a container for holding a set of ": "或关闭某条 I/O 连接，或用作容纳一组",
  "outputs that can be triggered from multiple places.": "可从多个位置触发的输出的容器。",
  "Logic Timer": "逻辑计时器",
  "Fire an event on a timer": "按计时器触发事件",
  "An entity that fires a timer event at regular, or random, intervals. It can also be set to oscillate between": "一种以固定或随机间隔触发计时事件的实体。它还可以设置为在",
  "a high and low end, in which case it will fire alternating high/low outputs each time it fires.": "高端与低端之间振荡，此时它每次触发都会交替触发高/低输出。",
  "Specifies entities that are to be ignored by the hammer_update_safe_entities console command. ": "指定要被 hammer_update_safe_entities 控制台命令忽略的实体。",
  "Enter the targetnames of entities that you want to exclude into the list of fields here. ": "将要排除的实体的 targetname 输入此处的字段列表中。",
  "Several of these may exist in a map.": "地图中可以存在多个此类实体。",
  "An entity that can be used to enables/disable vphysics collisions between two target entities.": "一种可用于启用/禁用两个目标实体之间 vphysics 碰撞的实体。",
  "An entity that remaps a range of input values to a given range of output values.": "一种将输入值范围重新映射到给定输出值范围的实体。",
  "Used to create a blend between two colors for controlling the color of another entity.": "用于在两种颜色之间创建混合，以控制另一个实体的颜色。",
  "Math Counter": "数学计数器",
  "Store a numeric value and perform arithmetic operations on it": "存储数值并对其执行算术运算",
  "Holds a numeric value and performs arithmetic operations upon it. If either the minimum or maximum ": "保存一个数值并对其执行算术运算。如果最小或最大",
  "legal value is nonzero, OutValue will be clamped to the legal range, and the OnHitMin/OnHitMax ": "合法值中任一为非零，OutValue 将被限制在合法范围内，且 OnHitMin/OnHitMax",
  "outputs will be fired at the appropriate times. If both min and max are set to zero, no clamping is ": "输出会在适当时机触发。如果最小值和最大值都设为零，则不进行限制，",
  "performed and only the OutValue output will be fired.": "仅触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "An entity that calculates and outputs a vector from one entity to another.": "一种计算并输出从一个实体到另一个实体的向量的实体。",
  "An entity that is used to set navigation properties on other entities. Useful to make NPCs ignore physics props in their way that they can easily push.": "一种用于在其他实体上设置导航属性的实体。适用于让 NPC 忽略挡路但它们可以轻松推动的物理模型。",
  "An entity that is used to force an autosave.": "一种用于强制自动存档的实体。",
  "An entity that is used to look for opportunities to autosave.": "一种用于寻找自动存档时机的实体。",
  "Spawns the specified entity template at its origin. If set to auto-spawn, it will spawn the template whenever there's room and the player ": "在其原点处生成指定的实体模板。如果设置为自动生成，只要空间足够且玩家",
  "is looking elsewhere.": "看向别处，它就会生成该模板。",
  "A filter that tests the activator against multiple filters. This allows you to build more complex filters, such as": "一种针对激活者测试多个筛选器的筛选器。这使你可以构建更复杂的筛选器，例如",
  "'Allow anyone on Team 1 who is also class engineer', or 'Allow everyone except classes npc_zombie and npc_headcrab'.": "'允许 1 队中职业为工程师的任何人'，或 '允许除 npc_zombie 和 npc_headcrab 类以外的所有人'。",
  "A filter that filters by the name of the activator.": "按激活者名称进行筛选的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters by the model of the activator.": "按激活者的模型进行筛选的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters by a context on the activator.": "按激活者的上下文进行筛选的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters by the class name of the activator.": "按激活者的类名进行筛选的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters by the mass of the activator.": "按激活者的质量进行筛选的筛选器。",
  "A damage filter that filters by the type of damage inflicted. This can only be used as a damage filter, not as an activator filter.": "按造成的伤害类型进行筛选的伤害筛选器。这只能用作伤害筛选器，不能用作激活者筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters a potential enemy entity by a set of criteria.": "按一组条件筛选潜在敌人实体的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters a potential entity by proximity from the origin of the filter.": "按与筛选器原点的距离筛选潜在实体的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters a potential entity by line of sight from the origin of the filter.": "按与筛选器原点的视线筛选潜在实体的筛选器。",
  "A filter that filters entities by active modifiers applied to them": "按应用于实体的活动修改器筛选实体的筛选器",
  "An entity that detects if another entity points in a given direction for a period of time.": "一种检测另一个实体是否在一段时间内指向给定方向的实体。",
  "An entity that detects if another entity's angular velocity meets or exceeds a threshold value.": "一种检测另一个实体的角速度是否达到或超过阈值的实体。",
  "An entity that detects and outputs an entity's velocity.": "一种检测并输出实体速度的实体。",
  "An entity that detects another entity's proximity to a target position.": "一种检测另一个实体与目标位置接近程度的实体。",
  "An entity that teleports a target entity to this position and angles. ": "一种将目标实体传送到此位置和角度的实体。",
  "If 'Teleport Home' spawn flag is set, teleports the target entity to its spawn position instead.": "如果设置了 'Teleport Home' 生成标记，则会将目标实体传送回其生成位置。",
  "If object is physically simulated, simulation is turned off when teleported.": "如果物体受物理模拟，传送时将关闭其模拟。",
  "An entity that does damage to all entities in a radius around itself, with a specified delay.": "一种在自身周围一定半径内对所有实体造成伤害的实体，可带指定延迟。",
  "If 'Target Entity' is specified, the damage is only done to that entity.": "如果指定了 'Target Entity'，则只对该实体造成伤害。",
  "A brush entity that's physically simulated.": "一种受物理模拟的画刷实体。",
  "A controller that tries to keep an entity facing a particular direction.": "一种尝试保持实体朝向特定方向的控制器。",
  "An entity used to attach constraints to a local position on an entity. Usually constraints will attach to the center of mass of an object. ": "一种用于将约束附加到实体局部位置的实体。通常约束会附加到物体质心。",
  "Attach the desired constraint to this entity, and then parent this entity to the entity you want the constraint to apply to.": "将所需约束附加到此实体，然后将此实体设为希望约束作用于的实体的父级。",
  "A physically simulated spring. ": "一种受物理模拟的弹簧。",
  "'Length' is what's known as the 'natural spring length'. This is how long the spring would ": "'Length' 就是所谓的 '弹簧自然长度'，即弹簧在",
  "be if it was at rest (nothing hanging on it or attached). When you attach something to the ": "静止（没有悬挂或连接任何东西）时的长度。当你把东西连接到",
  "spring, it will stretch longer than its 'natural length'. The amount of stretch is ": "弹簧上时，它会被拉伸得比 '自然长度' 更长。拉伸量",
  "determined by the 'Sprint Frequency'. The larger the spring frequency the less stretch the spring.": "由 '弹簧频率' 决定。弹簧频率越大，弹簧拉伸越小。",
  "A physically simulated hinge. Use the helper to define the axis of rotation.": "一种受物理模拟的铰链。使用辅助工具定义旋转轴。",
  "A constraint that keeps the position of two objects fixed, relative to the constraint's origin. You can optionally specify limits for the relative twist and swing rotation.": "一种使两个物体的位置相对约束原点保持固定的约束。你可以选择为相对扭转和摆动旋转指定限制。",
  "Constrain an entity to the world or another entity at a fixed relative position.": "以固定相对位置将一个实体约束到世界或另一个实体。",
  "A constraint that is essentially two length constraints and two points. Imagine it as a virtual rope connected to two objects, each suspended from a pulley above them.": "一种本质上由两个长度约束和两个点组成的约束。可以把它想象成一根连接两个物体的虚拟绳索，每个物体悬挂在它们上方的滑轮上。",
  "The constraint keeps the sum of the distances between the pulley points and their suspended objects constant.": "该约束保持滑轮点与其悬挂物体之间的距离之和恒定。",
  "A constraint that constrains an entity along a line segment.": "一种沿一条线段约束实体的约束。",
  "A constraint that preserves the distance between two entities. If the 'Keep Rigid' flag is set, think of it as a rod. If not, think off it as a virtual rope.": "一种保持两个实体之间距离的约束。如果设置了 'Keep Rigid' 标记，可以把它想象成一根杆；否则想象成一根虚拟绳索。",
  "A constraint that fixes the position of two entities, relative to this constraint's origin. Also allows for limits on the rotation around each axis, in the space of this constraint.": "一种使两个实体的位置相对此约束原点固定的约束。还允许在此约束空间中限制绕每个轴的旋转。",
  "A configurable constraint between two objects.": "两个物体之间可配置的约束。",
  "Constrain an entity to a spline.": "将实体约束到样条曲线。",
  "An entity used to apply constant acceleration to a physics object. ": "一种用于对物理物体施加恒定加速度的实体。",
  "The force and torque is calculated using the position and direction of the thruster as an impulse. So moving those off the object's center ": "力和扭矩以推进器的位置和方向作为冲量来计算。因此把它们移离物体中心",
  "will cause torque as well. Torque can be removed by unchecking the 'apply torque' flag. The position of the thruster can be forced to be ": "也会产生扭矩。取消勾选 'apply torque' 标记可移除扭矩。勾选 'ignore pos' 标记可强制",
  "at the object's center by checking to 'ignore pos' flag.": "推进器位于物体中心。",
  "An angular thruster. Use it to apply angular force to an entity.": "一种角推进器。用它对实体施加角向力。",
  "An entity that tries to spin a target entity at a particular speed.": "一种尝试以特定速度旋转目标实体的实体。",
  "An entity that acts like a magnet, attaching metallic physics objects to itself when they touch it.": "一种表现类似磁铁的实体，接触它的金属物理物体会被吸附到它上面。",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage.<br>": "一种可放入层级结构并可播放动画的模型。它还可以配置为在受到足够伤害时破碎。<br>",
  "prop_dynamic_override is a prototyping entity only. It will allow the use of models designed to be used as prop_physics.": "prop_dynamic_override 仅用于原型制作。它允许使用原本设计为 prop_physics 的模型。",
  "A prop that physically simulates as a single rigid body. It can be constrained to other physics objects using hinges ": "一种作为单个刚体进行物理模拟的模型。可以使用铰链",
  "or other constraints. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage. Health can be overridden on this version.": "或其他约束将其约束到其他物理物体。它还可以配置为在受到足够伤害时破碎。此版本可以覆盖生命值。",
  "Physics Prop": "物理模型",
  "Adds a physically simulated model that is affected by gravity and other forces": "添加一个受重力和其他作用力影响的物理模拟模型",
  "This class is the same as prop_physics, except the runtime collisions use a more bouncy method that avoids ": "此类与 prop_physics 相同，但其运行时碰撞使用一种更有弹性的方法，可避免",
  "the prediction errors normal physics objects get.": "普通物理物体常出现的预测错误。",
  "A prop that physically simulates and can be articulated with internal joints. The joint constraints are part of the physics model.": "一种进行物理模拟并可通过内部关节活动的模型。关节约束是物理模型的一部分。",
  "A way to attach one model to another as an ornament. It will render in the way that player/NPC weapons render.": "一种将一个模型作为饰品附着到另一个模型上的方式。其渲染方式与玩家/NPC 武器的渲染方式相同。",
  "A brush entity that can be broken from damage, or an input.": "一种可因伤害或输入而破碎的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity that creates precipitation inside its volume.": "一种在其体积内产生降水的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity that prevents rain and snow inside its volume.": "一种阻止其体积内降雨和降雪的画刷实体。",
  "A Hammer-only brush entity that prevents detail sprites from being placed inside its volume.": "一种仅限 Hammer 使用的画刷实体，可防止细节精灵被放置在其体积内。",
  "A brush entity that can be toggled on/off. When off, the brush will be non-solid and invisible. Does not cast lightmap shadows.": "一种可切换开/关的画刷实体。关闭时，画刷将变为非实体且不可见。不投射光照贴图阴影。",
  "This is a moving target that moves along a path of path_tracks. It can be shot and killed.": "一种沿 path_track 路径移动的活动靶标。它可以被射击并杀死。",
  "Creates a school of interactive fish that swim near this entity.": "创建一群在此实体附近游动的互动鱼。",
  "An entity that works as a rotating/moving platform that will carry a train to a new track. ": "一种作为旋转/移动平台工作的实体，可将列车运送到新轨道上。",
  "It must be larger in X-Y planar area than the train, since it must contain the train within ": "它在 X-Y 平面区域上必须比列车更大，因为必须在这些尺寸内容纳列车，",
  "these dimensions in order to operate when the train is near it.": "才能在列车靠近时正常运作。",
  "A moving platform that the player can ride. It follows a path of path_track entities.<br>": "一种可供玩家乘坐的移动平台。它沿 path_track 实体路径行进。<br>",
  "NOTE: Build your train so that the front of the train is facing down the X axis. ": "注意：构建列车时应使列车前端朝向 X 轴正方向。",
  "When it spawns it will automatically rotate to face the next path_track on the path.": "生成时它会自动旋转以面向路径上的下一个 path_track。",
  "A moving train that follows a path of path_track entities, shoots at the player, and can be killed.<br>": "一种沿 path_track 实体路径行进、会向玩家射击且可以被击杀的活动列车。<br>",
  "When used by the player, this entity overrides the player's controls to let them drive a train.": "被玩家使用时，此实体会接管玩家的控制，让玩家驾驶列车。",
  "An entity that changes the target of a tanktrain_ai entity.": "一种更改 tanktrain_ai 实体目标的实体。",
  "Train chase AI": "列车追逐 AI",
  "An entity used to build paths for other entities to follow. Each path_track is a node on the path, each holding the name of the next path_track in the path.": "一种用于构建供其他实体跟随的路径的实体。每个 path_track 都是路径上的一个节点，各自保存路径中下一个 path_track 的名称。",
  "A debugging tool for testing tracelines.": "用于测试追踪线的调试工具。",
  "A trigger volume that autosaves when the player touches it.": "玩家触碰时自动存档的触发体积。",
  "An entity that triggers a level change.<br><br>": "一种触发关卡切换的实体。<br><br>",
  "Place an info_landmark in both maps in the PVS of the transition region that marks the 'same' location in each map.<br><br>": "在两张地图的切换区域 PVS 中各放置一个 info_landmark，标记每张地图中 '相同' 的位置。<br><br>",
  "<b>TIPS & TRICKS:</b><br>To fire events in the next level, use the OnLevelChange output to turn on ": "<b>技巧与提示：</b><br>要在下一关触发事件，可使用 OnLevelChange 输出开启",
  "an env_global in the current level.  Create a logic_auto in the next level that checks ": "当前关中的一个 env_global。在下一关创建一个 logic_auto 来检查",
  "for the state set by the env_global.<br><br>": "env_global 设置的状态。<br><br>",
  "To control which entities go through the level transition, create one or more trigger_transitions and ": "要控制哪些实体参与关卡切换，可创建一个或多个 trigger_transition 并",
  "give them the same name as the landmark. Any entities within the trigger_transition(s) will go to the next map.": "将其命名为与 landmark 相同的名称。位于 trigger_transition 内的所有实体都会进入下一张地图。",
  "A trigger volume that changes the gravity on any entity that touches it.": "一种改变触碰它的所有实体重力的触发体积。",
  "Soundscape trigger. ": "声音景观触发器。",
  "It is not necessary to create outputs for this trigger. It automatically will trigger the ": "无需为此触发器创建输出。它会自动触发",
  "soundscape referred to by its 'Soundscape' property.": "其 'Soundscape' 属性所指的声音景观。",
  "A trigger volume that damages entities that touch it.": "一种对触碰它的实体造成伤害的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that removes any entities that touch it. Be careful, removing some entities can cause instability. ": "一种移除触碰它的任何实体的触发体积。请小心，移除某些实体可能导致不稳定。",
  "This is not the same as killing entities. i.e. NPCs removed in this manner will not fire their OnKilled outputs.": "这与杀死实体不同，即以此方式移除的 NPC 不会触发其 OnKilled 输出。",
  "A trigger volume that can be triggered multiple times.": "一种可多次触发的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that removes itself after it is triggered once.": "一种在触发一次后自行移除的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that sets the value of an snd_sos opvar.": "一种设置 snd_sos opvar 值的触发体积。",
  "An entity used to trigger something when the player looks at something. It fires 'OnTrigger' when the player ": "一种在玩家注视某物时触发某些事件的实体。当玩家",
  "looks at a target entity for the given amount of time, while within the trigger volume. If the player leaves ": "在触发体积内注视目标实体达到给定时间时，它会触发 'OnTrigger'。如果玩家离开",
  "the trigger or looks away from the target entity the clock resets. If the 'Use Velocity instead of facing' spawnflag ": "触发器或移开对目标实体的视线，计时将重置。如果勾选了 'Use Velocity instead of facing' 生成标记，",
  "is checked, the trigger uses the player's velocity instead of the player's view, so it determines whenever the player ": "触发器将使用玩家速度而非玩家视角，因此它判断的是玩家何时",
  "is moving toward the target entity. Useful for triggering when players are driving a vehicle at something.": "正在朝目标实体移动。适用于在玩家驾驶载具朝向某物时触发。",
  "NOTE: Only designed for single-player game. ": "注意：仅为单人游戏设计。",
  "A trigger volume that pushes entities that touch it.": "一种推动触碰它的实体的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that pushes physics objects that touch it.": "一种推动触碰它的物理物体的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that can be told to push all physics objects that are inside of it in the direction specified by this trigger's angles.<br>": "一种可设置为将位于其内部的所有物理物体沿此触发器角度指定的方向推动的触发体积。<br>",
  "Also outputs the force at the time of impact for anyone else that wants to use it.": "同时还会输出撞击时的作用力，供其他需要使用它的对象使用。",
  "Measures the distance of the player within the trigger volume from a given point (and within ": "测量触发体积内的玩家距给定点（且在给定",
  "a given radius). The NearestPlayerDistance output will be 0 when the player is at the center point, ": "半径内）的距离。当玩家位于中心点时，NearestPlayerDistance 输出为 0，",
  "and 1 when the player is at the radius.": "当玩家位于半径处时为 1。",
  "A trigger volume that teleports entities that touch it. Entities are teleported to the Remote Destination, and have their angles ": "一种传送触碰它的实体的触发体积。实体被传送到远程目的地，且其角度",
  "set to that of the Remote Destination's. If a Local Destination Landmark is specified, teleported entities are offset from the target ": "被设为远程目的地的角度。如果指定了局部目的地地标，被传送的实体将保持其相对",
  "by their initial offset from the landmark, and their angles are left alone.": "于地标的初始偏移，且其角度保持不变。",
  "A volume that's used to control which entities go through the level transition. Create one or more trigger_transitions and ": "一种用于控制哪些实体参与关卡切换的体积。创建一个或多个 trigger_transition 并",
  "give them the same name as the changelevel landmark. Any entities within the trigger_transition(s) will go to the next map.": "将其命名为与切换关卡地标相同的名称。位于 trigger_transition 内的所有实体都会进入下一张地图。",
  "See trigger_changelevel for more info.": "更多信息参见 trigger_changelevel。",
  "A volume that forces any NPC inside it to create a server side ragdoll instead of a client one.": "一种强制其内部所有 NPC 创建服务器端布娃娃而非客户端布娃娃的体积。",
  "An entity used to control the LOD behavior of any water in the map. If your map has water, this entity is required.": "一种用于控制地图中所有水体的 LOD 行为的实体。如果你的地图有水，则需要此实体。",
  "Camera": "摄像机",
  "Orient Towards": "朝向目标",
  "Camera Vertical FOV": "摄像机垂直 FOV",
  "An entity that can measure the movement of an entity relative to another entity ": "一种测量一个实体相对于另一个实体",
  "and apply that movement to a third entity.": "的移动并将该移动应用到第三个实体的实体。",
  "An entity to control the rolling credits.": "一种控制制作人员名单滚动显示的实体。",
  "An entity used by the -makedevshots system, which automatically takes screenshots at the position of every devshot camera in the level.": "一种由 -makedevshots 系统使用的实体，该系统会在关卡中每个 devshot 摄像机的位置自动截图。",
  "An entity that is used to relay inputs/ouputs to the player and back to the world.": "一种用于向玩家转发输入/输出并从玩家回传到世界的实体。",
  "Simple projected decal entity": "简单投影贴花实体",
  "Used to produce perfectly reflective glass that renders world + entities. ": "用于生成渲染世界 + 实体的完美反射玻璃。",
  "Typically, you want your glass brush to have nodraw on all non-reflective surfaces ": "通常，你希望玻璃画刷的所有非反射表面都使用 nodraw，",
  "and you want to use a shader like lightmappedreflective in your material applied ": "并希望所应用材质中的非 nodraw 表面使用诸如 lightmappedreflective 之类的着色器。",
  "to the non-nodraw surfaces. See hl2/materials/glass/reflectiveglass001.vmat for an example. ": "示例参见 hl2/materials/glass/reflectiveglass001.vmat。",
  "NOTE: currently, you cannot use reflective glass in scenes with water, and you can only ": "注意：目前，有水的场景中不能使用反射玻璃，并且",
  "have 1 reflective glass in your view frustum ( + pvs ) at a time.": "视锥体（+ PVS）中一次只能有 1 块反射玻璃。",
  "Generic game statistics counter.": "通用游戏统计计数器。",
  "An entity to draw a spotlight. Will draw a beam when the player views it side on, and a halo when it's facing towards the player. ": "一种用于绘制聚光灯的实体。当玩家从侧面观看时会绘制光束，当其正对玩家时会显示光晕。",
  "Unless the 'No Dynamic Light' spawnflag is checked, it will also create a dynamic light wherever the end of the spotlight rests.": "除非勾选了 'No Dynamic Light' 生成标记，否则它还会在聚光灯落点处创建动态光源。",
  "This spotlight is entirely client side, it is not sync'd across clients.": "此聚光灯完全在客户端运行，不会在客户端之间同步。",
  "An entity for placing an instance of a prefab map file.  You may translate and rotate this entity. ": "一种用于放置 Prefab 地图文件实例的实体。你可以对此实体进行平移和旋转。",
  "You can use the replace keys to do parameter changes on the instance contents.  In a $ at the ": "你可以使用替换键对实例内容进行参数更改：在变量名开头加 $，",
  "beginning of a variable name.  Then just use the $variable name inside of the instance contents on any ": "然后只需在实例内容中的任意键/值对的值部分使用该",
  "value portion of a key/value pair.": "$变量名。",
  "An entity that allows for creation and control of instructor lessons by map logic": "一种允许通过地图逻辑创建和管理教学课程的实体",
  "A generic target that gets replicated to the client for hud hint targeting": "一种被复制到客户端用于 HUD 提示定位的通用目标",
  "An entity that allows for creation and control of VR Based instructor lessons by map logic": "一种允许通过地图逻辑创建和管理 VR 教学课程的实体",
  "An entity that fires simple game events from map logic for game instructor": "一种从地图逻辑为游戏教学者触发简单游戏事件的实体",
  "Adjust the time scale of the server and client.": "调整服务器和客户端的时间缩放。",
  "3D text in the world": "世界中的 3D 文本",
  "An entity to control the fog in the map.": "一种控制地图中雾效的实体。",
  "A dummy entity used to bookmark a frequently used workplane origin and angles. Not compiled into the map.": "一种用于记录常用工作平面原点和角度的虚拟实体。不会编译进地图。",
  "Generic path point": "通用路径点",
  "Used by info_spawngroup_load to specify a landmark between two spawngroups to load": "由 info_spawngroup_load 使用，用于指定两个要加载的生成组之间的地标",
  "Skybox": "天空盒",
  "Fog & Sky": "雾与天空",
  "Adds a 2D skybox": "添加 2D 天空盒",
  "Controls the sky.": "控制天空。",
  "A procedurally-shattering glass panel.": "一种程序化碎裂的玻璃面板。",
  "Controller for volumetric fogging - bounds are extents of fog irradiance volume (for indirect)": "体积雾控制器 - 边界为雾辐照度体积的范围（用于间接光照）",
  "Sets a user bounding volume for volumetric fog - if one of these are in the map then all fog will get clamped to it. More than one then fog gets rendered if it's inside any of them.": "为体积雾设置用户边界体积 - 如果地图中存在其中之一，所有雾都会被限制在其范围内。若存在多个，则只要处于任意一个内部就会渲染雾。",
  "A dynamic visibility culling box which can be used to hide objects at runtime and can be toggled on and off by entity I/O.": "一种动态可见性剔除盒，可用于在运行时隐藏物体，并可通过实体 I/O 开启和关闭。",
  "A static (compile-time) volume that will delete geometry inside it as part of map compile.": "一种静态（编译时）体积，会在地图编译时删除其内部的几何体。",
  "Specifies a path that will be exported to game and can be referenced by other entities": "指定一条将被导出到游戏且可被其他实体引用的路径",
  "Takes Eventoutput and translates them to a Haptic Event (VR / Controller Target)": "将事件输出转换为触觉事件（VR / 控制器目标）",
  "Fires outputs when a map spawns in commentary mode.": "在地图以解说模式生成时触发输出。",
  "Defines the position and data of a commentary node.": "定义解说节点的位置和数据。",
  "Causes nav mesh to be generated here and at all points that are reachable via ground movement from here.": "使导航网格在此处以及所有可经地面移动到达的点处生成。",
  "A grid of precomputed light probes.": "预计算光照探针的网格。",
  "An env_cubemap with box projection.": "一种盒投影的 env_cubemap。",
  "Combination of an env_cubemap_box and an env_light_probe_volume": "env_cubemap_box 与 env_light_probe_volume 的组合",
  "Barn Door Light": "挡光板灯",
  "A cinematic barn door style light": "一种电影级挡光板样式灯",
  "Rectangular Light": "矩形灯",
  "A rectangular or disk shaped light": "一种矩形或圆盘形灯",
  "Omni Light": "全向灯",
  "Omni directional light source": "全向光源",
  "Sets the color and angle of the light from the sun and sky.<br><br>": "设置来自太阳和天空的光照的颜色与角度。<br><br>",
  "Typical setup:<br>": "典型设置：<br>",
  "1. Create an <b>env_sky</b> entity to use as your skybox<br>": "1. 创建一个 <b>env_sky</b> 实体作为你的天空盒<br>",
  "2. Create a <b>light_environment</b> entity and set <b>Sky IBL Source</b> to the name of the <b>env_sky</b> entity<br>": "2. 创建一个 <b>light_environment</b> 实体，并将其 <b>Sky IBL Source</b> 设为 <b>env_sky</b> 实体的名称<br>",
  "3. Right-click on your <b>light_environment</b> entity and select 'Selected environment light -> Estimate lighting from HDR skybox'<br>": "3. 右键点击 <b>light_environment</b> 实体，选择 'Selected environment light -> Estimate lighting from HDR skybox'<br>",
  "4. Adjust angle and brightness of the sunlight as you see fit": "4. 根据需要调整阳光的角度和亮度",
  "Generic markup volume entity, can be queried in-game by name/type/location": "通用标记体积实体，可在游戏中按名称/类型/位置查询",
  "Tagged generic markup volume entity, can be queried in-game by tag/name/type/location": "带标签的通用标记体积实体，可在游戏中按标签/名称/类型/位置查询",
  "Tagged markup volume entity with a target reference point.  Points are only in volume if behind the reference point relative to a given query position.": "带目标参考点的带标签标记体积实体。仅当点相对于给定查询位置位于参考点之后时，点才被视为在体积内。",
  "Markup group entity; add the group's targetname to the 'Markup Groups' field of a markup entity to add that entity to this group": "标记组实体；将组的目标名添加到标记实体的 'Markup Groups' 字段中，即可将该实体添加到此组",
  "Tagged NAV markup volume entity, used during export and can be queried in-game by tag/name/type/location": "带标签的 NAV 标记体积实体，在导出期间使用，可在游戏中按标签/名称/类型/位置查询",
  "Generate nav inside this volume and in the direction of the arrow": "在此体积内沿箭头方向生成导航",
  "Applies a radial burst to breakpieces outwards from the influence point (default is the origin of the model)": "对碎裂件施加从影响点（默认为模型原点）向外的径向爆散力",
  "Applies an angular 'flip' to breakpieces (like objects tipping over from an explosion or flower petals opening) causing them to tip outwards from the influence point (default is the origin of the model)": "对碎裂件施加角向 '翻转'（如物体因爆炸倾倒或花瓣张开），使其从影响点（默认为模型原点）向外倾倒",
  "Applies an angular 'twist' to breakpieces, causing them to roll around the radial axis outward from the influence point (default is the origin of the model)": "对碎裂件施加角向 '扭转'，使其绕从影响点（默认为模型原点）向外的径向轴翻滚",
  "Overrides the materialgroup on spawned breakpieces. (By default the active material group of the parent model is propagated to the breakpieces.)": "覆盖生成的碎裂件上的材质组。（默认情况下，父模型的活动材质组会传播到碎裂件。）",
  "Spawn a particle system when this model breaks": "此模型破碎时生成一个粒子系统",
  "After breaking, further damage the spawned pieces (creates more dynamic breaks for multi-tier breakables)": "破碎后对生成的碎片造成进一步伤害（为多层破碎物创建更多动态破碎）",
  "Disables impact (physics) damage on spawned breakpiece(s)": "禁用生成的碎裂件受到的冲击（物理）伤害",
  "Disables collisions (physics) with player on spawned breakpiece(s)": "禁用生成的碎裂件与玩家之间的碰撞（物理）",
  "Creates a revolute (hinge) joint between two spawned breakpieces": "在两个生成的碎裂件之间创建转动（铰链）关节",
  "Creates a prismatic (slide) joint between two spawned breakpieces": "在两个生成的碎裂件之间创建棱柱（滑动）关节",
  "A stage in a prop_animating_breakable progression": "prop_animating_breakable 进程中的一个阶段",
  "Adds a modifier to each break piece": "为每个碎块添加一个修改器",
  "Set postprocessing params while a player is inside the volume.": "玩家位于体积内时设置后处理参数。",
  "Addon info": "附加内容信息",
  "Tool Brushes/Place": "工具画刷/放置",
  "Tool Brushes/Clip/Grenades": "工具画刷/裁剪/手雷",
  "Player Start": "玩家起点",
  "Entity which specifies where the player will start.": "指定玩家生成位置的实体。",
  "This entity indicates the FOV override for cascading shadow maps.   .": "此实体标示级联阴影贴图的 FOV 覆盖。   。",
  "This is the world entity. Each map can only contain one, and it's automatically created for you.": "这是世界实体。每张地图只能包含一个，且它会自动为你创建。",
  "AK-47": "AK-47",
  "AUG": "AUG",
  "AWP": "AWP",
  "PP-Bizon": "PP-野牛",
  "CZ75a": "CZ75a",
  "Desert Eagle": "沙漠之鹰",
  "Defuse Kit": "拆弹器",
  "Dual Berettas": "双持贝瑞塔",
  "FAMAS": "FAMAS",
  "G3SG1 Sniper": "G3SG1 狙击步枪",
  "Galil AR": "加利尔 AR",
  "Glock-18": "格洛克18型",
  "Knife": "刀",
  "M249 Para": "M249",
  "M4A4": "M4A4",
  "M4A1 Silenced": "M4A1 消音型",
  "MAC-10": "MAC-10",
  "MAG-7": "MAG-7",
  "MP5-SD": "MP5-SD",
  "MP7": "MP7",
  "MP9": "MP9",
  "Negev": "内格夫",
  "Nova": "新星",
  "P90": "P90",
  "Revolver ": "左轮手枪",
  "Scar20": "SCAR-20",
  "SG 553": "SG 553",
  "SSG 08": "SSG 08",
  "Tec-9": "Tec-9",
  "UMP-45": "UMP-45",
  "USP Silenced": "USP 消音版",
  "C4 Bomb": "C4 炸弹",
  "Flashbang": "闪光弹",
  "Decoy Grenade": "诱饵手雷",
  "HE Grenade": "高爆手雷",
  "Molotov": "燃烧瓶",
  "Incendiary Grenade": "燃烧手雷",
  "Smoke Grenade": "烟雾弹",
  "An entity that ends a multiplayer game.": "一种结束多人游戏的实体。",
  "Cubemap fog": "立方体贴图雾",
  "Specifies fog based on an env_sky or skybox material.": "基于 env_sky 或天空盒材质指定雾。",
  "Gradient Fog": "渐变雾",
  "Specifies fog based on a color gradient": "基于颜色渐变指定雾",
  "Player Visibility": "玩家可见性",
  "Player visibility settings for fog and postprocessing": "针对雾效和后处理的玩家可见性设置",
  "Controls the 2D skybox material. Rotation of this entity rotates the skybox material": "控制 2D 天空盒材质。旋转此实体会旋转天空盒材质",
  "An entity to control the display of HUD hints. HUD hints are used to show the player what key is bound to a particular command.": "一种控制 HUD 提示显示的实体。HUD 提示用于向玩家显示某个命令绑定的按键。",
  "Counter Terrorist Spawn Point": "反恐精英出生点",
  "This entity marks the spawn point for Counter Terrorists": "此实体标示反恐精英的出生点",
  "This entity marks the start point for counter-terrorists. One of these needs to be placed for each team member. ": "此实体标示反恐精英的起始点。每名队员都需要放置一个。",
  "20 start points is typical. Should be placed at least 128 units away from each other and surrounding walls": "通常需要 20 个起始点。彼此之间以及与周围墙壁之间应至少相距 128 单位",
  "Terrorist Spawn Point": "恐怖分子出生点",
  "This entity marks the spawn point for Terrorists": "此实体标示恐怖分子的出生点",
  "This entity marks the start point for terrorists. One of these needs to be placed for each team member. ": "此实体标示恐怖分子的起始点。每名队员都需要放置一个。",
  "20 start points is typical. Should be placed at least 128 units away from each other and surrounding walls.": "通常需要 20 个起始点。彼此之间以及与周围墙壁之间应至少相距 128 单位。",
  "Deathmatch Spawn Point": "死斗模式出生点",
  "This entity marks a deathmatch spawn point": "此实体标示一个死斗模式出生点",
  "This entity marks a deathmatch spawn point. This is the entity that populates the map when mp_random_spawn is used.": "此实体标示一个死斗模式出生点。使用 mp_random_spawn 时，地图就是由该实体来填充的。",
  "Manually adding them to the map will guarantee that these spawn points are included in the set": "手动将它们添加到地图中可确保这些出生点被包含在该集合内",
  "Arms Race Counter Terrorist Spawn Point": "军备竞赛反恐精英出生点",
  "This entity marks the start point for counter-terrorists in Arms Race": "此实体标示军备竞赛中反恐精英的起始点",
  "This entity marks the start point for counter-terrorists in Arms Race. ": "此实体标示军备竞赛中反恐精英的起始点。",
  "Should be placed at least 128 units away from each other and surrounding walls": "彼此之间以及与周围墙壁之间应至少相距 128 单位",
  "Arms Race Terrorist Spawn Point": "军备竞赛恐怖分子出生点",
  "This entity marks the start point for terrorists in Arms Race": "此实体标示军备竞赛中恐怖分子的起始点",
  "This entity marks the start point for terrorists in Arms Race. ": "此实体标示军备竞赛中恐怖分子的起始点。",
  "Should be placed at least 128 units away from each other and surrounding walls.": "彼此之间以及与周围墙壁之间应至少相距 128 单位。",
  "This entity marks the start point for enemy terrorists in a coop game. ": "此实体标示合作模式中敌方恐怖分子的起始点。",
  "Should be placed at least 80 units away from each other and surrounding walls.": "彼此之间以及与周围墙壁之间应至少相距 80 单位。",
  "Hostage. A hostage NPC will spawn at this point.\n\n": "人质。人质 NPC 将在此点生成。\n\n",
  "There are usually four hostages placed in each hostage rescue map. The model for each Hostage is randomly chosen.": "每个人质营救地图中通常放置四名人质。每个人质的模型是随机选择的。",
  "Hostage Rescue Zone. When a hostage is led into this zone, it is marked as rescued.": "人质营救区。当人质被带入该区域时，即被标记为已营救。",
  "A trigger volume that resets the bomb by teleporting it back into the playable area.": "一种通过将炸弹传送回可玩区域来重置炸弹的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that resets the hostage by teleporting it back into the playable area.": "一种通过将人质传送回可玩区域来重置人质的触发体积。",
  "Environment Light": "环境光",
  "For sunlight and sky lighting": "用于阳光和天空光照",
  "Defines a cube map location.": "定义一个立方体贴图位置。",
  "Combined Cubemap and Light Probe volume": "立方体贴图与光照探针体积的组合",
  "Combined box-projected cubemap for reflections and a light probe volume for dynamic objects": "盒投影立方体贴图（用于反射）与光照探针体积（用于动态物体）的组合",
  "An entity to create light glows built via the particle editor": "一种通过粒子编辑器构建的、用于创建光晕的实体",
  "Offscreen Panorama Texture": "屏外 Panorama 纹理",
  "An entity used to place a door in the world. If two doors have the same name, they will open and close together as double doors.": "一种用于在世界中放置门的实体。如果两扇门同名，它们会作为双开门一起开关。",
  "A security door.": "一扇安保门。",
  "Flashbang Projectile": "闪光弹投射物",
  "DZ Spawn Location": "危险区（DZ）出生位置",
  "DZ Named Map Region": "危险区（DZ）命名地图区域",
  "Exploding barrel": "爆炸油桶",
  "C4 target": "C4 目标",
  "Door price counter": "门价格计数器",
  "Weapon spawn group.": "武器生成组。",
  "Drone Gun": "无人机炮塔",
  "Paradrop denial area.": "禁止空降区域。",
  "An entity that can listen to events fired from code and fire ": "一种能够监听代码中触发的事件",
  "and output when it happens.": "并在事件发生时触发输出的实体。",
  "An entity used to define a place on a CSGO map.": "一种用于在 CSGO 地图上定义地点（place）的实体。",
  "A brush entity that can block nav areas touching its AABB.": "一种可阻挡与其 AABB 接触的导航区域的画刷实体。",
  "A trigger used to define a buyzone.": "一种用于定义购买区的触发器。",
  "A trigger used to define the survial play area.": "一种用于定义生存模式游戏区域的触发器。",
  "Defines areas where tablet is covered by static.": "定义平板电脑被静电干扰覆盖的区域。",
  "A brush entity that's considered solid to vphysics.": "一种对 vphysics 而言被视为实心的画刷实体。",
  "Bomb Target. The terrorists can place C4 explosives while standing in this zone.\n\n": "炸弹目标区。恐怖分子站在该区域内时可以安放 C4 炸药。\n\n",
  "When the bomb is planted and explodes inside this area, the BombExplode outputs are fired. The game handles ": "当炸弹在此区域内被安放并爆炸时，会触发 BombExplode 输出。游戏会处理",
  "all of the bomb planting and scoring logic – the BombExplode outputs are provided to add visual and damage effects.": "所有炸弹安放和计分逻辑 – BombExplode 输出用于添加视觉和伤害效果。",
  "Map parameters. Used to set which teams can buys, and the C4 bomb detonation radius.": "地图参数。用于设置哪些队伍可以购买装备，以及 C4 炸弹的引爆半径。",
  "An editable path which controls an animated camera. Can only be used in background UI maps": "一种控制动画摄像机的可编辑路径。只能在背景 UI 地图中使用",
  "A brush entity with a moving surface that moves linearly in a given direction": "一种具有沿给定方向做直线移动的移动表面的画刷实体",
  "One of two corners needed to define the minimap boundaries (extend to support multilevel maps).": "定义小地图边界所需的两个角点之一（扩展后可支持多层地图）。",
  "Location on the map where to place pet.": "地图上放置宠物的位置。",
  "An entity that awards money to a specific team.": "一种向指定队伍发放金钱的实体。",
  "Scale Reference (Human)": "比例参照（人类）",
  "Panorama UI that can be controlled by cs_script. See point_script.": "可由 cs_script 控制的 Panorama UI。参见 point_script。",
  "A filter that filters by the team of the activator.": "按激活者的队伍进行筛选的筛选器。",
  "Brush-built model that fades out over a specified distance. Useful for creating world detail that doesn't need to be drawn far away, for performance reasons.": "一种随指定距离渐隐的画刷构建模型。出于性能考虑，适用于创建无需在远处绘制的世界细节。",
  "An entity that can display and control a set of screen overlays, to be displayed over the player's view. Useful for view effects like drunkenness, or teleporter afterimages, etc.": "一种可显示和控制一组屏幕覆盖层的实体，这些覆盖层会显示在玩家视图之上。适用于醉酒、传送器残影等视图特效。",
  "Allows screenspace effects to be played on the player's view.": "允许在玩家视图上播放屏幕空间特效。",
  "An entity that can be used to light the smoke particles emitted by env_smokestack entities. Does not light any other particle types.": "一种可用于照亮 env_smokestack 实体产生的烟雾粒子的实体。不能照亮其他粒子类型。",
  "An entity to control & draw a sun effect in the sky.": "一种在天空中控制并绘制太阳效果的实体。",
  "An entity that controls the depth of field settings for the player. Depth of field simulates camera blur of out-of-focus regions of the scene.": "一种控制玩家景深设置的实体。景深用于模拟相机对场景失焦区域的模糊。",
  "An entity that puts an additive glow in the world, mostly used over light sources.": "一种在世界中放置叠加发光的实体，主要用于光源之上。",
  "An entity that monitors the material of the surface the player is standing on, and fires outputs whenever it changes to/from a specific material.": "一种监控玩家所站立表面材质的实体，并在材质变入/变出特定材质时触发输出。",
  "A Half-Life 2 ladder. Handles player auto mount/unmount, as well as +use to get onto the ladder. \n\n": "半条命2 式梯子。处理玩家的自动上/下梯，以及用 +use 爬上梯子。\n\n",
  "See also 'info_ladder_dismount', used to specify ladder auto-dismount points.\n\n": "另请参阅 'info_ladder_dismount'，用于指定梯子自动下梯点。\n\n",
  "Note: This entity is non-functional in Counter-Strike: Source. Use func_ladder instead.": "注意：此实体在 Counter-Strike: Source 中不可用。请改用 func_ladder。",
  "An entity used to specify the endpoints of a ladder. This entity is functional, but has been replaced by the ": "一种用于指定梯子端点的实体。此实体可用，但已被",
  "easier-to-use func_useableladder entity. Left in only for backwards-compatibility!\n\n": "更易用的 func_useableladder 实体取代。保留它只是为了向后兼容！\n\n",
  "To be valid, a full sized player hull traced between the start and end points must not be obstructed at level ": "要使其有效，在关卡激活时在起点和终点之间描摹的完整尺寸玩家碰撞壳不得被阻挡。",
  "activation time. The angle determines in which direction the player leaves the ladder if the player presses the ": "该角度决定玩家按下",
  "+jump button.\n\n": "+jump 键时离开梯子的方向。\n\n",
  "Note: This entity is non-functional in Counter-Strike: Source. In CS:S, use func_ladder instead.": "注意：此实体在 Counter-Strike: Source 中不可用。在 CS:S 中请改用 func_ladder。",
  "An entity that can be used to optimize the visibility in a map. If you seal off an area with them, when the viewer moves the specified distance away from them, they will go opaque and the parts inside the area will not be drawn. The 'target' brush model should enclose the func_areaportalwindow so no parts of it are culled by the window. If you use the optional foreground brush model, then it should enclose the 'target' brush model.": "一种可用于优化地图可见性的实体。如果你用它封闭一个区域，当观察者移开指定距离后，它会变为不透明，区域内部的部分将不会被绘制。'target' 画刷模型应包住 func_areaportalwindow，使其任何部分都不会被窗口剔除。如果使用可选的前景画刷模型，则它应包住 'target' 画刷模型。",
  "A VGUI screen. Useful for in-world monitors.": "一种 VGUI 屏幕。适用于世界内显示器。",
  "An entity used to display a model for testing purposes. Shooting it with cycle through the model's animations.": "一种用于测试目的显示模型的实体。射击它可以在模型的动画之间循环切换。",
  "An entity used to create a volume in which to spawn fire embers.": "一种用于创建生成火星余烬体积的实体。",
  "HL1 Legacy: Large Portal Funnel": "HL1 旧版：大型传送门漏斗",
  "An entity used to create a volume in which to spawn bubbles.": "一种用于创建生成气泡体积的实体。",
  "An entity used to create a jet of steam.": "一种用于创建蒸汽喷射的实体。",
  "A env_sprite thats only clientside.": "一种仅存在于客户端的 env_sprite。",
  "An entity to control wind in the map. Partially functional.": "一种控制地图中风效的实体。仅部分可用。",
  "An entity that gives equipment to the player who activates it. To use, add new keys to this entity, where each key is the classname of a weapon/item, and the corresponding value is the number of those weapons/items to give to the player who uses this entity. If the 'Use Only' spawnflag isn't set, then players can just touch this entity to get the equipment (or the TriggerForAllPlayers input can be used).  If the Strip Player First flag is set, the player will be stripped of all weapons and items (including armor) before being given the items specified in this entity.": "一种向激活它的玩家发放装备的实体。使用方法是为此实体添加新键值：每个键为一件武器/物品的类名，对应的值为向使用此实体的玩家发放的该武器/物品数量。如果未设置 'Use Only' 生成标记，玩家只需触碰此实体即可获得装备（或使用 TriggerForAllPlayers 输入）。如果设置了 Strip Player First 标记，玩家会在获得此实体指定的物品之前先被移除所有武器和物品（包括护甲）。",
  "An entity that changes the team of the player who activates it.": "一种更改激活它的玩家所属队伍的实体。",
  "An entity that awards/deducts points from the player who activates it.": "一种从激活它的玩家处加分/扣分的实体。",
  "An entity that displays a text message oriented in the world, at its origin.": "一种在世界中（位于其原点处）按世界方向显示文本消息的实体。",
  "An entity that creates tesla lightning arcs around its origin.": "一种在其原点周围产生特斯拉电弧的实体。",
  "An entity that relays bonus maps changes.": "一种转发奖励地图更改的实体。",
  "An entity used to override player input when the player is looking at it.": "一种在玩家注视它时接管玩家输入的实体。",
  "An entity that places a decal on the world. If the decal has no target name, it will immediately apply itself when the level is loaded. ": "一种在世界中放置贴花的实体。如果贴花没有目标名，关卡加载时它会立即应用。",
  "If it has a name specified, it won't apply until it receives the 'Activate' input.": "如果指定了名称，它要到收到 'Activate' 输入时才会应用。",
  "An entity that projects a decal onto the world (or props). If the decal has no target name, it will immediately apply itself when ": "一种将贴花投影到世界（或模型）上的实体。如果贴花没有目标名，关卡加载时它会立即应用。",
  "the level is loaded. If it has a name specified, it won't apply until it receives the 'Activate' input.": "如果指定了名称，它要到收到 'Activate' 输入时才会应用。",
  "Use this entity to mark surfaces that shouldn't receive dynamic shadows. Useful to apply to walls and floors ": "使用此实体标记不应接收动态阴影的表面。适用于应用于阴影绘制不当、",
  "where shadows are drawn improperly, giving away the location of enemies.": "会暴露敌人位置的墙壁和地板。",
  "An entity that places an overlay on the world.": "一种在世界中放置覆盖层（overlay）的实体。",
  "Overlay Transition": "覆盖层过渡",
  "An entity that acts as a landmark for transitions to another level. There should be a corresponding info_landmark entity in the next map. Entities will be transitioned to the next level relative to the info_landmark entities.": "一种作为切换到另一关卡地标的实体。下一张地图中应有对应的 info_landmark 实体。实体会以相对于 info_landmark 实体的位置切换到下一关卡。",
  "the NPC should face to perform the hint behavior.\n\n": "NPC 在执行提示行为时应当朝向的方向。\n\n",
  "A dynamic connection between two navigation nodes. You specify the node IDs of the start and end nodes, and then you can use entity I/O ": "两个导航节点之间的动态连接。你指定起始节点和结束节点的节点 ID，然后可以使用实体 I/O",
  "to turn on and off the connection. This could be used to create or destroy a connection in the nodegraph because of some event in your map ": "来开启和关闭该连接。这可用于因地图中的某些事件",
  "(a bridge being created/destroyed, etc).": "（例如桥梁被创建/摧毁等）而在节点图中创建或销毁连接。",
  "An invisible omnidirectional lightsource.": "一种不可见的全向光源。",
  "Sets the color and angle of the light from the sun and sky.": "设置来自太阳和天空的光照的颜色与角度。",
  "An invisible and directional spotlight.": "一种不可见的定向聚光灯。",
  "An entity to control the shadows in the map.": "一种控制地图中阴影的实体。",
  "An entity to control the sunlight that casts shadows in the map.": "一种控制地图中投射阴影的阳光的实体。",
  "An entity to control the sunlight that casts cascaded shadows in the map.": "一种控制地图中投射级联阴影的阳光的实体。",
  "A water brush entity that moves linearly along a given distance, in a given direction": "一种沿给定方向、按给定距离做直线移动的水画刷实体",
  "An entity used to place a door in the world.": "一种用于在世界中放置门的实体。",
  "An entity that creates a sample point for the Cubic Environment Map.": "一种为立方体环境贴图创建采样点的实体。",
  "A brush entity that spawns sparkling dust motes within its volume.": "一种在其体积内生成闪烁尘埃微粒的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity that spawns smoke particles within its volume.": "一种在其体积内生成烟雾粒子的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity that spawns a translucent dust cloud within its volume.": "一种在其体积内生成半透明尘埃云的画刷实体。",
  "An entity that can emit dust puffs.": "一种可以喷出尘团的实体。",
  "An entity that allows you to script special visual effects via a script file.": "一种允许你通过脚本文件编排特殊视觉特效的实体。",
  "A camera entity that controls the player's view. While it's active, the player will see out of the camera.": "一种控制玩家视角的摄像机实体。当其激活时，玩家将从摄像机视角观看。",
  "A camera entity that controls all players' views. While it's active, the players will see out of the camera.": "一种控制所有玩家视角的摄像机实体。当其激活时，所有玩家将从摄像机视角观看。",
  "A camera entity that moves the player's view. Use this if you want the player to retain control of where the player looks but want to base the position to be based on the proxy.": "一种移动玩家视角的摄像机实体。当你希望玩家保留对视线方向的控制、但希望位置基于代理实体时使用。",
  "An entity that controls a pose parameter of a prop and cycles the pose clientside.": "一种控制模型姿态参数并在客户端循环该姿态的实体。",
  "Contains a list of logic_branch entities and fires outputs when the state of any of the logic_branches changes.\n\n": "包含一个 logic_branch 实体列表，并在任意 logic_branch 状态变化时触发输出。\n\n",
  "Compares an input to up to 16 preset values. If the input value is the same as ": "将输入与最多 16 个预设值进行比较。如果输入值与",
  "any of the preset values, an output corresponding to that value is fired.\n\n": "任一预设值相同，则触发与该值对应的输出。\n\n",
  "the OnCase02 output will be fired.\n\n": "则会触发 OnCase02 输出。\n\n",
  "can be disabled to prevent forwarding outputs.\n\n": "并且可以被禁用以阻止转发输出。\n\n",
  "Stores an entity and sends messages with it as the activator\n": "存储一个实体并以它作为激活者发送消息\n",
  "Useful for keeping track of entities with mangled names due ": "适用于跟踪因模板生成器和实例",
  "to template spawners and instances.": "而名称被改变的实体。",
  "A message forwarder. Fires up to eight separate outputs, each with a different chance of firing.": "一种消息转发器。最多触发八个独立的输出，每个输出有不同的触发几率。",
  "An entity that acts as a microphone. It works in one of two modes. If it has a 'Speaker' set, it picks up all sounds within the specified sound range, ": "一个充当麦克风的实体。它以两种模式之一工作。如果设置了“扬声器（Speaker）”，它会拾取指定声音范围内的所有声音，",
  "and rebroadcasts them through the Speaker entity. In this Speaker mode, it ignores the Hears X spawnflags and does not fire the SoundLevel output. ": "并通过扬声器实体重新播放。在扬声器模式下，它会忽略“听到 X”生成标记，且不会触发 SoundLevel 输出。",
  "If it has no Speaker set, it measures the sound level at a point, and outputs the sound level as a value between 0 and 1. In Measuring mode, it only hears sounds that match the Hear X spawnflags.": "如果未设置扬声器，它会测量某一点的声音强度，并将声音强度以 0 到 1 之间的值输出。在测量模式下，它只听到符合“听到 X”生成标记的声音。",
  "Plays a movie and allows for various playback options": "播放影片并提供多种播放选项",
  "will be replaced with the current global template instance, so wildcard searches for '<original name>*' will still find them.\n": "将被替换为当前的全局模板实例，因此对“<原名称>*”的通配符搜索仍能找到它们。\n",
  "If you don't want the name fixup to happen, because you're only spawning the template once, or you want inputs to ": "如果你不希望进行名称修正，因为你只生成一次该模板，或者你希望输入",
  "trigger all instances of the template, check the 'Preserve entity names' spawnflag. \n": "触发模板的所有实例，请勾选“保留实体名称”生成标记。\n",
  "An entity that constrains players to a radius around itself, slowing them down the closer they get to the edge of the radius.": "将玩家限制在其周围一定半径内的实体，玩家越接近半径边缘，速度越慢。",
  "An entity used to manage a group of interacting constraints and keep them stable. ": "用于管理一组相互作用的约束并保持其稳定的实体。",
  "All constraints on a set of entities should be placed in the same system, or they will fight each other during simulation.": "同一组实体上的所有约束应放在同一个约束系统中，否则它们会在模拟中相互冲突。",
  "A physically simulated gas cannister that can have its cap shot off, at which point gas will start escaping and cause the cannister to fly around. If it takes enough damage, it will explode.": "物理模拟的煤气罐，其盖子可被击落，此时气体会开始泄漏并使煤气罐四处乱飞。若受到足够伤害，它会爆炸。",
  "An entity that overrides the mass center of the target physics prop, or func_physbox, by moving it to the info_mass_center's location.": "通过将目标物理模型或 func_physbox 的质量中心移到 info_mass_center 的位置来覆盖其质量中心的实体。",
  "determined by the 'Sprint Constant'. The larger the spring constant the less stretch the spring.": "由“弹性系数”决定。弹性系数越大，弹簧的拉伸越小。",
  "A constraint that keeps the position of two objects fixed, relative to the constraint's origin. It does not affect rotation.": "使两个物体的位置相对于约束原点保持固定的约束。它不影响旋转。",
  "A constraint that keeps the relative position and orientation of two objects fixed.": "使两个物体的相对位置和朝向保持固定的约束。",
  "Turns an arbitrary entity into a physically simulated entity. i.e. brush entities will behave like func_physbox, model entities behave like prop_physics.": "将任意实体转换为物理模拟实体。例如画刷实体的行为如同 func_physbox，模型实体的行为如同 prop_physics。",
  "Detail Prop": "细节 Prop",
  "A prop that doesn't move and doesn't animate.": "不移动也不播放动画的模型。",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage. ": "可置于层级中并可播放动画的模型。还可以配置其在受到足够伤害时破碎。",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage.\n": "可置于层级中并可播放动画的模型。还可以配置其在受到足够伤害时破碎。\n",
  "A way to attach one studio model to another as an ornament. It will render in the way that player/NPC weapons render.": "将一个 studio 模型作为饰物附加到另一个模型上的方式。它将以玩家/NPC 武器的渲染方式渲染。",
  "A portal brush used to manage visibility in maps. Portals define areas, which are spaces ": "用于管理地图中可见性的门户画刷。门户定义了区域，即地图中",
  "that are connected in the map. Both sides of a portal cannot touch the same area, for example, a ": "相互连接的空间。门户的两侧不能接触同一区域，例如，",
  "doughnut shaped map would require at least two portals to divide the map into two areas. A linear map ": "环形地图至少需要两个门户才能将地图划分为两个区域。线性地图",
  "could be divided into two areas with a single area portal.": "则可以用单个区域门户划分为两个区域。",
  "A occluder brush used to manage dynamic visibility in maps. Occluders are used to dynamically ": "用于管理地图中动态可见性的遮挡画刷。遮挡器用于动态",
  "determine what things are behind them, to prevent trying to draw them at all.": "判断位于其后的物体，以完全避免绘制它们。",
  "A breakable surface, for partially breakable glass / tile / etc.  All faces but the desired visible one must be marked as NODRAW and that": "可破碎表面，用于部分可破碎的玻璃/瓷砖等。除所需可见面之外的所有面必须标记为 NODRAW，且",
  "face must be 4 sided.  The material applied to the visible face must be set up to be breakable.": "该面必须是四边形。应用于可见面的材质必须设置为可破碎。",
  "Conveyor Belt": "传送带",
  "An entity that turns its brushes into detail brushes. Detail brushes do NOT contribute to visibility in the PVS. World geometry ": "将其画刷转换为细节画刷的实体。细节画刷不会对 PVS 中的可见性产生影响。世界几何",
  "is not clipped to detail brushes, so if you have a small detail clump attached to a wall, the wall won't be cut up by the detail brush.": "不会对细节画刷进行裁剪，因此如果你有一小簇附着在墙上的细节几何体，墙壁不会被细节画刷切割。",
  "func_detail is great for high-frequency brush geometry that's visual detail only. It is also ideal for reducing map VIS time.": "func_detail 非常适合仅作为视觉细节的高频画刷几何体。它也是缩短地图 VIS 时间的理想选择。",
  "Any leaves touching this brush will have their vis merged together into a single cluster.  Use multiple func_viscluster entities to reduce vis time": "与此画刷相接触的所有叶节点，其可见性将被合并为一个群集。使用多个 func_viscluster 实体可缩短 vis 时间",
  "A brush entity that creates rain and snow inside its volume.": "在其体积内产生雨雪的画刷实体。",
  "A brush entity that prevents detail sprites from being placed inside its volume.": "阻止细节精灵被放置在其体积内的画刷实体。",
  "A moving platform that the player can ride. It follows a path of path_track entities.\n": "玩家可乘坐的移动平台。它沿 path_track 实体构成的路径移动。\n",
  "A moving train that follows a path of path_track entities, shoots at the player, and can be killed.\n": "沿 path_track 实体构成的路径行驶、向玩家射击且可被击毁的移动列车。\n",
  "An entity that triggers a level change.\n": "触发关卡切换的实体。\n",
  "Place an info_landmark in both maps that marks the 'same' location in each map.\n": "在两张地图中各放置一个 info_landmark，标记每张地图中“相同”的位置。\n",
  "TIPS & TRICKS: To fire events in the next level, use the OnLevelChange output to turn on ": "技巧与提示：要在下一关卡中触发事件，请使用 OnLevelChange 输出开启",
  "for the state set by the env_global.\n\n": "env_global 所设置的状态。\n\n",
  "An entity that can be used to disable player's automatic ducking/unducking when jumping.": "可用于禁用玩家跳跃时自动下蹲/起身的实体。",
  "An entity that can control sound operator parameters.": "可以控制声音运算器参数的实体。",
  "A trigger volume that can will check if any of trigger's children pass a secondary filter.": "可检查触发器的任何子实体是否通过二级筛选器的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that can be told to push all physics objects that are inside of it in the direction specified by this trigger's angles.\n": "可将位于其内部的所有物理对象沿此触发器角度所指定方向推送的触发体积。\n",
  "An entity that can use point_cameras to render images for materials used by entities. ": "可使用 point_camera 为实体所用材质渲染图像的实体。",
  "To author the material, use the special identifier _rt_Camera ": "要制作该材质，请使用特殊标识符 _rt_Camera",
  "for the $baseTexture (or whatever texture you want, like envmap, etc.) in the .vmat ": "作为 .vmat 中的 $baseTexture（或任何你想要的纹理，如 envmap 等）",
  "then connect the 'target' field to the entity which uses that material, and the 'PointCamera' ": "然后将“target（目标）”字段连接到使用该材质的实体，并将“PointCamera”",
  "field to the point_camera you want to have appear on that entity's material": "字段连接到你希望出现在该实体材质上的 point_camera",
  "An entity that can listen to the item_equip event fired from code and fire ": "可以监听代码触发的 item_equip 事件并",
  "and output when it happens and the weapon class or type defined, match.": "在其发生且与所定义的武器类别或类型匹配时触发输出的实体。",
  "An entity that can be used to directly control material vars. To use it, you need to read the .vmt of the material you ": "可直接控制材质变量的实体。要使用它，你需要读取你要",
  "intend to change. Parent this entity to a brush model entity who's material you want to control.": "更改的材质的 .vmt。将此实体父级到想要控制其材质的画刷模型实体。",
  "A magical trail you can parent to anything you heart desires.": "可以父级到你心之所向的任何物体的魔法轨迹。",
  "Projected texture entity.": "投影纹理实体。",
  "to the non-nodraw surfaces. See hl2/materials/glass/reflectiveglass001.vmt for an example. ": "到非 nodraw 表面。示例请参见 hl2/materials/glass/reflectiveglass001.vmt。",
  "An entity for turning on and off measuring and display of particle throughput.": "用于开启和关闭粒子吞吐量测量与显示的实体。",
  "An entity for placing an instance of a map file.  You may translate and rotate this entity. ": "用于放置地图文件实例的实体。你可以平移和旋转此实体。",
  "Place one copy of this entity inside of an instance.  Whenever you add a $parameter for the instance, get the properties ": "在实例内放置此实体的一份副本。每当你为实例添加 $parameter 时，获取",
  "of this entity.  It will auto-populate it with the variables and allow you to indicate the variable type.": "此实体的属性。它会自动填充变量并允许你指定变量类型。",
  "Place one copy of this entity inside of an instance.  Sending messages to entities inside the instance from the Proxy's OnProxyRelay output ": "在实例内放置此实体的一份副本。通过代理（Proxy）的 OnProxyRelay 输出向实例内的实体发送消息，",
  "will allow you to trigger these entities from outside the instance by sending messages to the func_instance.  ": "即可通过向 func_instance 发送消息从实例外部触发这些实体。",
  "Send the ProxyRelay message from entities inside the instance to the proxy and you will be able to use these events to send messages to other entities ": "从实例内的实体向代理发送 ProxyRelay 消息，你就可以利用这些事件向",
  "outside the instance from the func_instance. NOTE: The instance, the proxy, and all entities involved should be named descriptively.": "实例外的其他实体发送消息（经由 func_instance）。注意：实例、代理及所有相关实体都应以描述性名称命名。",
  "This is the center of the instance for rotation.": "这是实例用于旋转的中心。",
  "Entity that, when seen, generates a simple game event.": "被看到时生成简单游戏事件的实体。",
  "A prop that players can't get a good look at, hopefully making them unsure if it's there at all": "玩家无法看清的模型，希望让他们不确定它是否真的存在",
  "A directional light with no falloff. Similar to sunlight in light_environment.": "无衰减的定向光源。类似于 light_environment 中的阳光。",
  "Brush Gun Turret": "画刷机枪炮塔",
  "Works exactly like a prop_dynamic, but it can optionally have a custom glow around it.": "工作方式与 prop_dynamic 完全相同，但可以选择在其周围添加自定义发光效果。",
  "This entity marks a potential spawn point for a survival crates. ": "此实体标记生存模式补给箱的潜在生成点。",
  "This is for logo maps for demos. All players will spawn here, and there will be no ": "用于演示的标志地图。所有玩家都将在此生成，且不会有",
  "class menu, team menu, or HUD.": "职业菜单、队伍菜单或 HUD。",
  "Pet. A pet animal will spawn at this point.\n": "宠物。一只宠物动物将在此点生成。\n",
  "This entity selects whether or not this level uses the Half-Life 2 view parameters (eye height: 64, FOV: 75) ": "此实体用于选择该关卡使用《半衰期2》的视点参数（视高：64，FOV：75）",
  "or the old Counter-Strike settings (eye height: 53.5, FOV: 90).": "还是旧版反恐精英设置（视高：53.5，FOV：90）。",
  "An entity that lets you control the fade distances for detail props.": "可让你控制细节模型淡出距离的实体。",
  "Zone Repulsor Device": "区域排斥装置",
  "HE Grenade Projectile": "高爆手榴弹投射物",
  "Molotov Projectile": "燃烧弹投射物",
  "Training C4": "训练用 C4",
  "A Generic NPC entity that hears and reports 'danger' and is not preverved on round restart. ": "会听到并报告“危险”且在回合重启时不保留的通用 NPC 实体。",
  "Danger sounds consist of gunshots, player sounds, bullet impacts, nearby vehicles and andything else that ": "危险声音包括枪声、玩家声音、子弹撞击、附近载具以及",
  "gives off a danger sound.": "其他任何发出危险声音的东西。",
  "Ladder. Players will be able to freely along this brush, as if it was a ladder. If you are using a model prop ": "梯子。玩家可以像在梯子上一样沿此画刷自由攀爬。如果你在地图中使用模型",
  "for the visual representation of the ladder in the map, apply the toolsinvisibleladder material to the ": "Prop 作为梯子的视觉表现，请将 toolsinvisibleladder 材质应用到",
  "func_ladder brush.": "func_ladder 画刷上。",
  "This class is the same as func_physbox, except the runtime collisions use a more bouncy method that avoids ": "此类与 func_physbox 相同，但运行时碰撞使用一种更具弹性的方法，可避免",
  "Buy Zone. Players can buy equipment while standing in this zone, if the zone matches their current team.\n\n": "购买区。玩家站在此区域内时可购买装备，前提是该区域与其当前队伍匹配。\n\n",
  "A single Buy Zone entity must be either terrorist or counter-terrorist, it cannot be both. Should have ": "单个购买区实体必须是恐怖分子或反恐精英之一，不能两者兼有。所有面都应",
  "the toolstrigger material applied to all sides": "应用 toolstrigger 材质",
  "No Defuse Area.  The counter-terrorists will not be able to defuse bombs while they are touching this trigger volume.\n\n": "禁止拆除区域。反恐精英在接触此触发体积时将无法拆除炸弹。\n\n",
  "This is used in map design to prevent players from defusing bombs through walls or floors.": "用于地图设计，防止玩家隔着墙壁或地板拆除炸弹。",
  "Surround Sound Test": "环绕声测试",
  "Hospital Territory Control Point": "医院领地控制点",
  "Terrorists' Base Territory Point (Non-Capturable)": "恐怖分子基地领地点（不可占领）",
  "Counter-Terrorists' Base Territory Point (Non-Capturable)": "反恐精英基地领地点（不可占领）",
  "Barracks Territory Control Point": "兵营领地控制点",
  "Bank Territory Control Point": "银行领地控制点",
  "Encryption Center Territory Control Point": "加密中心领地控制点",
  "Surveillance Center Territory Control Point": "监控中心领地控制点",
  "The position a gas canister will launch from in Survival Mode.": "生存模式中煤气罐的发射位置。",
  "The Territory Control rules entity (VERY IMPORTANT!)": "领地控制规则实体（非常重要！）",
  "Players will respawn inside this area.": "玩家将在此区域内重生。",
  "An entity that ends a multiplayer game ROUND.": "结束多人游戏回合（ROUND）的实体。",
  "An entity that awards/deducts points from the player who activates it or to a specific team.": "向激活它的玩家或特定队伍加分/扣分的实体。",
  "Studiomodel vehicle that can be driven via inputs.": "可通过输入驾驶的 studio 模型载具。",
  "Generic driveable studiomodel vehicle.": "通用可驾驶 studio 模型载具。",
  "An entity that will fire outputs when events happen during Survival mode.": "在生存模式中发生事件时触发输出的实体。",
  "An entity that keeps track of the coop wave/phase and fires outputs when players complete them.": "跟踪合作模式波次/阶段并在玩家完成时触发输出的实体。",
  "Gunfire Effect": "枪火效果",
  "Adds a hiding spot to the nav mesh at this location.": "在此位置为导航网格添加一个隐藏点。",
  "Collectable coin for coop missions.": "合作任务中可收集的硬币。",
  "Exploding barrel.  BOOM!": "爆炸桶。轰！",
  "A trigger volume that softly slows player velocity in a given direction.": "在给定方向上柔和减缓玩家速度的触发体积。",
  "An entity that gives ammo to the activator.  Use a trigger or a button to trigger this entity.": "向激活者提供弹药的实体。使用触发器或按钮来触发此实体。",
  "An entity that precaches skybox materials and swaps them on trigger.": "预缓存天空盒材质并在触发时切换它们的实体。",
  "Survival item spawn point.\n": "生存模式物品生成点。\n",
  "Survival weapon spawn point.\n": "生存模式武器生成点。\n",
  "Survival item spawn grouping.\n": "生存模式物品生成分组。\n",
  "Survival weapon spawn grouping.\n": "生存模式武器生成分组。\n",
  "Danger Zone Controller entity for mission-driven bomb explosions": "用于任务驱动炸弹爆炸的危险区域控制器实体",
  "A trigger volume that defines the bounds of the survival play area.": "定义生存模式游戏区域范围的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that encompasses the survival map room.": "包围生存模式地图房间的触发体积。",
  "A trigger volume that defines the top of the survival map room minimap table.": "定义生存模式地图房间小地图桌面顶部的触发体积。",
  "DroneGun Emplacement\n": "无人机炮位\n",
  "Parachute Backpack\n": "降落伞背包\n",
  "Survival Door": "生存模式门",
  "Numerical Display Counter\n": "数字显示计数器\n",
  "A VGUI world panel that can be placed and modified by entity logic and display localized text": "可由实体逻辑放置和修改并显示本地化文本的 VGUI 世界面板",
  "A brush entity that can be broken by c4 within specific radius in survival mode.": "生存模式中可被特定半径内的 C4 破坏的画刷实体。",
  "Disable the tablet for players within this region.": "禁用此区域内玩家的平板电脑。",
  "Point entity for setting the name of a map region for display.": "用于设置地图区域名称以供显示的点实体。",
  "Danger Zone paradrops will avoid this volume.": "危险区域空投将避开此体积。",
  "Manager for DZ coop missions.": "危险区域（DZ）合作任务管理器。",
  "Sharable ammo box.": "可共享的弹药箱。",
  "One time use armor activating on touch.": "接触时激活的一次性护甲。",
  "One time heavy armor refill activating with long use.": "长按使用激活的一次性重型护甲补充。",
  "A map placed entity which activates with long use.": "通过长按使用激活的地图放置实体。",
  "Chicken AI entity.": "鸡的 AI 实体。",
  "A monitor that renders the view from a given point_camera entity.": "渲染来自指定 point_camera 实体视图的显示器。",
  "Map veto controller.": "地图禁选（veto）控制器。",
  "Global settings that apply across your entire addon": "应用于你整个附加包（addon）的全局设置",
  "Camera preset position names for patch slots on this character.": "此角色贴片槽位的相机预设位置名称。",
  "Explicit order for composite material evaluation.": "复合材质求值的显式顺序。",
  "Override inspect model for keychains": "钥匙扣（keychain）的替代检视模型",

