  "Generic Hint": "通用提示",
  "String identifying what the hint type is, if generic.": "当提示类型为通用（generic）时，用于标识提示类型的字符串。",
  "Priority": "优先级",
  "Relative importance of this hint. Will factor into how NPCs will choose a hint.": "此提示的相对重要程度。将影响 NPC 选择提示的方式。",
  "Low": "低",
  "Medium": "中",
  "High": "高",
  "Critical": "关键",
  "Animgraph Entry Action": "动画图入场动作",
  "Animgraph action that NPCs using this hint should use to initiate a handshake when they start using it.": "使用此提示的 NPC 在开始使用它时应使用的动画图动作，用于启动握手。",
  "Animgraph Exit Action": "动画图出场动作",
  "Animgraph action that NPCs using this hint should use to initiate a handshake when they want to stop using it.": "使用此提示的 NPC 在想要停止使用它时应使用的动画图动作，用于启动握手。",
  "Animgraph Entry Command": "动画图入场指令",
  "Animgraph command that NPCs using this hint should apply to their animgraph when they start using it.": "使用此提示的 NPC 在开始使用它时应应用到其动画图的动画图指令。",
  "Animgraph Exit Command": "动画图出场指令",
  "Animgraph command that NPCs using this hint should apply to their animgraph when they want to stop using it.": "使用此提示的 NPC 在想要停止使用它时应应用到其动画图的动画图指令。",
  "Navlink Target": "导航链接目标",
  "The name of an info_target entity that specifies the location that the animgraph's 'v_navlink_target' parameter should be set to when an NPC uses this node.": "info_target 实体的名称，指定当 NPC 使用此节点时动画图的“v_navlink_target”参数应设置到的位置。",
  "Node FOV": "节点视野",
  "Imagine this node requires that an NPC be in the node's field of view in order to use this hint.": "设定 NPC 必须位于此节点的视野内才能使用此提示。",
  "45 Degrees": "45 度",
  "90 Degrees": "90 度",
  "180 Degrees": "180 度",
  "360 Degrees": "360 度",
  "Start Hint Disabled": "开始时禁用提示",
  "Hint Group": "提示组",
  "If specified, gives the hint a specific group name.  Useful for hint nodes that need to be logically grouped together. NPCs may also refuse to use hint nodes that don't match their hint group.": "如指定，则为该提示指定一个组名。适用于需要在逻辑上归为一组的提示节点。NPC 也可能拒绝使用与其提示组不匹配的提示节点。",
  "Radius": "半径",
  "How close an NPC must be to consider this hint. 0 means infinite.": "NPC 必须靠近到什么程度才考虑此提示。0 表示无限。",
  "Ignore Facing": "忽略朝向",
  "Don't pay attention to the facing of the node. May not apply to a given hint type.": "不关注节点的朝向。可能不适用于某些提示类型。",
  "No": "否",
  "Yes": "是",
  "Default": "默认",
  "Minimum State": "最小状态",
  "Require an NPC have a minimum state to use the hint.": "要求 NPC 具有最小状态才能使用此提示。",
  "Idle": "空闲",
  "Alert": "警戒",
  "Combat": "战斗",
  "Maximum State": "最大状态",
  "Require an NPC have a maximum state to use the hint.": "要求 NPC 具有最大状态才能使用此提示。",
  "Cooldown": "冷却时间",
  "After use, how long does another NPC has to wait in order to use this hint (in seconds).": "使用后，其他 NPC 需等待多长时间才能再次使用此提示（秒）。",
  "Snap NPC To Hint Distance": "NPC 吸附到提示的距离",
  "If > 0, don't snap the NPC to this hint position until the NPC is within the specified range (allows animgraph or other systems to move the entity even after the animations have started). If < 0, don't snap unless you have a Follow Entity specified.": "若 > 0，则在 NPC 进入指定范围之前不将其吸附到此提示位置（允许动画图或其他系统在动画开始后继续移动实体）。若 < 0，则除非指定了跟随实体，否则不吸附。",
  "Enable hint.": "启用提示。",
  "Disable hint.": "禁用提示。",
  "Keep editor position": "保留编辑器位置",
  "Fired when an NPC has reached this node and started using it. Passes along the NPC.": "当 NPC 到达此节点并开始使用时触发。传递该 NPC。",
  "Fired when an NPC has stopped using this node. Passes along the NPC.": "当 NPC 停止使用此节点时触发。传递该 NPC。",
  "Initial State": "初始状态",
  "Off - navigation between the nodes is disabled": "关 - 节点之间的导航被禁用",
  "On - navigation between the nodes is enabled": "开 - 节点之间的导航被启用",
  "Allow Pass When Off": "关闭时允许通过",
  "Entity or class to allow passage even when node is off.": "即使节点关闭也允许通过的实体或类别。",
  "Invert exclusion rules": "反转排除规则",
  "Allowed entity is the only entity NOT allowed when this is checked.": "勾选此项后，被允许的实体将成为唯一不被允许通过的实体。",
  "Normal": "普通",
  "Use As Last Resort": "作为最后手段使用",
  "Turn the link on, enabling travel between the nodes.": "打开链接，启用节点之间的通行。",
  "Turn the link off, disabling travel between the nodes.": "关闭链接，禁用节点之间的通行。",
  "Mins": "最小值",
  "Maxs": "最大值",
  "Use Larger Radius (for air links)": "使用较大半径（用于空中链接）",
  "Check this if this controller is intended to control air links. ": "如果此控制器用于控制空中链接，请勾选此项。",
  "Air links connect using a larger search radius so leaving this unchecked might miss some air links.": "空中链接使用较大的搜索半径连接，因此不勾选此项可能会漏掉一些空中链接。",
  "Change the allowed pass when off": "更改“关闭时允许通过”",
  "Change the invert exclusion rule": "更改反转排除规则",
  "Tests to see if the controlled links are navigable by a human hull and enables the ones that are.": "测试受控链接是否可供人形体通行，并启用可通行的链接。",
  "Radius (Use Helper!)": "半径（请使用辅助工具！）",
  "Start Disabled": "开始时禁用",
  "Infinite Children": "无限子代",
  "Do Not Drop": "不落下",
  "Don't Spawn While Visible": "可见时不生成",
  "Radius around this maker within which NPCs are to be placed. Spawned NPCs will try and find empty space within this radius to spawn.": "此生成器周围的半径，NPC 将在其中被放置。生成的 NPC 会尝试在此半径内寻找空白空间来生成。",
  "Name of Destination Group": "目的地组名称",
  "If you'd like spawned NPCs to be created at an info_npc_spawn_destination entity, enter the name of that entity here. If you have more than one destination entity by that name, the Destination Criteria will be used to select one from the group.": "如果你希望在 info_npc_spawn_destination 实体处生成 NPC，请在此输入该实体的名称。如果你有多个同名目的地实体，将使用目的地条件从该组中选择一个。",
  "Dest. Criterion: Visible to player?": "目的地条件：玩家可见？",
  "Should the NPC try to spawn at a destination that the player can see? Only applicable if a Destination Group is being used.": "NPC 是否应尝试在玩家可以看到的目的地生成？仅在使用目的地组时适用。",
  "Has LOS": "有视线",
  "No LOS": "无视线",
  "Don't Care": "不在乎",
  "In View Cone": "在视锥内",
  "Not In View Cone": "不在视锥内",
  "Has LOS and In View Cone": "有视线且在视锥内",
  "No LOS and Not View Cone": "无视线且不在视锥内",
  "Dest. Criterion: Distance to player?": "目的地条件：与玩家的距离？",
  "Should the NPC try to spawn nearest to or farthest from the player's current location? Only applicable if a Destination Group is being used.": "NPC 是否应尝试在离玩家当前位置最近或最远处生成？仅在使用目的地组时适用。",
  "Nearest": "最近",
  "Farthest": "最远",
  "Minimum spawn distance from player": "距离玩家的最小生成距离",
  "The spawn destination node distance to the player will have to be further or equal than this value.": "生成目的地节点与玩家的距离必须大于或等于此值。",
  "Num. of NPCs": "NPC 数量",
  "Number of NPCs that will spawn before this spawner is exhausted.": "此生成器耗尽前将生成的 NPC 数量。",
  "Batch Count": "批次数量",
  "Number of NPCs to spawn at once, before delaying next spawn by Frequency. (If you change this, you usually want to set Spawn Threshold too)": "一次生成的 NPC 数量，之后按频率延迟下一次生成。（如果你更改此项，通常也需要设置生成阈值）",
  "Frequency": "频率",
  "How often (in seconds) a new NPC will be spawned. If set to -1, a new NPC will be made when the last NPC dies.": "生成新 NPC 的间隔（秒）。若设为 -1，则在上一个 NPC 死亡时生成新的 NPC。",
  "Retry Frequency": "重试频率",
  "How long (in seconds) to wait before trying again after failing to spawn an NPC when no valid spot could be found. If set to -1, Spawn Frequency is used.": "因找不到有效生成点而生成 NPC 失败后，重试前的等待时间（秒）。若设为 -1，则使用生成频率。",
  "Max Live NPCs": "最大存活 NPC 数",
  "Maximum number of live children allowed at any one time (new ones will not be made until one dies). If set to -1, no limit is applied.": "任意时刻允许的最大存活子代数量（有子代死亡前不会生成新的）。若设为 -1，则不限制。",
  "Spawn Threshold": "生成阈值",
  "Number of NPCs below max before we start spawning new ones. (ie, if set to 3, no NPCs will be spawned until we're 3 below our max, at which point we spawn until max)": "低于最大数量多少时开始生成新 NPC。（例如设为 3，则在数量低于最大值 3 之前不会生成，随后一直生成到最大值）",
  "Hull Check Mode": "形体检查模式",
  "How NPC's hull should be checked at spawn destination?": "在生成目的地应如何检查 NPC 的形体？",
  "No hull check": "不检查形体",
  "Oriented": "按朝向",
  "Zero Pitch and Roll on Spawn": "生成时俯仰和翻滚归零",
  "Should we only orient the NPC using the YAW of the destination or spawner, or should we allow any angle?": "应仅使用目的地或生成器的偏航角（YAW）来确定 NPC 朝向，还是允许任意角度？",
  "Tactical Search Spawn": "战术搜索生成",
  "Centered Entity": "居中实体",
  "Entity to center the tactical search spawn test around.  Filling in this field will enable this spawning path.  Requiers AI_DefaultNPC currently.": "以其为中心进行战术搜索生成测试的实体。填写此字段将启用此生成路径。目前需要 AI_DefaultNPC。",
  "Distance Min": "最小距离",
  "Minimum distance allowed from the origin of the centered entity.": "距居中实体原点允许的最小距离。",
  "Distance Max": "最大距离",
  "Maximum distance allowed from the origin of the centered entity.": "距居中实体原点允许的最大距离。",
  "View Angle": "视角",
  "View angle used, if other than -1, to create side planes of a view frustum.": "使用的视角，若非 -1，则用于创建视锥体的侧面。",
  "View Angle Optional": "视角可选",
  "If enalbed, allow the search to fallback to outside the defined view angle in order to find a spawn position.": "启用后，允许搜索回退到定义的视角之外以寻找生成位置。",
  "Nav Filter Tag Name": "导航筛选器标签名称",
  "Nav tag filter constraint requirement.": "导航标签筛选器约束要求。",
  "Material Filter Name": "材质筛选器名称",
  "Ground material contraint requirement.  Defined in material's surface properties.": "地面材质约束要求。在材质的表面属性中定义。",
  "Spawn Randomization Radius": "生成随机化半径",
  "Calculate a random spawn point within this radius centered around the center entity (WIP).": "在此半径内、以中心实体为圆心计算随机生成点（开发中）。",
  "Allow Non-Z Nav": "允许非 Z 轴导航",
  "Allow non-Z up nav meshes as part of the path search.": "在路径搜索中允许非 Z 轴向上的导航网格。",
  "Fired when an NPC is spawned. The activator is the NPC, and the string is the name of the NPC.": "NPC 生成时触发。激活者为该 NPC，字符串为 NPC 的名称。",
  "Fired when any spawned child died": "任何生成的子代死亡时触发",
  "Fired when the spawned is exhausted (all children have been spawned).": "生成器耗尽（所有子代已生成）时触发。",
  "Fired when the spawner is exhausted (all children have been spawned) and all spawned children have died.": "生成器耗尽（所有子代已生成）且所有生成的子代均已死亡时触发。",
  "Fired when all spawned children have died. This does not mean the spawned is exhausted, so a new child may be spawned any time after this (unless the maker is disabled).": "所有生成的子代均已死亡时触发。这并不意味着生成器已耗尽，因此此后随时可能生成新的子代（除非生成器被禁用）。",
  "Spawns an NPC.": "生成一个 NPC。",
  "Toggles the spawner enabled/disabled state.": "切换生成器的启用/禁用状态。",
  "Enables the spawner.": "启用生成器。",
  "Disables the spawner.": "禁用生成器。",
  "Adds to the number of NPCs that can spawn before the spawner is exhausted. If an exhausted spawner is given some children to spawn, it still wont begin spawning until it is re-enabled with the Enable input.": "增加生成器耗尽前可生成的 NPC 数量。如果向已耗尽的生成器添加要生成的子代，它仍不会开始生成，直到通过 Enable 输入重新启用。",
  "Sets the number of NPCs that can spawn before the spawner is exhausted. If an exhausted spawner is given some children to spawn, it still won't begin spawning until it is re-enabled with the Enable input.": "设置生成器耗尽前可生成的 NPC 数量。如果向已耗尽的生成器添加要生成的子代，它仍不会开始生成，直到通过 Enable 输入重新启用。",
  "Sets the maximum number of NPCs that can be alive at any one time from this spawner.": "设置此生成器任意时刻可存活的 NPC 最大数量。",
  "Sets how often (in seconds) a new NPC will be spawned.": "设置生成新 NPC 的间隔（秒）。",
  "Spawn an NPC somewhere within the maker's radius.": "在生成器半径内的某处生成一个 NPC。",
  "Spawn an NPC somewhere within a line behind the maker.": "在生成器后方一条线上的某处生成一个 NPC。",
  "Spawn multiple NPCs (uses destination group, else radius).": "生成多个 NPC（使用目的地组，否则使用半径）。",
  "Switch to a different set of Destination entities.": "切换到另一组目的地实体。",
  "Set the minimum spawn distance from player to destination node.": "设置玩家到目的地节点的最小生成距离。",
  "Select (override) the entity to center the spawn destination around.": "选择（覆盖）作为生成目的地中心的实体。",
  "Set the Batch Count to a new value. See help for Batch Count to understand how it works.": "将批次数量设置为新值。请参阅批次数量的帮助以了解其工作原理。",
  "Set this maker to keep spawning NPCs forever.": "将此生成器设置为永久生成 NPC。",
  "Set this maker to no longer infinitely spawn, using MaxChildren instead. By default, MaxChildren will be reduced by the number of live children (pass in 1 to disable).": "将此生成器设置为不再无限生成，改用 MaxChildren。默认情况下，MaxChildren 会减去当前存活子代的数量（传入 1 可禁用此行为）。",
  "Vehicle to drive": "要驾驶的载具",
  "Start Inactive": "开始时为非活动状态",
  "Tell the driver to attack nearby enemies with the vehicle's weaponry (if any)": "命令驾驶员使用载具武器（如有）攻击附近的敌人",
  "Tell the driver to stop attacking nearby enemies with the vehicle's weaponry.": "命令驾驶员停止使用载具武器攻击附近的敌人。",
  "Tell the driver to go to a specific path corner and continue from there.": "命令驾驶员前往特定的路径拐角并从那里继续。",
  "Maxspeed (percentage of vehicle's maxspeed).": "最大速度（载具最大速度的百分比）。",
  "MinSpeed (percentage of vehicle's maxspeed).": "最小速度（载具最大速度的百分比）。",
  "Set the Maxspeed (percentage of vehicle's maxspeed).": "设置最大速度（载具最大速度的百分比）。",
  "Set the Minspeed (percentage of vehicle's maxspeed).": "设置最小速度（载具最大速度的百分比）。",
  "Tell the driver to start driving.": "命令驾驶员开始驾驶。",
  "Tell the driver to stop driving.": "命令驾驶员停止驾驶。",
  "Reuse Delay": "重复使用延迟",
  "After an NPC is spawned at this destination, the delay before this destination is eligible for selection again.": "在此目的地生成 NPC 后，此目的地再次可供选择前的延迟。",
  "New NPC Name": "新 NPC 名称",
  "If an NPC spawns at this destination, change that NPC's targetname to this.": "如果 NPC 在此目的地生成，则将该 NPC 的 targetname 更改为此名称。",
  "Preview Entity": "预览实体",
  "Fired when an NPC spawns at this destination.": "NPC 在此目的地生成时触发。",
  "Actor to affect": "要影响的角色",
  "NPC that should perform this operation": "应执行此操作的 NPC",
  "Position entity": "位置实体",
  "Name of the entity that the NPC should move to in order to perform the operation.": "NPC 为执行操作应移动到的实体名称。",
  "Context target": "上下文目标",
  "(Optional) Name of an entity that the operator will use within context.": "（可选）操作器将在上下文中使用的实体名称。",
  "Not ready (closed, locked, etc)": "未就绪（关闭、上锁等）",
  "Ready (open and accessible)": "就绪（打开且可进入）",
  "How should NPC approach?": "NPC 应如何接近？",
  "DO NOT USE THIS SETTING": "请勿使用此设置",
  "Walk": "行走",
  "Run": "奔跑",
  "Begin operating on the object": "开始对该对象进行操作",
  "Set the object's state to READY. Fire this input when the object has been unlocked/opened or otherwise made ready for interaction.": "将对象状态设置为就绪。当对象已解锁/打开或已准备好进行交互时，触发此输入。",
  "Fire this input when the NPC has completed the interaction with this object.": "当 NPC 完成与此对象的交互时触发此输入。",
  "Fired when the NPC begins to approach the position": "当 NPC 开始接近该位置时触发",
  "Make the item ready to operate": "使物品准备好被操作",
  "Fired when the NPC is ready to operate": "当 NPC 准备好操作时触发",
  "The item is done": "物品已完成",
  "Subclass name of spawned NPC": "生成 NPC 的子类名称",
  "Childrens' Name": "子代名称",
  "Childrens' Squad Name": "子代小队名称",
  "Childrens' Hint Group": "子代提示组",
  "Disposition": "关系态度",
  "Choose the way the Subject(s) should feel about the Target(s)": "选择主体对目标应持有的态度",
  "Hate": "仇恨",
  "Fear": "恐惧",
  "Like": "好感",
  "Neutral": "中立",
  "Radius for subject": "主体的半径",
  "Disposition Priority": "关系态度优先级",
  "How much the Subject(s) should Like/Hate/Fear the Target(s). Higher priority = stronger feeling.": "主体对目标的好感/仇恨/恐惧程度。优先级越高 = 感情越强。",
  "Start Active": "开始时激活",
  "Reciprocal": "互惠",
  "Set this to YES to have the new relationship mirrored by Target": "设为“是”可让目标镜像这段新关系",
  "Notify subject of target's location": "将目标的位置通知主体",
  "Notify target of subject's location": "将主体的位置通知目标",
  "Apply relationship changes. This will change all Subject entities' relationships to all Target entities.<br><br><b>IMPORTANT:</b> Once you ApplyRelationships, this entity is then 'ALWAYS ON' until you send a Disable input or RevertRelationship input. During the time this entity is 'ON', any entities that spawn who match the Subject or Target names will be affected.<br><br><b>IMPORTANT:</b> Unpredictable results may occur when two ai_relationship entities refer to the same set or subset of target or subject entities. This situation should be avoided.": "应用关系更改。这将改变所有主体实体与所有目标实体的关系。<br><br><b>重要：</b>一旦应用关系（ApplyRelationships），该实体就会“始终开启”，直到你发送 Disable 输入或 RevertRelationship 输入。在此实体“开启”期间，任何生成的、与主体或目标名称匹配的实体都会受到影响。<br><br><b>重要：</b>当两个 ai_relationship 实体引用相同或部分相同的目标或主体实体时，可能出现不可预测的结果。应避免这种情况。",
  "Revert relationship changes. This will return the relationship to what it was at the time the ApplyRelationship input was called (or when this ai_relationship was spawned if StartActive is set).": "还原关系更改。这将把关系恢复到调用 ApplyRelationship 输入时（若设置了 StartActive 则为该 ai_relationship 生成时）的状态。",
  "Revert relationship changes to the default relationship, which may have changed since this ai_relationship was applied. This returns control of the entity relationship to the code.": "将关系更改还原为默认关系，默认关系可能自该 ai_relationship 应用后已发生变化。这将把实体关系的控制权交还给代码。",
  "Subject NPC(s) whose opinion of Target(s) will change": "其对待目标的态度将发生变化的主体 NPC",
  "This is the NPC(s) whose disposition about the Target(s) will change. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是对待目标的态度将发生改变的 NPC。可以是 targetname 或类别名（classname）。",
  "Target player or NPC(s) about whom Subject(s) will feel differently": "主体对其态度将改变的玩家或 NPC",
  "This is the player or NPC(s) about whom the Subject(s) will change their disposition. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是主体将改变对其态度的玩家或 NPC。可以是 targetname 或类别名。",
  "Subject NPC(s) Classification": "主体 NPC 分类",
  "This is the Classification of the NPC who's disposition will change. Optionally used instead of the subject targetname or classname.": "这是态度将发生改变的 NPC 的分类。可选用来代替主体 targetname 或类别名。",
  "Target NPC(s) Classification": "目标 NPC 分类",
  "This is the Classification of the target(s) about whom the Subject(s) will change their disposition. Optionally used instead of the target targetname or classname.": "这是主体将改变对其态度的目标的分类。可选用来代替目标 targetname 或类别名。",
  "Actor(s) to affect": "要影响的角色",
  "Target Entity": "目标实体",
  "Point to wait at if the target's not visible": "目标不可见时等待的位置",
  "Goal Tolerance": "目标容差",
  "If the Actor doesn't get to the lead goal exactly, but gets within this distance, it considers itself as having reached the goal. -1 means use the NPC's default tolerance (which is half their hull width).": "如果角色没有精确到达引导目标，但进入了此距离范围内，即视为已达成目标。-1 表示使用 NPC 的默认容差（其形体宽度的一半）。",
  "Wait until player gets within this distance before starting to Lead them. If set to 0, start Leading as soon as the player is visible.": "等待玩家进入此距离后才开始引导。若设为 0，则玩家一可见立即开始引导。",
  "Starting Speech Distance": "开始对话距离",
  "The distance from the player that this NPC should move to before speaking the TLK_LEAD_START concept.": "该 NPC 在说出 TLK_LEAD_START 概念之前应移动到的与玩家的距离。",
  "Close Distance": "贴近距离",
  "The player is considered to be Close if they're within this distance.": "玩家在此距离内即视为贴近。",
  "Lagging Distance": "滞后距离",
  "The player is considered to be Lagging if they're beyond this distance. If the player is Lagging > 3-4s, they're considered Lost, and the NPC will go back to retrieve them. If the Retrieve Player option is set to 'No', the NPC will stop moving and wait instead.": "玩家超出此距离即视为滞后。如果玩家滞后超过 3-4 秒，即视为掉队，NPC 将返回寻回他们。如果“寻回玩家”选项设为“否”，NPC 将停止移动并原地等待。",
  "Success Distance": "成功距离",
  "The distance from the player (to the NPC) that the player must be within for the Lead to succeed, once the NPC has reached the goal. If set to 0, it'll use the lead distance instead (for legacy support).": "NPC 到达目标后，玩家与 NPC 之间必须保持的距离，引导才算成功。若设为 0，则改用引导距离（为兼容旧版）。",
  "Retrieve Lost players?": "寻回掉队玩家？",
  "No, just idle and wait.": "否，仅空闲等待。",
  "Yes, move to retrieve.": "是，移动寻回。",
  "Before Coming Back, Wait for speech?": "返回前等待对话？",
  "No, come back while speaking.": "否，边说话边返回。",
  "Yes, wait for speech to finish.": "是，等待对话结束。",
  "On Retrieve, Wait for speech?": "寻回后等待对话？",
  "No, start leading while speaking.": "否，边说话边开始引导。",
  "Yes, wait for speech to finish before starting to lead.": "是，等待对话结束后再开始引导。",
  "Speak start greeting?": "说出开始问候语？",
  "Yes, speak the start greeting before starting to lead.": "是，在开始引导前说出开始问候语。",
  "No, don't speak the greeting.": "否，不说问候语。",
  "Lead during combat?": "战斗中继续引导？",
  "No. Stop to fight, resume leading when safe.": "否。停下战斗，安全后继续引导。",
  "Yes, lead while fighting.": "是，边战斗边引导。",
  "Stop Scenes When Player Lagging?": "玩家滞后时停止场景？",
  "If set, pause any choreo scenes the Leader is running when the player lags. They'll be resumed after the player has been retrieved.": "设置后，当玩家滞后时暂停领队正在运行的编舞场景。玩家被寻回后场景将恢复。",
  "No, don't pause.": "否，不暂停。",
  "Yes, pause scenes player lags.": "是，玩家滞后时暂停场景。",
  "Gag Leader?": "使领队禁言？",
  "Prevent the Leader from speaking any concepts related to the Lead behavior.": "阻止领队说出与引导行为相关的任何概念。",
  "No.": "否。",
  "Yes, prevent speech.": "是，禁止说话。",
  "Prevent Success?": "禁止成功？",
  "If set, the Lead won't be allowed to succeed and finish. Use this when you want the Lead to continue forever, until some other external logic intervenes and tells it to stop.": "设置后，引导将不允许成功完成。当你希望引导无限持续，直到其他外部逻辑介入并命令其停止时使用。",
  "Yes. ": "是。",
  "Use Goal Facing?": "使用目标朝向？",
  "While waiting at the lead goal for the player to arrive, should the Leader face along the yaw specified by the goal entity?": "在引导目标处等待玩家到达时，领队是否应朝向目标实体指定的偏航角？",
  "No, let other AI dictate facing while waiting.": "否，等待时朝向由其他 AI 决定。",
  "Yes, turn to face while waiting.": "是，等待时转身面向。",
  "Attract player concept modifier": "吸引玩家概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_ATTRACTPLAYER' concept is spoken.": "在说出“TLK_LEAD_ATTRACTPLAYER”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。",
  "Player wait over concept modifier": "玩家等待结束概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_WAITOVER' concept is spoken.": "在说出“TLK_LEAD_WAITOVER”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。",
  "Arrival concept modifier": "到达概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_ARRIVAL' concept is spoken.": "在说出“TLK_LEAD_ARRIVAL”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。",
  "Post-arrival concepts modifier": "到达后概念修饰符",
  "Success concept modifier": "成功概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_SUCCESS' concept is spoken.": "在说出“TLK_LEAD_SUCCESS”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。",
  "Failure concept modifier": "失败概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'lead_fail' concept is spoken.": "在说出“lead_fail”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。",
  "Coming Back concept modifier": "返回概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_RETRIEVE' concept is spoken. Spoken as the NPC starts returning to the player to retrieve him.": "在说出“TLK_LEAD_RETRIEVE”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。在 NPC 开始返回寻回玩家时说出。",
  "Retrieve concept modifier": "寻回概念修饰符",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_COMINGBACK' concept is spoken. Spoken when NPC has finally reached the player to retrieve him.": "在说出“TLK_LEAD_COMINGBACK”概念时附加到传入响应规则的键值中。在 NPC 最终到达玩家处寻回时说出。",
  "Begin the leading behavior": "开始引导行为",
  "Stop the leading behavior": "停止引导行为",
  "Updates the Target Entity to the entity matching the string parameter.": "将目标实体更新为与字符串参数匹配的实体。",
  "Notify success of leading": "通知引导成功",
  "Notify failure of leading": "通知引导失败",
  "Fires when NPC reaches the lead point": "当 NPC 到达引导点时触发",
  "Fires when NPC has played out any arrival speech": "当 NPC 播放完任何到达台词时触发",
  "Fires when NPC achieves the goal": "当 NPC 达成目标时触发",
  "Fires when NPC fails to achieves the goal": "当 NPC 未能达成目标时触发",
  "Fires when NPC completes behavior (any post-success or fail acting is complete)": "当 NPC 完成行为（所有成功或失败后的表演均结束）时触发",
  "Search Type": "搜索类型",
  "How to search for the entities using the targetname.": "如何使用 targetname 搜索实体。",
  "Entity Name": "实体名称",
  "Classname": "类别名",
  "The name of the entity to follow. If blank, and the actor likes the player, then defaults to player": "要跟随的实体名称。若留空，且该角色对玩家有好感，则默认跟随玩家",
  "Maximum state": "最大状态",
  "Formation": "队形",
  "Close circle": "紧密环绕",
  "Wide circle": "宽散环绕",
  "Medium circle": "中等环绕",
  "Sidekick": "伙伴",
  "Vortigaunt (FIXME)": "弗地岗人（FIXME）",
  "Use parent's orientation": "使用父级的朝向",
  "Actor(s) or squad to affect": "要影响的角色或小队",
  "Match by actor name only": "仅按角色名称匹配",
  "If false, match by squad name as well as actor name.": "若为 false，则同时按小队名称和角色名称匹配。",
  "Active": "激活",
  "Strict": "严格",
  "Player orders can override, applies to allies only": "玩家命令可以覆盖，仅对友军生效",
  "NPC's that should act busy": "应执行忙碌行为的 NPC",
  "Search Range for Busy Hints": "忙碌提示搜索范围",
  "Visible Busy Hints Only": "仅可见的忙碌提示",
  "Update the busy search range for all actors.": "更新所有角色的忙碌搜索范围。",
  "Force an NPC to act busy. Takes parameters, separated by spaces: <Targetname> <hint node targetname> <optional:teleport> <optional:$customactivityorsequence> <maximum time to actbusy>. If no hint node targetname is specified, it'll search for a random one. If no max time is specified, it'll use the default. Specifying 0 as the max time will make the NPC act busy until disturbed. If the optional teleport parameter is specified, the NPC will teleport to the act busy point. A custom move animation can be specified by prepending $ to the name of it. i.e. $ACT_RUN will make the NPC Run. Sequence names can be used instead of activities.": "强制 NPC 进入忙碌状态。接受以空格分隔的参数：<Targetname> <提示节点 targetname> <可选：teleport> <可选：$自定义动作或序列> <最长忙碌时间>。若未指定提示节点 targetname，将随机搜索一个。若未指定最长时间，将使用默认值。最长时间指定为 0 会使 NPC 一直忙碌，直到被打扰。若指定了可选的 teleport 参数，NPC 将传送到忙碌点。可通过在名称前加 $ 来指定自定义移动动画。例如 $ACT_RUN 会让 NPC 奔跑。序列名称也可以代替动作使用。",
  "Force an NPC outputted from another entity to act busy. (only usable from an output that specifies an entity)": "强制从另一实体输出的 NPC 进入忙碌状态。（仅可用于指定了实体的输出）",
  "Force an NPC outputted from another entity to find a HINT_NPC_EXIT_POINT hintnode and vanish.": "强制从另一实体输出的 NPC 寻找 HINT_NPC_EXIT_POINT 提示节点并消失。",
  "Fired when an NPC targeted by this goal starts an ActBusy animation.": "当此目标指定的 NPC 开始忙碌动画时触发。",
  "Fired when an NPC targeted by this goal finishes an ActBusy.": "当此目标指定的 NPC 结束忙碌行为时触发。",
  "Fired when an NPC target by this goal finishes a forced Leave.": "当此目标指定的 NPC 结束被强制的离开时触发。",
  "Sight Entity": "注视实体",
  "The Sight Entity (if you provide one) is an entity that will leave the current ActBusy if the Actor playing the ActBusy loses sight of it for the amount of time specified in 'Sight Entity Timeout'. THIS MAY ONLY BE A TARGET NAME. NO CLASSNAMES.": "注视实体（如果你提供的话）是这样一种实体：当执行忙碌行为的角色在“注视实体超时”指定的时间内失去对它的视线时，将退出当前的忙碌行为。只能填写目标名称，不能填写类别名。",
  "Sight Entity Timeout": "注视实体超时",
  "If you provide a Sight Entity, the Actor will leave the current ActBusy if the Actor has lost sight of Sight Entity for this many seconds.": "如果你提供了注视实体，当角色失去对注视实体的视线达到此秒数时，角色将退出当前的忙碌行为。",
  "Disable Active Searching": "禁用主动搜索",
  "If set, Actors won't search for act busy opportunities, even when the act busy goal is enabled. Instead, they'll require the NPC AI code to trigger act busies opportunistically (i.e. like zombies with unreachable enemies do).": "设置后，即使忙碌目标已启用，角色也不会主动搜索忙碌机会，而是需要 NPC AI 代码随机触发忙碌行为（例如僵尸面对无法到达的敌人时）。",
  "Sight Enemy Method": "注视敌人判定方式",
  "The method to use to determine whether the Sight enemy is visible.": "用于判断注视的敌人是否可见的方式。",
  "Default. LOS -and- Viewcone": "默认。视线 -且- 视锥",
  "LOS Only. Disregard Viewcone": "仅视线。忽略视锥",
  "Forced": "强制",
  "Not forced": "不强制",
  "Forced but not held": "强制但不保持",
  "Forced and held until deactivated via input": "强制并保持，直到通过输入解除",
  "Actbusy Type": "忙碌类型",
  "Default (Standard)": "默认（标准）",
  "Combat Safe Zone": "战斗安全区",
  "Only for combat actbusy. Lets you specify a volume which is the 'safe zone'. The Combat ActBusy will cancel if any enemies are seen in the safe zone.": "仅用于战斗忙碌。允许你指定一个作为“安全区”的体积。如果在安全区内发现任何敌人，战斗忙碌将取消。",
  "Allow actor to teleport?": "允许角色传送？",
  "Yes (Only for Combat Actbusy)": "是（仅用于战斗忙碌）",
  "Change the Actbusy Type to the specified value. See 'Actbusy Type' for valid values.": "将忙碌类型更改为指定值。有效值请参见“忙碌类型”。",
  "Turn on active searching.": "开启主动搜索。",
  "Turn off active searching.": "关闭主动搜索。",
  "Fired when the NPC loses sight of the see entity (if one is specified).": "当 NPC 失去对注视实体（如果指定了）的视线时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC leaves his actbusy because of sighting an enemy.": "当此 NPC 因发现敌人而离开忙碌状态时触发。",
  "Exit Node": "出口节点",
  "The name of the node the first NPC in the queue should move to when he leaves the head of the queue.": "队列中第一个 NPC 离开队首时应移动到的节点名称。",
  "Node 1": "节点 1",
  "The name of the first actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第一个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 2": "节点 2",
  "The name of the second actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第二个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 3": "节点 3",
  "The name of the third actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第三个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 4": "节点 4",
  "The name of the fourth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第四个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 5": "节点 5",
  "The name of the fifth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第五个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 6": "节点 6",
  "The name of the sixth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第六个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 7": "节点 7",
  "The name of the seventh actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第七个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 8": "节点 8",
  "The name of the eighth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第八个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 9": "节点 9",
  "The name of the ninth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第九个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 10": "节点 10",
  "The name of the tenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 11": "节点 11",
  "The name of the eleventh actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十一个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 12": "节点 12",
  "The name of the twelfth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十二个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 13": "节点 13",
  "The name of the thirteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十三个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 14": "节点 14",
  "The name of the fourteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十四个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 15": "节点 15",
  "The name of the fifteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十五个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 16": "节点 16",
  "The name of the sixteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十六个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 17": "节点 17",
  "The name of the seventeenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十七个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 18": "节点 18",
  "The name of the eighteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十八个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 19": "节点 19",
  "The name of the nineteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十九个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Node 20": "节点 20",
  "The name of the twentieth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第二十个忙碌提示节点的名称。",
  "Must Reach Front": "必须到达队首",
  "If true, NPCs much reach the front node in the queue before they're allowed to leave the queue.": "如果为 true，NPC 必须先到达队首节点才被允许离开队列。",
  "Tell the queue manager that the player has started blocking a spot in the queue.": "告诉队列管理器玩家已开始占用队列中的位置。",
  "Tell the queue manager that the player has stopped blocking a spot in the queue.": "告诉队列管理器玩家已停止占用队列中的位置。",
  "Force the queue to move up, sending the front-most NPC out of the queue.": "强制队列前移，使最前面的 NPC 离开队列。",
  "Fired when the queue moves. Outputs the number of NPCs left in the queue.": "队列移动时触发。输出队列中剩余的 NPC 数量。",
  "Fired when the NPC at the head of the queue starts to leave. The activator is the NPC, and the string is the name of the NPC.": "位于队首的 NPC 开始离开时触发。激活者为该 NPC，字符串为 NPC 的名称。",
  "Fired when the NPC at the head of the queue leaves. The activator is the NPC, and the string is the name of the NPC.": "位于队首的 NPC 离开时触发。激活者为该 NPC，字符串为 NPC 的名称。",
  "How to search for the entities to change.": "如何搜索要更改的实体。",
  "Old Hint Group": "原提示组",
  "Name to search for": "要搜索的名称",
  "New Hint Group": "新提示组",
  "Search Radius": "搜索半径",
  "Radius to search (0 for all of map)": "搜索半径（0 为整个地图）",
  "Removes this entity from the world": "将此实体从世界中移除",
  "Change the Hint Group": "更改提示组",
  "Actor": "角色",
  "NPC Target": "NPC 目标",
  "Minimum state": "最小状态",
  "Actor is running a script?": "角色正在运行脚本？",
  "Don't care": "不在乎",
  "Required Time": "要求时间",
  "Duration of time that all the conditions must be true": "所有条件必须保持为真的时长",
  "Minimum time out": "最小超时",
  "Minimum time before OnConditionsTimeout is fired. 0 = never expire.": "触发 OnConditionsTimeout 前的最短时间。0 = 永不过期。",
  "Maximum time out": "最大超时",
  "Maximum time before OnConditionsTimeout is fired. 0 = ignore (If you don't specify a Maximum timeout, conditions will time out at exactly Minimum Time Out. If you DO specify a Maximum time out, timeout will occur randomly between Minimum and Maximum time out values.)": "触发 OnConditionsTimeout 前的最长时间。0 = 忽略（如果不指定最大超时，条件将在恰好最小超时值时过期。如果指定了最大超时，超时将在最小与最大超时值之间随机发生。）",
  "Actor Sees Player": "角色看见玩家",
  "Player distance": "玩家距离",
  "The distance the player must/must not be to the actor. Negative values for NOT, 0 for ignore.": "玩家与角色之间必须/必须不保持的距离。负值表示“非”，0 表示忽略。",
  "Player FOV for Actor ": "角色眼中玩家的视场角 ",
  "Specify angle of view cone in degrees. Negative value = NOT": "以度指定视锥角度。负值 = 非",
  "Play FOV to Actor is a true view cone": "玩家的视场角对于角色是否为真实视锥",
  "Player's view cone is evaluated as a true cone, not pie slice ": "玩家的视锥被评估为真实锥体，而非扇形切片 ",
  "No - Tall pie slice": "否 - 高扇形切片",
  "Yes - True view cone": "是 - 真实视锥",
  "Player has LOS to Actor": "玩家对角色有视线",
  "Checks that the player has clear Line of Sight to the Actor": "检查玩家与角色之间是否有清晰的视线",
  "Target (Optional)": "目标（可选）",
  "Optional entity to include in conditions": "可包含在条件中的可选实体",
  "Actor Sees Target": "角色看见目标",
  "Target distance": "目标距离",
  "The distance the actor must/must not be to the Target. Negative values for NOT, 0 for ignore.": "角色与目标之间必须/必须不保持的距离。负值表示“非”，0 表示忽略。",
  "Player distance from Target": "玩家与目标的距离",
  "The distance the player must/must not be to the Target. Negative values for NOT, 0 for ignore.": "玩家与目标之间必须/必须不保持的距离。负值表示“非”，0 表示忽略。",
  "Player FOV for Target": "目标眼中玩家的视场角",
  "Play FOV to Target is a true view cone": "玩家的视场角对于目标是否为真实视锥",
  "Player has LOS to Target": "玩家对目标有视线",
  "Checks that the player has clear Line of Sight to the Target": "检查玩家与目标之间是否有清晰的视线",
  "Player blocking Actor": "玩家阻挡角色",
  "Checks that the player is blocking the Actor's path": "检查玩家是否阻挡了角色的路径",
  "Actor in Player's PVS": "角色在玩家的 PVS 内",
  "Checks that the actor is in the player's PVS": "检查角色是否位于玩家的 PVS 内",
  "Actor in a vehicle": "角色在载具中",
  "Checks the actor's state in a vehicle": "检查角色在载具中的状态",
  "Player in a vehicle": "玩家在载具中",
  "Checks the player's state in a vehicle": "检查玩家在载具中的状态",
  "Fire outputs with the Actor as Activator": "以角色作为激活者触发输出",
  "Enable this entity": "启用此实体",
  "Disable this entity": "禁用此实体",
  "Fires when AI conditions satisfied": "当 AI 条件满足时触发",
  "Fires when AI conditions timed out": "当 AI 条件超时时触发",
  "Fires if/when there are no matching actors in the map.": "如果/当地图中没有匹配的角色时触发。",
  "Subject(s)": "主体",
  "This is the NPC(s) whose speech we're filtering. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是我们要过滤其对话的 NPC。可以是 targetname 或类别名。",
  "Idle modifier.": "空闲修饰符。",
  "Multiplier to the percentage chance that our NPC(s) will idle speak. Set to 0 to prevent all idle speech.": "我们的 NPC 进行空闲对话的几率乘数。设为 0 可完全禁止空闲对话。",
  "Greet Player?": "问候玩家？",
  "If set to Yes, our NPC(s) won't greet the player when they first meet him.": "如果设为“是”，我们的 NPC 初次遇见玩家时不会问候他。",
  "Allows designers to change the idle modifier at runtime": "允许设计者在运行时更改空闲修饰符",
  "Scene file": "场景文件",
  "Target 1": "目标 1",
  "Target 2": "目标 2",
  "Target 3": "目标 3",
  "Target 4": "目标 4",
  "Target 5": "目标 5",
  "Target 6": "目标 6",
  "Target 7": "目标 7",
  "Target 8": "目标 8",
  "If an Actor is talking...": "如果某角色正在说话……",
  "What to do if an actor this scene needs is already talking when this scene is told to start.": "当此场景被要求开始时，若场景所需的角色已在说话，应如何处理。",
  "Start immediately": "立即开始",
  "Wait for actor to finish": "等待角色说完",
  "Interrupt at next interrupt event": "在下一个中断事件处打断",
  "Cancel at next interrupt event": "在下一个中断事件处取消",
  "Starts playback of the scene file": "开始播放场景文件",
  "Pauses playback of the scene file": "暂停播放场景文件",
  "Resumes playback of the scene if it has been paused": "若场景已暂停，则恢复播放",
  "Cancels playback of the scene": "取消播放场景",
  "Cancels playback of the scene at the next interrupt event in the scene.": "在场景中的下一个中断事件处取消播放场景。",
  "Multiplies the the pitch": "音调倍乘",
  "Finds an actor who can respond to the specified concept string while the scene continues playing": "查找一个能够在场景继续播放时响应指定概念字符串的演员（actor）",
  "Stop waiting on an actor to stop talking.": "停止等待演员结束说话。",
  "Pause playback of the scene at the next interrupt event in the scene.": "在场景中的下一个中断事件处暂停播放场景。",
  "Change the entity Target1 references.": "更改 Target1 所引用的实体。",
  "Change the entity Target2 references.": "更改 Target2 所引用的实体。",
  "The scene has started": "场景已开始",
  "The scene has completed": "场景已完成",
  "The scene has been canceled": "场景已被取消",
  "The scene has been paused": "场景已暂停",
  "The scene has been resumed": "场景已恢复",
  "On player death": "玩家死亡时",
  "What should this entity do if the player dies": "如果玩家死亡，此实体应该做什么",
  "Do Nothing": "不做任何事",
  "Cancel Script and return to AI": "取消脚本并返回 AI 控制",
  "Scene 1": "场景 1",
  "The name of a logic_choreographed_scene, or logic_scene_list_manager.": "logic_choreographed_scene 或 logic_scene_list_manager 的名称。",
  "Scene 2": "场景 2",
  "Scene 3": "场景 3",
  "Scene 4": "场景 4",
  "Scene 5": "场景 5",
  "Scene 6": "场景 6",
  "Scene 7": "场景 7",
  "Scene 8": "场景 8",
  "Scene 9": "场景 9",
  "Scene 10": "场景 10",
  "Scene 11": "场景 11",
  "Scene 12": "场景 12",
  "Scene 13": "场景 13",
  "Scene 14": "场景 14",
  "Scene 15": "场景 15",
  "Scene 16": "场景 16",
  "Remove the manager and all scenes referenced by it (and all scenes referenced by logic_scene_list_manager's embedded in this one).": "移除该管理器及其引用的所有场景（包括 logic_scene_list_manager 内嵌引用的所有场景）。",
  "Start the AI event.": "启动 AI 事件。",
  "Stop this AI event if it is currently active.": "若此 AI 事件当前处于活动状态，则停止它。",
  "How far away this event can be detected. This is a radius.": "此事件能被侦测到的最大距离。此值为半径。",
  "Duration": "持续时间",
  "How long the event persists each time you start it.": "此事件每次启动后持续的时长。",
  "Event Type": "事件类型",
  "The type of sound or smell will determine the reaction of NPCs that sense it.": "声音或气味的类型将决定感知到它的 NPC 的反应。",
  "Danger": "危险",
  "Bullet Impact": "子弹冲击",
  "Physics Danger": "物理危险",
  "Move Away": "远离",
  "Glass Break": "玻璃破碎",
  "Warn Friends": "警告同伴",
  "Gunfire": "枪声",
  "Explosion": "爆炸",
  "Thumper": "捣碎器（Thumper）",
  "Food": "食物",
  "Additional event context (optional)": "附加事件上下文（可选）",
  "Optional settings specifying such things as who can or cannot detect the event.": "可选设置，用于指定谁能或不能侦测到该事件。",
  "Cause npcs to blindly panic": "使 NPC 盲目恐慌",
  "Only Combine react": "仅联合军（Combine）作出反应",
  "Combine ignore": "联合军忽略",
  "Location Proxy": "位置代理",
  "The name of an entity to use as a proxy to determine the location at which to make the sound. If you specify an entity here, the sound will be made at that entity's location (!player included)": "用作代理以确定发出声音位置的实体名称。如果在此指定实体，声音将在该实体的位置发出（包括 !player）",
  "Animation target": "动画目标",
  "Target attachment point name": "目标附着点名称",
  "Set the animation target to use. An empty string will disable the puppet.": "设置要使用的动画目标。空字符串将禁用木偶（puppet）。",
  "Listen Filter": "监听过滤器",
  "The name of an filter entity which specifies the only entities the microphone can hear. Sounds emitted by other entities will not be heard.": "过滤器实体的名称，指定麦克风只能听到的实体。其他实体发出的声音将不会被听到。",
  "Event Types": "事件类型",
  "The type of event to listen for": "要监听的事件类型",
  "Player": "玩家",
  "Player Vehicle": "玩家载具",
  "Physics Object": "物理对象",
  "Gravity Force": "重力",
  "Sensitivity": "灵敏度",
  "How much to scale event radii when doing sensing": "进行感知时事件半径的缩放比例",
  "Maximum hearing range (0=infinite)": "最大听觉范围（0=无限）",
  "Events beyond this range won't be detected, irrelevant of event radius.": "超出此范围的事件将不会被侦测到，与事件半径无关。",
  "Unit Subclass": "单位子类",
  "Subclass of the NPC Unit.": "NPC 单位的子类。",
  "Spawn as Temp Ragdoll": "以临时布娃娃生成",
  "Specifies if the NPC will spawn as a temporary ragdoll and the behavior after becoming a ragdoll.": "指定 NPC 是否以临时布娃娃生成，以及变成布娃娃后的行为。",
  "Disabled": "禁用",
  "Ragdoll and get up when settled": "变为布娃娃并在稳定后起身",
  "Ragdoll and remain ragdoll": "变为布娃娃并保持布娃娃状态",
  "Spawn Hunting Nearest Player?": "生成时猎杀最近的玩家？",
  "Enemy Filter": "敌人过滤器",
  "Filter by which to filter potential enemies": "用于筛选潜在敌人的过滤器",
  "Ignore unseen enemies": "忽略未见过的敌人",
  "Prefer visible enemies, regardless of distance or relationship priority": "优先选择可见的敌人，无论距离或关系优先级",
  "Wait until seen by player": "等待被玩家看到",
  "Disable sensing until this NPC has been seen by the player": "在此 NPC 被玩家看到之前禁用感知",
  "Fired when this NPC establishes line of sight to its enemy, and that enemy is a player (outputs player entity).": "当此 NPC 与其敌人建立视线且该敌人是玩家时触发（输出玩家实体）。",
  "Fired when this NPC hears the player.": "当此 NPC 听到玩家时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC hears combat sounds.": "当此 NPC 听到战斗声音时触发。",
  "This NPC just finished getting up after being a ragdoll.": "此 NPC 刚以布娃娃状态结束并起身。",
  "A new condition was set on the NPC. Only a subset of conditions are sent through this to reduce the amount of entity IO happening.": "NPC 上设置了新的状态（condition）。只有一部分状态会通过此输出发送，以减少实体 IO 的数量。",
  "A condition was removed from the NPC. Only a subset of conditions are sent through this to reduce the amount of entity IO happening.": "NPC 上移除了一个状态（condition）。只有一部分状态会通过此输出发送，以减少实体 IO 的数量。",
  "An ability has started, but may not complete.": "一个技能已开始，但可能不会完成。",
  "An ability has been finished.": "一个技能已完成。",
  "Fired when NPC touches a surface material defined in the touch material modifier.": "当 NPC 接触到在接触材质修改器中定义的表面材质时触发。",
  "Fired when NPC leaves a surface material defined in the touch material modifier.": "当 NPC 离开在接触材质修改器中定义的表面材质时触发。",
  "Changes this NPC's enemy filter to the named filter.": "将此 NPC 的敌人过滤器更改为指定的过滤器。",
  "Ignore danger sounds for the specified number of seconds.": "在指定的秒数内忽略危险声音。",
  "Force the NPC to holster their weapon. Ignored if the NPC is scripting, if the NPC's weapon is already holstered, or if the NPC doesn't use weapons.": "强制此 NPC 收起武器。如果 NPC 正在执行脚本、武器已收起或不使用武器，则忽略。",
  "Identical to HolsterWeapon, except the weapon is destroyed once it has been holstered and concealed.": "与 HolsterWeapon 相同，但武器在收起并藏好后会被销毁。",
  "Force the NPC to draw their weapon. Ignored if the NPC is scripting, if the NPC's weapon is already drawn, or if the NPC doesn't use weapons.": "强制此 NPC 拔出武器。如果 NPC 正在执行脚本、武器已拔出或不使用武器，则忽略。",
  "Become a temporary ragdoll that then can be later unrgadolled.": "变为临时布娃娃，之后可以解除布娃娃状态。",
  "Become a temporary animated ragdoll that then can be later unrgadolled.": "变为带动画的临时布娃娃，之后可以解除布娃娃状态。",
  "Rise from your grave.": "从坟墓中复活。",
  "Rise from your grave to attack an enemy. Animgraph NPCs will turn to face the enemy during their unragdoll. Parameter is the enemy, usually the !activator on the trigger that's firing this input.": "从坟墓中复活以攻击敌人。Animgraph NPC 在解除布娃娃期间会转向面对敌人。参数为敌人，通常是触发此输入的触发器上的 !activator。",
  "Enter scripting state. In this state, NPCs ignore a variety of stimulus that would make them break out of their scripts: They ignore danger sounds, ignore +USE, don't idle speak or respond to other NPC's idle speech, and so on.": "进入脚本状态。在此状态下，NPC 会忽略各种会使它们脱离脚本的刺激：忽略危险声音、忽略 +USE、不进行闲聊语音或回应其他 NPC 的闲聊语音等。",
  "Exit scripting state.": "退出脚本状态。",
  "Set an animation graph parameter Format: <name=value>": "设置动画图参数 格式：<名称=值>",
  "Sets the active ragdoll profile.": "设置活动布娃娃配置文件。",
  "Enable the teleport buffer around this NPC, if it's been disabled previously.": "启用此 NPC 周围的传送缓冲（如果之前已被禁用）。",
  "Disable the teleport buffer around this NPC.": "禁用此 NPC 周围的传送缓冲。",
  "Enable the phys proxy.": "启用物理代理。",
  "Disable the phys proxy.": "禁用物理代理。",
  "Disables the AI's random lookAts.": "禁用 AI 的随机注视（lookAt）。",
  "Enables the AI's random lookAts.": "启用 AI 的随机注视（lookAt）。",
  "Disable the NPC's Hearing senses. They won't hear any AI sounds (NPC/Combat/Player/Weapon/etc)": "禁用 NPC 的听觉感知。它们将听不到任何 AI 声音（NPC/战斗/玩家/武器等）",
  "Enable the NPC's Hearing senses.": "启用 NPC 的听觉感知。",
  "Disable the NPC's ability to see. They won't hear determine visibility of any enemies / friends.": "禁用 NPC 的视觉能力。它们将无法判断任何敌人/同伴的可见性。",
  "Enable the NPC's ability to see.": "启用 NPC 的视觉能力。",
  "Set named actor to be the look at target": "将指定演员设置为注视目标",
  "Clear the look at target set by ForceLookAtTarget": "清除由 ForceLookAtTarget 设置的注视目标",
  "NPC does not look at the player hands": "NPC 不注视玩家的手",
  "NPC will look at the player hands": "NPC 会注视玩家的手",
  "Adds an ability to the NPC": "为 NPC 添加一个技能",
  "Enables an ability on the NPC.": "在 NPC 上启用一个技能。",
  "Disables an ability on the NPC.": "在 NPC 上禁用一个技能。",
  "Return the ability on the NPC to the AI's control (i.e. AI will decide whether or not the ability is enabled or disabled)": "将 NPC 上的技能交还给 AI 控制（即由 AI 决定该技能是启用还是禁用）",
  "Removes an ability to the NPC": "从 NPC 上移除一个技能",
  "Disable all abilities on the NPC. Parameter: 0 - Do not disable all abilities, 1 - Do disable all abilities": "禁用 NPC 上的所有技能。参数：0 - 不禁用所有技能，1 - 禁用所有技能",
  "Force this NPC to use a specified movement gait. Empty string cancels the override; otherwise use 'Slow,Medium,Fast,VeryFast' .": "强制此 NPC 使用指定的移动步态。空字符串取消覆盖；否则使用 'Slow,Medium,Fast,VeryFast'。",
  "Force this NPC to use a specified movement gait set. Empty string cancels the override": "强制此 NPC 使用指定的移动步态组。空字符串取消覆盖",
  "Force this NPC to aim or not aim. Parameter: 0 - Return to AI, 1 - Force Aiming, 2 - Force Not Aiming. Note that an NPC forced to Not Aim may be non-functional in combat.": "强制此 NPC 瞄准或不瞄准。参数：0 - 返回 AI 控制，1 - 强制瞄准，2 - 强制不瞄准。注意：被强制不瞄准的 NPC 在战斗中可能无法正常运作。",
  "Force an NPC to go into an Act Busy. The parameter is the act busy entry name found in actbusy.vdata": "强制 NPC 进入 Act Busy。参数为在 actbusy.vdata 中找到的 act busy 条目名称。",
  "Force an NPC to exit a performing Act Busy.": "强制 NPC 退出正在执行的 Act Busy。",
  "Set the hint group you want the NPC to find hints for. This takes precedence over preferrred hint groups specified in vdata.": "设置你希望 NPC 寻找提示（hint）的提示组。此设置优先于 vdata 中指定的首选提示组。",
  "Adds a hint group that the NPC to find hints for. This takes precedence over preferrred hint groups specified in vdata.": "为 NPC 添加一个用于寻找提示的提示组。此设置优先于 vdata 中指定的首选提示组。",
  "Removes a hint group that the NPC to find hints for. This takes precedence over preferrred hint groups specified in vdata.": "移除一个 NPC 用于寻找提示的提示组。此设置优先于 vdata 中指定的首选提示组。",
  "Adds a nav attribute by name that the NPC is not allowed to navigate on.": "按名称添加一个 NPC 不允许在其上进行导航的导航属性。",
  "Removes a nav attribute by name that the NPC was not allowed to navigate on.": "按名称移除一个 NPC 原本不允许在其上进行导航的导航属性。",
  "Update (or Create) this NPC's memory of an enemy and its location": "更新（或创建）此 NPC 对某个敌人及其位置的记忆",
  "Clears out the NPC's knowledge of a named entity.": "清除 NPC 对指定实体的认知。",
  "Turn on the NPC Gag flag. NPC won't speak outside of choreographed scenes.": "打开 NPC 的禁言（Gag）标记。NPC 在编排场景之外不会说话。",
  "Turn off the NPC Gag flag.": "关闭 NPC 的禁言（Gag）标记。",
  "Waiting to Rappel?": "等待速降？",
  "If yes, this NPC spawns suspended in air and awaits a BeginRappel input. It will then spawn a zipline and slide down. When it hits the ground, NPC will cut away the line and try to move forward a few feet to make room for the next NPC. The NPC will not attempt to clear its landing space if it cannot do so by taking a few steps forward": "如果是，此 NPC 将悬挂在空中生成并等待 BeginRappel 输入。随后它会生成一条滑索并滑下。落地时，NPC 会切断绳索并尝试向前移动几英尺，为下一个 NPC 腾出空间。如果无法通过向前走几步来清理着陆空间，NPC 将不会尝试清理。",
  "Fires when done rappeling": "速降完成时触发",
  "Initial Speed": "初始速度",
  "Sets the helicopter's desired speed that it should try to reach as soon as it's spawned.": "设置直升机生成后应尽快达到的期望速度。",
  "Target path_track": "目标 path_track",
  "(Optional) The name of a path_track entity that this NPC will fly to after spawning.": "（可选）此 NPC 生成后将飞往的 path_track 实体的名称。",
  "The helicopter will immediately move at top speed toward its current goal, or in its current orientation if it's on top of its goal.": "直升机将立即以最高速度朝其当前目标移动，若已在目标之上，则保持当前朝向。",
  "The helicopter will immediately move at the specified speed (you provide this as parameter override in units per second) towards its current goal.": "直升机将立即以指定速度（你以参数覆盖形式提供，单位为每秒单位数）朝其当前目标移动。",
  "Change the helicopter's max speed.": "更改直升机的最大速度。",
  "Tell the helicopter to move to a path corner on a new path.": "命令直升机移动到新路径上的路径拐点。",
  "Self Destruct.": "自毁。",
  "Activate. Use to wake up a helicopter that spawned with the 'Await Input' spawnflag on.": "激活。用于唤醒以 'Await Input' 生成标记生成的直升机。",
  "Set a track for the helicopter to adhere to. The helicopter will do nothing if he's on the same path, and will move to the closest point on the specified track if he's on a different path.": "设置直升机遵循的轨迹。如果直升机已在同一路径上，它将不做任何事；如果在不同的路径上，它将移动到指定轨迹上最近的点。",
  "The helicopter will first fly to the closest point on the path if he's on a different path. Then he'll fly along the path to the specified track point.": "如果直升机在不同的路径上，它会先飞到路径上最近的点，然后沿路径飞到指定的轨迹点。",
  "Start patrolling back and forth along the current track.": "开始沿当前轨迹来回巡逻。",
  "Stop patrolling back and forth along the track. This will cause the helicopter to come to rest at the track which he's currently flying toward.": "停止沿轨迹来回巡逻。这将使直升机停在它当前正飞向的轨迹处。",
  "When tracking an enemy, choose the point on the path furthest from the enemy, but still in firing range.": "追踪敌人时，选择路径上离敌人最远但仍在射程内的点。",
  "When tracking an enemy, choose the point on the path nearest from the enemy.": "追踪敌人时，选择路径上离敌人最近的点。",
  "The helicopter is now allowed to disobey direct commands to go to particular points if he senses an enemy. He will move to the closest point (or farthest point, if ChooseFarthestPathPoint is used), on the path if he senses an enemy.": "直升机现在可以在感知到敌人时不服从前往指定点的直接命令。感知到敌人时，它会移动到路径上最近的点（如果使用了 ChooseFarthestPathPoint，则为最远的点）。",
  "The helicopter can not disobey direct commands. He will continue to fly along his patrol path or to his specified target even if he senses an enemy.": "直升机不能不服从直接命令。即使感知到敌人，它也会继续沿巡逻路径飞行或飞向指定目标。",
  "No Rotorwash": "无旋翼气流",
  "Await Input": "等待输入",
  "Target(s)": "目标",
  "This is the entity who's items this manager should be managing. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是此管理器应管理的物品所属的实体。可以是 targetname 或 classname。",
  "Listen to Entity Spawns": "监听实体生成",
  "If you want this manager to affect valid targets that are spawned after the manager, you need to set this. Most likely only needed if you want to target NPCs via a classname to catch all future spawns on that NPC type. It has a perf cost, so don't turn it on if you don't need it.": "如果你希望此管理器影响在管理器之后生成的有效目标，需要设置此项。通常仅在你希望通过 classname 定位 NPC 以捕捉该 NPC 类型所有未来生成时才需要。它有性能开销，因此不需要时请不要开启。",
  "Item Removal Allowed for Ammo Balancing": "允许为弹药平衡移除物品",
  "Item Or Ability Subclass 1": "物品或技能子类 1",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 1.": "要附加到槽位 1 的物品或技能的子类。",
  "Item Or Ability Subclass 2": "物品或技能子类 2",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 2.": "要附加到槽位 2 的物品或技能的子类。",
  "Item Or Ability Subclass 3": "物品或技能子类 3",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 3.": "要附加到槽位 3 的物品或技能的子类。",
  "Item Or Ability Subclass 4": "物品或技能子类 4",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 4.": "要附加到槽位 4 的物品或技能的子类。",
  "Primary Linked Ability 1": "主关联技能 1",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 1st ability to add.": "（可选）要关联到第 1 个添加技能的主技能子类。",
  "Primary Linked Ability 2": "主关联技能 2",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 2nd ability to add.": "（可选）要关联到第 2 个添加技能的主技能子类。",
  "Primary Linked Ability 3": "主关联技能 3",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 3rd ability to add.": "（可选）要关联到第 3 个添加技能的主技能子类。",
  "Primary Linked Ability 4": "主关联技能 4",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 4th ability to add.": "（可选）要关联到第 4 个添加技能的主技能子类。",
  "Ability Subclass To Remove 1": "要移除的技能子类 1",
  "Subclass of 1st ability to remove.": "要移除的第 1 个技能的子类。",
  "Ability Subclass To Remove 2": "要移除的技能子类 2",
  "Subclass of 2nd ability to remove.": "要移除的第 2 个技能的子类。",
  "Ability Subclass To Remove 3": "要移除的技能子类 3",
  "Subclass of 3rd ability to remove.": "要移除的第 3 个技能的子类。",
  "Ability Subclass To Remove 4": "要移除的技能子类 4",
  "Subclass of 4th ability to remove.": "要移除的第 4 个技能的子类。",
  "Health": "生命值",
  "Minimum Angle": "最小角度",
  "Angle from the bullseye required for bullseye to be a valid enemy": "靶心成为有效敌人所需的角度（相对于靶心）",
  "Minimum Distance": "最小距离",
  "Distance from the bullseye required for bullseye to be a valid enemy": "靶心成为有效敌人所需的与靶心的距离",
  "Autoaim Radius": "自动瞄准半径",
  "Radius of autoaim influence. Use ent_autoaim <picker> to visualize.": "自动瞄准影响的半径。使用 ent_autoaim <picker> 来可视化。",
  "Not Solid": "非固体",
  "Take No Damage": "不受伤害",
  "Enemy Damage Only": "仅敌人伤害",
  "Bleed": "流血",
  "Perfect Accuracy": "完美精度",
  "Fires when targeted": "被瞄准时触发",
  "Fires when no longer targeted": "不再被瞄准时触发",
  "Check Visibility": "检查可见性",
  "APC Visibility checks": "APC 可见性检查",
  "Short memory": "短期记忆",
  "Can be an enemy": "可以成为敌人",
  "How far to look (1.0 = straight ahead, 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees, -1.0 = all directions)": "视线搜索范围（1.0 = 正前方，0.0 = ±90 度，-1.0 = 所有方向）",
  "Min Search Dist": "最小搜索距离",
  "Max Search Dist": "最大搜索距离",
  "Player pass issue time": "玩家通行证发放时间",
  "Amount of time an enemy is hidden after which a 'free pass' on reaquire is granted": "敌人被隐藏的时间，超过该时间后将授予重新获取的“自由通行”",
  "Player pass duration": "玩家通行证持续时间",
  "After granted 'free pass', the amount of time a target is allowed before reaquire": "授予“自由通行”后，目标在被重新获取前被允许的时间",
  "Player pass move tolerance": "玩家通行证移动容差",
  "After granted 'free pass', the distance the target is allowed to move before reaquire": "授予“自由通行”后，目标在被重新获取前被允许移动的距离",
  "Player pass refill rate": "玩家通行证回复速率",
  "After free pass begins expiring, how much the time the target gets back for every second they hide again": "自由通行开始到期后，目标每再次隐藏一秒可返还的时间",
  "Player pass peek time": "玩家通行证窥视时间",
  "How long targets in cover are allowed to peek without penalty": "掩体中的目标被允许窥视而不受惩罚的时长",
  "Start On": "开启时启动",
  "Turn on: Look for enemies": "开启：寻找敌人",
  "Turn off: Stop looking for enemies": "关闭：停止寻找敌人",
  "Fires when the enemy finder has no enemies.": "当敌人寻找器没有敌人时触发。",
  "Fires when the enemy finder acquires enemies.": "当敌人寻找器获得敌人时触发。",
  "Target NPC": "目标 NPC",
  "The name or class name (such as 'npc_zombie') of an NPC to use for this script.": "用于此脚本的 NPC 的名称或类名（例如 'npc_zombie'）。",
  "Pre Action Idle Animation": "动作前空闲动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play before the action animation if the NPC must wait for the script to be triggered. Use 'Start on Spawn' flag or MoveToPosition input to play this idle animation.": "如果 NPC 必须等待脚本被触发，在动作动画之前播放的序列名称（例如 'idle01'）。使用 'Start on Spawn' 标记或 MoveToPosition 输入来播放此空闲动画。",
  "Entry Animation": "进入动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'reload02') to play when the sequence starts, before transitioning to play the main action sequence.": "序列开始时、在过渡到播放主动作序列之前播放的序列名称（例如 'reload02'）。",
  "Action Animation": "动作动画",
  "The name of the main sequence (such as 'reload02') to play.": "要播放的主序列名称（例如 'reload02'）。",
  "Post Action Idle Animation": "动作后空闲动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play after the action animation.": "在动作动画之后播放的序列名称（例如 'idle01'）。",
  "Synchronization Group": "同步组",
  "If set, identifier used to match other scripted sequences to synchronze with (alternative to name-based sync)": "如果设置，用于与其他脚本序列匹配同步的标识符（基于名称同步的替代方案）",
  "Allow Player Camera Movement?": "允许玩家相机移动？",
  "Loop Pre Idle Animation?": "循环播放动作前空闲动画？",
  "Loop Action Animation?": "循环播放动作动画？",
  "Loop Post Idle Animation?": "循环播放动作后空闲动画？",
  "Synch Post Idles?": "同步动作后空闲动画？",
  "Allow custom interrupt conditions to be set.": "允许设置自定义中断条件。",
  "Script Conflict Response": "脚本冲突响应",
  "What to do if this scripted sequence begins and the actor is already executing a scripted sequence.": "如果此脚本序列开始时演员已在执行另一个脚本序列，该怎么做。",
  "Enqueue": "排队",
  "Interrupt": "中断",
  "Search Radius (0=everywhere)": "搜索半径（0=所有位置）",
  "Radius to search within for an NPC to use. 0 searches everywhere.": "搜索可用 NPC 的半径。0 表示搜索所有位置。",
  "Repeat Rate ms": "重复间隔（毫秒）",
  "Move-to interp time": "移动插值时间",
  "Move to Position": "移动到位置",
  "Use Specified Gait": "使用指定步态",
  "Instantaneous": "瞬时",
  "No - Turn to Face": "否 - 转身面向",
  "Move to Gait": "移动步态",
  "Gait to use if Move to Position is set to 'Use Specified Gait'.": "当“移动到位置”设为“使用指定步态”时要使用的步态。",
  "Slow (Walk)": "慢速（步行）",
  "Medium (Jog)": "中速（慢跑）",
  "Fast (Run)": "快速（奔跑）",
  "Very Fast (Sprint)": "极快（冲刺）",
  "Held Weapon Behavior": "持武器行为",
  "What do to with any held weapon before starting the sequence.": "开始执行序列前对持有的武器做什么。",
  "Holster": "收起",
  "Deploy": "展开",
  "Drop": "丢弃",
  "Next Script": "下一脚本",
  "The name of the script to run immediately after this script completes. The NPC will not return to AI between the two scripts.": "此脚本完成后立即运行的脚本名称。NPC 在两个脚本之间不会返回 AI 控制。",
  "Ignore Gravity on NPC during script": "脚本期间忽略 NPC 重力",
  "If this is set to 'Yes', the NPC will not be subject to gravity while playing this script.": "如果设置为“是”，NPC 在播放此脚本期间将不受重力影响。",
  "Ignore look at targets during script": "脚本期间忽略注视目标",
  "If this is set to 'Yes', the NPC will not look at the look at target when playing the script.": "如果设置为“是”，NPC 在播放脚本期间不会看向注视目标。",
  "Disable NPC collisions during script": "脚本期间禁用 NPC 碰撞",
  "Useful for when NPCs playing scripts must interpenetrate while riding on trains, elevators, etc. This only disables collisions between the NPCs in the script and must be enabled on BOTH scripted_sequences.": "适用于 NPC 在播放脚本时需要在火车、电梯等上互相穿插的情况。这只会禁用脚本中 NPC 之间的碰撞，并且必须在两个 scripted_sequence 上都启用。",
  "Keep Animgraph Locked after script": "脚本后保持 Animgraph 锁定",
  "If set, the animgraph will remain locked in the Direct Playback node after this sequence finishes. This is only useful if you have a 'Next Script' set, and you don't want the animgraph to return to Idle during the transition. Note that the 'Next Script' cannot require the NPC to animate/move to it, because the NPC will be unable to move while in the Direct Playback node. In that case, or if you have no 'Next Script' set, selecting this will simply cause the NPC to freeze after it finishes the sequence.": "如果设置，序列完成后动画图将保持在 Direct Playback 节点中锁定。仅当你设置了“Next Script”且不希望动画图在过渡期间返回 Idle 时才有用。注意，“Next Script”不能要求 NPC 动画/移动到它，因为 NPC 在 Direct Playback 节点中无法移动。在这种情况下，或者未设置“Next Script”时，选择此项只会导致 NPC 在完成序列后冻结。",
  "Summons an NPC to act out the scripted sequence.": "召唤一个 NPC 来执行此脚本序列。",
  "Summons an NPC to the script location. They will play their scripted idle (or ACT_IDLE if none is specified) until BeginSequence is triggered.": "将 NPC 召唤到脚本位置。它们会播放其脚本空闲动画（如果未指定则为 ACT_IDLE），直到 BeginSequence 被触发。",
  "Stops the scripted sequence. If fired after a sequence starts, this input will not take effect until the NPC finishes playing the scripted action animation.": "停止脚本序列。如果在序列开始后触发，此输入在 NPC 播放完脚本动作动画之前不会生效。",
  "Sets the name of the action sequence that will play when the action sequence plays. Can be used for branching sequences.": "设置动作序列播放时将播放的动作序列名称。可用于分支序列。",
  "Forces a particular NPC to be the target of the scripted sequence": "强制某个特定 NPC 作为脚本序列的目标",
  "Fires when the scripted sequence begins playing.": "脚本序列开始播放时触发。",
  "Fires when the action animation begins playing and each time it loops.": "动作动画开始播放时及每次循环时触发。",
  "Fires when the action animation completes.": "动作动画完成时触发。",
  "Fires when the sequence is cancelled.": "序列被取消时触发。",
  "Fires when the sequence is cancelled without ever playing (OnCancelSequence will also fire).": "序列在未播放的情况下被取消时触发（OnCancelSequence 也会触发）。",
  "Fires when an AE_SCRIPT_EVENT_FIREEVENT anim event occurs while playing the script.": "播放脚本期间发生 AE_SCRIPT_EVENT_FIREEVENT 动画事件时触发。",
  "Move Speed": "移动速度",
  "Pause Duration": "暂停持续时间",
  "Effect Duration": "效果持续时间",
  "Next Target": "下一目标",
  "Fires when NPC reaches this target": "NPC 到达此目标时触发",
  "Fires when NPC leaves this target": "NPC 离开此目标时触发",
  "Is Repeatable": "可重复",
  "If yes, this scripted sequence can be started multiple times.": "如果是，此脚本序列可以多次启动。",
  "Leave Corpse (if not, fade)": "留下尸体（否则淡出）",
  "If no, the NPC will fade out if it's in a dying state.": "如果否，NPC 在濒死状态下会淡出。",
  "Start On Spawn": "生成时启动",
  "No Interruptions": "无中断",
  "Override AI": "覆盖 AI",
  "We can start the sequence, no matter the NPC state.": "无论 NPC 状态如何，我们都可以启动序列。",
  "Don't Teleport NPC On End": "结束时不传送 NPC",
  "Don't fixup end position with a teleport when the SS is finished.": "脚本序列（SS）完成时不通过传送修正结束位置。",
  "Is Priority Script": "是优先脚本",
  "If set, we don't allow other scripts to steal our spot in the queue.": "如果设置，我们不允许其他脚本抢占我们在队列中的位置。",
  "Hide Debug Complaints": "隐藏调试抱怨信息",
  "Continue On Death": "死亡时继续",
  "Allow other NPC actors to continue after this NPC actor's death": "允许其他 NPC 演员在此 NPC 演员死亡后继续",
  "What this entity should do if the player dies.": "如果玩家死亡，此实体应该做什么。",
  "On NPC actor death": "NPC 演员死亡时",
  "What the NPC performing this script should do if it dies.": "执行此脚本的 NPC 死亡时应该做什么。",
  "LEGACY - Use old settings": "传统方式 - 使用旧设置",
  "Ragdoll immediately": "立即变为布娃娃",
  "Perform a death animation": "执行死亡动画",
  "Prevent Yaw Update on Finish": "完成时阻止偏航更新",
  "By default, when finishing the sequence, the NPC has its ideal yaw updated to maintain the current forward facing. This allows you to prevent that if you want to return to the facing prior to starting the sequence.": "默认情况下，序列完成时，NPC 的理想偏航角会被更新以保持当前朝向。如果你想返回到开始序列之前的朝向，可以通过此选项阻止。",
  "Ensure on Nav Mesh on Finish": "完成时确保位于导航网格上",
  "When finishing the sequence, if the NPC uses the navmesh, ensure the NPC is on a valid location on the navmesh.": "序列完成时，如果 NPC 使用导航网格，确保 NPC 位于导航网格上的有效位置。",
  "NPC Lock Delay": "NPC 锁定延迟",
  "Optionnal per NPC override of the same parameter defined in the lock trigger.": "可选的按 NPC 覆盖，覆盖锁定触发器中定义的同名参数。",
  "Target NPC(s)": "目标 NPC",
  "The name or classname of an NPC which will run the scripted command. If multiple NPCs are found, all of them will perform the command.": "将执行脚本命令的 NPC 的名称或类名。如果找到多个 NPC，它们都将执行该命令。",
  "Target": "目标",
  "An optional entity that marks the target of the scripted command.": "标记脚本命令目标的可选实体。",
  "Used to decide when to start the scripted command. Low means only start when the NPC is about to idle. High means it should start as soon as possible, unless the NPC needs to perform a critical schedule (like being required to flinch in response to heavy damage).": "用于决定何时开始脚本命令。低表示仅在 NPC 即将空闲时开始。高表示应尽快开始，除非 NPC 需要执行关键计划（例如因重伤而必须做出退缩反应）。",
  "Reacquire after break": "打断后重新获取",
  "If set, once the NPC has nothing important to do, it'll return to idling, even if it previously broke out of the schedule due to the Interruptability choices.": "如果设置，一旦 NPC 没有重要的事情要做，它将返回空闲状态，即使它之前因可中断性选择而脱离了计划。",
  "Interruptability": "可中断性",
  "Sets what kind of events can interrupt an NPC that's performing this scripted command. Note that when set to 'Everything', NPCs can be easily interrupted by small things like physics impact sounds, or distant combat sounds.": "设置哪些类型的事件可以中断正在执行此脚本命令的 NPC。注意，设置为“所有事件”时，NPC 很容易被物理碰撞声或远处的战斗声等小事打断。",
  "Everything that usually interrupts AI": "通常会中断 AI 的所有事件",
  "Direct Combat (Seeing enemies, taking damage, etc)": "直接战斗（看到敌人、受到伤害等）",
  "Only Taking Damage": "仅受到伤害",
  "Nothing": "无",
  "Start on Spawn?": "生成时启动？",
  "If checked, when this entity is spawned, it will start the scripted command on all eligible NPC(s).": "如果勾选，此实体生成时，将在所有符合条件的 NPC 上启动脚本命令。",
  "Switch To Alert State if Idle": "空闲时切换到警戒状态",
  "If the commanded NPC(s) is in Idle state, switch them to Alert state.": "如果受命 NPC 处于空闲状态，将其切换到警戒状态。",
  "Set Enemy To Target": "将敌人设为目标",
  "If the script target is an NPC or player, setting this to 'Yes' will also give commanded NPCs memory of the target, and cause them to set their enemy to it. Note that if there's another NPC that's a better enemy, commanded NPCs will flip to the better enemy on their next think.": "如果脚本目标是 NPC 或玩家，将此项设置为“是”还会让受命 NPC 获得对该目标的记忆，并将其敌人设置为该目标。注意，如果有另一个更好的敌人，受命 NPC 会在下一次思考时切换到更好的敌人。",
  "Only Apply to 1 NPC": "仅应用于 1 个 NPC",
  "If the script would find multiple npcs on start, pick only one of them to run the command. Will only select NPCs who aren't currently scripted.": "如果脚本启动时会找到多个 NPC，则只选择其中一个执行命令。只会选择当前未在执行脚本的 NPC。",
  "Starts all target NPC(s) performing the scripted command.": "启动所有目标 NPC 执行脚本命令。",
  "Cancels the scripted command on all target NPCs that are performing it.": "取消所有正在执行脚本命令的目标 NPC 的该命令。",
  "Fired when any target NPC finishes performing the scripted command.": "任意目标 NPC 完成脚本命令时触发。",
  "Fired when we fail to command any target NPC(s) to perform the scripted command. This occurs if no target NPCs could be found, or if they were found but if they failed to be able to execute the action. Note that resilient actions will not trigger a failure ever; they will just try to restart the action again later if they fail.": "当我们未能命令任何目标 NPC 执行脚本命令时触发。发生在找不到目标 NPC，或找到了但无法执行动作时。注意，弹性动作（resilient actions）永远不会触发失败；它们失败后只会在稍后尝试重新开始动作。",
  "Fired when the scripted command is aborted, either because the AI needed to switch away, or because a different scripted action was started.": "脚本命令中止时触发，原因是 AI 需要切换离开，或启动了不同的脚本动作。",
  "Handshake Action to Perform": "要执行的握手动作",
  "The e_action_desired animgraph parameter will be set to this value during this idle. If it is a looping animation, the idle will not exit until explicitly canceled or interrupted by game code.": "在此空闲期间，e_action_desired 动画图参数将被设置为此值。如果是循环动画，空闲将不会退出，直到被游戏代码显式取消或中断。",
  "The e_action_desired animgraph parameter will be set to this value during the move. The action will not complete until both the movement and the action are finished.": "在移动期间，e_action_desired 动画图参数将被设置为此值。动作在移动和动作都完成之前不会完成。",
  "Force Gait": "强制步态",
  "Force this NPC to use a specific movement gait. Will return to the AI's default value afterwards.": "强制此 NPC 使用特定移动步态。之后会恢复为 AI 的默认值。",
  "Default (No Override)": "默认（不覆盖）",
  "Forced Slow (Walk)": "强制慢速（步行）",
  "Forced Medium (Jog)": "强制中速（慢跑）",
  "Forced Fast (Run)": "强制快速（奔跑）",
  "Forced Very Fast (Sprint)": "强制极快（冲刺）",
  "Goal Success Radius (Blocked)": "目标成功半径（阻塞）",
  "In general, NPCs always try to exactly reach the goal target. If the target is blocked for some reason, being this close to the goal means we'll still consider the movement a success anyways. -1 means use the default settings.": "一般而言，NPC 总会尝试真正到达目标。如果目标因某种原因被阻塞，设置接近目标的距离意味着我们仍会将这次移动视为成功。-1 表示使用默认设置。",
  "[Optional] Goal Success Radius": "[可选] 目标成功半径",
  "Optional distance from the goal position within which the NPC is allowed to end the navigation. -1 means use the blocked success radius. WARNING: You probably want to be setting blocked success radius rather than this, since in general, you want NPCs to actually reach their goals.": "可选的与目标位置的距离，NPC 可以在此范围内结束导航。-1 表示使用阻塞成功半径。警告：你可能更想设置阻塞成功半径而不是此项，因为通常你希望 NPC 真正到达目标。",
  "Minimum End Distance From Goal": "距目标的最小结束距离",
  "Optional distance to goal at which to terminate the path.  Clips the goal to this distance away from the goal, along the path, so the NPC will never get closer than this to the goal.": "可选的与目标的距离，路径在此处终止。会将目标沿路径裁剪到距目标此距离处，因此 NPC 永远不会比这更接近目标。",
  "Stop At Goal": "在目标处停止",
  "Should we stop at goal with zero velocity or keep our speed.": "我们应该在目标处以零速度停止，还是保持速度。",
  "Ability Subclass to Perform": "要执行的技能子类",
  "Subclass of the ability that target NPC(s) should perform against the Ability Target.": "目标 NPC 应对技能目标执行的技能的子类。",
  "Add Ability if Missing?": "缺失时添加技能？",
  "If yes, we'll add the ability to the NPC when trying to execute it. ": "如果是，我们会在尝试执行技能时将该技能添加到 NPC。",
  "Target Body Location": "目标身体位置",
  "The body location on the Ability Target entity that the ability should target.": "技能应瞄准的技能目标实体上的身体位置。",
  "Eyes": "眼睛",
  "Muzzle": "枪口",
  "Abs Origin": "绝对原点",
  "Randomized around Body Center": "身体中心附近随机",
  "Head": "头部",
  "Target Origin": "目标原点",
  "The method by which we determine the origin of the entity that the Ability will target. The Target Body Location is then used as a local offset on top of this origin. Predicated Abs Origin uses the current velocity of the target to anticipate where they'll be 0.5s in the future. Last Known/Seen position only really applies to enemies that the performing NPC has lost sight of.": "我们确定技能所瞄准实体原点的方法。目标身体位置将在此原点之上作为局部偏移使用。预测绝对原点使用目标当前的速度来预测它们 0.5 秒后的位置。最后已知/看到位置仅适用于执行 NPC 已失去视线的敌人。",
  "Current Abs Origin": "当前绝对原点",
  "Predicted Abs Origin": "预测绝对原点",
  "Last Known Position": "最后已知位置",
  "Last Seen Position": "最后看到位置",
  "Ability Use Position": "技能使用位置",
  "An optional entity that marks where to move BEFORE using the ability.": "标记在使用技能之前移动到哪里的可选实体。",
  "Move While Using Target": "使用目标时移动",
  "An optional entity that marks where to move to while using the ability.": "标记在使用技能期间移动到哪里的可选实体。",
  "Optional per NPC override of the same parameter defined in the lock trigger.": "可选的按 NPC 覆盖，覆盖锁定触发器中定义的同名参数。",
  "Misc": "杂项",
  "Entity Scripts": "实体脚本",
  "Name(s) of script files that are executed after all entities have spawned.": "在所有实体生成后执行的脚本文件名称。",
  "Load and execute a script file": "加载并执行脚本文件",
  "Execute a fragment of script code": "执行一段脚本代码",
  "Call a script function": "调用脚本函数",
  "Calls a script function from this entity's private script scope.": "从此实体的私有脚本作用域调用脚本函数。",
  "Calls a script function in the global script scope.": "在全局脚本作用域中调用脚本函数。",
  "Removes this entity from the world.": "从世界中移除此实体。",
  "Removes this entity and all its children from the world.": "从世界中移除此实体及其所有子实体。",
  "Removes this entity, all its children, and anything constrained to it, from the world.": "从世界中移除此实体、其所有子实体以及所有约束到它的物体。",
  "Adds an entity I/O connection to this entity. Parameter format: outputname>targetname>inputname>parameter>delay>max times to fire (-1 == infinite). Very dangerous, use with care.": "为此实体添加一个实体 I/O 连接。参数格式：outputname>targetname>inputname>parameter>delay>max times to fire (-1 == infinite)。非常危险，请谨慎使用。",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser1 output to be fired.": "使此实体的 OnUser1 输出被触发。",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser2 output to be fired.": "使此实体的 OnUser2 输出被触发。",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser3 output to be fired.": "使此实体的 OnUser3 输出被触发。",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser4 output to be fired.": "使此实体的 OnUser4 输出被触发。",
  "Fired in response to FireUser1 input.": "响应 FireUser1 输入时触发。",
  "Fired in response to FireUser2 input.": "响应 FireUser2 输入时触发。",
  "Fired in response to FireUser3 input.": "响应 FireUser3 输入时触发。",
  "Fired in response to FireUser4 input.": "响应 FireUser4 输入时触发。",
  "Fired when the entity is killed and removed from the game. Parameter is the inflictor.": "当实体被杀死并从游戏中移除时触发。参数为伤害来源。",
  "Name": "名称",
  "The name that other entities refer to this entity by.": "其他实体引用此实体时使用的名称。",
  "AnimGraph2 Identifier": "AnimGraph2 标识符",
  "Which animgraph should we use when spawning the entity? Animgraph identifiers are authored in modeldoc, see the AnimGraph2 reference node.": "生成实体时应使用哪个动画图？动画图标识符在 modeldoc 中创建，参见 AnimGraph2 参考节点。",
  "Toggles the platform's state.": "切换平台的状态。",
  "Tells the platform to go up.": "命令平台上升。",
  "Tells the platform to go down.": "命令平台下降。",
  "Enable this entity.": "启用此实体。",
  "Disable this entity.": "禁用此实体。",
  "Render FX": "渲染特效（FX）",
  "Slow Pulse": "慢速脉冲",
  "Fast Pulse": "快速脉冲",
  "Slow Wide Pulse": "慢速宽脉冲",
  "Fast Wide Pulse": "快速宽脉冲",
  "Slow Strobe": "慢速频闪",
  "Fast Strobe": "快速频闪",
  "Faster Strobe": "更快频闪",
  "Slow Flicker": "慢速闪烁",
  "Fast Flicker": "快速闪烁",
  "Slow Fade Away": "慢速淡出",
  "Fast Fade Away": "快速淡出",
  "Slow Become Solid": "慢速变为固体",
  "Fast Become Solid": "快速变为固体",
  "Constant Glow": "恒定发光",
  "Distort": "扭曲",
  "Hologram (Distort + fade)": "全息（扭曲+淡出）",
  "Cull By Distance (TEST)": "按距离剔除（测试）",
  "Spotlight FX": "聚光灯特效",
  "Fade Near": "近处淡出",
  "Render Mode": "渲染模式",
  "Used to set a non-standard rendering mode on this entity. See also 'FX Amount' and 'FX Color'.": "用于在此实体上设置非标准渲染模式。另见“FX Amount”和“FX Color”。",
  "Color": "颜色",
  "Texture": "纹理",
  "Glow": "发光",
  "Solid": "固体",
  "Additive": "加法",
  "Additive Fractional Frame": "加法分数帧",
  "World Space Glow": "世界空间发光",
  "Dont Render": "不渲染",
  "Dev Visualizer": "开发可视化器",
  "Glow Properties": "发光属性",
  "Glow State": "发光状态",
  "OFF": "关闭",
  "ON": "开启",
  "Glow Range": "发光范围",
  "Range at which the glow becomes visible. (0 = always visible)": "发光可见的距离。（0 = 始终可见）",
  "Glow Range Min": "发光最小范围",
  "Range at which the glow stops being visible. (0 = always visible)": "发光不再可见的距离。（0 = 始终可见）",
  "Glow Color Override (R G B)": "发光颜色覆盖（R G B）",
  "Change the render color of the glow.": "更改发光的渲染颜色。",
  "Glow Team": "发光队伍",
  "Change the team we glow for.": "更改为其发光的队伍。",
  "Turn on a permanent glow effect for this prop.": "为此模型开启永久的发光效果。",
  "Turn off this prop's glow effect.": "关闭此模型的发光效果。",
  "FX Amount (0 - 255)": "特效强度（0 - 255）",
  "The FX amount is used by the selected Render Mode.": "特效强度由所选渲染模式使用。",
  "FX Color (R G B)": "特效颜色（R G B）",
  "The FX color is used by the selected Render Mode.": "特效颜色由所选渲染模式使用。",
  "Disable Receiving Shadows": "禁用接收阴影",
  "Set the sprite's alpha (0 - 255).": "设置精灵（sprite）的 alpha（0 - 255）。",
  "Set the sprite's color (R G B).": "设置精灵（sprite）的颜色（R G B）。",
  "Start Fade Dist": "开始淡出距离",
  "Distance at which the overlay starts to fade (-1 = subtract from fademaxdist).": "叠加层开始淡出的距离（-1 = 从 fademaxdist 中减去）。",
  "End Fade Dist": "结束淡出距离",
  "Maximum distance at which the overlay is visible (0 = don't fade out).": "叠加层可见的最大距离（0 = 不淡出）。",
  "Culling Behaviour": "剔除行为",
  "Modifies culling behaviour when the object is small / distant": "当物体很小/很远时修改剔除行为",
  "Smaller than default": "比默认更小",
  "Much smaller than default": "比默认小得多",
  "When extremely small": "极小时",
  "Render to Cubemaps": "渲染到立方体贴图",
  "If true, this geometry renders into baked cube maps": "如果为真，此几何体会渲染到烘焙的立方体贴图中",
  "Lightmap Static": "静态光照贴图",
  "Determines if this geometry be considered static & cast shadows/bounce light when baking lightmaps?": "决定此几何体在烘焙光照贴图时是否被视为静态并投射阴影/反弹光线？",
  "Bounce Only": "仅反弹",
  "Input Filter": "输入过滤器",
  "Used to specify which inputs this entity will accept.": "用于指定此实体将接受哪些输入。",
  "Allow all inputs": "允许所有输入",
  "Ignore Touch/Untouch": "忽略接触/离开接触",
  "Ignore Use": "忽略使用",
  "Ignore All": "全部忽略",
  "Global Entity Name": "全局实体名称",
  "Name by which this entity is linked to another entity in a different map. When the player transitions to a new map, entities in the new map with globalnames matching entities in the previous map will have the previous map's state copied over their state.": "此实体与另一张地图中的实体链接时使用的名称。当玩家转移到新地图时，新地图中与上一张地图中的实体匹配全局名称的实体将复制上一张地图的状态。",
  "Off": "关闭",
  "On": "开启",
  "Dead": "失效",
  "Counter": "计数器",
  "An integer counter value associated with this global.": "与此全局变量关联的整型计数器值。",
  "Set Initial State": "设置初始状态",
  "Set state of global to ON.": "将全局变量状态设置为 ON。",
  "Set state of global to OFF.": "将全局变量状态设置为 OFF。",
  "Toggles state of global between ON and OFF.": "在 ON 和 OFF 之间切换全局变量的状态。",
  "Set state of global to DEAD.": "将全局变量状态设置为 DEAD。",
  "Sets the counter value of this global.": "设置此全局变量的计数器值。",
  "Adds to the counter value of this global. Negative numbers subtract.": "增加此全局变量的计数器值。负数为减。",
  "Causes the Counter output to be fired, passing the current counter value for this global.": "使 Counter 输出被触发，并传递此全局变量当前的计数器值。",
  "Fired in response to the GetCounter input, passing the current value of the counter.": "响应 GetCounter 输入时触发，传递计数器的当前值。",
  "Damage Filter": "伤害过滤器",
  "Name of the filter entity that controls which entities can damage us.": "控制哪些实体可以伤害我们的过滤器实体的名称。",
  "Sets the entity to use as damage filter. Pass in an empty string to clear the damage filter.": "设置用作伤害过滤器的实体。传入空字符串以清除伤害过滤器。",
  "Adds a context to this entity's list of response contexts. The format should be 'key:value'.": "向此实体的响应上下文列表添加一个上下文。格式应为 'key:value'。",
  "Remove a context from this entity's list of response contexts. The name should match the 'key' of a previously added context.": "从此实体的响应上下文列表中移除一个上下文。名称应与之前添加的上下文的“key”匹配。",
  "Removes all contexts in this entity's list of response contexts.": "移除此实体响应上下文列表中的所有上下文。",
  "Response Contexts": "响应上下文",
  "Response system context(s) for this entity. Format should be: 'key:value,key2:value2,etc'. When this entity speaks, the list of keys & values will be passed to the response rules system.": "此实体的响应系统上下文。格式应为：'key:value,key2:value2,etc'。当此实体说话时，键值列表将传递给响应规则系统。",
  "Breakable Properties": "可破坏属性",
  "Explosion Damage": "爆炸伤害",
  "If non-zero, when this entity breaks it will create an explosion that causes the specified amount of damage. See also 'Explosion Radius'.": "如果非零，此实体破碎时将产生造成指定伤害量的爆炸。另见“Explosion Radius”。",
  "Explosion Radius": "爆炸半径",
  "If non-zero, when this entity breaks it will create an explosion with a radius of the specified amount. See also 'Explosion Damage'.": "如果非零，此实体破碎时将产生具有指定半径的爆炸。另见“Explosion Damage”。",
  "Performance Mode": "性能模式",
  "Used to limit the amount of gibs produced when this entity breaks, for performance reasons.": "出于性能原因，用于限制此实体破碎时产生的碎块数量。",
  "No Gibs": "无碎块",
  "Disable Client-Side Interpolation": "禁用客户端插值",
  "Breaks the breakable.": "破坏此可破坏物。",
  "Sets whether or not the breakable can break.": "设置此可破坏物是否可以破碎。",
  "Sets whether or not the breakable has collision at all.": "设置此可破坏物是否具有碰撞。",
  "Sets a new value for the breakable's health. If the breakable's health reaches zero it will break.": "为可破坏物设置新的生命值。如果生命值降为零，它将破碎。",
  "Adds health to the breakable. If the breakable's health reaches zero it will break.": "为可破坏物增加生命值。如果生命值降为零，它将破碎。",
  "Removes health from the breakable. If the breakable's health reaches zero it will break.": "从可破坏物移除生命值。如果生命值降为零，它将破碎。",
  "Set mass of this object.": "设置此物体的质量。",
  "Fired when this prop has begun dying (breaking) before other death-related callbacks.": "当此模型开始死亡（破碎）时、在其他死亡相关回调之前触发。",
  "Fired when this breakable breaks.": "此可破坏物破碎时触发。",
  "Fired when the health of this breakable changes, passing the new value of health as a percentage of max health, from [0..1].": "此可破坏物的生命值变化时触发，以最大生命值的百分比（[0..1]）传递新的生命值。",
  "Only Break on Trigger": "仅在触发时破碎",
  "Break on Touch": "接触时破碎",
  "Break on Pressure": "压力下破碎",
  "Break immediately on Physics": "物理作用下立即破碎",
  "Don't take physics damage": "不受物理伤害",
  "Don't allow bullet penetration": "不允许子弹穿透",
  "Don't allow hand physics damage": "不允许手部物理伤害",
  "Force nav-ignore": "强制导航忽略",
  "Prop Data": "模型数据（Prop Data）",
  "Set to the best approximation of the size and material of this entity's brushes. If set, it will override this entity's health and damage taken from various weapons. See the propdata.txt file in the scripts directory of your MOD to get a detailed list of what each entry specifies.": "设置为此实体画刷大小和材质的最佳近似。如果设置，它将覆盖此实体的生命值以及受到各种武器伤害的数值。请查看你的 MOD 的 scripts 目录中的 propdata.txt 文件以获取每个条目所指定内容的详细列表。",
  "Strength": "强度",
  "Number of points of damage to take before breaking. 0 means don't break.": "破碎前需要承受的伤害点数。0 表示不破碎。",
  "Material Type": "材质类型",
  "Set to the material type of the brush. Used to decide what sounds to make when damaged, and what gibs to produce when broken.": "设置为画刷的材质类型。用于决定受损时发出的声音以及破碎时产生的碎块。",
  "Glass": "玻璃",
  "Wood": "木材",
  "Metal": "金属",
  "Flesh": "血肉",
  "Ceiling Tile": "天花板瓷砖",
  "Computer": "电脑",
  "Unbreakable Glass": "不可破碎玻璃",
  "Rocks": "岩石",
  "Gibs Direction": "碎块方向",
  "Used to decide which direction to throw gibs when broken.": "用于决定破碎时碎块抛出的方向。",
  "Random": "随机",
  "Relative to Attack": "相对于攻击",
  "Use Precise Gib Dir": "使用精确碎块方向",
  "Damaging it Doesn't Push It": "受到伤害时不会推动它",
  "Used to determine whether or not damage should cause the brush to move.": "用于确定伤害是否应导致画刷移动。",
  "Damaging the entity applies physics forces to it.": "对实体造成伤害会对其施加物理力。",
  "Damaging the entity does *not* apply physics forces to it.": "对实体造成伤害*不会*对其施加物理力。",
  "Spawn On Break": "破碎时生成",
  "When broken, an entity of the selected type will be created.": "破碎时，将创建所选类型的实体。",
  "Explode Magnitude": "爆炸强度",
  "If non-zero, when this entity breaks it will create an explosion that causes the specified amount of damage.": "如果非零，此实体破碎时将产生造成指定伤害量的爆炸。",
  "Pressure Delay": "压力延迟",
  "Delay, in seconds, after 'broken' by pressure before breaking apart (allows for sound to play before breaking apart).": "被“压力”破坏后、破裂前的延迟（秒）（允许在破裂前播放声音）。",
  "Create Client-Only Entity": "创建仅客户端实体",
  "Burst Force Scale": "爆发力度缩放",
  "Radial force applied to our pieces when we break.": "破碎时施加到我们碎片上的径向力。",
  "Burst Force Location": "爆发力位置",
  "Location in local space where the burst force is applied.": "施加爆发力的局部空间位置。",
  "Break Contents": "破碎内容物",
  "Contents Type": "内容物类型",
  "Set the type of contents inside this breakable.": "设置此可破坏物内部的内容物类型。",
  "Empty": "空",
  "Prop Group Override": "模型组覆盖",
  "Particle System Override": "粒子系统覆盖",
  "Breakable Contents Prop Group Override": "可破坏内容物模型组覆盖",
  "Prop Group to use when the prop is broken": "模型破碎时使用的模型组",
  "Breakable Contents Particle Override": "可破坏内容物粒子覆盖",
  "Fired each time this breakable takes any damage.": "此可破坏物每次受到任何伤害时触发。",
  "Brightness": "亮度",
  "BrightnessHDR": "HDR 亮度",
  "Amount to scale the light by when compiling for HDR.": "为 HDR 编译时对光照的缩放倍数。",
  "Appearance": "外观",
  "Fluorescent flicker": "荧光灯闪烁",
  "Slow, strong pulse": "缓慢的强脉冲",
  "Slow pulse, noblack": "慢速脉冲，无变黑",
  "Gentle pulse": "轻柔脉冲",
  "Flicker A": "闪烁 A",
  "Flicker B": "闪烁 B",
  "Candle A": "蜡烛 A",
  "Candle B": "蜡烛 B",
  "Candle C": "蜡烛 C",
  "Fast strobe": "快速频闪",
  "Slow strobe": "慢速频闪",
  "Custom Appearance": "自定义外观",
  "Set a custom pattern of light brightness for this light. Pattern format is a string of characters, where 'a' is total darkness, 'z' fully bright. i.e. 'aaggnnttzz' would be a steppy fade in from dark to light.": "为此灯设置自定义的亮度模式。模式格式为一个字符串，其中 'a' 表示全暗，'z' 表示全亮。例如 'aaggnnttzz' 表示从暗到亮的阶梯式渐亮。",
  "Constant": "恒定",
  "Linear": "线性",
  "Quadratic": "平方",
  "50 percent falloff distance": "50% 衰减距离",
  "Distance at which brightness should fall off to 50%. If set, overrides linear constant and quadratic paramaters.": "亮度应衰减至 50% 的距离。如果设置，将覆盖线性恒定参数和平方参数。",
  "0 percent falloff distance": "0% 衰减距离",
  "Distance at which brightness should fall off to negligible (1/256)%. Must set _fifty_percent_distance to use.": "亮度应衰减至可忽略（1/256）% 的距离。必须设置 _fifty_percent_distance 才能使用。",
  "hard falloff": "硬衰减",
  "If set, causes lights to fall to exactly zero beyond the zero percent distance. May cause unrealistic lightijng if not used carefully.": "如果设置，灯光在超过零百分比距离后精确降为零。如果不谨慎使用，可能导致不真实的光照。",
  "Turn the light on.": "打开灯。",
  "The the light off.": "关闭灯。",
  "Toggle the light's current state.": "切换灯的当前状态。",
  "Fades from first value in old pattern, to first value in the new given pattern. Pattern format is a string of characters, where 'a' is total darkness, 'z' fully bright. i.e. 'aaggnnttzz' would be a steppy fade in from dark to light.": "从旧模式的第一个值渐变到新模式给定的第一个值。模式格式为一个字符串，其中 'a' 表示全暗，'z' 表示全亮。例如 'aaggnnttzz' 表示从暗到亮的阶梯式渐亮。",
  "Clients": "玩家客户端",
  "Projectiles": "投射物",
  "Physics Objects": "物理对象",
  "Only player ally NPCs": "仅玩家友方 NPC",
  "Only clients in vehicles": "仅载具中的 NPC",
  "Everything (not including physics debris)": "所有物体（不包括物理碎片）",
  "Only clients *not* in vehicles": "仅不在载具中的客户端",
  "Physics debris": "物理碎片",
  "Only NPCs in vehicles (respects player ally flag)": "仅载具中的 NPC（遵循玩家友方标记）",
  "Correctly account for object mass (trigger_push used to assume 100Kg) and multiple component physobjs (car, blob...)": "正确计算物体质量（trigger_push 过去假定 100Kg）以及多组件物理对象（汽车、团块等）",
  "Touch objects in the trigger's hierarchy": "接触触发器层级中的对象",
  "Filter Name": "过滤器名称",
  "Filter to use to see if activator triggers me. See filter_activator_name for more explanation.": "用于判断激活者是否触发我的过滤器。更多说明参见 filter_activator_name。",
  "Toggles this trigger between enabled and disabled states.": "在启用和禁用状态之间切换此触发器。",
  "Fired when an entity starts touching this trigger. The touching entity must pass this trigger's filters to cause this output to fire.": "当实体开始接触此触发器时触发。接触实体必须通过此触发器的过滤器才能触发此输出。",
  "Fired when an entity starts touching this trigger, and no other entities are touching it. Only entities that passed this trigger's filters are considered.": "当实体开始接触此触发器且没有其他实体接触时触发。仅考虑通过了此触发器过滤器的实体。",
  "Fired when an entity stops touching this trigger. Only entities that passed this trigger's filters will cause this output to fire.": "当实体停止接触此触发器时触发。只有通过了此触发器过滤器的实体会触发此输出。",
  "Fires when an entity stops touching this trigger, and no other entities are touching it. Only entities that passed this trigger's filters are considered.": "当实体停止接触此触发器且没有其他实体接触时触发。仅考虑通过了此触发器过滤器的实体。",
  "SkyBox Texture Name": "天空盒纹理名称",
  "Level Fade In": "关卡淡入",
  "Level Fade In Color (R G B)": "关卡淡入颜色（R G B）",
  "Precomputed Visibility": "预计算可见性",
  "Test map (open space, no skybox)": "测试地图（开放空间，无天空盒）",
  "Full visibility solve": "完整可见性求解",
  "Partitioned solve (large map volume)": "分区求解（大型地图体积）",
  "New Level Unit": "新关卡单元",
  "Used to clear out savegame data of previous levels to keep the savegame size as small as possible. Only set it to Yes if the player cannot return to any previous levels.": "用于清除之前关卡的存档数据，以保持存档文件尽可能小。仅当玩家无法返回任何之前的关卡时才设置为“是”。",
  "No, keep current": "否，保留当前",
  "Yes, clear previous levels": "是，清除之前的关卡",
  "Start Fade Pixels": "开始淡出像素",
  "Number of pixels wide at which all props in the level start to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist). This number is ignored if the prop has a specific fade distance specified.": "关卡中所有模型开始淡出的像素宽度（<0 = 使用 fademaxdist）。如果模型指定了特定淡出距离，此数字将被忽略。",
  "End Fade Pixels": "结束淡出像素",
  "Minimum number of pixels wide at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out). This number is ignored if the prop has a specific fade distance specified.": "模型可见的最小像素宽度（0 = 不淡出）。如果模型指定了特定淡出距离，此数字将被忽略。",
  "Sound Name": "声音名称",
  "Name of the GameSound entry for the sound to play. Also supports direct .wav filenames.": "要播放的声音的 GameSound 条目名称。也支持直接的 .wav 文件名。",
  "Volume": "音量",
  "Sound volume, expressed as a range from 0 to 10, where 10 is the loudest.": "声音音量，范围从 0 到 10，10 为最响。",
