  "LFO mod pitch (0-100)": "LFO 音调调制 (0-100)",
  "LFO mod vol (0-100)": "LFO 音量调制 (0-100)",
  "Incremental Spinup Count": "渐进加速次数",
  "Max Audible Distance": "最大可闻距离",
  "Maximum distance at which this sound is audible.": "此声音可被听到的最大距离。",
  "Play everywhere": "到处播放",
  "Start Silent": "静默启动",
  "Is NOT Looped": "非循环",
  "If an entity is specified, sound will come from this named entity instead of the location of ambient_generic.": "如果指定了实体，声音将来自该命名实体，而不是 ambient_generic 的位置。",
  "Sets the sound pitch, expressed as a range from 1 to 255, where 100 is the sound's default pitch.": "设置声音音调，范围从 1 到 255，100 为该声音的默认音调。",
  "Starts the sound.": "开始播放声音。",
  "Stops the sound if it is playing.": "如果声音正在播放则停止播放。",
  "Toggles the sound between playing and stopping.": "在播放与停止之间切换声音。",
  "Sets the sound volume, expressed as a range from 0 to 10, where 10 is the loudest.": "设置声音音量，范围从 0 到 10，10 为最响。",
  "Fades the sound up to full volume over a specified number of seconds, with a range from 0 to 100 seconds.": "在指定秒数内将声音淡入至全音量，范围为 0 到 100 秒。",
  "Fades the sound to silence over a specified number of seconds, with a range from 0 to 100 seconds.": "在指定秒数内将声音淡出至无声，范围为 0 到 100 秒。",
  "Sound Event Name": "声音事件名称",
  "Name of the sound event to play": "要播放的声音事件的名称",
  "Source Entity Name": "源实体名称",
  "Name of the entity the sound should emit from.": "声音应从其发出的实体名称。",
  "Play the sound immediately upon spawning": "生成时立即播放声音",
  "To Local Player": "至本地玩家",
  "Play the sound directly to the local player": "直接向本地玩家播放声音",
  "Re-trigger Stops Last": "重新触发时停止上一个",
  "Stop a previously playing event when a new one is started": "启动新事件时停止先前正在播放的事件",
  "This soundevent should be saved and restored.": "此声音事件应被保存和恢复。",
  "Entity Attachment Name": "实体附加点名称",
  "If set, will play the soundevent from this attachment point.": "如果设置，将从此附加点播放声音事件。",
  "Entity Index Selection": "实体索引选择",
  "Use World Index": "使用世界索引",
