  "Set the name of the entity to play the sound from. The sound will follow the entity as it moves.": "设置播放声音的实体名称。声音将跟随该实体移动。",
  "Set the name of the sound event to play": "设置要播放的声音事件的名称",
  "Start the sound event. If an entity name is provided, the sound will originate from that entity": "启动声音事件。如果提供了实体名称，声音将从该实体发出",
  "Pause the sound event.": "暂停声音事件。",
