  "Fired when the sound finished playing": "声音播放完毕时触发",
  "Size of soundevent sphere": "声音事件球体的大小",
  "Box Mins": "盒体最小点",
  "Box Maxs": "盒体最大点",
  "Path Corner Entity Name": "路径转角实体名称",
