  "Max Distance": "最大距离",
  "The distance beyond which a segment will not emit a soundevent": "超过此距离时线段将不再发出声音事件",
  "Max Dot Product": "最大点积",
  "For excluding soundevents that are close to eachother": "用于排除彼此相近的声音事件",
  "Attenuation Parameter Name": "衰减参数名称",
