  "Set the name of the entity to check distance/occlusion from. This check will follow the entity as it moves.": "设置用于检测距离/遮挡的实体名称。此检测将跟随该实体移动。",
  "Dynamic Entity Name": "动态实体名称",
  "Name of the dynamic prop_door_rotating_physics entity to check for dynamic factor calculation.": "用于动态系数计算的动态 prop_door_rotating_physics 实体的名称。",
  "Dynamic Proxy Point": "动态代理点",
  "Position of a proxy point across a dynamic point to use for visiblity calculation. Make sure to set the Occlusion Radius such that it is entirely on one side of the dynamic object.": "用于可见性计算的、位于动态点对面的代理点位置。请确保遮挡半径设置得当，使其完全位于动态对象的一侧。",
  "Dynamic Maximum Occlusion": "动态最大遮挡",
  "Value when the dynamic occlusion is considered fully unoccluded and return 1.": "动态遮挡被视为完全无遮挡并返回 1 时的值。",
  "Box Direction": "盒体方向",
  "Limit the evaluation of the box to a single axis": "将盒体的计算限制在单一轴上",
  "Any": "任意",
  "X Only": "仅 X",
  "Y Only": "仅 Y",
  "Z Only": "仅 Z",
  "No Z": "无 Z",
  "Box Inner Mins": "盒体内部最小点",
  "Box Inner Maxs": "盒体内部最大点",
  "Box Outer Mins": "盒体外部最小点",
  "Box Outer Maxs": "盒体外部最大点",
  "Path Corner Starting Entity": "路径转角起始实体",
  "The name of the entity that is at the start of the path": "位于路径起点的实体名称",
  "Enable Path Corner Parenting": "启用路径转角父级关联",
  "Enables the path corner entities to be parented to another entity and update their position accordingly": "允许路径转角实体父子关联到另一实体并相应更新其位置",
  "Size (radius)": "大小（半径）",
  "Size of the room to analyze": "要分析的房间的大小",
  "Height Tolerance (units)": "高度容差（单位）",
  "If the player's height and the raycast height are within this many units, the difference is ignored when performing distance calculations": "如果玩家高度与光线投射高度之差在此单位数以内，执行距离计算时将忽略该差值",
  "Minimum Wind Value": "最小风力值",
  "Minimum value of env_wind": "env_wind 的最小值",
  "Maximum Wind Value": "最大风力值",
  "Maximum value of env_wind": "env_wind 的最大值",
  "Minimum Wind Map Value": "最小风力映射值",
  "Minimum value to map env_wind to opvar": "env_wind 映射到 OpVar 的最小值",
  "Maximum Wind Map Value": "最大风力映射值",
  "Maximum value to map env_wind to opvar": "env_wind 映射到 OpVar 的最大值",
  "Sound Area Type": "声音区域类型",
  "Name of the type of Sound Area": "声音区域类型的名称",
  "Sound Area Radius": "声音区域半径",
  "The radius of the Sound Area": "声音区域的半径",
  "Sound Area Min": "声音区域最小点",
  "Sound Area Max": "声音区域最大点",
  "Target Brush(es).": "目标画刷。",
  "Increments target brush's current texture frame by one.": "将目标画刷的当前纹理帧增加一。",
  "Sets target brush's texture frame to the specified index.": "将目标画刷的纹理帧设置为指定索引。",
  "Frames Per Second": "每秒帧数",
  "Loop": "循环",
  "Preview Sequence": "预览序列",
  "Position Keyframes": "位置关键帧",
  "Rotation Keyframes": "旋转关键帧",
  "Animation Bounds Min": "动画边界最小点",
  "Minimum extents of the model throughout the whole animation": "模型在整个动画期间的最小范围",
  "Animation Bounds Max": "动画边界最大点",
  "Maximum extents of the model throughout the whole animation": "模型在整个动画期间的最大范围",
  "Select an info_lighting to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of its own origins.": "选择一个 info_lighting 来指定采样光照的位置，而不是使用其自身原点。",
  "Starts the animation": "开始动画",
  "Stops the animation": "停止动画",
  "Enable the Object.": "启用该对象。",
  "Disable the Object.": "禁用该对象。",
  "Scale of the splash": "水花的大小",
  "Create a splash effect.": "创建水花效果。",
  "Automatically find water surface (place entity above water)": "自动寻找水面（将实体放置在水面上方）",
  "Diminish with depth (diminished completely in 10 feet of water)": "随深度衰减（在水下 10 英尺处完全衰减）",
  "Minimum Auto Exposure": "最小自动曝光",
  "Maximum Auto Exposure": "最大自动曝光",
  "Target Bright Pixel Percentage": "目标高亮像素百分比",
  "Set a target for percentage of pixels above a certain brightness. (-1 for default engine behavior)": "设置超过某一亮度的像素百分比目标。（-1 为引擎默认行为）",
  "Target Brightness Percent": "目标亮度百分比",
  "Set a custom brightness target to go along with 'Target Bright Pixel Percentage'. (-1 for default engine behavior)": "设置与“目标高亮像素百分比”配合使用的自定义亮度目标。（-1 为引擎默认行为）",
  "Rate": "速率",
  "Master": "主控制器",
  "The master tonemap controller for the map presents the default values to use. Will be used initially and whenever active tonemaps are disabled.": "地图的主色调映射控制器提供默认使用值。将在初始时以及所有启用的色调映射被禁用时使用。",
  "Enables this tonemap controller": "启用此色调映射控制器",
  "Sets min exposure for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的最小曝光",
  "Sets max exposure for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的最大曝光",
  "Sets percentage target for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的百分比目标",
  "Sets percentage bright pixels for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的高亮像素百分比",
  "Sets average luminosity for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的平均亮度",
  "Sets rate of adjustment for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的调整速率",
  "Sets accelerate exposure down for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的曝光加速下降",
  "Max Ragdoll Count": "最大布娃娃数量",
  "Sets the max number of ragdolls that can be in the world at a time (if they are flagged to fade). Set to -1 if you want to use the default value (g_ragdoll_maxcount).": "设置世界中同时可存在的最大布娃娃数量（针对标记为淡出的布娃娃）。若要使用默认值（g_ragdoll_maxcount），请设为 -1。",
  "Save Important Ragdolls": "保存重要布娃娃",
  "Should the ragdoll manager make sure ally ragdolls aren't deleted?": "布娃娃管理器是否应确保友方布娃娃不被删除？",
  "Ragdolls Take Damage": "布娃娃可受伤害",
  "Can ragdolls be damaged and eventually destroyed if they have health?": "布娃娃是否可受伤害并在有生命值的情况下最终被摧毁？",
  "Set the Max Ragdoll Count.": "设置最大布娃娃数量。",
  "Max Gib Count": "最大碎块数量",
  "Sets the max number of gib that can be spawned at a time. (-1=no limit)": "设置一次可生成的最大碎块数量。（-1 = 无限制）",
  "Allow New Gibs To Spawn": "允许生成新碎块",
  "If true, when the max gib count is reached, oldest gibs are removed as new gibs spawn. If false, new gibs will not be spawned once the gib limit is reached.": "如果为真，当达到最大碎块数量时，生成新碎块的同时会移除最旧的碎块。如果为假，一旦达到碎块上限，将不再生成新碎块。",
  "Set the max gib count.": "设置最大碎块数量。",
  "Spread at the base": "底部扩散",
  "Amount of random spread in the origins of the smoke particles when they're spawned.": "烟雾粒子生成时其原点的随机扩散量。",
  "Spread Speed": "扩散速度",
  "Amount of random spread in the velocity of the smoke particles after they're spawned.": "烟雾粒子生成后其速度的随机扩散量。",
  "Speed": "速度",
  "The speed at which the smoke particles move after they're spawned.": "烟雾粒子生成后的移动速度。",
  "Particle start size": "粒子起始大小",
  "Size of the smoke particles when they're first emitted.": "烟雾粒子初次发射时的大小。",
  "Particle end size": "粒子结束大小",
  "Size of the smoke particles at the point they fade out completely.": "烟雾粒子完全淡出时的大小。",
  "Emission rate": "发射速率",
  "Rate at which to emit smoke particles (i.e. particles to emit per second).": "发射烟雾粒子的速率（即每秒发射的粒子数）。",
  "Length of smoke trail": "烟雾尾迹长度",
  "Length of the smokestack. Lifetime of the smoke particles is derived from this & particle speed.": "烟柱的长度。烟雾粒子的寿命由此数值与粒子速度共同决定。",
  "Wind X/Y Angle": "风 X/Y 角度",
  "This specifies the wind direction. It is an angle in the XY plane. WindSpeed specifies the strength of the wind.": "指定风向。它是 XY 平面上的一个角度。WindSpeed 指定风的强度。",
  "Wind Speed": "风速",
  "The strength of the wind.": "风的强度。",
  "Particle material": "粒子材质",
  "Material of the smoke particles emitted by this stack.": "此烟柱发射的烟雾粒子的材质。",
  "Twist": "扭转",
  "The amount, in degrees per second, that the smoke particles twist around the origin.": "烟雾粒子绕原点扭转的速度（单位：度/秒）。",
  "Roll Speed": "翻滚速度",
  "Amount of roll in degrees per second.": "翻滚量（单位：度/秒）。",
  "Base Color (R G B)": "基础颜色 (R G B)",
  "Translucency": "半透明度",
  "Turn on the smokestack.": "打开烟柱。",
  "Turn off the smokestack.": "关闭烟柱。",
  "Toggles the smokestack between on and off state.": "在开启与关闭状态之间切换烟柱。",
  "Set the length of the smoke trail.": "设置烟雾尾迹的长度。",
  "Set the rate at which to emit smoke particles (particles per second).": "设置发射烟雾粒子的速率（每秒粒子数）。",
  "Set the speed at which the smoke particles move after they're spawned.": "设置烟雾粒子生成后的移动速度。",
  "Set the amount of random spread in the velocity of the smoke particles after they're spawned.": "设置烟雾粒子生成后其速度的随机扩散量。",
  "Fade From": "淡出来源",
  "Modulate": "调制",
  "Triggering player only": "仅触发玩家",
  "Stay Out": "保持退出",
  "Duration (seconds)": "持续时间（秒）",
  "The time that it will take to fade the screen in or out.": "屏幕淡入或淡出所需的时间。",
  "Hold Fade (seconds)": "保持淡入/淡出（秒）",
  "The time to hold the faded in/out state.": "保持淡入/淡出状态的时间。",
  "Fade Alpha": "淡出透明度",
  "Alpha of the fade, where 0 = fully transparent and 255 = fully opaque.": "淡出的透明度，0 = 完全透明，255 = 完全不透明。",
  "Fade Color (R G B)": "淡出颜色 (R G B)",
  "Start the screen fade.": "开始屏幕淡入/淡出。",
  "Fired when the fade has begun.": "淡入/淡出开始时触发。",
  "Tonemap Name": "色调映射名称",
  "The name of the tonemap controller entity associated with this trigger.": "与此触发器关联的色调映射控制器实体的名称。",
  "Fake Ladder": "假梯子",
  "End": "末端",
  "Ladder end point.": "梯子终点。",
  "Auto Ride Speed": "自动 riding 速度",
  "Enable this ladder.": "启用此梯子。",
  "Disable this ladder.": "禁用此梯子。",
  "Fired whenever a player gets on this ladder.": "玩家登上此梯子时触发。",
  "Fired whenever a player gets off this ladder.": "玩家离开此梯子时触发。",
  "Surface properties (optional)": "表面属性（可选）",
  "If multiple ladders are near multiple endpoints, use this to stop them from interfering with each other.": "如果多个梯子靠近多个端点，使用此项防止它们相互干扰。",
  "Minimum Light Level": "最小光照等级",
  "The minimum level of ambient light that hits this brush.": "照射到此画刷上的环境光最低等级。",
  "Interacts As": "交互身份层",
  "Set the interacts as layer": "设置交互身份层",
  "Interacts With": "交互对象层",
  "Set the interacts with layer": "设置交互对象层",
  "Ignore player +USE": "忽略玩家 +USE",
  "Solidity": "实体性",
  "Used to control the solidity/collision of these brushes.": "用于控制这些画刷的实体性/碰撞。",
  "Toggle": "切换",
  "Never Solid": "永不实体化",
  "Always Solid": "始终实体化",
  "NPC class excluded from collisions": "排除碰撞的 NPC 类",
  "If an NPC classname is specified here, NPCs of that type won't collide with these brushes. In Episodic, you may also specify an individual entity's name.": "如果在此指定 NPC 类名，该类型的 NPC 将不会与这些画刷碰撞。在 Episodic 中，你也可以指定单个实体的名称。",
  "Invert NPC class exclusion": "反转 NPC 类排除",
  "If set, then the excluded NPC class will consider this brush solid, and all other NPC classes will consider it non-solid.": "如果设置，被排除的 NPC 类将视此画刷为实体，而所有其他 NPC 类将视其为非实体。",
  "Nav: Ignore if 'Always Solid'": "导航：若为“始终实体化”则忽略",
  "If set, nav generation will ignore this func_brush if 'Solidity' is set to 'Always Solid'.": "如果设置，当“实体性”设为“始终实体化”时，导航生成将忽略此 func_brush。",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers": "以逗号分隔的交互层列表",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers to interact with": "以逗号分隔的、要与之交互的交互层列表",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers to not collide with": "以逗号分隔的、不与之碰撞的交互层列表",
  "Solid BSP": "实体 BSP",
  "Set this if this brush is in hierarchy with a moving object of some kind, and the player can stand on this brush.": "如果此画刷与某种移动物体处于同一层级结构中，且玩家可以站在此画刷上，则设置此项。",
  "Scripted Movement": "脚本移动",
  "Set this to allow vscript code to move the brush via SetVelocity() calls.": "设置此项以允许 vscript 代码通过 SetVelocity() 调用来移动画刷。",
  "Sets the brush's alpha value.": "设置画刷的透明度值。",
  "Change the NPC class excluded from collisions": "更改排除碰撞的 NPC 类",
  "Set the state of invversion for NPC class exclusion (0 or 1)": "设置 NPC 类排除的反转状态（0 或 1）",
  "Enables all collisions with this func_brush.": "启用与此 func_brush 的所有碰撞。",
  "Disables all collisions with this func_brush.": "禁用与此 func_brush 的所有碰撞。",
  "Toggle enable state.": "切换启用状态。",
  "Panel Name": "面板名称",
  "Overlay Material": "覆盖材质",
  "Name of a material to overlay over the top of the VGUI screen. NOTE: This material must write Z for the VGUI screen to work.": "覆盖在 VGUI 屏幕上方的材质名称。注意：此材质必须写入 Z，VGUI 屏幕才能正常工作。",
  "Panel Width in World": "面板世界宽度",
  "Width of the panel in units.": "面板的宽度（单位）。",
  "Panel Height in World": "面板世界高度",
  "Height of the panel in units.": "面板的高度（单位）。",
  "Make the vgui screen visible.": "使 vgui 屏幕可见。",
  "Make the vgui screen invisible.": "使 vgui 屏幕不可见。",
  "Display Text": "显示文本",
  "Image Directory (materials/vgui/...)": "图像目录 (materials/vgui/...)",
  "Min Slide Time": "最短幻灯片时间",
  "Minimum amount of random time that a slide is displayed.": "一张幻灯片显示的最短随机时间。",
  "Max Slide Time": "最长幻灯片时间",
  "Maximum amount of random time that a slide is displayed.": "一张幻灯片显示的最长随机时间。",
  "Cycle Type": "循环类型",
  "Forward": "前进",
  "Backward": "后退",
  "No List Repeat": "列表不重复",
  "Allow List Repeats": "允许列表重复",
  "No List Repeats": "列表不重复",
  "Panel width": "面板宽度",
  "Panel height": "面板高度",
  "Make slideshow visible.": "使幻灯片放映可见。",
  "Make slideshow invisible.": "使幻灯片放映不可见。",
  "Sets the display text.": "设置显示文本。",
  "Removes all slides from slideshow.": "从幻灯片放映中移除所有幻灯片。",
  "Adds slides by keyword.": "按关键字添加幻灯片。",
  "Sets min random time between slides.": "设置幻灯片之间的最短随机时间。",
  "Sets max random time between slides.": "设置幻灯片之间的最长随机时间。",
  "0 - random, 1 - forward, 2 - backward": "0 - 随机，1 - 前进，2 - 后退",
  "Sets if lists can be randomly picked twice in a row.": "设置列表是否可以连续两次被随机选中。",
  "Movie Filename": "影片文件名",
  "Group Name": "组名称",
  "Loop Movie": "循环影片",
  "Make movie visible.": "使影片可见。",
  "Make movie invisible.": "使影片不可见。",
  "Gib Direction (Pitch Yaw Roll)": "碎块方向 (Pitch Yaw Roll)",
  "The direction the gibs will fly.": "碎块飞出的方向。",
  "Number of Gibs": "碎块数量",
  "Total number of gibs to shoot each time it's activated.": "每次激活时发射的碎块总数。",
  "Delay between shots": "发射间隔",
  "Delay (in seconds) between shooting each gib. If 0, all gibs shoot at once.": "发射每个碎块之间的延迟（秒）。如果为 0，所有碎块同时发射。",
  "Gib Angles (Pitch Yaw Roll)": "碎块角度 (Pitch Yaw Roll)",
  "The orientation of the spawned gibs.": "生成碎块的朝向。",
  "Max angular velocity": "最大角速度",
  "How fast (degrees/sec) the gib pieces should spin. They will spin on x and y axis at between 10% and 100% of this speed.": "碎块旋转的速度（度/秒）。它们将以此速度的 10% 到 100% 绕 X 轴和 Y 轴旋转。",
  "Gib Velocity": "碎块速度",
  "Speed of the fired gibs": "发射出的碎块的速度",
  "Course Variance": "弹道偏差",
  "How much variance in the direction gibs are fired.": "碎块发射方向的偏差量。",
  "Gib Life": "碎块存活时间",
  "Time in seconds for gibs to live +/- 5%": "碎块的存活时间（秒），误差 ±5%",
  "Select an entity to specify a location to sample lighting from for all gibs spawned by this shooter, instead of their own origins.": "选择一个实体，为该发射器生成的所有碎块指定采样光照的位置，而不是使用其自身原点。",
  "Repeatable": "可重复",
  "Force the gibshooter to create and shoot a gib.": "强制碎块发射器创建并发射一个碎块。",
  "Brightness (1 - 255)": "亮度 (1 - 255)",
  "Beam Color (R G B)": "光束颜色 (R G B)",
  "If the 'Random Strike' spawnflag is set, this radius determines the area within which the endpoints will randomly strike.": "如果设置了“随机打击”生成标记，此半径决定端点随机打击的区域范围。",
  "Life (seconds 0 = infinite)": "寿命（秒，0 = 无限）",
  "Amount of time before the beam dies. Setting to zero will make the beam stay forever.": "光束消失前的时间。设为零将使光束永久存在。",
  "Width of beam": "光束宽度",
  "Pixel width of the beam.": "光束的像素宽度。",
  "Amount of noise (0-255)": "噪声量 (0-255)",
  "The amount of noise in the beam. 0 is a perfectly straight beam.": "光束的噪声量。0 为完全笔直的光束。",
  "Sprite Name": "精灵名称",
  "The material used to draw the beam.": "用于绘制光束的材质。",
  "Texture Scroll Rate (0-100)": "纹理滚动速率 (0-100)",
  "Rate at which the beam texture should scroll along the beam.": "光束纹理沿光束滚动的速率。",
  "Frames per 10 seconds": "每 10 秒帧数",
  "Framerate at which the beam texture should animate, if it has multiple frames.": "如果光束纹理有多帧，其动画的帧率。",
  "Starting Frame": "起始帧",
  "The frame to start the beam texture on.": "光束纹理的起始帧。",
  "Strike again time (secs)": "再次打击时间（秒）",
  "Refire time between random strikes of the beam. Only used if the 'Random Strike' spawnflag is set.": "光束随机打击之间的再触发时间。仅在设置了“随机打击”生成标记时使用。",
  "Damage / second": "伤害/秒",
  "How much damage this beam does per second to things it hits when it is continually on, or instantaneously if it strikes. For continuous damage, the value should be greater than 10 or it may not work.": "此光束持续开启时每秒对其击中物造成的伤害，或在打击时瞬间造成的伤害。若要造成持续伤害，该值应大于 10，否则可能无效。",
  "Start Entity": "起始实体",
  "Entity that the beam starts at.": "光束起始处的实体。",
  "Ending Entity": "结束实体",
  "Entity that the beam ends at.": "光束终止处的实体。",
  "Decal Name": "贴花名称",
  "Bigshot": "大弹孔",
  "Decal to be applied at the end of the beam": "在光束末端应用的贴花",
