  "Fires when the fire is first ignited.": "火焰首次被点燃时触发。",
  "Fires when the fire is fully extinguished.": "火焰被完全扑灭时触发。",
  "The radius around this entity in which to provide heat.": "此实体周围提供热量的半径。",
  "Intensity / Damage": "强度/伤害",
  "Amount of heat 'damage' to apply to env_fire entities within the radius.": "对半径内 env_fire 实体施加的热量“伤害”量。",
