  "The radius around this entity in which to detect heat changes.": "此实体周围检测热量变化的半径。",
  "Heat level": "热量等级",
  "The target heat level to check for. Outputs are fired when the heat moves over this target level (increasing or decreasing).": "要检测的目标热量等级。当热量越过此目标等级（上升或下降）时触发输出。",
  "Time at level": "等级持续时间",
