  "Limit to entity": "限制到实体",
  "Limit the shake to entity or entities matching the name or class name.": "将摇晃限制到与名称或类名匹配的实体。",
  "Amplitude (0-16)": "振幅 (0-16)",
  "The amount of noise in the screen shake. Should be a range between 0 and 16.": "屏幕摇晃中的噪声强度。取值范围应在 0 到 16 之间。",
  "Effect Radius": "效果半径",
  "The radius around this entity in which to affect players.": "此实体周围影响玩家的半径。",
  "The length of time in which to shake the player's screens.": "摇晃玩家屏幕的时长。",
  "The frequency used to apply the screen shake. Should be a value between 0 and 255, where 0.1 = jerk, and 255.0 = rumble.": "应用屏幕摇晃的频率。取值应在 0 到 255 之间，其中 0.1 = 颤动，255.0 = 隆隆震动。",
