  "On fire": "着火",
  "strict remove after lifetime": "生存期结束后严格移除",
  "Disable Shadows on Gibs": "禁用碎块阴影",
  "Gib gravity scale": "碎块重力缩放",
  "ONLY WORKS FOR POINT GIBS. This field allows you to scale gravity so that gibs fall faster, slower, or not at all.": "仅对点碎块有效。此字段允许你缩放重力，使碎块下落更快、更慢或不下落。",
  "Mass override": "质量覆盖",
  "EPISODIC ONLY. Specify an arbitrary mass for the gibs emitted by me.": "仅限 EPISODIC。为我发射的碎块指定任意质量。",
  "Thing to shoot out.  Can be a .vmdl or a .vmat.": "要射出的物体。可以是 .vmdl 或 .vmat。",
  "Time Under Rotor": "在旋翼下的时间",
  "The average time it has to be under the rotor before it shoots a gib.": "在射出碎块前物体需要处于旋翼下的平均时间。",
  "Time variance": "时间变化量",
  "The random amount to vary the time it has to be under the rotor before it shoots a gib.": "在射出碎块前物体需处于旋翼下的时间的随机变化量。",
  "Soundscape Entity": "音景实体",
  "The soundscape to get all sound parameters from.": "从中获取所有声音参数的音景。",
  "If set to -1, then the player can hear the soundscape as long as he can see it (regardless of distance to it).": "如果设为 -1，只要玩家能看到音景（无论距离多远），就能听到它。",
  "Soundscape": "音景",
  "The name of the soundscape to use. Corresponds to an entry in the soundscapes*.txt file in the scripts directory.": "要使用的音景名称。对应 scripts 目录中 soundscapes*.txt 文件里的条目。",
  "Override soundscape with sound event": "用声音事件覆盖音景",
  "Sound Event": "声音事件",
  "The name of the sound event to start from the soundscape entity.": "要从音景实体启动的声音事件名称。",
  "Sound Position 0": "声音位置 0",
  "A sound position that will be referenced inside the soundscape text file. Usually used to position a set of sounds within the world.": "将在音景文本文件内部引用的声音位置。通常用于在世界中定位一组声音。",
  "Sound Position 1": "声音位置 1",
  "Sound Position 2": "声音位置 2",
  "Sound Position 3": "声音位置 3",
  "Sound Position 4": "声音位置 4",
  "Sound Position 5": "声音位置 5",
  "Sound Position 6": "声音位置 6",
  "Sound Position 7": "声音位置 7",
  "Toggle the soundscape enabled state.": "切换音景的启用状态。",
  "Fired when this soundscape becomes the active one.": "当此音景成为活动音景时触发。",
  "Max Delay": "最大延迟",
  "The longest delay between sparks (in seconds).": "火花之间的最长延迟（秒）。",
  "Spark Type": "火花类型",
  "What Type of Spark Effect": "火花效果的类型",
  "Electrical": "电气",
  "The size of the sparks.": "火花的大小。",
  "Small": "小",
  "Huge": "巨大",
  "Spark Trail Length": "火花拖尾长度",
  "Short": "短",
  "Long": "长",
  "Start ON": "启动时开启",
  "Silent": "静音",
  "Directional": "有方向性",
  "Start the spark effect.": "启动火花效果。",
  "Stop the spark effect.": "停止火花效果。",
  "Toggle the on/off state of the spark effect.": "切换火花效果的开关状态。",
  "Spark once.": "迸发一次火花。",
  "Framerate": "帧率",
  "Rate at which the sprite should animate, if at all.": "精灵图的动画播放速率（如果有）。",
  "Material of the sprite to be drawn.": "要绘制的精灵图材质。",
  "Scale": "缩放",
  "Scale multiplier of the sprite.": "精灵图的缩放倍率。",
  "Start on": "启动时开启",
  "Size of Glow Proxy Geometry.": "发光代理几何体的大小。",
  "Size of the glow to be rendered for visibility testing. Must be larger than the distance from the sprite center to empty space.  So if this glow is inside geometry (like a light bulb), set this value to be bigger than the bulb's radius. Any time a sphere of this radius would be visible (poking through any nearby geometry), the glow will be rendered.": "为可见性测试而渲染的发光大小。必须大于从精灵图中心到空白空间的距离。因此，如果此发光位于几何体内部（如灯泡内），请将此值设置为大于灯泡的半径。只要这个半径的球体可见（从附近的几何体中穿出），就会渲染发光。",
  "Set the sprite's scale (0 - 8.0).": "设置精灵图的缩放 (0 - 8.0)。",
  "Hide the sprite. Won't be drawn until the 'ShowSprite' input is received.": "隐藏精灵图。在接收到 'ShowSprite' 输入之前不会绘制。",
  "Show the sprite.": "显示精灵图。",
  "Toggle the sprite between hidden and shown.": "在隐藏和显示之间切换精灵图。",
  "Wind": "风",
  "Min normal speed": "最小常规速度",
  "Minimum speed of the wind while idling.": "空闲时风的最小速度。",
  "Max normal speed": "最大常规速度",
  "Maximum speed of the wind while idling.": "空闲时风的最大速度。",
  "Min gust speed": "最小阵风速度",
  "Minimum speed of wind gusts.": "阵风的最小速度。",
  "Max gust speed": "最大阵风速度",
  "Maximum speed of wind gusts.": "阵风的最大速度。",
  "Min gust delay": "最小阵风延迟",
  "Minimum time delay between random gusts.": "随机阵风之间的最短时间延迟。",
  "Max gust delay": "最大阵风延迟",
  "Maximum time delay between random gusts.": "随机阵风之间的最长时间延迟。",
  "Gust Duration": "阵风持续时间",
  "How long will the wind gust for.": "阵风将持续多长时间。",
  "Max gust direction change (degrees)": "最大阵风方向变化（度）",
  "Maximum amount that the wind's direction changes due to a gust.": "风因阵风而改变方向的最大幅度。",
  "The radius this entity applies wind effects to.  -1 for global effect, other value to allow multiple or limited wind entities.": "此实体施加风效的半径。-1 为全局效果，其他值允许存在多个或受限的风实体。",
  "Fired when a wind gust begins.": "阵风开始时触发。",
  "Fired when a wind gust ends.": "阵风结束时触发。",
  "3D Skybox scale": "3D 天空盒缩放",
  "Scale of the skybox.": "天空盒的缩放。",
  "Clip 3D sky near plane to world far plane": "将 3D 天空近裁剪面对齐到世界远裁剪面",
  "3D sky near plane offset": "3D 天空近裁剪面偏移",
  "Offset for the near clip plane for the 3D sky in world units.  This is only used if the above field is true.  Negative values to pull closer, etc.": "3D 天空近裁剪面的偏移量（世界单位）。仅当上一字段为真时使用。负值可将平面拉近等。",
  "Name of the skybox this camera belongs to.": "此摄像机所属天空盒的名称。",
  "Fog": "雾",
  "Distance at which the skybox fog should start.": "天空盒雾开始出现的距离。",
  "Distance at which the skybox fog should be fully opaque.": "天空盒雾完全遮蔽的距离。",
  "Min Delay Between Announcements": "公告之间的最小延迟",
  "Max Delay Between Announcements": "公告之间的最大延迟",
  "Context rule script": "上下文规则脚本",
  "Script file containing rules for playing appropriate sounds.": "包含播放相应声音规则的脚本文件。",
  "Concept name": "概念名称",
  "High level concept name used as primary search key.": "用作主要搜索键的高级概念名称。",
  "Turn on the random announcements.": "开启随机公告。",
  "Turn off the random announcements.": "关闭随机公告。",
  "Toggle the random announcements off and on.": "切换随机公告的关和开。",
  "Weapon Classname": "武器类名",
  "Classname of the weapon type to limit.": "要限制的武器类型的类名。",
  "Max Allowed in Level": "关卡中允许的最大数量",
  "The maximum amount of the specified weapon type allowed in the world.": "世界中允许存在的指定武器类型的最大数量。",
  "Ammo modifier": "弹药修正值",
  "Modifier for ammount of ammo dropped by a weapon.": "对武器掉落弹药数量的修正值。",
  "Adjust the ammo modifier.": "调整弹药修正值。",
  "Use Only": "仅可使用",
  "Strip First": "先缴械",
  "Team Master (Obsolete)": "队伍主控（已废弃）",
  "Legacy support: The name of a master entity. If the master hasn't been activated, this entity will not activate.": "旧版支持：主控实体的名称。如果主控实体未被激活，此实体将不会激活。",
  "Weapon": "武器",
  "Classname of item to equip, eg 'weapon_ak47'.": "要装备的物品类名，例如 'weapon_ak47'。",
  "This will force all connected players to take the weapon(s) specified.": "这将强制所有已连接的玩家持有指定的武器。",
  "This will force the player who activated to equip the specified weapon.": "这将强制触发此操作的玩家装备指定的武器。",
  "All Players": "所有玩家",
  "Message to display onscreen.": "显示在屏幕上的消息。",
  "X (0 - 1.0 = left to right) (-1 centers)": "X (0 - 1.0 = 从左到右) (-1 为居中)",
  "Horizontal position on the player's screens to draw the text. The value should be between 0 and 1, where 0 is the far left of the screen and 1 is the far right. -1 centers the text.": "文本绘制在玩家屏幕上的水平位置。取值应在 0 到 1 之间，0 为屏幕最左侧，1 为最右侧。-1 为居中。",
  "Y (0 - 1.0 = top to bottom) (-1 centers)": "Y (0 - 1.0 = 从上到下) (-1 为居中)",
  "Vertical position on the player's screens to draw the text. The value should be between 0 and 1, where 0 is the top of the screen and 1 is the bottom. -1 centers the text.": "文本绘制在玩家屏幕上的垂直位置。取值应在 0 到 1 之间，0 为屏幕顶部，1 为底部。-1 为居中。",
  "Text Effect": "文本效果",
  "Fade In/Out": "淡入/淡出",
  "Credits": "制作人员名单",
  "Scan Out": "扫描输出",
  "Color1": "颜色1",
  "Color2": "颜色2",
  "Fade in Time (or character scan time)": "淡入时间（或字符扫描时间）",
  "The time it should take for the text to fully fade in.": "文本完全淡入所需的时间。",
  "Fade Out Time": "淡出时间",
  "The time it should take for the text to fade out, after the hold time has expired.": "保持时间结束后文本淡出所需的时间。",
  "Hold Time": "保持时间",
  "The time the text should stay onscreen, after fading in, before it begins to fade out.": "文本淡入后停留在屏幕上、开始淡出之前的时间。",
  "Scan time (scan effect only)": "扫描时间（仅扫描效果）",
  "If the 'Text Effect' is set to Scan Out, this is the time it should take to scan out all the letters in the text.": "如果 'Text Effect' 设为 Scan Out，这是扫描完文本中所有字母所需的时间。",
  "Text Channel": "文本通道",
  "You can have up to four individual game_text messages onscreen at once, stored in channels. Select which channel this text should be placed in, which will overwrite any active message already in that channel.": "屏幕上最多可同时显示四条独立的 game_text 消息，存储在通道中。选择此文本应放入的通道，将覆盖该通道中已有的活动消息。",
  "Channel 1": "通道 1",
  "Channel 2": "通道 2",
  "Channel 3": "通道 3",
  "Channel 4": "通道 4",
  "Display the message text.": "显示消息文本。",
  "Set the text to display.": "设置要显示的文本。",
  "Entity Message": "实体消息",
  "Show message radius": "消息显示半径",
  "Distance the player must be within to see this message.": "玩家必须处于该距离内才能看到此消息。",
  "Developer Only?": "仅开发者？",
  "If set, this message will only be visible when developer mode is on.": "如果设置，此消息仅在开发者模式开启时可见。",
  "Start displaying the message text, if the player is within the message radius.": "如果玩家在消息半径内，开始显示消息文本。",
  "Stop displaying the message text.": "停止显示消息文本。",
  "Sets the message text to display.": "设置要显示的消息文本。",
  "Command to execute.": "要执行的命令。",
  "Filter to use to narrow set of findable entities. See filter_activator_name for more explanation.": "用于缩小可找到实体范围的过滤器。详见 filter_activator_name 的说明。",
  "Reference Entity": "参考实体",
  "Name of the entity to use when evaluating criteria.  For example, when using 'Nearest', this is the entity that distance will be measured from.  If left blank will use the point_entity_finder.": "评估条件时使用的实体名称。例如，使用 'Nearest' 时，将从此实体测量距离。留空则使用 point_entity_finder。",
  "Search Method": "搜索方法",
  "Find an entity that meets the specified criteria.  Will fire OutEntity if found and pass the entity as !Caller.": "查找符合指定条件的实体。找到后将触发 OutEntity，并将该实体作为 !Caller 传递。",
  "Fired when FindEntity is input and an entity was found. Passes the found entity as !Caller.": "输入 FindEntity 且找到实体时触发。将找到的实体作为 !Caller 传递。",
  "Count the number of players in the zone, and fire the corresponding outputs.": "统计区域内的玩家数量，并触发相应的输出。",
  "Fired whenever a count finds a player inside the zone, with the player as the activator.": "每次统计发现玩家在区域内时触发，以该玩家为激活者。",
  "Fired whenever a count finds a player outside the zone, with the player as the activator.": "每次统计发现玩家在区域外时触发，以该玩家为激活者。",
  "Fired after a count, and contains the number of players found inside the zone.": "统计后触发，包含在区域内找到的玩家数量。",
  "Fired after a count, and contains the number of players found outside the zone.": "统计后触发，包含在区域外找到的玩家数量。",
  "Master has priority if multiple info_player_starts exist": "存在多个 info_player_start 时主控实体优先",
  "Pawn Subclass": "Pawn 子类",
  "Subclass of the player pawn to spawn.": "要生成的玩家 Pawn 的子类。",
  "Toggle the enable/disable state of this player spawn position.": "切换此玩家出生位置的启用/禁用状态。",
  "Entity to look at": "要朝向的实体",
  "Name of entity that dead players will face while in intermission at this spot.": "死于此处的玩家在间歇期间面对的实体名称。",
  "Set position of landmark.": "设置地标位置。",
  "Level to stream in/out": "要流入/流出的关卡",
  "Name of entity filter to apply": "要应用的实体过滤器名称",
  "The landmark (same landmark name should be in both maps) used to determine the offset of the second map to the first": "用于确定第二张地图相对第一张地图偏移的地标（两张地图中应使用相同的地标名称）",
  "Timeout Interval": "超时间隔",
  "The amount of seconds after which, if any client hasn't finished streaming the necessary assets, that client is disconnected and the spawngroup spawns anyways. 0 means use some reasonable default set in the code.": "如果任何客户端在此秒数后仍未完成必要资产的流式加载，该客户端将被断开连接，而生组仍会生成。0 表示使用代码中设定的合理默认值。",
  "Automatically activate and show streamed level": "自动激活并显示流式加载的关卡",
  "Automatically activates the spawn group once loaded.": "加载完成后自动激活生成组。",
  "Fired when the level starts streaming in.": "关卡开始流入时触发。",
  "Fired when the level finishes streaming in.": "关卡流入完成时触发。",
  "Fired when the level starts streaming out.": "关卡开始流出时触发。",
  "Fired when the level finishes streaming out.": "关卡流出完成时触发。",
  "Start loading the level.": "开始加载关卡。",
  "Activate the loaded spawn group.": "激活已加载的生成组。",
  "Start unloading the level.": "开始卸载关卡。",
  "Transmit to client (respect PVS)": "传输到客户端（遵循 PVS）",
  "Always transmit to client (ignore PVS)": "始终传输到客户端（忽略 PVS）",
  "Particle System Name": "粒子系统名称",
  "Start Active?": "启动时激活？",
  "Don't Save": "不保存",
  "Particle Snapshot File": "粒子快照文件",
  "Name of .VSNAP (Particle Snapshot File) to be loaded and used by this particle system (e.g. 'smoke_snapshot1')": "要由该粒子系统加载和使用的 .VSNAP（粒子快照文件）名称（例如 'smoke_snapshot1'）",
  "Particle Snapshot Node": "粒子快照节点",
  "Id of a node in the map to be used to generate a particle snapshot, if specified Particle Snapshot File is ignored.": "地图中用于生成粒子快照的节点 ID。如果指定，粒子快照文件将被忽略。",
  "Data Control Point (-1 unused)": "数据控制点（-1 为不使用）",
  "What controlpoint to set data on.  -1 means this is not used.": "要设置数据的控制点。-1 表示不使用。",
  "Data Control Point Value": "数据控制点值",
  "Data Control Point Value to set.": "要设置的数据控制点值。",
  "Tint Control Point (-1 unused)": "着色控制点（-1 为不使用）",
  "What controlpoint to set color on.  -1 means this is not used.": "要设置颜色的控制点。-1 表示不使用。",
  "Tint CP Color": "着色控制点颜色",
  "Color for the specified Control Point": "指定控制点的颜色",
  "Control Points": "控制点",
  "Control Point 0": "控制点 0",
  "If set, control point 0 of the effect will be at this entity's location. (Otherwise it is at the info_particle_system origin)": "如果设置，效果的控制点 0 将位于此实体的位置。（否则位于 info_particle_system 原点）",
  "Control Point 1": "控制点 1",
  "If set, control point 1 of the effect will be at this entity's location.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 1 将位于此实体的位置。",
  "Control Point 2": "控制点 2",
  "If set, control point 2 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 1 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 2 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 1 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 3": "控制点 3",
  "If set, control point 3 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 2 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 3 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 2 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 4": "控制点 4",
  "If set, control point 4 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 3 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 4 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 3 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 5": "控制点 5",
  "If set, control point 5 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 4 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 5 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 4 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 6": "控制点 6",
  "If set, control point 6 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 5 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 6 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 5 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 7": "控制点 7",
  "If set, control point 7 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 6 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 7 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 6 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 8": "控制点 8",
  "If set, control point 8 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 7 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 8 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 7 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 9": "控制点 9",
  "If set, control point 9 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 8 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 9 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 8 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 10": "控制点 10",
  "If set, control point 10 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 9 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 10 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 9 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 11": "控制点 11",
  "If set, control point 11 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 10 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 11 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 10 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 12": "控制点 12",
  "If set, control point 12 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 11 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 12 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 11 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 13": "控制点 13",
  "If set, control point 13 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 12 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 13 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 12 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 14": "控制点 14",
  "If set, control point 14 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 13 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 14 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 13 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
  "Control Point 15": "控制点 15",
  "If set, control point 15 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 14 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置，效果的控制点 15 将位于此实体的位置。如果控制点 14 未设置，此项将被忽略。",
