  "Tell the particle system to start emitting.": "让粒子系统开始发射。",
  "Tell the particle system to stop emitting.": "让粒子系统停止发射。",
  "Tell the particle system to freeze, with optional transition time.": "让粒子系统冻结，可选过渡时间。",
  "Tell the frozen particle system to unfreeze, with optional transition time.": "让已冻结的粒子系统解冻，可选过渡时间。",
  "Tell the particle system to stop emitting and play its End Cap Effect.": "让粒子系统停止发射并播放其结束帽效果。",
  "Destroy the particle system and remove all particles immediately.": "立即销毁粒子系统并移除所有粒子。",
  "Set a Control Point via format - CP: X Y Z": "通过格式 - CP: X Y Z 设置控制点",
  "Set X Component of Data Control Point": "设置数据控制点的 X 分量",
  "Set Y Component of Data Control Point": "设置数据控制点的 Y 分量",
  "Set Z Component of Data Control Point": "设置数据控制点的 Z 分量",
  "Bar Magnet Axis": "条形磁铁轴",
  "Effective Radius": "有效半径",
  "Radius in which ragdolls are affected around this entity's origin.": "此实体原点周围布娃娃受影响的半径。",
  "Force": "力",
  "Magnetic force to apply to ragdolls within the radius. Expressed as kilograms per inch per second. So a force of 1000 will add 10 inches/second to a 100kg man. It will add 100 inches per second to a 10kg headcrab.": "施加给半径内布娃娃的磁力。以千克·英寸/秒表示。因此 1000 的力会给 100 千克的人增加 10 英寸/秒的速度，给 10 千克的猎头蟹增加 100 英寸/秒。",
  "Entity to affect": "要影响的实体",
  "If specified, the phys_ragdollmagnet will only affect the target entity.": "如果指定，phys_ragdollmagnet 将只影响目标实体。",
  "Bar Magnet (use axis helper)": "条形磁铁（使用轴辅助器）",
  "Force human AI Hull": "强制使用 human AI 外壳",
  "Force small_centered AI Hull": "强制使用 small_centered AI 外壳",
  "Force wide_human AI Hull": "强制使用 wide_human AI 外壳",
  "Force tiny AI Hull": "强制使用 tiny AI 外壳",
  "Force medium AI Hull": "强制使用 medium AI 外壳",
  "Force tiny_centered AI Hull": "强制使用 tiny_centered AI 外壳",
  "Force large AI Hull": "强制使用 large AI 外壳",
  "Force large_centered AI Hull": "强制使用 large_centered AI 外壳",
  "Force medium_tall AI Hull": "强制使用 medium_tall AI 外壳",
  "Entity to point at": "要指向的实体",
  "The name of an entity in the map that the dynamic light will point at.": "地图中动态灯光指向的实体名称。",
  "Light color": "灯光颜色",
  "Light brightness": "灯光亮度",
  "Inner (bright) angle": "内（亮）角度",
  "Outer (fading) angle": "外（渐暗）角度",
  "Maximum distance": "最大距离",
  "This is the distance that light is allowed to cast, in inches.": "允许光照投射的距离，以英寸为单位。",
  "Spotlight end radius": "聚光灯末端半径",
  "This is the radius of the light, in inches, at the object that it is hitting.": "光照射到物体处的半径，以英寸为单位。",
  "Do not light world (better perf)": "不照亮世界（性能更佳）",
  "Do not light models": "不照亮模型",
  "Add Displacement Alpha": "增加位移面 Alpha",
  "Subtract Displacement Alpha": "减少位移面 Alpha",
  "Set the light's render color (R G B).": "设置灯光的渲染颜色 (R G B)。",
  "Set the light brightness.": "设置灯光亮度。",
  "Set the maximum light distance.": "设置最大光照距离。",
  "Set the inner (bright) angle.": "设置内（亮）角度。",
  "Set the outer (fading) angle.": "设置外（渐暗）角度。",
  "Set the radius of the spotlight at the end point.": "设置聚光灯末端点的半径。",
  "Change the lightstyle (see Appearance field for possible values).": "更改灯光样式（可选值见 Appearance 字段）。",
  "Turn the light off.": "关闭灯光。",
  "Toggle the light on/off.": "切换灯光开/关。",
  "Lookup Falloff Start Distance": "查找衰减起始距离",
  "This is the distance to the start of the falloff region (-1 = everywhere)": "到衰减区域起点的距离（-1 = 处处）",
  "Lookup Falloff End Distance": "查找衰减结束距离",
  "This is the distance to the end of the falloff region (-1 = everywhere)": "到衰减区域终点的距离（-1 = 处处）",
  "Maximum Weight": "最大权重",
  "This is the maximum weight for this lookup": "此查找的最大权重",
  "Lookup Table Filename": "查找表文件名",
  "This is the lookup table filename": "这是查找表文件名",
  "Lookup Fade In Duration": "查找淡入时长",
  "Duration of fade in on when enabled.": "启用时的淡入时长。",
  "Lookup Fade out Duration": "查找淡出时长",
  "Dration of fade out on when disabled.": "禁用时的淡出时长。",
  "Exlusive": "独占",
  "An exclusive color_correction entity disables and fades out all other color corrections when it is enabled. There should only be one active exclusive color_correction ent at any time.": "独占的 color_correction 实体在启用时会禁用并淡出所有其他颜色校正。任何时刻应只有一个激活的独占 color_correction 实体。",
  "Sets the 'fadeInDuration' variable, used to fade cc lookup usage when entity is enabled.": "设置 'fadeInDuration' 变量，用于在实体启用时淡入颜色校正查找的使用。",
  "Sets the 'fadeOutDuration' variable, used to fade cc lookup usage when entity is disabled.": "设置 'fadeOutDuration' 变量，用于在实体禁用时淡出颜色校正查找的使用。",
  "Master (Default color correction when used with L4D fog_volume)": "主控（与 L4D fog_volume 一起使用时的默认颜色校正）",
  "Simulate client-side (Must be set when used with L4D fog_volume)": "在客户端模拟（与 L4D fog_volume 一起使用时必须设置）",
  "Lookup Fade Duration": "查找淡入淡出时长",
  "This is the duration for the lookup to fade in/out on extry/exit": "进入/离开时查找淡入/淡出的时长",
  "Next KeyFrame": "下一个关键帧",
  "Name of the next keyframe along this keyframe path.": "沿此关键帧路径的下一个关键帧名称。",
  "Speed (units per second)": "速度（单位/秒）",
  "Position Interpolator": "位置插值器",
  "Catmull-Rom Spline": "Catmull-Rom 样条",
  "Move Direction (Pitch Yaw Roll)": "移动方向（俯仰 偏航 翻滚）",
  "The direction the brushes will move, when told to.": "画刷被指令时移动的方向。",
  "Start Position": "起始位置",
  "Position of brush when spawned. The range is a value between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "画刷生成时的位置。取值为 0.0 到 1.0 之间，0 为起始位置，1 为起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离）。",
  "Authored position": "编辑位置",
  "The entity may be authored in one of three positions for convenience.": "为方便起见，实体可以在三种位置之一进行编辑。",
  "Start position (position = 'Start Position' key)": "起始位置（位置 = 'Start Position' 键值）",
  "Open position (position = 1)": "打开位置（位置 = 1）",
  "Closed position (position = 0)": "关闭位置（位置 = 0）",
  "Move Without Pushing Blockers": "移动时不推挤阻挡物",
  "Just moves the entity and anything attached to it, without going the expensive process of finding and pushing potentially blocking brush entities and NPCs. Will still push dynamic physics entities.": "只移动实体及其附属物，而不执行查找并推挤可能阻挡的画刷实体和 NPC 的昂贵过程。仍会推挤动态物理实体。",
  "The speed that the brush moves, in inches per second.": "画刷移动的速度，以英寸/秒为单位。",
  "Move Distance": "移动距离",
  "The distance from the starting point that the brush should move, in inches.": "画刷从起始点应移动的距离，以英寸为单位。",
  "Block Damage": "阻挡伤害",
  "The amount of damage to do to any entity that blocks the brushes, per frame.": "对阻挡画刷的实体每帧造成的伤害。",
  "Sound played when the brush starts moving.": "画刷开始移动时播放的声音。",
  "Sound played when the brush stops moving.": "画刷停止移动时播放的声音。",
  "Create Nav Obstacle": "创建导航障碍物",
  "Create a navigation obstacle to assist NPC pathfinding": "创建导航障碍物以辅助 NPC 寻路",
  "Create Movable Nav Mesh": "创建可移动导航网格",
  "Create a navigation mesh that moves with the brush.": "创建随画刷一起移动的导航网格。",
  "Movable Nav Mesh, Allow Docking on Full Entity": "可移动导航网格，允许在整个实体上停靠",
  "If this entity creates a movable nav mesh, then allow docking test across the entire entity.": "如果此实体创建可移动导航网格，则允许对整个实体进行停靠测试。",
  "Move the brush to the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "将画刷移动到结束位置（起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离））。",
  "Move the brush to the starting position.": "将画刷移动到起始位置。",
  "Move the brush to a specific position between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "将画刷移动到 0.0 到 1.0 之间的指定位置，0 为起始位置，1 为起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离）。",
  "Set a new start position for our current location.": "以当前位置设置新的起始位置。",
  "Set the speed and update immediately.": "设置速度并立即更新。",
  "Teleport to this entity's origin.": "传送到此实体的原点。",
  "Update the end position to be this distance from the start position.": "将结束位置更新为距起始位置此距离处。",
  "Update the start position to be this distance from the end position.": "将起始位置更新为距结束位置此距离处。",
  "Fired when the brush reaches the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "画刷到达结束位置（起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离））时触发。",
  "Fired when the brush reaches the starting position.": "画刷到达起始位置时触发。",
  "Max Rotation Speed": "最大旋转速度",
  "The maximum rotation speed of the brushes, in degrees per second.": "画刷的最大旋转速度，以度/秒为单位。",
  "Friction (0 - 100%)": "摩擦力 (0 - 100%)",
  "The amount of rotational friction. Value must be between 0 and 100 %.": "旋转摩擦量。取值必须在 0 到 100% 之间。",
  "Rotating sound WAV": "旋转声音 WAV",
  "Sound to play while rotating.": "旋转时播放的声音。",
  "Volume (10 = loudest)": "音量（10 = 最响）",
  "The volume of the rotation sound.": "旋转声音的音量。",
  "Reverse Direction": "反转方向",
  "X Axis": "X 轴",
  "Y Axis": "Y 轴",
  "Fan Pain": "风扇伤害",
  "Small Sound Radius": "小声音半径",
  "Medium Sound Radius": "中声音半径",
  "Large Sound Radius": "大声音半径",
  "Client-side Animation": "客户端动画",
  "Unblockable by Player": "玩家不可阻挡",
  "Rotate in world space": "在世界空间中旋转",
  "Blocking Damage": "阻挡伤害",
  "Damage done to any entity that blocks the rotation, per frame.": "对阻挡旋转的实体每帧造成的伤害。",
  "Just rotates the entity and anything attached to it, without going the expensive process of finding and pushing potentially blocking brush entities and NPCs. Will still push dynamic physics entities.": "只旋转实体及其附属物，而不执行查找并推挤可能阻挡的画刷实体和 NPC 的昂贵过程。仍会推挤动态物理实体。",
  "Solid Type": "固体类型",
  "Sets the speed as a ratio of the specified Max Rotation Speed, where 0 is stopped and 1 is the Max Rotation Speed. Negative values rotate backwards. Any non-zero values with this call will cause rotating to start": "将速度设置为指定最大旋转速度的比例，0 为停止，1 为最大旋转速度。负值反向旋转。此调用中任何非零值都会使旋转开始",
  "Snap to the initial position and stop moving.": "吸附到初始位置并停止移动。",
  "Start the rotator rotating at maximum Speed": "以最大速度开始旋转体旋转",
  "Stop the rotator from rotating.": "停止旋转体旋转。",
  "Stop the rotator from rotating when it gets around to the start position again (on its rotation axis).": "当旋转体再次转到起始位置（绕其旋转轴）时停止旋转。",
  "Set angles that can be snapped back to.": "设置可吸附回的角度。",
  "Start the rotator rotating forward at maximum speed.": "以最大速度开始旋转体正向旋转。",
  "Start the rotator rotating backward at maximum speed.": "以最大速度开始旋转体反向旋转。",
  "Toggle the rotator between rotating and not rotating.": "在旋转与不旋转之间切换旋转体。",
  "Reverse the direction of rotation of the rotator, preserving the current speed.": "反转旋转体的旋转方向，保持当前速度。",
  "Enables the acceleration and deceleration of this rotator": "启用此旋转体的加速和减速",
  "Disables the acceleration and deceleration of this rotator (instantly starts/stops)": "禁用此旋转体的加速和减速（立即启动/停止）",
  "Fired this brush has stopped moving.": "此画刷停止移动时触发。",
  "Fired this brush has started moving": "此画刷开始移动时触发",
  "Movement Sound": "移动声音",
  "The sound to play when the brush moves.": "画刷移动时播放的声音。",
  "Stop Sound": "停止声音",
  "The sound to play when the brush stops moving.": "画刷停止移动时播放的声音。",
  "Speed of Rotation": "旋转速度",
  "Speed at which the brush rotates, in degrees per second.": "画刷旋转的速度，以度/秒为单位。",
  "Travel Altitude": "行进高度",
  "The vertical distance from the starting position that this platform moves. If negative, the platform will lower.": "此平台从起始位置移动的垂直距离。若为负值，平台将下降。",
  "Spin amount": "自转量",
  "The amount this platform should rotate as it moves, in degrees.": "此平台移动时应旋转的角度，以度为单位。",
  "Distance between the wheels": "轮子之间的距离",
  "Damage done to blocking entities": "对阻挡实体造成的伤害",
  "Turn to face down path": "转向沿路径朝向",
  "Auto Resize": "自动调整大小",
  "Slack": "松弛量",
  "How much extra length the rope has (by default it has the length between its two endpoints in the editor).": "绳索的额外长度（默认为编辑器中两个端点之间的长度）。",
  "Rope": "绳索",
  "Semi-rigid": "半刚性",
  "Rigid": "刚性",
  "Subdivision": "细分",
  "Number of subdivisions between each rope segment. Maximum value is 8. Higher values make smoother ropes, but are slower to render.": "每个绳段之间的细分数。最大值为 8。数值越高绳索越平滑，但渲染更慢。",
  "Barbed": "带刺",
  "Test effect that makes the rope look sharper and more barbed.": "使绳索看起来更尖锐、更多刺的测试效果。",
  "Width (1-64)": "宽度 (1-64)",
  "Width of the rope.": "绳索的宽度。",
  "Texture Scale": "纹理缩放",
  "This changes the texture resolution. The default resolution is 4 pixels per inch. Larger values stretch the texture and smaller values scrunch it up.": "更改纹理分辨率。默认分辨率为每英寸 4 像素。较大的值拉伸纹理，较小的值压缩纹理。",
  "Collide with world": "与世界碰撞",
  "Start Dangling": "启动时悬垂",
  "Whether the rope starts out detached from its target endpoint.": "绳索开始时是否与其目标端点分离。",
  "Breakable": "可断裂",
  "Whether the rope can be detached from either endpoint when shot.": "绳索是否可在被射击时从任一端点脱离。",
  "Use Wind": "使用风力",
  "Whether the rope be blown by the wind (enabling this is expensive!)": "绳索是否被风吹动（启用此项开销很大！）",
  "Rope Material": "绳索材质",
  "The material to use when rendering the rope.": "渲染绳索时使用的材质。",
  "Set the speed at which the texture scrolls.": "设置纹理滚动的速度。",
  "Apply a force instantaneously to the rope. The parameter should be a vector containing the force to be applied (X Y Z).": "对绳索瞬时施加一个力。参数应为包含要施加的力 (X Y Z) 的向量。",
  "Break the rope, if it's marked to do so.": "如果绳索被标记为可断裂，则使其断裂。",
  "Curve Type. Currently only type 2 (Rope) is fully supported.": "曲线类型。目前仅完全支持类型 2（绳索）。",
  "Lock the button, preventing it from functioning.": "锁定按钮，使其无法使用。",
  "Unlock the button, allowing it to function.": "解锁按钮，使其可以使用。",
  "Disable the button, preventing entities from finding the button (removes all capabilities of the button)": "禁用按钮，使实体无法找到该按钮（移除按钮的所有功能）",
  "Enable the button, allowing entities to find the button again": "启用按钮，使实体可以再次找到该按钮",
  "Activate the button as if it was pressed.": "激活按钮，如同被按下一样。",
  "Activate the button as if it was pressed, sending it to the bottom position.": "激活按钮，如同被按下一样，使其移动到底部位置。",
  "Unpress the button, sending it to the top position.": "取消按钮按下状态，使其回到顶部位置。",
  "Fired when the button is damaged.": "按钮受损时触发。",
  "Fired when the button is pressed.": "按钮被按下时触发。",
  "Fired when the button is used while locked.": "按钮在锁定状态下被使用时触发。",
  "Fired when the button reaches the in/pressed position.": "按钮到达按下位置时触发。",
  "Fired when the button reaches the out/released position.": "按钮到达弹出位置时触发。",
  "Place localization text here and it will be displayed in tooltips, etc.": "在此处放置本地化文本，它将显示在工具提示等处。",
  "Use sound": "使用声音",
  "Sound event played when the button is successfully used.": "按钮被成功使用时播放的声音事件。",
  "Locked Sound": "锁定声音",
  "Sound played when the player tries to use the button, and fails because it's locked.": "玩家尝试使用按钮但因锁定而失败时播放的声音。",
  "Unlocked Sound": "解锁声音",
  "Sound played when the button is unlocked.": "按钮被解锁时播放的声音。",
  "Specifies the direction of motion to move when the button is used.": "指定按钮被使用时移动的方向。",
  "The speed that the button moves, in inches per second.": "按钮移动的速度，以英寸/秒为单位。",
  "Glow Entity": "发光实体",
  "The name of an entity that will get the +use glow for this button.": "将获得此按钮 +use 发光的实体名称。",
  "Delay Before Reset (-1 stay)": "重置前延迟（-1 为保持）",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the button has been pressed before it returns to the starting position. Once it has returned, it can be used again. If the value is set to -1, the button never returns.": "按钮被按下后返回起始位置之前的时间（秒）。返回后可再次使用。如果设为 -1，按钮永不返回。",
  "Lip": "凸出量",
  "The amount, in inches, of the button to leave sticking out of the wall it recedes into when pressed. Negative values make the button recede even further into the wall.": "按钮被按下时仍凸出在墙面之外的量（英寸）。负值使按钮进一步缩入墙内。",
  "Master (Obsolete)": "主控（已废弃）",
  "Legacy support: The name of a master entity. If the master hasn't been activated, this button cannot be pressed.": "旧版支持：主控实体的名称。如果主控实体未被激活，此按钮无法被按下。",
  "Override Anticipation Action Name": "覆盖预备动作名称",
  "Specify an override for the GetUsePreviewAction for this button (the anticipation type)": "为此按钮指定 GetUsePreviewAction 的覆盖值（预备动作类型）",
  "Force NPC Exclude": "强制 NPC 排除",
  "NPC movement and collision will ignore this button": "NPC 移动和碰撞将忽略此按钮",
  "Don't move": "不移动",
  "Starts Disabled": "启动时禁用",
  "Touch Activates": "触碰激活",
  "Damage Activates": "伤害激活",
  "Use Activates": "使用激活",
  "Starts locked": "启动时锁定",
  "Sparks": "火花",
  "Non-solid": "非固体",
  "Skip Player Animation": "跳过玩家动画",
  "Legacy support: The name of a master entity. If the master hasn't been activated, this button cannot be used.": "旧版支持：主控实体的名称。如果主控实体未被激活，此按钮无法被使用。",
  "The speed that the button rotates, in degrees per second.": "按钮旋转的速度，以度/秒为单位。",
  "Health (Obsolete)": "生命值（已废弃）",
  "Legacy method of specifying whether or not the button can be shot to activate it. Use the 'Damage Activates' spawnflag instead.": "指定按钮是否可以通过射击来激活的旧方法。请改用 'Damage Activates' 生成标记。",
  "Distance (deg)": "距离（度）",
  "The amount, in degrees, that the button should rotate when it's pressed.": "按钮被按下时应旋转的角度，以度为单位。",
  "Not solid": "非固体",
  "Reverse Dir": "反转方向",
  "Speed (deg/sec)": "速度（度/秒）",
  "The amount, in degrees, that the wheel turns per second.": "轮子每秒转动的角度，以度为单位。",
  "Sounds": "声音",
  "Big zap & Warmup": "大电击与预热",
  "Access Denied": "拒绝访问",
  "Access Granted": "允许访问",
  "Quick Combolock": "快速密码锁",
  "Power Deadbolt 1": "电动门闩 1",
  "Power Deadbolt 2": "电动门闩 2",
  "Plunger": "活塞",
  "Small zap": "小电击",
  "Keycard Sound": "门卡声音",
  "Squeaky": "吱吱声",
  "Squeaky Pneumatic": "吱吱气动声",
  "Ratchet Groan": "棘轮呻吟声",
  "Clean Ratchet": "清脆棘轮声",
  "Gas Clunk": "气动铿锵声",
  "The maximum amount, in degrees, that the wheel is allowed to rotate.": "轮子允许旋转的最大角度，以度为单位。",
  "Auto-return speed": "自动返回速度",
  "If the 'Toggle' spawnflag is not set, the speed at which the wheel auto-returns when left alone, in degrees per second.": "如果未设置“Toggle”生成标记，转轮在无人操作时自动回转的速度，单位为度/秒。",
  "Toggle (Disable Auto Return)": "切换（禁用自动回转）",
  "Jiggle when used while locked": "锁定状态下使用时晃动",
  "Postion when spawned. The value is a range between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "生成时的位置。取值范围在 0.0 到 1.0 之间，0 为未旋转位置，1 为旋转位置 + “Distance”。",
  "Start Direction": "起始方向",
  "Move to a position. The parameter must be a value between 0 and 1, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "移动到某个位置。参数必须为 0 到 1 之间的值，0 为未旋转位置，1 为旋转位置 + “Distance”。",
  "Immediately teleport to a position. The parameter must be a value between 0 and 1, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "立即传送到某个位置。参数必须为 0 到 1 之间的值，0 为未旋转位置，1 为旋转位置 + “Distance”。",
  "Fired whenever the button moves. The output is the position of button from 0 to 1, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "每当按钮移动时触发。输出为按钮的位置（0 到 1），0 为未旋转位置，1 为旋转位置 + “Distance”。",
  "Fired when the button is first pressed.": "按钮首次被按下时触发。",
  "Fired when the button is first released from being pressed.": "按钮首次从按下状态释放时触发。",
  "Fired when the button has reached position 1, the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "按钮到达位置 1（旋转位置 + “Distance”）时触发。",
  "Fired when the button has reached position 0, the unrotated starting position.": "按钮到达位置 0（未旋转的起始位置）时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the button reaches a goal position: i.e. when it becomes open, becomes closed, or reaches the point specified by a 'SetPosition' input.": "每当按钮到达目标位置时触发：即变为打开、变为关闭，或到达“SetPosition”输入指定的位置时。",
  "The speed at which the door moves.": "门移动的速度。",
  "Start Sound": "启动声音",
  "Sound to play when the door starts moving.": "门开始移动时播放的声音。",
  "Sound to play when the door stops moving.": "门停止移动时播放的声音。",
  "Start Close Sound": "开始关闭声音",
  "(Optional) Sound to play when the door starts closing.": "（可选）门开始关闭时播放的声音。",
  "Stop Close Sound": "停止关闭声音",
  "(Optional) Sound to play when the door stops closing.": "（可选）门停止关闭时播放的声音。",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the door has opened before it closes. Once it has closed, it can be used again. If the value is set to -1, the door never closes itself.": "门打开后经过的秒数（单位：秒）。关闭后可再次使用。若设为 -1，门永远不会自动关闭。",
  "Amount of damage done to entities that block the movement of this door, per frame.": "每帧对阻挡此门移动的实体造成的伤害量。",
  "Force Closed": "强制关闭",
  "If set, this door will close no matter what. Useful for doors that have to close even if the player tries to block them with objects.": "如果设置，无论任何情况此门都会关闭。适用于即使玩家试图用物体阻挡也必须关闭的门。",
  "Ignore Debris": "忽略碎屑",
  "If set this will change the door's collision group to one that ignore collisions with debris objects (note that this is not compatible with the non-solid-to-player spawnflag).": "设置后会将门的碰撞组更改为忽略与碎屑物体碰撞的组（注意：与“对玩家非实体”生成标记不兼容）。",
  "Message If Triggered": "触发时消息",
  "Health (shoot open)": "生命值（可射开）",
  "Sound played when the player tries to use the door, and fails because it's locked.": "玩家尝试使用门但因锁定而失败时播放的声音。",
  "Sound played when the door is unlocked.": "门解锁时播放的声音。",
  "Spawn Position": "生成位置",
  "Closed": "关闭",
  "Open": "打开",
  "Starts Open - OBSOLETE, use 'Spawn Position' key instead": "初始为打开 - 已废弃，请改用“Spawn Position”键",
  "Non-solid to Player": "对玩家非实体",
  "Passable": "可穿过",
  "Use Opens": "使用键打开",
  "NPCs Can't Use": "NPC 无法使用",
  "Touch Opens": "触碰打开",
  "Door Silent": "门静音",
  "Loop Moving Sound?": "循环移动声音？",
  "If set to true, the door's 'Start Sound' will be continually looped until the door finishes moving.": "若设为 true，门的“Start Sound”将持续循环播放，直至门完成移动。",
  "Fired when the door starts closing.": "门开始关闭时触发。",
  "Fired when the door starts opening.": "门开始打开时触发。",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully open position. Reversed if 'Start Open' flag is set.": "门到达完全打开位置时触发。若设置了“Start Open”标记则相反。",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully closed position. Reversed if 'Start Open' flag is set.": "门到达完全关闭位置时触发。若设置了“Start Open”标记则相反。",
  "Fired when the door is blocked while closing.": "门在关闭过程中被阻挡时触发。",
  "Fired when the door is blocked while opening.": "门在打开过程中被阻挡时触发。",
  "Fired when the door is unblocked while closing.": "门在关闭过程中不再被阻挡时触发。",
  "Fired when the door is unblocked while opening.": "门在打开过程中不再被阻挡时触发。",
  "Fired when the player uses the door, but it is locked.": "玩家使用门但门被锁定时触发。",
  "Open the door, if it is not fully open.": "打开门（若尚未完全打开）。",
  "Close the door, if it is not fully closed.": "关闭门（若尚未完全关闭）。",
  "Toggle the door between open and closed.": "在打开和关闭之间切换门的状态。",
  "Lock the door.": "锁定门。",
  "Unlock the door.": "解锁门。",
  "Set the door speed.": "设置门的速度。",
  "Set whether NPCs can use this door or not.": "设置 NPC 是否可以使用此门。",
  "The direction the door will move, when it opens.": "门打开时移动的方向。",
  "Block Filter Name": "阻挡过滤器名称",
  "Filter to use to determine entities that block the door. ( Half-Life: Source port only )": "用于确定阻挡门的实体的过滤器。（仅 Half-Life: Source 移植版）",
  "One-way": "单向",
  "New func_door +USE rules (NOT for prop_doors!!)": "新的 func_door +USE 规则（不适用于 prop_door！！）",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (<0 = subtract from fademaxdist).": "模型开始淡出的距离（<0 = 从 fademaxdist 中减去）。",
  "Max fade distance at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out)": "模型可见的最大淡出距离（0 = 不淡出）",
  "Color (R G B)": "颜色（R G B）",
  "Slave Name": "从属门名称",
  "The name of any doors that should be slaved to this door (i.e. should open when this one opens, and close when this one closes).": "应从属于此门的门的名称（即随此门一起打开和关闭）。",
  "Ajar Angle": "半开角度",
  "If the door 'Spawn Position' is set to Ajar, this is the angle to spawn at, relative to the closed position.": "如果门的“Spawn Position”设为 Ajar（半开），这是生成时的角度，相对于关闭位置。",
  "Ajar Shouldn't Always Open": "半开不应总是完全打开",
  "By default, Ajar doors always open fully when +USEd. If this is set to true, Ajar doors will stop opening if they cross the close position.": "默认情况下，半开门被 +USE 时总是完全打开。如果设为 true，半开门在越过关闭位置时会停止打开。",
  "Open forward": "向前打开",
  "Open back": "向后打开",
  "Ajar (use Ajar Angle)": "半开（使用半开角度）",
  "Rotation Distance (deg)": "旋转距离（度）",
  "The amount, in degrees, that the door should rotate when opened.": "门打开时应旋转的角度（单位：度）。",
  "Fully Open Sound": "完全打开声音",
  "Sound played when the door has finished opening.": "门完成打开时播放的声音。",
  "Fully Closed Sound": "完全关闭声音",
  "Sound played when the door has finished closing.": "门完成关闭时播放的声音。",
  "Moving Sound": "移动声音",
  "Sound played when the door starts to move.": "门开始移动时播放的声音。",
  "Jiggle Sound": "晃动声音",
  "Sound played when the player tries to move the door while the latch is engaged.": "玩家在门闩锁住时尝试移动门时播放的声音。",
  "Delay Before close (-1 stay open)": "关闭前延迟（-1 保持打开）",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the door has opened before it closes. If the value is set to -1, the door never closes itself.": "门打开后经过的秒数（单位：秒）。若设为 -1，门永远不会自动关闭。",
  "Damage Inflicted When Blocked": "被阻挡时造成的伤害",
  "Health (0 = Unbreakable)": "生命值（0 = 不可破坏）",
  "Sound played when the player tries to open the door, and fails because it's locked.": "玩家尝试打开门但因锁定而失败时播放的声音。",
  "Latch Sound": "门闩声音",
  "Sound played when the door's latch is engaged.": "门闩锁住时播放的声音。",
  "Starts Open": "初始为打开",
  "Door silent (No sound, and does not alert NPCs)": "门静音（无声音，且不会惊动 NPC）",
  "Use closes": "使用键关闭",
  "Door silent to NPCS (Does not alert NPCs)": "对 NPC 静音（不会惊动 NPC）",
  "Open Direction": "打开方向",
  "Force the door to open only forwards or only backwards. Both directions is the standard door behavior.": "强制门只能向前或只能向后打开。双向打开是标准的门行为。",
  "Open Both Directions": "双向打开",
  "Open Forward Only": "仅向前打开",
  "Open Backward Only": "仅向后打开",
  "Fired when the door is told to close.": "门被命令关闭时触发。",
  "Fired when the door is told to open.": "门被命令打开时触发。",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully open position.": "门到达完全打开位置时触发。",
  "Fired when the door is ajar and told to open.": "门处于半开状态并被命令打开时触发。",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully closed position.": "门到达完全关闭位置时触发。",
  "Open the door away from the specified entity.": "将门打开至远离指定实体的一侧。",
  "Set the distance (in degrees) between Open and Closed.": "设置打开与关闭之间的距离（单位：度）。",
  "Set the speed at which the door rotates. 100 is default.": "设置门旋转的速度。默认值为 100。",
  "Particle Color (R G B)": "粒子颜色（R G B）",
  "Particle Per Second": "每秒粒子数",
  "Number of particles to spawn, per second.": "每秒生成的粒子数量。",
  "Maximum Particle Speed": "最大粒子速度",
  "Maximum speed that the particles can move after spawning.": "粒子生成后可移动的最大速度。",
  "Minimum Particle Lifetime": "最小粒子寿命",
  "Minimum number of seconds until each particle dies. Particles live for a random duration between this and 'Maximum Particle Lifetime'.": "每个粒子存活的最小秒数。粒子的存活时长为该值与“Maximum Particle Lifetime”之间的随机值。",
  "Maximum Particle Lifetime": "最大粒子寿命",
  "Maximum number of seconds until each particle dies. Particles live for a random duration between 'Minimum Particle Lifetime' and this.": "每个粒子存活的最大秒数。粒子的存活时长为“Minimum Particle Lifetime”与该值之间的随机值。",
  "Maximum Visible Distance": "最大可见距离",
  "Maximum distance at which particles are visible. They fade to translucent at this distance.": "粒子可见的最大距离。在此距离处粒子会渐变为半透明。",
  "Frozen": "冻结",
  "When set, this entity spawns the number of particles in SpawnRate immediately, and then goes inactive.": "设置后，此实体会立即生成 SpawnRate 指定数量的粒子，然后进入非活动状态。",
  "Turn on.": "打开。",
  "Turn off.": "关闭。",
  "Script Model": "脚本模型",
  "Model to use for animation sequences.": "用于动画序列的模型。",
  "Sets the script model's sequence.": "设置脚本模型的序列。",
  "Remove on fire": "触发后移除",
  "Global State to Read": "要读取的全局状态",
  "If set, this specifies a global state to check before firing. The OnMapSpawn output will only fire if the global state is set.": "如果设置，将在触发前检查指定的全局状态。只有当全局状态已设置时，OnMapSpawn 输出才会触发。",
  "--- None ---": "--- 无 ---",
  "Gordon pre-criminal": "Gordon 犯罪前状态",
  "Antlions are player allies": "蚁狮是玩家盟友",
  "Suit sprint function not yet enabled": "HEV 护甲冲刺功能尚未启用",
  "Super phys gun is enabled": "超级重力枪已启用",
  "Friendly encounter sequence (lower weapons, etc.)": "友好遭遇序列（放下武器等）",
  "Gordon is invulnerable": "Gordon 无敌",
  "Don't spawn seagulls on the jeep": "不要在吉普车上生成海鸥",
  "Game is running on a console": "游戏运行于主机平台",
  "Game is running on a PC": "游戏运行于 PC 平台",
  "Fired when the map is loaded for any reason.": "无论任何原因加载地图时触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded to start a new game.": "加载地图以开始新游戏时触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded from a saved game.": "从存档加载地图时触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded due to a level transition.": "因关卡切换而加载地图时触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded as a background to the main menu.": "作为主菜单背景加载地图时触发。",
  "Fired only in multiplayer, when a new map is loaded.": "仅在多人游戏中加载新地图时触发。",
  "Fired only in multiplayer, when a new round is started. Only fired in multiplayer games that use round-based gameplay.": "仅在多人游戏中开始新一轮时触发。只在采用回合制玩法的多人游戏中触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded in Demo Mode.": "以演示模式加载地图时触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded with a VR HMD active.": "在 VR 头显启用状态下加载地图时触发。",
  "Fired when the map is loaded without a VR HMD active.": "在无 VR 头显状态下加载地图时触发。",
  "Initial value": "初始值",
  "Initial value for the input value.": "输入值的初始值。",
  "Compare value": "比较值",
  "The value to compare against.": "要与之比较的值。",
  "Set the value that will be compared against the compare value.": "设置将与比较值进行比较的值。",
  "Set the value that will be compared against the compare value and performs the comparison.": "设置将与比较值进行比较的值并执行比较。",
  "Set the compare value.": "设置比较值。",
  "Force a compare of the input value with the compare value.": "强制将输入值与比较值进行比较。",
  "Fired when the input value is less than the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "输入值小于比较值时触发。以输入值作为数据发送。",
  "Fired when the input value is equal to the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "输入值等于比较值时触发。以输入值作为数据发送。",
  "Fired when the input value is different from the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "输入值与比较值不同时触发。以输入值作为数据发送。",
  "Fired when the input value is greater than the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "输入值大于比较值时触发。以输入值作为数据发送。",
  "Initial value for the boolean value (0 or 1).": "布尔值的初始值（0 或 1）。",
  "Set the boolean value without performing the comparison. Use this to hold a value for a future test.": "设置布尔值而不执行比较。用于保存一个值以供将来测试。",
  "Set the boolean value and test it, firing OnTrue or OnFalse based on the new value.": "设置布尔值并进行测试，根据新值触发 OnTrue 或 OnFalse。",
  "Toggle the boolean value between true and false.": "在 true 和 false 之间切换布尔值。",
  "Toggle the boolean value and tests it, firing OnTrue or OnFalse based on the new value.": "切换布尔值并进行测试，根据新值触发 OnTrue 或 OnFalse。",
  "Test the input value and fire OnTrue or OnFalse based on the value.": "测试输入值，并根据该值触发 OnTrue 或 OnFalse。",
  "Fired when the input value is true (nonzero).": "输入值为 true（非零）时触发。",
  "Fired when the input value is false (zero).": "输入值为 false（零）时触发。",
