  "Fires a random OnCase output with at least one connection, with no repeats until all cases have been picked, at which point the shuffle starts over.": "随机触发一个至少有一个连接的 OnCase 输出，在所有情况都被选取过之前不重复，全部选取完后重新开始洗牌。",
