  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of all NPCs, that is closest to player.": "输出所有 NPC 中距玩家最近的 NPC 的距离。",
  "Fired when the count of npc 1 transitions to the min count or less.": "NPC 1 的数量变为最小数量或更少时触发。",
  "Fired when the count of npc 1 transitions to the max count or greater.": "NPC 1 的数量变为最大数量或更多时触发。",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of npc 1.": "输出 NPC 1 数量的系数。",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of NPCs 1, that is closest to player.": "输出 NPC 1 中距玩家最近的 NPC 的距离。",
  "Fired when the count of npc 2 transitions to the min count or less.": "NPC 2 的数量变为最小数量或更少时触发。",
  "Fired when the count of npc 2 transitions to the max count or greater.": "NPC 2 的数量变为最大数量或更多时触发。",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of npc 2.": "输出 NPC 2 数量的系数。",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of NPCs 2, that is closest to player.": "输出 NPC 2 中距玩家最近的 NPC 的距离。",
  "Fired when the count of npc 3 transitions to the min count or less.": "NPC 3 的数量变为最小数量或更少时触发。",
  "Fired when the count of npc 3 transitions to the max count or greater.": "NPC 3 的数量变为最大数量或更多时触发。",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of npc 3.": "输出 NPC 3 数量的系数。",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of NPCs 3, that is closest to player.": "输出 NPC 3 中距玩家最近的 NPC 的距离。",
  "Maximum distance to test for NPC": "检测 NPC 的最大距离",
  "Trigger Once": "仅触发一次",
  "Deletes the logic relay after firing an OnTrigger() or a connected OnSpawn() output": "在触发 OnTrigger() 或已连接的 OnSpawn() 输出后删除此逻辑中继器",
  "Fast Retrigger": "快速重复触发",
  "Without this, the logic_relay will wait until all inputs connected to OnTrigger() have fired before retriggering": "如果不设置，logic_relay 会等待连接到 OnTrigger() 的所有输入都触发后才重新触发",
  "Pass through caller": "传递调用者",
  "If set, this logic_relay will be ignored by !caller in downstream IO connections. Instead, the previous caller in the IO chain will be found by !caller.": "如果设置，下游 IO 连接中的 !caller 将忽略此 logic_relay，而是由 IO 链中上一个调用者作为 !caller。",
  "Oscillator (alternates between OnTimerHigh and OnTimerLow outputs)": "振荡器（在 OnTimerHigh 和 OnTimerLow 输出之间交替）",
  "Use Random Time": "使用随机时间",
  "Pause After Firing": "触发后暂停",
  "Minimum Random Interval": "最小随机间隔",
  "If 'Use Random Time' is set, this is the minimum time between timer fires. The time will be a random number between this and the 'Maximum Random Interval'.": "如果设置了“Use Random Time”，这是计时器两次触发之间的最小时间。时间为此值与“Maximum Random Interval”之间的随机数。",
  "Maximum Random Interval": "最大随机间隔",
  "If 'Use Random Time' is set, this is the maximum time between timer fires. The time will be a random number between the 'Minimum Random Interval' and this.": "如果设置了“Use Random Time”，这是计时器两次触发之间的最大时间。时间为“Minimum Random Interval”与此值之间的随机数。",
  "Refire Interval": "重复触发间隔",
  "If 'Use Random Time' isn't set, this is the time between timer fires, in seconds.": "如果未设置“Use Random Time”，这是计时器两次触发之间的时间（单位：秒）。",
  "Initial delay before first fire": "首次触发前的初始延迟",
  "Time to wait after the timer is enabled before firing the first time. Negative values can be used to avoid ": "计时器启用后等待多长时间才首次触发。负值可用于避免 ",
  "waiting the lower random bound on spawn, or positive values to postpone the first event.": "在生成时等待较低的随机下限，或正值用于推迟第一个事件。",
  "Set a new Refire Interval.": "设置新的重复触发间隔。",
  "Reset the timer. It will fire after the Refire Interval expires.": "重置计时器。重复触发间隔到期后它将触发。",
  "Force the timer to fire immediately.": "强制计时器立即触发。",
  "Toggle the timer on/off.": "开/关切换计时器。",
  "Set a new Minimum Random Interval.": "设置新的最小随机间隔。",
  "Set a new Maximum Random Interval.": "设置新的最大随机间隔。",
  "Add time to the timer if it is currently enabled.  Does not change the Refire Interval.": "如果计时器当前已启用，则为其增加时间。不会更改重复触发间隔。",
  "Subtract time from the timer if it is currently enabled.  Does not change the Refire Interval.": "如果计时器当前已启用，则从中减去时间。不会更改重复触发间隔。",
  "Pauses the timer, maintaining its current remaining time.": "暂停计时器，保留当前剩余时间。",
  "Unpauses the timer, continuing from where it left off when frozen.": "取消暂停计时器，从冻结时中断的位置继续。",
  "Fired when the timer expires.": "计时器到期时触发。",
  "Fired every other time for an oscillating timer.": "振荡计时器每隔一次触发时触发。",
  "IgnoredName 01": "忽略名称 01",
  "Do not send this entity's information back to hammer during hammer_update_safe_entities": "在 hammer_update_safe_entities 期间不将此实体的信息发回 Hammer",
  "IgnoredName 02": "忽略名称 02",
  "IgnoredName 03": "忽略名称 03",
  "IgnoredName 04": "忽略名称 04",
  "IgnoredName 05": "忽略名称 05",
  "IgnoredName 06": "忽略名称 06",
  "IgnoredName 07": "忽略名称 07",
  "IgnoredName 08": "忽略名称 08",
  "IgnoredName 09": "忽略名称 09",
  "IgnoredName 10": "忽略名称 10",
  "IgnoredName 11": "忽略名称 11",
  "IgnoredName 12": "忽略名称 12",
  "IgnoredName 13": "忽略名称 13",
  "IgnoredName 14": "忽略名称 14",
  "IgnoredName 15": "忽略名称 15",
  "IgnoredName 16": "忽略名称 16",
  "Attachment 1": "关联实体 1",
  "First entity.  Must be a single entity unless \"Support multiple entities with same name\" is specified.": "第一个实体。必须为单个实体，除非指定了“支持多个同名实体”。",
  "Attachment 2": "关联实体 2",
  "Second entity.  Must be a single entity unless \"Support multiple entities with same name\" is specified.": "第二个实体。必须为单个实体，除非指定了“支持多个同名实体”。",
  "Support multiple entities with same name": "支持多个同名实体",
  "If true, we affect all entities matching our attachment names. If false, we only affect the first entity found matching each attachment name.": "如果为 true，将影响所有匹配关联名称的实体。如果为 false，则只影响匹配每个关联名称的第一个实体。",
  "Include Hierarchy": "包含层级",
  "Disable collision between the entire hierarchies of the two entities, instead of just the individual entities themselves.": "禁用两个实体整个层级之间的碰撞，而不仅仅是这两个实体本身之间的碰撞。",
  "Start with collisions disabled": "以禁用碰撞开始",
  "Enable collisions between the first and second entity.": "启用第一个和第二个实体之间的碰撞。",
  "Disable collisions between the first and second entity.": "禁用第一个实体之间的碰撞。",
  "Disable collisions between the first entity and use the parameter to find the second entity.": "禁用第一个实体的碰撞，并使用参数查找第二个实体。",
  "Ignore out of range input values": "忽略超出范围的输入值",
  "Clamp out of range output values": "钳制超出范围的输出值",
  "Minimum Valid Input Value": "最小有效输入值",
  "Input values below this value will be ignored.": "低于此值的输入值将被忽略。",
  "Maximum Valid Input Value": "最大有效输入值",
  "Input values above this value will be ignored.": "高于此值的输入值将被忽略。",
  "Output Value When Input Is Min.": "输入为最小值时的输出值",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Minimum Valid Input Value', this is the output value.": "当输入值等于“Minimum Valid Input Value”时，此为输出值。",
  "Output Value When Input Is Max.": "输入为最大值时的输出值",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Maximum Valid Input Value', this is the output value.": "当输入值等于“Maximum Valid Input Value”时，此为输出值。",
  "Input value and fire the output with the remapped value.": "输入值并以重映射后的值触发输出。",
  "Fired when the InValue input is received, with the remapped input value as the parameter.": "接收到 InValue 输入时触发，以重映射后的输入值作为参数。",
  "Fired when the InValue input rises above the minimum legal value.": "InValue 输入超过最小合法值时触发。",
  "Fired when the InValue input rises above the maximum legal value.": "InValue 输入超过最大合法值时触发。",
  "Fired when the InValue input falls below the minimum legal value.": "InValue 输入低于最小合法值时触发。",
  "Fired when the InValue input falls below the maximum legal value.": "InValue 输入低于最大合法值时触发。",
  "Output RGB color when input is min.": "输入为最小值时输出的 RGB 颜色",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Minimum Valid Input Value', this is the output RGB color.": "当输入值等于“Minimum Valid Input Value”时，此为输出的 RGB 颜色。",
  "Output RGB color when input is max.": "输入为最大值时输出的 RGB 颜色",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Maximum Valid Input Value', this is the output RGB color.": "当输入值等于“Maximum Valid Input Value”时，此为输出的 RGB 颜色。",
  "Fired when the InValue input is received, with the remapped RGB color as the parameter.": "接收到 InValue 输入时触发，以重映射后的 RGB 颜色作为参数。",
  "Initial Value": "初始值",
  "Starting value for the counter.": "计数器的起始值。",
  "Minimum Legal Value": "最小合法值",
  "Minimum legal value for the counter. If min=0 and max=0, no clamping is performed.": "计数器的最小合法值。如果 min=0 且 max=0，则不进行钳制。",
  "Maximum Legal Value": "最大合法值",
  "Maximum legal value for the counter. If min=0 and max=0, no clamping is performed.": "计数器的最大合法值。如果 min=0 且 max=0，则不进行钳制。",
  "Add an amount to the counter and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "为计数器增加一个数值，并以结果触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Divide the counter by an amount and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将计数器除以一个数值，并以结果触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Multiply the counter by an amount and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将计数器乘以一个数值，并以结果触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Set the counter to a new value and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将计数器设为新值，并以结果触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Set the counter to a new value without firing any outputs.": "将计数器设为新值而不触发任何输出。",
  "Subtract an amount from the counter and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "从计数器中减去一个数值，并以结果触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Set the upper bound of the counter and fire the OutValue output with the current value.": "设置计数器的上限，并以当前值触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Set the lower bound of the counter and fire the OutValue output with the current value.": "设置计数器的下限，并以当前值触发 OutValue 输出。",
  "Causes the counter fire its OnGetValue output with the current value of the counter. Used for polling the counter when you don't want constant updates from the OutValue output.": "使计数器以当前值触发其 OnGetValue 输出。用于在不需要 OutValue 输出持续更新时轮询计数器。",
  "Fired when the counter value changes.": "计数器值发生变化时触发。",
  "Fired when the counter value meets or goes below the min value. The counter must go back above the min value before the output will fire again.": "计数器值达到或低于最小值时触发。计数器必须重新高于最小值后此输出才会再次触发。",
  "Fired when the counter value meets or exceeds the max value. The counter must go below the max value before the output will fire again.": "计数器值达到或超过最大值时触发。计数器必须重新低于最大值后此输出才会再次触发。",
  "Fired when the counter value changes from the minimum value.": "计数器值从最小值变化时触发。",
  "Fired when the counter value changes from the max value.": "计数器值从最大值变化时触发。",
  "Fired in response to the GetValue input. Used for polling the counter when you don't want constant updates from the OutValue output.": "响应 GetValue 输入而触发。用于在不需要 OutValue 输出持续更新时轮询计数器。",
  "Start entity": "起始实体",
  "Name of the entity the line should start from.": "线条应起始的实体名称。",
  "End entity": "结束实体",
  "Name of the entity that line should end at.": "线条应结束的实体名称。",
  "Fired when the vector, from the start entity to the end entity, changes. Passes along the vector as a parameter.": "从起始实体到结束实体的向量发生变化时触发。以该向量作为参数传递。",
  "Navigation Entity": "导航实体",
  "Name of the entity to set navigation properties on.": "要设置导航属性的实体名称。",
  "Nav Property": "导航属性",
  "Ignore": "忽略",
  "NPCs Ignore this when navigating (they'll bump into it)": "NPC 导航时忽略此项（它们会撞上去）",
  "Turn on. The Navigation Entity will have its navigation properties set.": "打开。导航实体的导航属性将被设置。",
  "Turn off. The Navigation Entity will have its navigation properties returned to the default settings.": "关闭。导航实体的导航属性将恢复为默认设置。",
  "Toggle on/off.": "开/关切换。",
  "Force New Level Unit": "强制新关卡单元",
  "If set, the save will discard any savedata from previous levels, for the purpose of keeping savegame filesizes down. Can only be safely used if there is no way for the player to return to previous levels.": "如果设置，存档将丢弃之前关卡的任何存档数据，以减小存档文件大小。只有在玩家无法返回之前关卡的情况下才能安全使用。",
  "Minimum Hit Points": "最小生命值",
  "Don't save dangerous when player has less than this many hitpoints.": "玩家生命值低于此值时不保存危险存档。",
  "Minimum Hit Points to Commit": "提交保存的最小生命值",
  "Minimum hitpoints required to commit to save. The save will be made if you have at least Minimum Hit Points, but when the autosave timer expires, the autosave is only kept if you have at least Min Hitpoints to Commit.": "提交保存所需的最小生命值。如果生命值至少达到最小生命值则会进行保存，但当自动存档计时器到期时，只有生命值至少达到提交保存的最小生命值，自动存档才会保留。",
  "Force an autosave.": "强制进行一次自动存档。",
  "Force an autosave as autosavedangerous.sav. If the player is alive after the passed number of seconds it replaces the standard auto save.": "强制进行一次自动存档并存为 autosavedangerous.sav。如果经过指定秒数后玩家仍存活，它将替换标准自动存档。",
  "Set MinimumHitPoints to this.": "将 MinimumHitPoints 设置为此值。",
  "Initiation Hit Points": "启动生命值",
  "Start looking for an opportunity to save if player drops below this hitpoint level.": "如果玩家生命值低于此值，则开始寻找保存的机会。",
  "Trigger Hit Points": "触发生命值",
  "If started looking for an opportunity, save when hitpoints reach this level.": "如果已开始寻找机会，当生命值达到此值时保存。",
  "Time to trigger": "触发时间",
  "If > 0, how long to try and get a save off before giving up": "如果 > 0，表示在放弃前尝试完成保存的时长",
  "Dangerous time": "危险时间",
  "If 0, just autosave. Otherwise, do an autosavedangerous with this time threshold": "如果为 0，仅自动存档。否则，以该时间阈值执行危险自动存档",
  "World layer name": "世界层名称",
  "Name of the world layer which this entity will control": "此实体将控制的世界层的名称",
  "Visible on spawn": "生成时可见",
  "Spawn Type": "生成类型",
  "If you select Child Spawn Group, it means the world layer is dependent on resources in the parent map that defines the info_worldlayer. For example, the dota world layers containing the dire and radiant bases refer to the tree maps of the main dota map. They would need to be set as Child spawn groups.": "如果选择子生成组（Child Spawn Group），表示该世界层依赖于定义 info_worldlayer 的父地图中的资源。例如，包含夜魇和天辉基地的 Dota 世界层引用主 Dota 地图的树木地图，它们需要被设置为子生成组。",
  "World Layer is Child Spawn Group": "世界层为子生成组",
  "Show the world geometry the target layer, but not the associated entities": "显示目标层的世界几何体，但不包括关联实体",
  "Hide the world geometry of the target layer, but not the associated entities": "隐藏目标层的世界几何体，但不包括关联实体",
  "Spawn the entities associated with the layer, but don't change the visiblity of the world geometry": "生成与该层关联的实体，但不更改世界几何体的可见性",
  "Destroy the entities spawned by the world layer, but don't change the visibilty of the world geometry": "销毁由世界层生成的实体，但不更改世界几何体的可见性",
  "Show the world geometry of the target layer and spawn the associated entities": "显示目标层的世界几何体并生成关联实体",
  "Hide the world goemtry of the target layer and destory the associated entities": "隐藏目标层的世界几何体并销毁关联实体",
  "Fired when the entities associated with the layer have been spawned.": "与该层关联的实体已生成时触发。",
  "Enable AutoSpawn (will spawn whenever there's room)": "启用自动生成（只要有空间就会生成）",
  "AutoSpawn: Wait for entity destruction": "自动生成：等待实体被销毁",
  "AutoSpawn: Even if the player is looking": "自动生成：即使玩家正在看",
  "ForceSpawn: Only if there's room": "强制生成：仅在有空间时",
  "ForceSpawn: Only if the player isn't looking": "强制生成：仅当玩家没在看时",
  "Point_template To Spawn": "要生成的 point_template",
  "Name of the point_template to spawn here. If there is an offset between the point_template and its spawned entities in hammer, that offset will be maintained when spawning happens relative to the env_entity_maker.": "要在此处生成的 point_template 的名称。如果 point_template 与其在 Hammer 中生成的实体之间存在偏移，生成时将相对于 env_entity_maker 保持该偏移。",
  "PostSpawn Movement Speed": "生成后移动速度",
  "If specified, all the entities created in the template will move this fast in the specified PostSpawn Movement Direction.": "如果指定，模板中创建的所有实体将按指定的生成后移动方向以此速度移动。",
  "PostSpawn Movement Direction": "生成后移动方向",
  "If a PostSpawn Movement Speed is specified, this angle will be added to the movement direction all the entities created by the template.": "如果指定了生成后移动速度，此角度将被添加到模板创建的所有实体的移动方向上。",
  "PostSpawn Direction Variance": "生成后方向偏差",
  "This variance is applied to the PostSpawn Movement Direction for each spawned entity in the template. Use it to apply some randomness to the directions.": "此偏差应用于模板中每个生成实体的生成后移动方向。用它为方向增加一些随机性。",
  "PostSpawn Inherit Angles": "生成后继承角度",
  "If checked, uses the parent's forward vector as the spawn direction. Otherwise uses the entity maker's forward.": "如果勾选，使用父项的前向向量作为生成方向。否则使用实体生成器的前向向量。",
  "Spawn an instance of the template at this origin and angle.": "在此原点和角度处生成模板的一个实例。",
  "Spawn an instance of the template that the same origin and angle as the specified entity (specify by targetname in parameters)": "在与指定实体相同的原点和角度处生成模板的一个实例（通过参数中的 targetname 指定）",
  "Fired when an instance of the entity template has been spawned.": "实体模板的实例已生成时触发。",
  "Fired when a ForceSpawn input failed to spawn the template, either due to lack of space or being in player's view, depending on the spawnflags.": "ForceSpawn 输入未能生成模板时触发，原因可能是空间不足或在玩家视野内，取决于生成标记。",
  "Filter mode": "过滤模式",
  "If set to Allow, only entities who match the criteria will pass the filter. ": "如果设为 Allow（允许），只有符合条件的实体才能通过过滤器。",
  "If set to Disallow, only entities who do NOT match the criteria will pass the filter.": "如果设为 Disallow（禁止），只有不符合条件的实体才能通过过滤器。",
  "Allow entities that match criteria": "允许符合条件的实体",
  "Disallow entities that match criteria": "禁止符合条件的实体",
  "Test the activator against the filter and fires OnPass or OnFail output.": "对激活者进行过滤器测试，并触发 OnPass 或 OnFail 输出。",
  "Fired in response to TestActivator input if the activator passes the filter.": "响应 TestActivator 输入时，如果激活者通过过滤器则触发。",
  "Fired in response to TestActivator input if the activator fails to pass the filter.": "响应 TestActivator 输入时，如果激活者未通过过滤器则触发。",
  "Logic Type": "逻辑类型",
  "AND (all filters must pass)": "AND（所有过滤器都必须通过）",
  "OR (any filter must pass)": "OR（任一过滤器通过即可）",
  "Negate Outcome": "取反结果",
  "Whether to negate the result of the subfilters, after combining them using the Logic Type chosen.<br>": "是否在使用所选逻辑类型组合子过滤器之后对结果取反。<br>",
  "Negating the outcome using the AND logic type means that any subfilter must fail for this filter to pass.<br>": "使用 AND 逻辑类型取反结果意味着任何子过滤器失败时此过滤器才通过。<br>",
  "Negating the outcome using the OR logic type means that all subfilters must fail for this filter to pass.": "使用 OR 逻辑类型取反结果意味着所有子过滤器都失败时此过滤器才通过。",
  "Filter 1": "过滤器 1",
  "Activator filter to test.": "要测试的激活者过滤器。",
  "Filter 2": "过滤器 2",
  "Filter 3": "过滤器 3",
  "Filter 4": "过滤器 4",
  "Filter 5": "过滤器 5",
  "Filter 6": "过滤器 6",
  "Filter 7": "过滤器 7",
  "Filter 8": "过滤器 8",
  "Filter 9": "过滤器 9",
  "Filter 10": "过滤器 10",
  "The name to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要按名称过滤。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有其名称 ",
  "name matches the given string will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "匹配给定字符串的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those whose name matches the string will pass the filter.": "除名称匹配该字符串的实体之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "Filter Model": "模型过滤器",
  "The model to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要按模型过滤。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有其模型 ",
  "model matches the given string will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "匹配给定字符串的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those whose model matches the string will pass the filter.": "除模型匹配该字符串的实体之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "Filter Context": "上下文过滤器",
  "The context to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities that ": "要按上下文过滤。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有 ",
  "have a context matching the given string, of any value, will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "拥有匹配给定字符串（任意值）的上下文的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those whose context matches the string will pass the filter.": "除上下文匹配该字符串的实体之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "Filter Classname": "类名过滤器",
  "The class name to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要按类名过滤。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有其类名 ",
  "class name matches the given string will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "匹配给定字符串的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those whose class name matches the given string will pass the filter.": "除类名匹配该字符串的实体之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "Filter Mass": "质量过滤器",
  "The mass to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要按质量过滤。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有质量 ",
  "mass is greater than the give float will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "大于给定浮点数的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those whose mass is greater than the given float will pass the filter.": "除质量大于该浮点数的实体之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "Damage type": "伤害类型",
  "The damage type to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only damage types that ": "要按其过滤的伤害类型。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有匹配的伤害类型才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "match will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, all damage types EXCEPT those who match will pass the filter.": "除匹配的伤害类型之外的所有伤害类型都将通过过滤器。",
  "Attribute Name": "属性名称",
  "The attribute to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities who ": "要按属性过滤。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有 ",
  "have the attribute with a value > 0 will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "拥有值 > 0 的该属性的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those who have the attribute with a value > 0 will pass the filter.": "除拥有值 > 0 的该属性的实体之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "The classname or entity name to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要按其过滤的类名或实体名称。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有其 ",
  "Radius by which to test the proximity of the enemy.  If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于测试敌人接近程度的半径。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有其 ",
  "distance is equal to or closer than the radius will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "距离等于或小于该半径的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities outside the radius will pass the filter.": "半径之外的所有实体都将通过过滤器。",
  "Outer Radius": "外半径",
  "Enemies outside this radius are considered invalid if Allow is set and valid if Disallow is set.": "如果设为 Allow，此半径之外的敌人视为无效；如果设为 Disallow，则视为有效。",
  "Max Squadmates Per Enemy": "每个敌人的最大小队成员数",
  "Maximum number of squadmates allowed to target any given entity.": "允许瞄准任意给定实体的小队成员的最大数量。",
  "Do not lose target if already aquired but filter failed.": "如果已获取目标但过滤器失败，则不丢失目标。",
  "Radius by which to test the proximity.": "用于测试接近程度的半径。",
  "Modifier Name": "修改器名称",
  "The name of the modifier to filter entities by": "用于过滤实体的修改器名称",
  "Target Entity Name": "目标实体名称",
  "Name of the entity whose angles will be sensed.": "将感知其角度的实体名称。",
  "Look At Entity": "注视实体",
  "The entity we want to check to see if the Target Entity is looking at.": "要检查目标实体是否正在注视的实体。",
  "The amount of time the Target Entity must look at the 'Look at Entity' to trigger this entity, in seconds.": "目标实体必须注视“注视实体”多长时间才能触发此实体（单位：秒）。",
  "Tolerance": "容差",
  "The tolerance, in degrees, in the checking to determine when the Target Entity is looking at the Look At Entity.": "判断目标实体是否正在注视注视实体的检查容差（单位：度）。",
  "Use target entity's angles (NOT position)": "使用目标实体的角度（而非位置）",
  "Toggle the sensor between enabled and disabled.": "在启用和禁用之间切换传感器。",
  "Check to see if the Target Entity is facing the Look At Entity within the specified tolerance, firing either the OnFacingLookat or OnNotFacingLookat output based on the result.": "检查目标实体是否在指定容差内面向注视实体，并根据结果触发 OnFacingLookat 或 OnNotFacingLookat 输出。",
  "Fired when the forward direction of the Target Entity changes. Passes the new forward direction as a parameter.": "目标实体的前向方向发生变化时触发。以新的前向方向作为参数传递。",
  "Fired when the Target Entity points at the Look At Entity for more than the specified Duration, or in response to a Test input.": "目标实体注视注视实体的时间超过指定时长时触发，或响应 Test 输入时触发。",
  "Fires in response to a Test input when the Target Entity is not pointing at the Look At Entity.": "响应 Test 输入时，如果目标实体未注视注视实体则触发。",
  "Normalized value (0..1) where 1 is facing directly at target and 0 is at or beyond the angle of tolerance.": "归一化值（0..1），1 表示正对目标，0 表示达到或超出容差角度。",
  "Name of the entity whose angular velocity will be sensed.": "将感知其角速度的实体名称。",
  "Threshold Velocity": "阈值速度",
  "The threshold angular velocity to compare against, in degrees per second.": "要比较的角速度阈值，单位为度/秒。",
  "Fire Interval": "触发间隔",
  "Angular velocity must cross the threshold for at least this long to fire.": "角速度必须超过阈值至少这么长时间才会触发。",
  "Axis": "轴",
  "Use Axis Helper": "使用轴辅助器",
  "Use axis helper to determine rotation values (clockwise/counter-clockwise).": "使用轴辅助器确定旋转值（顺时针/逆时针）。",
  "Checks to see if the Target Entity's angular velocity meets or exceeds the Threshold Velocity, ": "检查目标实体的角速度是否达到或超过阈值速度，",
  "firing either the OnGreaterThanOrEqualTo or OnLessThan output based on the result.": "并根据结果触发 OnGreaterThanOrEqualTo 或 OnLessThan 输出。",
  "Checks to see if the Target Entity's angular velocity meets or exceeds the Threshold Velocity. Once the Fire Interval expires, ": "检查目标实体的角速度是否达到或超过阈值速度。触发间隔到期后，",
  "fires the appropriate test result output if the result is stable throughout the Fire Interval.": "如果结果在整个触发间隔内保持稳定，则触发相应的测试结果输出。",
  "Fired when the Target's Angular Velocity changes, passing the new magnitude of the angular velocity.": "目标的角速度发生变化时触发，传递角速度的新大小。",
  "Fired when the Target Entity goes from slower than the threshold angular velocity to faster than the threshold angular velocity.": "目标实体从低于阈值角速度变为高于阈值角速度时触发。",
  "Fired when the Target Entity goes from faster than the threshold angular velocity to slower than the threshold angular velocity.": "目标实体从高于阈值角速度变为低于阈值角速度时触发。",
  "Fired when the Target Entity reaches the threshold angular velocity from a different velocity.": "目标实体从不同速度达到阈值角速度时触发。",
  "Name of the entity whose velocity will be sensed.": "将感知其速度的实体名称。",
  "Measurement Axis": "测量轴",
  "Start Enabled": "初始启用",
  "Whether or not to start enabled and active.": "是否以启用和活动状态开始。",
  "Averaging interval": "平均间隔",
  "Amount of time in seconds over which to average the measured velocity, 0=instantaneous.": "对测量速度取平均值的时间（单位：秒），0=瞬时。",
  "Fired when the Target's Velocity changes, passing the new magnitude of the velocity.": "目标的速度发生变化时触发，传递速度的新大小。",
  "Enable the sensor.": "启用传感器。",
  "Disable the sensor.": "禁用传感器。",
  "Test the distance as measured along the axis specified by our direction.": "测试沿我们方向指定轴测量的距离。",
  "Distance of the target entity away from this entity.": "目标实体与该实体的距离。",
  "Entity To Teleport": "要传送的实体",
  "Name of the entity that will be teleported.": "将被传送的实体名称。",
  "Teleport Home": "传送回家",
  "Into Duck (episodic)": "进入下蹲（episodic）",
  "Change View Direction (VR)": "改变视角方向（VR）",
  "Teleport Parented Ents": "传送附属实体",
  "Teleport Uses Current Rotation": "传送使用当前旋转",
  "If specified, only this entity will take damage. Otherwise, all entities within the Radius will take damage.": "如果指定，只有该实体会受到伤害。否则，半径内的所有实体都会受到伤害。",
  "All entities within this radius of this entity will take damage. If a 'Target Entity' is specified, only that entity will take damage.": "该实体此半径范围内的所有实体都会受到伤害。如果指定了“目标实体”，则只有该实体会受到伤害。",
  "Damage done to all affected entities each time this entity fires.": "此实体每次触发时对所有受影响实体造成的伤害。",
  "Delay": "延迟",
  "Delay between refires, in seconds.": "重复触发之间的延迟（单位：秒）。",
  "Damage Type": "伤害类型",
  "Type of damage to inflict on entities damaged.": "对受伤害实体造成的伤害类型。",
  "Force a single fire, damaging either the Target Entity or all entities within the radius.": "强制单次触发，对目标实体或半径内的所有实体造成伤害。",
  "Enable this entity. It will start damaging entities everytime it fires, and refire based upon the specified Delay.": "启用此实体。它每次触发时都会对实体造成伤害，并按指定延迟重新触发。",
  "Disable this entity. It will stop damaging entities.": "禁用此实体。它将停止对实体造成伤害。",
  "Toggle this entity between On/Off state.": "在开/关状态之间切换此实体。",
  "Skip pre-settle": "跳过预稳定",
  "If set this entity will not particpate in the physics pre-settle during compile, but will start awake in game.": "如果设置，此实体不会参与编译期间的物理预稳定，而是在游戏中以唤醒状态开始。",
  "Debris - Don't collide with the player or other debris": "碎屑 - 不与玩家或其他碎屑碰撞",
  "Motion Disabled": "禁用运动",
  "Start Asleep": "以休眠状态开始",
  "Prevent motion enable on player bump": "防止玩家碰撞时启用运动",
  "Impact Damage Type": "冲击伤害类型",
  "Blunt": "钝击",
  "Sharp": "锐利",
  "Mass Override": "质量覆盖",
  "Override the mass of the object instead of calculating it based on the size / shape and material.": "覆盖物体的质量，而不是基于大小/形状和材质进行计算。",
  "Mass Scale": "质量缩放",
  "A scale multiplier for the object's mass. 0 = use auto-calculated mass based on the object's size / shape and material": "物体质量的缩放倍数。0 = 基于物体大小/形状和材质自动计算的质量",
  "Center of Mass Offset": "质心偏移",
  "Offset in local space applied to the object's center of mass.": "应用到物体质心的本地空间偏移。",
  "Buoyancy Scale": "浮力缩放",
  "Scale on the buoyancy forces applied to this object (not including fluid drag)": "施加到此物体上的浮力缩放（不包括流体阻力）",
  "Fluid Drag Scale": "流体阻力缩放",
  "Scale on fluid forces applied to this object (not including buoyancy)": "施加到此物体上的流体力缩放（不包括浮力）",
  "Collision Group": "碰撞组",
  "Override the default collision group": "覆盖默认碰撞组",
  "Interacts Exclude": "排除交互",
  "Health Level to Override Motion": "覆盖运动的生命值等级",
  "If specified, this object will start motion disabled. Once its health has dropped below this specified amount, it will enable motion.": "若指定，此物体将以禁用运动状态启动。当其生命值低于该指定值时，将启用运动。",
  "Physics Impact Force to Override Motion": "覆盖运动的物理冲击力",
  "If specified, this object will start motion disabled. Any impact that imparts a force greater than this value on the physbox will enable motion.": "若指定，此物体将以禁用运动状态启动。任何对物理盒施加超过此值作用力的撞击都将启用运动。",
  "Enable +Use Output": "启用+使用输出",
  "Enables OnPlayerUse output being fired when this object is used": "启用在玩家使用此物体时触发 OnPlayerUse 输出",
  "Number of points of damage to take before breaking.  0 means don't break.": "破坏前需承受的伤害点数。0 表示不破坏。",
  "Position": "位置",
  "Angles": "角度",
  "Player-carry Hover Position": "玩家搬运悬停位置",
  "If the hoverposeflags Position flag is set, this position is the position which the object should move when the player picks it up, with the physgun or +USE.": "若设置了 hoverposeflags 的 Position 标记，则此位置为玩家用物理枪或+使用拾取该物体时物体应移动到的位置。",
  "Player-carry Hover Angles": "玩家搬运悬停角度",
  "If the hoverposeflags Angles flag is set, this angle is the angle which the object should orient to when the player picks it up, with the physgun or +USE.": "若设置了 hoverposeflags 的 Angles 标记，则此角度为玩家用物理枪或+使用拾取该物体时物体应朝向的角度。",
  "Not solid to world": "对世界无碰撞",
  "Solid to World": "对世界有碰撞",
  "Passes through World": "穿过世界",
  "Start Touch Per Entity Refire Delay": "每实体开始接触重复触发延迟",
  "When set to 0 OnStartTouch events are never sent. Otherwise it's a delay in seconds before another OnStartTouch is sent for the same entity.": "设为 0 时从不发送 OnStartTouch 事件。否则为同一实体再次发送 OnStartTouch 前的延迟秒数。",
  "Wake up this physics object, if it is sleeping.": "唤醒此物理物体（如果它正在休眠）。",
  "Put this physics object to sleep. It will wake if given the Wake input, or if force is applied to it. Note that physics objects go to sleep automatically after coming to rest for a while, so you don't really need to use this.": "使此物理物体休眠。若收到唤醒输入或对其施加力，它将醒来。注意物理物体静置一段时间后会自动休眠，因此你其实不需要使用此功能。",
  "Enable physics motion/collision response.": "启用物理运动/碰撞响应。",
  "Disable physics motion/collision response.": "禁用物理运动/碰撞响应。",
  "If this object is being carried by a player, with the physgun or +USE, force it to be dropped.": "如果此物体正被玩家用物理枪或+使用搬运，强制其被放下。",
  "Fired when this entity is damaged.": "此实体受伤害时触发。",
  "Fired when this entity becomes awake (collision/force is applied).": "此实体被唤醒时触发（受到碰撞/力的作用）。",
  "Fired when motion is enabled due to damage/physcannon/force.": "因伤害/物理钩爪/力而启用运动时触发。",
  "Fired when the player tries to +USE the physbox. This output will fire only if the Generate output on +USE spawnflag is set.": "玩家尝试+使用此物理盒时触发。仅当设置了“生成 +使用输出”生成标记时此输出才会触发。",
  "Fired when it touches with another entity. Activator is the other entity.": "与另一实体接触时触发。激活者为另一实体。",
  "No Collision until break": "破坏前无碰撞",
  "Start inactive": "以未激活状态启动",
  "Do not connect entities until turned on": "开启前不连接实体",
  "Entity 1": "实体 1",
  "Entity 2": "实体 2",
  "Entity 1 Attachment Name": "实体 1 附着点名称",
  "If set, we'll attach to the body / location corresponding to this attachment.": "若设置，将附着到与此附着点对应的身体/位置。",
  "Entity 2 Attachment Name": "实体 2 附着点名称",
  "Impulse Limit to Break (kg)": "断裂冲量限制（kg）",
  "The amount of impulse an impact must apply to the constraint to break it. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the constrainted objects.": "撞击必须对约束施加的冲量大小才能使其断裂。一种计算方法是将它设为一个物体的质量，该物体静置在受约束物体上时会破坏此约束。",
  "Angular Impulse Limit to Break (kg * distance)": "断裂角冲量限制（kg * 距离）",
  "The amount of angular impulse required to break the constraint. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "破坏约束所需的角冲量。一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以破坏约束所需（自物体质心算起）的静置距离。",
  "Play Sound on Break": "断裂时播放声音",
  "A sound played when the constraint is broken.": "约束断裂时播放的声音。",
  "Follow teleport distance": "跟随传送距离",
  "If one object teleports more than this many units away it will cause the other constrained object to teleport to an appropriate relative position.": "若一个物体传送到超过此数值的单位距离之外，将使另一个受约束的物体传送到合适的相对位置。",
  "Treat Entity 1 As Infinite Mass": "将实体 1 视为无限质量",
  "If true, the joint will not affect the motion of Entity 1. Entity 2 will just follow Entity 1.": "若为真，关节将不影响实体 1 的运动。实体 2 只会跟随实体 1。",
  "Force the constraint to break.": "强制此约束断裂。",
  "Enable the constraint.  Do this when the objects don't exist when the constraint spawns - or when you have deactivated the constraint.  Broken constraints can NOT be turned on.  They have been deleted.": "启用此约束。当约束生成时物体尚不存在、或你已停用该约束时执行此操作。已断裂的约束无法再启用，它们已被删除。",
  "Disable this constraint.": "禁用此约束。",
  "Fired when the constraint breaks.": "约束断裂时触发。",
  "The entity to align to the desired angles.": "对齐到目标角度的实体。",
  "Angular Limit": "角度限制",
  "The maximum angular velocity that this controller can compensate for, in degrees per second.": "此控制器能补偿的最大角速度，单位为度/秒。",
  "Damp all rotation": "阻尼所有旋转",
  "Forces the upright behavior to have perfect damping, instead of progressively damping.": "强制直立行为具有完美阻尼，而非渐进阻尼。",
  "Enable the controller.": "启用控制器。",
  "Disable the controller.": "禁用控制器。",
  "Amount to scale the mass of this body in the constraint solver": "此物体在约束求解器中的质量缩放量",
  "Force only on stretch": "仅在拉伸时施加力",
  "Enable collision": "启用碰撞",
  "Spring Axis": "弹簧轴",
  "Use the helper. Drag it out to match the virtual spring.": "使用辅助器。将其拖出以匹配虚拟弹簧。",
  "Length": "长度",
  "How long the spring would be if it was at rest (nothing hanging on it or attached). 0 means the length of the helper.": "弹簧在静止状态（未悬挂或未连接任何东西）下的长度。0 表示使用辅助器的长度。",
  "Length Scale": "长度缩放",
  "Scale on the rest length. You can use this to easily make the spring start out stretched. e.g. a value of 0.75 here means the spring will spawn stretched by ~25%.": "静止长度的缩放。可以用它轻松让弹簧初始处于拉伸状态。例如此处取 0.75 表示弹簧生成时拉伸约 25%。",
  "The stiffness of the spring.  The larger the number the less the spring will stretch. The maximum should be not more than 30!": "弹簧的刚度。数值越大，弹簧越不易拉伸。最大值不应超过 30！",
  "Damping Ratio": "阻尼比",
  "How much energy the spring loses. Values less than one give you an osscilating spring. A value of one makes the spring return without overshooting": "弹簧损失的能量。小于 1 的值会产生振荡弹簧。值为 1 时弹簧回弹不会过冲",
  "Set the spring rest length.": "设置弹簧静止长度。",
  "Increase the spring rest length by the given amount.": "将弹簧静止长度增加给定值。",
  "Decrease the spring rest length by the given amount.": "将弹簧静止长度减少给定值。",
  "Set the spring frequency (stiffness).": "设置弹簧频率（刚度）。",
  "Set the spring damping ratio.": "设置弹簧阻尼比。",
  "Minimum Sound Velocity": "最小声音速度",
  "When travelling below this many units/sec, will not play any sound.": "低于此单位/秒速度行进时，不播放任何声音。",
  "Full Sound Velocity": "全音量声音速度",
  "When travelling at this speed or above, will play sound at full volume.": "以此速度或更高速度行进时，以全音量播放声音。",
  "Travel sound (forward)": "行进声音（前进）",
  "Play this sound when travelling forward on helper axis": "沿辅助器轴前进时播放此声音",
  "Travel sound (backward)": "行进声音（后退）",
  "Play this sound when travelling backward on helper axis": "沿辅助器轴后退时播放此声音",
  "Reversal sound threshold (small)": "反向声音阈值（小）",
  "When accelerating by more than this many units/sec^2 opposite to direction of travel, play the small reversal sound.": "当以超过此单位/秒^2 的加速度沿行进反方向加速时，播放小的反向声音。",
  "Reversal sound threshold (medium)": "反向声音阈值（中）",
  "When accelerating by more than this many units/sec^2 opposite to direction of travel, play the medium reversal sound.": "当以超过此单位/秒^2 的加速度沿行进反方向加速时，播放中等的反向声音。",
  "Reversal sound threshold (large)": "反向声音阈值（大）",
  "When accelerating by more than this many units/sec^2 opposite to direction of travel, play the large reversal sound.": "当以超过此单位/秒^2 的加速度沿行进反方向加速时，播放大的反向声音。",
  "Reversal sound (small)": "反向声音（小）",
  "Play this sound when making a hard reverse over the small threshold but less than medium": "反向超过小阈值但小于中阈值时播放此声音",
  "Reversal sound (medium)": "反向声音（中）",
  "Play this sound when making a hard reverse over the medium threshold but less than large": "反向超过中阈值但小于大阈值时播放此声音",
  "Reversal sound (large)": "反向声音（大）",
  "Play this sound when making a hard reverse over the large threshold": "反向超过大阈值时播放此声音",
  "Friction": "摩擦",
  "Min Rotation Limit": "最小旋转限制",
  "Minimum rotation limit around hinge axis": "围绕铰链轴的最小旋转限制",
  "Max Rotation Limit": "最大旋转限制",
  "Maximum rotation limit around hinge axis": "围绕铰链轴的最大旋转限制",
  "Initial rotation": "初始旋转",
  "Initial rotation of the hinge (values -1 to 1 where -1 mean open at minimum limit and 1 means open at maximum limit)": "铰链的初始旋转（取值 -1 到 1，-1 表示张开至最小限制，1 表示张开至最大限制）",
  "Hinge Axis": "铰链轴",
  "Motor frequency": "马达频率",
  "Range 0 - 30 (only used when driving the relative angle through the angle input)": "范围 0 - 30（仅在通过角度输入驱动相对角度时使用）",
  "Motor damping ratio": "马达阻尼比",
  "Range 0 - 1 (only used when driving the relative angle through the angle input)": "范围 0 - 1（仅在通过角度输入驱动相对角度时使用）",
  "Load Scale": "负载缩放",
  "Scale of the load connected to this hinge (1=just the objects directly connected)": "连接到此铰链的负载缩放（1=仅直接连接的物体）",
  "Threshold for move events": "移动事件阈值",
  "Set angular velocity around the hinge (motor) in deg/sec": "设置围绕铰链（马达）的角速度，单位为度/秒",
  "Set Motor Friction, 0 = no friction, 1 = friction that is about enough to counter gravity": "设置马达摩擦，0 = 无摩擦，1 = 足以对抗重力的摩擦",
  "Set the minimum hinge angle (degrees)": "设置最小铰链角度（度）",
  "Set the maximum hinge angle (degrees)": "设置最大铰链角度（度）",
  "Turn Motor Off, will turn all friction off": "关闭马达，将关闭所有摩擦",
  "Set Motor target velocity in deg/sec, use 0 to just turn friction on": "设置马达目标速度（度/秒），使用 0 表示仅开启摩擦",
  "Set Motor target angle, degrees. Exact number depends on constrained bodies reference frames and initial configuration. See constraint limits for reference to sensible range of values.": "设置马达目标角度（度）。具体数值取决于受约束物体的参考坐标系和初始配置。合理取值范围请参考约束限制。",
  "The min limit has been reached.": "已达到最小限制。",
  "The max limit has been reached.": "已达到最大限制。",
  "Fires if the attached objects start rotating around the hinge axis relatively to each other.": "当连接的物体开始绕铰链轴相对旋转时触发。",
  "Fires if the attached objects stip rotating around the hinge axis relatively to each other.": "当连接的物体停止绕铰链轴相对旋转时触发。",
  "Local Space Hinge Axis": "本地空间铰链轴",
  "Enable Swing Limit": "启用摆动限制",
  "Limit relative rotation away from the constraint's Z axis": "限制偏离约束 Z 轴的相对旋转",
  "Swing Limit": "摆动限制",
  "Maximum swing angle in degrees, if the swing limit is enabled": "启用摆动限制时的最大摆动角度（度）",
  "Enable Twist Limit": "启用扭转限制",
  "Limit relative rotation about the Z axis": "限制绕 Z 轴的相对旋转",
  "Min Twist Angle": "最小扭转角度",
  "Minimum relative twist angle in degrees, if the twist limit is enabled": "启用扭转限制时的最小相对扭转角度（度）",
  "Max Twist Angle": "最大扭转角度",
  "Maximum relative twist angle in degrees, if the twist limit is enabled": "启用扭转限制时的最大相对扭转角度（度）",
  "Entity 1 Bone Name": "实体 1 骨骼名称",
  "If set, search for a physics body that corresponds with the given bone.": "若设置，将搜索与给定骨骼对应的物理刚体。",
  "Entity 2 Bone Name": "实体 2 骨骼名称",
  "Linear Frequency": "线性频率",
  "Linear spring frequency (stiffness).": "线性弹簧频率（刚度）。",
  "Linear Damping Ratio": "线性阻尼比",
  "Linear spring damping ratio.": "线性弹簧阻尼比。",
  "Angular Frequency": "角频率",
  "Angular spring frequency (stiffness).": "角弹簧频率（刚度）。",
  "Angular Damping Ratio": "角阻尼比",
  "Angular spring damping ratio.": "角弹簧阻尼比。",
  "Enable Linear Constraint": "启用线性约束",
  "Enable Angular Constraint": "启用角度约束",
  "Additional Length": "附加长度",
  "Add (or subtract) this amount to the rest length of the pulley rope.": "将此数值加到（或从）滑轮绳静止长度中。",
  "Pulley Gear Ratio": "滑轮齿轮比",
  "Pulley Position 2": "滑轮位置 2",
  "The position of the pulley for Entity 2. The pulley for Entity 1 is the origin of this constraint entity. Entity 1 is always suspended from pulley point 1, and Entity 2 is always suspended from pulley point 2.": "实体 2 的滑轮位置。实体 1 的滑轮即此约束实体的原点。实体 1 始终悬挂在滑轮点 1，实体 2 始终悬挂在滑轮点 2。",
  "Keep Rigid": "保持刚性",
  "Limit Endpoints": "限制端点",
  "Sliding Axis": "滑动轴",
  "Set motor friction, 0 = no friction, 1 = friction that is about enough to counter gravity": "设置马达摩擦，0 = 无摩擦，1 = 足以对抗重力的摩擦",
  "Scale of the mass load connected to this constraint (1=just the objects directly connected)": "连接到此约束的质量负载缩放（1=仅直接连接的物体）",
  "Initial Offset": "初始偏移",
  "Initial offset in the range from -1 to 1 where -1 means spawn at the min limit, 0 means apply no offset, and 1 means spawn at max limit": "-1 到 1 范围内的初始偏移，-1 表示在最小限制处生成，0 表示不施加偏移，1 表示在最大限制处生成",
  "Range 0 - 30 (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)": "范围 0 - 30（仅在通过偏移输入驱动相对偏移时使用）",
  "Range 0 - 1 (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)": "范围 0 - 1（仅在通过偏移输入驱动相对偏移时使用）",
  "Motor max force": "马达最大力",
  "Measured in multiples (e.g. 10x) of the mass where zero means NO limit (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)": "以质量的倍数（如 10x）计算，0 表示无限制（仅在通过偏移输入驱动相对偏移时使用）",
  "Force Pivot": "力轴点",
  "Force joint position as constraint pivot": "强制将关节位置作为约束轴点",
  "Normalized input to drive along the slide axis. E.g 0 = min limit and 1 = max limit": "沿滑动轴驱动的归一化输入。例如 0 = 最小限制，1 = 最大限制",
  "Set linear velocity along the constraint": "设置沿约束方向的线性速度",
  "Add (or subtract) this amount to the rest length of the rope.": "将此数值加到（或从）绳的静止长度中。",
  "Minimum Length": "最小长度",
  "If the constraint is not rigid, this is the minimum length it can be.": "若约束不是刚性的，这是它可以达到的最小长度。",
  "Attached object 2 point": "连接物体 2 的点",
  "The position the rope attaches to object 2": "绳连接到物体 2 的位置",
  "Only limit rotation (free movement)": "仅限制旋转（自由移动）",
  "X axis min limit": "X 轴最小限制",
  "-180 min and 180 max = no constraint on this axis.": "-180 最小和 180 最大 = 此轴无约束。",
  "X axis max limit": "X 轴最大限制",
  "Y axis min limit": "Y 轴最小限制",
  "Y axis max limit": "Y 轴最大限制",
  "Z axis min limit": "Z 轴最小限制",
  "Z axis max limit": "Z 轴最大限制",
  "X axis friction": "X 轴摩擦",
  "Y axis friction": "Y 轴摩擦",
  "Z axis friction": "Z 轴摩擦",
  "Place Anchors At Constraint Transform": "在约束变换处放置锚点",
  "If true, the joint anchors on each entity will be set to match the transform of the constraint entity. If false, the anchors will be set to the specified attachment points, or the physics body origins if no attachments are specified.": "若为真，每个实体上的关节锚点将被设为与约束实体的变换一致。若为假，锚点将设为指定的附着点，未指定附着点时则设为物理刚体原点。",
  "Linear Motion X": "线性运动 X",
  "Free motion": "自由运动",
  "Locked motion": "锁定运动",
  "Spring frequency (stiffness)": "弹簧频率（刚度）",
  "Spring damping ratio": "弹簧阻尼比",
  "0 for no damping and 1 for critical damping": "0 为无阻尼，1 为临界阻尼",
  "Notify when X force reaches": "X 力达到此值时通知",
  "Minimum time between event firing X event (0 disables firing)": "X 事件两次触发之间的最短时间（0 表示禁用触发）",
  "Break after time at threshold on X (time)": "X 轴阈值处计时后断裂（时间）",
  "Break after time threshold on X (threshold)": "X 轴阈值处计时断裂（阈值）",
  "Linear Motion Y": "线性运动 Y",
  "Notify when Y force reaches": "Y 力达到此值时通知",
  "Minimum time between event firing Y event (0 disables firing)": "Y 事件两次触发之间的最短时间（0 表示禁用触发）",
  "Break after time at threshold on Y (time)": "Y 轴阈值处计时后断裂（时间）",
  "Break after time threshold on Y (threshold)": "Y 轴阈值处计时断裂（阈值）",
  "Linear Motion Z": "线性运动 Z",
  "Notify when Z force reaches": "Z 力达到此值时通知",
  "Minimum time between event firing Z event (0 disables firing)": "Z 事件两次触发之间的最短时间（0 表示禁用触发）",
  "Break after time at threshold on Z (time)": "Z 轴阈值处计时后断裂（时间）",
  "Break after time threshold on Z (threshold)": "Z 轴阈值处计时断裂（阈值）",
  "Angular Motion X": "角运动 X",
  "Angular Motion Y": "角运动 Y",
  "Angular Motion Z": "角运动 Z",
  "The requested force has been reached on the X axis.  Won't fire if force min time is zero.": "X 轴已达到请求的力。力的最短时间为零时不会触发。",
  "The requested force has been reached on the Y axis.  Won't fire if force min time is zero.": "Y 轴已达到请求的力。力的最短时间为零时不会触发。",
  "The requested force has been reached on the Z axis.  Won't fire if force min time is zero.": "Z 轴已达到请求的力。力的最短时间为零时不会触发。",
  "Enable Lateral Constraint": "启用侧向约束",
  "Enable Vertical Constraint": "启用垂直约束",
  "Enable Limit": "启用限制",
  "Prevents the object from moving off the ends of the spline. Don't use on splines that are meant to loop.": "防止物体移出样条曲线两端。请勿在需要循环的样条上使用。",
  "Transition Time": "过渡时间",
  "When changing splines (e.g. via SetSplineEntity), we smoothly transition the constraint anchor to the new spline over this time interval.": "更换样条时（例如通过 SetSplineEntity），约束锚点将在该时间间隔内平滑过渡到新样条。",
  "Fire Events On Path": "在路径上触发事件",
  "Notify our path when the attached entity moves along it so it can fire passthrough events, etc.": "当连接实体沿路径移动时通知路径，使其可以触发穿透事件等。",
  "Set the transition time used when changing splines": "设置更换样条时使用的过渡时间",
  "Set the spline to a new entity": "将样条设置为新实体",
  "Enable the limits at the ends of the spline": "启用样条两端的限制",
  "Disable the limits at the ends of the spline": "禁用样条两端的限制",
  "Apply Force": "施加力",
  "Apply Torque": "施加力矩",
  "Orient Locally": "本地定向",
  "Attached Object": "被连接物体",
  "Object to apply the force to.": "要对其施加力的物体。",
  "Time of Force (0=inf)": "力持续时间（0=无限）",
  "Automatic shut-off after this time has passed (0 = stay on forever or until deactivated)": "此时间过后自动关闭（0 = 永久开启直至被停用）",
  "Turn the force on": "开启力",
  "Turn the force off": "关闭力",
  "Set Force Scale": "设置力缩放",
  "Ignore Pos": "忽略位置",
  "Force (will be integrated, units are force kg*in/s^2)": "力（将被积分，单位为力 kg*in/s^2）",
  "Angular Acceleration": "角加速度",
  "Rotation Axis": "旋转轴",
  "Rotation Speed": "旋转速度",
  "Angular speed (units are degress/second)": "角速度（单位为度/秒）",
  "Friction that slows the object's rotation when the motor is disabled. Start with a very small value between 0 and 1, and tune from there.": "马达禁用时减缓物体旋转的摩擦。初始使用 0 到 1 之间很小的值，再据此调整。",
  "Spin up time": "加速时间",
  "spin up time in seconds (also affects the rate at which speed changes happen)": "加速时间（秒）（也影响速度变化的速率）",
  "Spin down time": "减速时间",
  "spin down time in seconds (also affects the rate at which speed changes happen)": "减速时间（秒）（也影响速度变化的速率）",
  "System Interia Scale": "系统惯量缩放",
  "Make this larger if the object being driven is constrained to a set of heavier objects.": "若被驱动物体被约束到一组更重的物体上，可将此值调大。",
  "No world collision": "无世界碰撞",
  "Hinge Object": "铰链物体",
  "Object to apply the force to": "要对其施加力的物体",
  "Anchor Object": "锚点物体",
  "Object the other side of the motor joint is attached to. If blank, the motor is anchored to the world.": "马达关节另一侧连接的物体。留空则马达锚定到世界。",
  "Sets target speed": "设置目标速度",
  "Sets friction -- only applies when the motor is off": "设置摩擦——仅在马达关闭时生效",
  "Turns motor on": "开启马达",
  "Turns motor off": "关闭马达",
  "Suck On Touch": "接触时吸取",
  "Allow Attached Rotation": "允许连接旋转",
  "Coast jeep pickup hack": "海岸吉普拾取特例",
  "The amount of impulse necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the magnet.": "将卡住物体从磁铁上挣脱所需的冲量。一种计算方法是将它设为一个物体的质量，该物体静置在磁铁上时会破坏此约束。",
  "The amount of angular impulse necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "将卡住物体从磁铁上挣脱所需的角冲量。一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以破坏约束所需（自物体质心算起）的静置距离。",
  "A scale multiplier for the object's mass.": "物体质量的缩放乘数。",
  "Maximum Attached Objects": "最大连接物体数",
  "The maximum number of physics objects that can be stuck to the magnet at once. 0 = no limit.": "磁铁一次最多可吸附的物理物体数量。0 = 无限制。",
  "Turn the magnet on.": "开启磁铁。",
  "The the magnet off. This will detach anything current stuck to the magnet.": "关闭磁铁。这将分离当前吸附在磁铁上的所有物体。",
  "Fired when an entity is grabbed by the magnet.": "实体被磁铁抓取时触发。",
  "Fired when an entity is released by the magnet.": "实体被磁铁释放时触发。",
  "Collisions": "碰撞",
  "Use axis-aligned box": "使用轴对齐盒",
  "Use oriented Box": "使用定向盒",
  "Use VPhysics": "使用 VPhysics",
  "Used to disable shadow casting fromthis entity.": "用于禁用此实体的阴影投射。",
  "Start Fade Dist/Pixels": "开始淡出距离/像素",
  "End Fade Dist/Pixels": "结束淡出距离/像素",
  "Maximum distance at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out).": "此模型可见的最大距离（0 = 不淡出）。",
  "Vis Occluder": "Vis 遮挡体",
  "If true this geometry is used as an occluder for precomputed visibility": "若为真，此几何体将用作预计算可见性的遮挡体",
  "Alpha": "透明度",
  "Turn Off in Low-Violence": "低暴力模式下关闭",
  "Use Hitboxes for Renderbox": "使用命中盒作为渲染盒",
  "Start with collision disabled": "以禁用碰撞状态启动",
  "Set to Nav Ignore": "设为导航忽略",
  "Set to Local-Nav Ignore (NPC will not try to avoid this entity)": "设为本地导航忽略（NPC 不会尝试躲避此实体）",
  "Exclude from PVS (Always networked, use sparingly)": "从 PVS 中排除（始终联网，请谨慎使用）",
  "Use Animgraph": "使用动画图",
  "Allow the model to use its animgraph it has one. If the model has no animgraph this setting has no effect and is disabled": "允许模型使用其动画图（如果有）。若模型没有动画图，此设置无效且被禁用",
  "Starting Animation": "起始动画",
  "The name of a starting animation that this prop will start with when it spawns. After completion, it will switch to the Idle sequence, if it is specified. This setting is ignored for models with an animgraph when Use Animgraph is enabled.": "此模型生成时将以该起始动画开始播放。完成后，若指定了待机动作序列，它将切换到待机序列。启用“使用动画图”时，对带动画图的模型此设置被忽略。",
  "Start Animation Loop Mode": "起始动画循环模式",
  "Do Not Loop": "不循环",
  "Idle Animation": "待机动画",
  "The name of the idle animation that this prop will revert to whenever it finishes a random or forced animation. This setting is ignored for models with an animgraph when Use Animgraph is enabled.": "此模型在完成随机或强制动画后将回到的待机动画名称。启用“使用动画图”时，对带动画图的模型此设置被忽略。",
  "Idle Animation Loop Mode": "待机动画循环模式",
  "Randomize cycle": "随机化进度",
  "If set, this prop will randomize its cycle when it begins animating. Use this to desynchronize animating props that use the same model.": "若设置，此模型开始动画时会随机化其动画进度。用它来让使用相同模型的动画模型不同步。",
  "Lag Compensation": "延迟补偿",
  "Enable to lag compensate this prop, should be use very sparingly!": "启用对此模型的延迟补偿，应尽量少用！",
  "Animate on server in multiplayer": "多人游戏中在服务器端播放动画",
  "Enable this to animate on the server in multiplayer games, such as for props with triggers parented to attachment points. Use sparingly as there is a performance cost.": "启用此选项可在多人游戏中于服务器端播放动画，例如带触发、附着到附着点的模型。有性能开销，请谨慎使用。",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers to interact as": "以逗号分隔的交互层列表，指定以哪些层进行交互",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to loop. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制模型播放动画并强制循环。参数应为动画名称。",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to loop unless the prop is already playing the animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制模型播放动画并强制循环，除非该模型已在播放该动画。参数应为动画名称。",
  "Changes the Idle Animation to the one specified in the parameter and force it to loop.": "将待机动画更改为参数中指定的动画并强制循环。",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to not loop. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制模型播放动画并强制不循环。参数应为动画名称。",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to not loop unless the prop is already playing the animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制模型播放动画并强制不循环，除非该模型已在播放该动画。参数应为动画名称。",
  "Changes the Idle Animation to the one specified in the parameter and force it to not loop.": "将待机动画更改为参数中指定的动画并强制不循环。",
  "Set the playback rate for the animation.": "设置动画的播放速率。",
  "Sets bodygroup. Format is <BodygroupName,index> ": "设置身体分组。格式为 <BodygroupName,index> ",
  "Make the prop visible.": "使模型可见。",
  "Make the prop invisible.": "使模型不可见。",
  "Enable collision on the prop.": "启用模型的碰撞。",
  "Disable collision on the prop.": "禁用模型的碰撞。",
  "Enable and disable NAVIgnore on the prop.": "启用或禁用模型的 NAVIgnore。",
  "Fired whenever a new animation has begun playing.": "每当新动画开始播放时触发。",
  "Fired whenever an animation is complete.": "每当动画完成时触发。",
  "Fired whenever a non-looping animation playing forward hits the end (cycle=1).": "每当向前播放的非循环动画到达结尾（cycle=1）时触发。",
  "Fired whenever a non-looping animation playing backward hits the beginning (cycle=0).": "每当向后播放的非循环动画到达开头（cycle=0）时触发。",
  "Fires off an event when the current cycle of a looped animation is complete.": "循环动画的当前进度周期完成时触发一个事件。",
  "If set, NPC movement will ignore this prop": "若设置，NPC 移动将忽略此模型",
  "Debris with trigger interaction": "带触发交互的碎屑",
  "Force non-solid to players": "强制对玩家无碰撞",
  "Min Damage to Hurt": "造成伤害的最小伤害值",
  "The prop will ignore any damage events if the damage is less than this amount.": "若伤害小于此值，模型将忽略该伤害事件。",
  "Shadow Cast Distance": "阴影投射距离",
  "Use this to override how far this object casts shadows. 0 = default distance.": "用于覆盖此物体投射阴影的距离。0 = 默认距离。",
  "Scales damage energy when this object is hit by a physics object. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.<br>Set to 1.0 for materials as strong as flesh, smaller numbers indicate stronger materials.": "当此物体被物理物体撞击时缩放伤害能量。注意：为向后兼容，0 表示此功能被禁用。<br>设为 1.0 表示材质与肉体一样脆弱，数值越小表示材质越坚固。",
  "Impact damage type": "撞击伤害类型",
  "Accept damage from player held objects": "接受玩家手持物体的伤害",
  "Set to true so the player can bash this with held props.": "设为 true 使玩家可以用手持模型击打它。",
  "Scale Factor For Inertia": "惯性缩放系数",
  "Scales the angular mass of an object. Used to hack angular damage and collision response.": "缩放物体的角质量。用于调整角伤害和碰撞响应的特例处理。",
  "Scales how water forces affect this object.": "缩放水力对此物体的影响。",
  "Dynamic Continuous Contact Behavior": "动态连续碰撞行为",
  "Allow if requested by other body": "若被其他刚体请求则允许",
  "Always (request continuous contact against other dynamic bodies)": "总是（对其他动态刚体使用连续碰撞）",
  "Never (don't use continuous contact against other dynamic bodies even if another body requests it)": "从不（即使其他刚体请求，也不对其他动态刚体使用连续碰撞）",
  "Sound to make when punted": "被击飞时发出的声音",
  "AI AddOn": "AI 附加组件",
  "If specified this object will use this addon behavior when installed in a composite AI": "若指定，此物体安装到组合 AI 中时将使用此附加行为",
  "Force Nav Ignore": "强制导航忽略",
  "If set, NPCs will ignore this prop when navigating.": "若设置，NPC 寻路时将忽略此模型。",
  "No Navmesh Blocker": "无导航网格阻挡器",
  "If set, don't auto-create a navmesh blocker.": "若设置，不自动创建导航网格阻挡器。",
  "Auto Convert back from Debris": "自动从碎屑转换回来",
  "If set, this prop will automatically convert back to interactive debris after coming to rest as Debris.": "若设置，此模型作为碎屑静置后，将自动转换回可交互碎屑。",
  "Update Nav When Moving": "移动时更新导航",
  "If set, nav mesh will be constantly updated while this obstacle is moving, and not just when this obstacle is settled.": "若设置，此障碍物移动时导航网格将持续更新，而不只是在它稳定后更新。",
  "Force Nav Cut ": "强制导航切割 ",
  "If set, this obstacle will cut the mesh causing NPC's to avoid it regardless of its mass.": "若设置，此障碍物将切割导航网格，使 NPC 无论其质量如何都会避开它。",
  "Allow Obstacle Merging": "允许障碍物合并",
  "If set, this obstacle will be merged with nearby obstacles to improve performance.": "若设置，此障碍物将与附近障碍物合并以提升性能。",
  "Removal Allowed for Ammo Balancing": "允许为弹药平衡而移除",
  "Item Subclass 1": "物品子类 1",
  "Subclass name of the entity to spawn when the crate is broken": "板条箱破坏时生成实体的子类名称",
  "Item Count 1": "物品数量 1",
  "Number of items to emit upon breakage": "破坏时产生的物品数量",
  "Item Subclass 2": "物品子类 2",
  "Item Count 2": "物品数量 2",
  "Item Subclass 3": "物品子类 3",
  "Item Count 3": "物品数量 3",
  "Item Subclass 4": "物品子类 4",
  "Item Count 4": "物品数量 4",
  "Enable gravity on physics object": "启用物理物体的重力",
  "Disable gravity on physics object": "禁用物理物体的重力",
  "Set the Physics Impact Damage Scale for this character. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.": "设置此角色的物理冲击伤害缩放。注意：为向后兼容，0 表示此功能被禁用。",
  "Set whether or not this prop should automatically convert back to interactive debris after it comes to rest as debris.": "设置此模型作为碎屑静置后是否应自动转换回可交互碎屑。",
  "Add an attribute with a value of 1.": "添加一个值为 1 的属性。",
  "Remove an attribute.": "移除一个属性。",
  "Fired when motion is enabled on this prop, either via 'Health Level to Override Motion' or from the EnableMotion input.": "当此模型的运动被启用时触发，无论是通过“覆盖运动的生命值等级”还是 EnableMotion 输入。",
  "Fired when this entity becomes awake (collision/force is applied to it while it's asleep).": "此实体被唤醒时触发（休眠时受到碰撞/力的作用）。",
  "Fired when the player tries to +USE the prop. This output will fire only if the Generate output on +USE spawnflag is set.": "玩家尝试+使用此模型时触发。仅当设置了“生成 +使用输出”生成标记时此输出才会触发。",
  "Fired whenever the prop is out of the allowed world bounds.": "每当模型超出允许的世界边界时触发。",
  "Prop Data Override": "模型数据覆盖",
  "Prop Data names defined in propdata.vdata are typically defined in the VMDL used by this prop. For prototyping, this allows you to select a specific one and ignore the name in the VMDL.": "在 propdata.vdata 中定义的模型数据名称通常定义于此模型使用的 VMDL 中。为便于原型制作，此处允许你选择特定的一个并忽略 VMDL 中的名称。",
  "Ignite, burst into flames.": "点燃，燃起火焰。",
  "Ignite, with a parameternumber of hitbox fires.": "点燃，带有参数指定数量的命中盒火焰。",
  "Physics Mode": "物理模式",
  "Auto Detect": "自动检测",
  "Solid, Server-side": "有碰撞，服务器端",
  "Non-Solid, Server-side": "无碰撞，服务器端",
  "Non-Solid, Client-side": "无碰撞，客户端端",
  "Allow Dissolve": "允许溶解",
  "Unused": "未使用",
  "Start asleep": "以休眠状态启动",
  "Don't force sleep": "不强制休眠",
  "Allow Stretch": "允许拉伸",
  "Disables rendering fixup on bones that become separated": "禁用分离骨骼上的渲染修正",
  "Override Animation": "覆盖动画",
  "Filled in by the engine via wc_update_entity, do not edit by hand except to clear.": "由引擎通过 wc_update_entity 填写，除清除外请勿手动编辑。",
  "Scale on the buoyancy / fluid forces applied to this object": "施加到此物体上的浮力/流体力缩放",
  "Fade out then remove (kill) self. Parameter override = duration of fade": "淡出后移除（杀死）自身。参数覆盖 = 淡出时长",
  "Name of the entity that this ornament should attach to, at startup.": "此装饰物启动时应附着到的实体名称。",
  "Attach the ornament to a different entity. Parameter should be the name of entity to attach to.": "将装饰物附着到另一个实体。参数应为要附着到的实体名称。",
  "Detach from the Target Entity and become invisible. The ornament can be re-attached with the SetAttached input.": "从目标实体分离并变为不可见。装饰物可通过 SetAttached 输入重新附着。",
  "Vehicle Subclass": "载具子类",
  "Subclass of the Vehicle.": "载具的子类。",
  "Start locked": "以锁定状态启动",
  "Passenger entered the vehicle (argument is passenger index)": "乘客进入载具（参数为乘客索引）",
  "Passenger exited the vehicle (argument is passenger index)": "乘客离开载具（参数为乘客索引）",
  "Prevent passengers from entering or exiting the vehicle.": "阻止乘客进入或离开载具。",
  "Re-allow passengers to enter or exit the vehicle.": "重新允许乘客进入或离开载具。",
  "Game Mass Override": "游戏质量覆盖",
  "Set the game mass by hand instead of using the code defaults.": "手动设置游戏质量，而不使用代码默认值。",
  "Block LOS override": "视线阻挡覆盖",
  "Should this entity block or not-block LOS": "此实体是否阻挡视线",
  "use default": "使用默认",
  "Force no block LOS": "强制不阻挡视线",
  "Force block LOS": "强制阻挡视线",
  "Pushables": "可推动物体",
  "Ignore client's hands": "忽略客户端的双手",
  "Precipitation Subclass": "降水子类",
  "The Type of Precipitation.": "降水类型。",
  "Density (0-100%)": "密度（0-100%）",
  "Starts Invisible": "以不可见状态启动",
  "Toggle the brush on/off. When off, the brush will be non-solid and invisible.": "切换画刷开/关。关闭时，画刷将无碰撞且不可见。",
  "The speed at which the target moves along its path.": "目标沿其路径移动的速度。",
  "First stop target": "首个停靠目标",
  "The name of the first path_track entity in the path that this target should follow.": "此目标应遵循的路径中第一个 path_track 实体的名称。",
  "Damage to Take": "承受的伤害",
  "The amount of damage taken before this target is killed.": "此目标被杀死前承受的伤害量。",
  "Start the target moving.": "使目标开始移动。",
  "Stop the target from moving.": "使目标停止移动。",
  "Toggle the target between moving and stopped.": "在移动与停止之间切换目标。",
  "Fires when the target is killed.": "目标被杀死时触发。",
  "World model": "世界模型",
  "Fish Count": "鱼数量",
  "Number of Fish in this Pool": "此鱼群中的鱼数量",
  "Max Range": "最大范围",
  "How far away a Fish can wander (max 255)": "鱼可以游荡的距离（最大 255）",
  "Move Sound": "移动声音",
  "The sound played whenever the platform starts moving.": "平台开始移动时播放的声音。",
  "The sound played when the platform stops moving.": "平台停止移动时播放的声音。",
  "Sound Volume 0.0 - 1.0": "声音音量 0.0 - 1.0",
  "The vertical height above the track that the train moves. Negative values moves the train below.": "火车在轨道上方移动的垂直高度。负值使火车移到轨道下方。",
  "Auto Activate train": "自动激活火车",
  "Relink track": "重新链接轨道",
  "Start at Bottom": "从底部开始",
  "Rotate Only": "仅旋转",
  "Train to Switch": "要切换的火车",
  "Top Track": "顶部轨道",
  "Bottom Track": "底部轨道",
  "No Pitch (X-rot)": "无俯仰（X 轴旋转）",
  "No User Control": "无用户控制",
  "Fixed Orientation": "固定朝向",
  "HL1 Train": "HL1 火车",
  "Use max speed for pitch shifting move sound": "使用最大速度对移动声音进行音调偏移",
  "Is unblockable by player": "玩家无法阻挡",
  "First Stop Target": "首个停靠目标",
  "The name of the first path_track in the train's path. The train ": "火车路径中第一个 path_track 的名称。火车 ",
  "will spawn at this path_track. It will also turn to face direction indicated by the 'Orientation Type' setting.": "将在此 path_track 处生成。它还将转向“朝向类型”设置所指示的方向。",
  "Max Speed (units / second)": "最大速度（单位/秒）",
  "The maximum speed that this train can move. ": "此火车可移动的最大速度。 ",
  "Any speeds applied to this train, such as by path_tracks or SetSpeed inputs, will be clipped to this maximum value.": "施加到此火车的任何速度（例如通过 path_track 或 SetSpeed 输入）都将被截断到此最大值。",
  "Initial Speed (units / second)": "初始速度（单位/秒）",
  "The speed that the train will move at after it spawns, 0 = stopped.": "火车生成后的移动速度，0 = 停止。",
  "Change Velocity": "速度变化方式",
  "The method through which this train changes its velocity as it moves along the path.": "此火车沿路径移动时改变速度的方式。",
  "Instantaneously": "瞬时",
  "Linear blend": "线性混合",
  "Ease in/ease out": "缓入/缓出",
  "Change angles": "角度变化方式",
  "The method through which this train changes its orientation as it moves along the path.": "此火车沿路径移动时改变朝向的方式。",
  "Never (fixed orientation)": "从不（固定朝向）",
  "Near path_tracks": "靠近 path_track 时",
  "Distance Between the Wheels": "车轮间距",
  "Used for turning and stopping.": "用于转弯和停车。",
  "Height above track": "轨道上方高度",
  "The height above the track that this train moves.": "此火车在轨道上方移动的高度。",
  "Bank Angle on Turns": "转弯倾斜角",
  "Damage on Crush": "碾压伤害",
  "The amount of damage this train does to entities that block it.": "此火车对阻挡它的实体造成的伤害量。",
  "A sound that is played (and looped) while the train is moving.": "火车移动时播放（并循环）的声音。",
  "Move Ping Sound": "移动提示音",
  "A sound that is played more frequently as the train speeds up.": "火车加速时播放频率随之提高的声音。",
  "A sound played when the train starts moving.": "火车开始移动时播放的声音。",
  "A sound played when the train stops moving.": "火车停止移动时播放的声音。",
  "Min pitch (1-255, > 100 = higher)": "最小音高（1-255，> 100 = 更高）",
  "The sound pitch value that the train will approach as it comes to a stop.": "火车停止时音高将趋近的声音音高值。",
  "Max pitch (1-255, > 100 = higher)": "最大音高（1-255，> 100 = 更高）",
  "The sound pitch value that the train will approach as it approaches its ": "火车接近其最大速度时将趋近的声音音高值 ",
  "max speed (or 1000 inches/second if the 'Use max speed for pitch shifting move sound' flag is not set).": "（若未设置“使用最大速度对移动声音进行音调偏移”标记，则为 1000 英寸/秒）。",
  "Min move sound interval": "最小移动声音间隔",
  "Minimum interval at which to play the move ping sound.": "播放移动提示音的最小间隔。",
  "Max move sound interval": "最大移动声音间隔",
  "Maximum interval at which to play the move ping sound.": "播放移动提示音的最大间隔。",
  "Set the speed of the train, as a ratio of max speed [0, 1]": "设置火车速度，以最大速度的比率表示 [0, 1]",
  "Set the speed of the train, as a ratio of max speed. Negative values reverse the direction [-1, 1]": "设置火车速度，以最大速度的比率表示。负值反转方向 [-1, 1]",
  "Set the speed of the train. Must be a positive value from 0 to max speed.": "设置火车速度。必须为 0 到最大速度之间的正值。",
  "Stop the train.": "停止火车。",
  "Start the train moving forward.": "使火车开始前进。",
  "Start the train moving backward.": "使火车开始后退。",
  "Resume the train moving in the current direction after it was stopped via the 'Stop' or 'Toggle' input.": "火车因“停止”或“切换”输入停止后，沿当前方向恢复移动。",
  "Reverse the direction of the train.": "反转火车方向。",
  "Toggle the train between start and stop.": "在启动与停止之间切换火车。",
  "Trigger the track change.": "触发轨道切换。",
  "Start moving to a destination and stop when you get there. This must be in the same path.": "开始向目的地移动并在到达后停止。目的地必须位于同一路径中。",
  "Teleport to a destination and stop there. This can be in a new path.": "传送到目的地并停在那里。目的地可以位于新路径中。",
  "Lock the current orientation of the train.": "锁定火车当前朝向。",
  "Unlock the current orientation of the train.": "解锁火车当前朝向。",
  "Set a new max speed for the train.": "为火车设置新的最大速度。",
  "Fired when the train starts moving in either direction.": "火车开始沿任一方向移动时触发。",
  "Fires when this train picks a new point to move towards (and just after OnStart).": "当此火车选择新的移动目标点时触发（紧随 OnStart 之后）。",
  "Fired when this train arrives at a destination that was specified by the MoveToPathNode Input.": "此火车到达由 MoveToPathNode 输入指定的目的地时触发。",
  "Fired when the tank is killed.": "坦克被杀死时触发。",
  "Train Name": "火车名称",
  "The target train to control when the player uses these controls.": "玩家使用这些控制装置时控制的目标火车。",
  "Tank AI Entity": "坦克 AI 实体",
  "The tanktrain_ai entity to change the target of.": "要更改目标的 tanktrain_ai 实体。",
  "New Target Entity": "新目标实体",
  "The entity to tell the tanktrain_ai to target.": "通知 tanktrain_ai 瞄准的实体。",
  "Start Moving Sound": "开始移动声音",
  "Engine Loop Sound": "引擎循环声音",
  "Vehicle Movement Sound": "载具移动声音",
  "Fire once": "触发一次",
  "Branch Reverse": "分支反转",
  "Disable train": "禁用火车",
  "Teleport to THIS path track": "传送到此 path_track",
  "Next Stop Target": "下一停靠目标",
  "The next path_track in the path.": "路径中的下一个 path_track。",
  "Branch Path": "分支路径",
  "An alternative path_track to be the next node in the path. Useful for making branching paths. Use the ToggleAlternatePath / EnableAlternatePath inputs to make the alternative path active.": "作为路径中下一节点的备选 path_track。用于制作分叉路径。使用 ToggleAlternatePath / EnableAlternatePath 输入激活备选路径。",
  "New Train Speed": "新火车速度",
  "When the train reaches this path_track, it will set its speed to this speed. ": "火车到达此 path_track 时，将把速度设为该速度。 ",
  "This speed must be a positive value that is less than the train's max speed. A value of 0 will cause no change in the train's speed.": "此速度必须为小于火车最大速度的正值。值为 0 时不改变火车速度。",
  "Path radius": "路径半径",
  "Used by NPCs who follow track paths (attack chopper/gunship). This tells them the maximum distance they're allowed to be from the path at this node.": "由沿轨道路径行进的 NPC（攻击直升机/武装炮艇）使用。告知它们在此节点处与路径允许的最大距离。",
  "Orientation Type": "朝向类型",
  "The way that the path follower faces as it moves through this path track.": "路径跟随者穿过此 path_track 时的朝向方式。",
  "No change": "不改变",
  "Face direction of motion": "面向运动方向",
  "Face this path_track's angles": "面向此 path_track 的角度",
  "Cause the track to toggle to/from its alternate path.": "使轨道切换到/离开其备选路径。",
  "Enable the alternate path of the track.": "启用轨道的备选路径。",
  "Disable the alternate path of the track.": "禁用轨道的备选路径。",
  "Cause the track to toggle on/off/": "使轨道切换开/关/",
  "Enable the track.": "启用轨道。",
  "Disable the track.": "禁用轨道。",
  "Fired when any entity following this path passes this path_track node.": "任何沿此路径行进的实体经过此 path_track 节点时触发。",
  "Dangerous Timer": "危险计时器",
  "The number of seconds the player must survive before this autosave takes effect.": "此自动存档生效前玩家必须存活的秒数。",
  "Minumum Hit Points": "最小生命值",
  "Multiple Retrigger Delay": "重复触发延迟",
  "If >0 allow re-triggering after the specified number of seconds passes": "若 >0，允许在指定秒数后再次触发",
  "New Map Name": "新地图名称",
  "Landmark Name": "地标名称",
  "Disable Touch": "禁用接触",
  "To Previous Chapter": "到上一章节",
  "Cause the level change. Use this when triggering the level change with a button, etc.": "触发关卡切换。在用按钮等触发关卡切换时使用。",
  "Fired when the level changes.": "关卡切换时触发。",
  "Gravity (0-1)": "重力（0-1）",
  "The amount of damage done to entities that touch this trigger. The damage is done every half-second. See also 'Damage Model' for extra details on how damage can be dealt.": "对接触此触发的实体造成的伤害。伤害每半秒造成一次。另请参阅“伤害模型”了解如何造成伤害的更多细节。",
  "Damage Cap": "伤害上限",
  "Maximum damage dealt per second. This field is only used if you select the Doubling w/Forgiveness damage model, via the spawnflag.": "每秒造成的最大伤害。仅当你通过生成标记选择“带宽容的倍增”伤害模型时才使用此字段。",
  "Damage Model": "伤害模型",
  "How damage is dealt. Normal always does the specified amount of damage each half second. Doubling starts with the specified amount and doubles it each time it hurts the toucher. Forgiveness means that if the toucher gets out of the trigger the damage will reset to the specified value. Good for making triggers that are deadly over time without having to cause massive damage on each touch.": "伤害如何造成。“普通”每半秒总是造成指定伤害。“倍增”以指定值开始，每次伤害触碰到者时翻倍。“宽容”意味着如果触碰到者离开触发，伤害将重置为指定值。适合制作随时间致命而无需每次接触造成巨量伤害的触发。",
  "Doubling w/forgiveness": "带宽容的倍增",
  "Forgiveness delay": "宽容延迟",
  "When doubling with forgiveness, how many seconds the trigger must go without hurting anything before the damage is reset.": "在带宽容的倍增模式下，触发在不伤害任何东西多少秒后伤害才重置。",
  "Zero Damage Force": "零伤害力",
  "Should the damaged entity receive no physics force from this trigger.": "受伤实体是否不应从此触发获得物理力。",
  "Damage Force Override": "伤害力覆盖",
  "Always think every frame": "每帧都思考",
  "Normally triggers think every half second, in some cases you may need to request it to damage every frame.  This is expensive!": "通常触发每半秒思考一次，某些情况下你可能需要请求它每帧造成伤害。这开销很大！",
  "Set a new amount of damage for this trigger.": "为此触发设置新的伤害值。",
  "Fired whenever this trigger hurts something other than a player.": "每当此触发伤害到玩家以外的对象时触发。",
  "Fired whenever this trigger hurts a player.": "每当此触发伤害到玩家时触发。",
  "Fired whenever an entity is removed.": "每当实体被移除时触发。",
  "Delay Before Reset": "重置前延迟",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the trigger_multiple has triggered before it can be triggered again. If set to -1, it will never trigger again (in which case you should just use a trigger_once).": "trigger_multiple 触发后到再次可触发之间的时间（秒）。设为 -1 则永不再次触发（此时应直接使用 trigger_once）。",
  "Tests if the trigger is being touched and fires an output based on whether the value is true or false.": "测试触发是否正被接触，并根据结果为真或假触发输出。",
  "Fired whenever the trigger is activated.": "每当触发被激活时触发。",
  "Fired when the TestTouch input is true (something is touching the trigger.)": "当 TestTouch 输入为真（有东西正接触触发）时触发。",
  "Fires for each entity inside the trigger when the TestTouch input is true. Each call provides the individual entity as the activator.": "当 TestTouch 输入为真时，对触发内的每个实体各触发一次。每次调用以该实体作为激活者。",
  "Fired when the TestTouch input is not true (nothing is touching the trigger.)": "当 TestTouch 输入不为真（没有东西接触触发）时触发。",
  "Update Rate": "更新频率",
  "The rate, in seconds, that the trigger updates the OpVar": "触发更新 OpVar 的频率（秒）",
  "Minimum Value": "最小值",
  "The minimum value the opvar will be set to": "OpVar 将被设置的最小值",
  "Maximum Value": "最大值",
  "The maximum value the opvar will be set to": "OpVar 将被设置的最大值",
  "none": "无",
  "Volume Center Size": "体积中心尺寸",
  "The size of the center portion of the trigger volume.": "触发体积中心部分的尺寸。",
  "Use the trigger in 2D mode": "以 2D 模式使用触发",
  "In 2D mode the trigger only measures position along the x and y axes, not the z.": "2D 模式下触发仅测量沿 x 和 y 轴的位置，不测量 z。",
  "Fire Once": "触发一次",
  "Use Velocity instead of facing": "使用速度而非朝向",
  "Look Target": "注视目标",
  "The name of the entity to be looked at.": "被注视实体的名称。",
  "Look Time": "注视时间",
  "The time, in seconds, that the player must look the target before firing the output. Resets if player leaves trigger, or looks outside the Field of View threshold.": "玩家注视目标达到该时间（秒）后触发输出。玩家离开触发或视线超出视场阈值时重置。",
  "Field Of View": "视场",
  "How close the player has to be looking at the target.<br><br> 1.0 = straight ahead<br> 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees<br> -1.0 = all directions": "玩家需要多近距离注视目标。<br><br> 1.0 = 正前方<br> 0.0 = +/- 90 度<br> -1.0 = 所有方向",
  "Use 2D Field Of View": "使用 2D 视场",
  "In 2D mode the look angle FOV is only checked along the x and y axes, not the z.": "2D 模式下注视角度 FOV 仅沿 x 和 y 轴检查，不检查 z。",
  "Timeout": "超时",
  "The time, in seconds, to wait after player enters the trigger before firing the OnTimeout output, 0 = never. NOTE: When the timeout expires, the OnTrigger output does NOT fire!": "玩家进入触发后等待的秒数，之后触发 OnTimeout 输出，0 = 永不。注意：超时到期时不会触发 OnTrigger 输出！",
  "Test occlusion": "测试遮挡",
  "If set, player must have clear LOS to the target (ignoring dynamic entities).": "若设置，玩家必须与目标有清晰的视线（忽略动态实体）。",
  "Test All Visible Occlusion": "测试所有可见遮挡",
  "If set, player must have clear LOS to the target (all visible collision).": "若设置，玩家必须与目标有清晰的视线（所有可见碰撞）。",
  "Fired when the trigger is activated. Does NOT fire if the timeout expires.": "触发被激活时触发。超时到期时不触发。",
  "Fired after the timeout interval expires if the player never looked at the target. OnTrigger does NOT fire in this case.": "若玩家从未注视目标，超时间隔到期后触发。这种情况下不触发 OnTrigger。",
  "Fired once when the player looks until they have unlooked/untouched.": "玩家注视后直到停止注视/停止接触时触发一次。",
  "Fired when the player was looking and unlooked while still touching.": "玩家正在注视且在仍接触时停止注视时触发。",
  "Push Direction (Pitch Yaw Roll)": "推动方向（俯仰 偏航 翻滚）",
  "Angles indicating the direction to push touched entities.": "表示推动接触实体方向的角度。",
  "Once Only": "仅一次",
  "Affects Ladders (Half-Life 2)": "影响梯子（半衰期 2）",
  "Speed of Push": "推动速度",
  "The speed at which to push entities away, in inches / second.": "推开实体的速度，单位为英寸/秒。",
  "Trigger on Start Touch": "开始接触时触发",
  "Trigger on start touch instead of on touch.": "在开始接触时而非接触时触发。",
  "Set the push speed in inches / second.": "以英寸/秒设置推动速度。",
  "Sets the angles indicating the direction to push touched entities.": "设置表示推动接触实体方向的角度。",
  "The baseline for how hard the wind blows.": "风力吹拂强度的基准值。",
  "Speed Noise": "速度噪声",
  "Noise added to wind speed +/-": "加到风速上的噪声 +/-",
  "Direction Noise": "方向噪声",
  "Noise added to wind direction.": "加到风向上的噪声。",
  "Baseline for how long to wait before changing wind.": "更改风前等待时长的基准值。",
  "Hold Noise": "持续噪声",
  "Noise added to how long to wait before changing wind.": "加到更改风前等待时长上的噪声。",
  "Set the baseline for how hard the wind blows.": "设置风力吹拂强度的基准值。",
  "The strength of the impact. Negative values reverse the direction.": "冲击的强度。负值反转方向。",
  "Noise": "噪声",
  "The amount of directional noise (0-1). 0 = no noise, 1 = random direction.": "方向噪声的量（0-1）。0 = 无噪声，1 = 随机方向。",
  "Viewkick": "视角震动",
  "The amount to kick player's view if the player is in the trigger.  Proportional to magnitude (0-1).": "玩家在触发内时震动玩家视角的量。与强度成比例（0-1）。",
  "Fire the impact, pushing all entities within the volume.": "触发冲击，推动体积内的所有实体。",
  "Set the magnitude of the impact.": "设置冲击的强度。",
  "Fired after an impact. The parameter passed along is the force of the impact that was generated.": "冲击后触发。传递的参数是产生的冲击力。",
  "Point to Measure From": "测量起点",
  "The name of a target entity who's origin is the point to measure the player's distance from.": "一个目标实体的名称，其原点为测量玩家距离的基准点。",
  "Radius to measure within": "测量半径",
  "The radius to which the distance should be mapped. If the player is outside the radius he will be ignored.": "距离所映射到的半径。如果玩家在该半径之外，则会被忽略。",
  "Fired continuously when entities are touching the trigger volume. The output parameter is the distance from the ": "当实体接触触发体积时持续触发。输出参数是从“测量起点”到通过触发过滤器的最近实体的距离，",
  "Point to Measure From to the nearest entity that passed the trigger filters. The distance is mapped to the radius distance, ": "该距离会映射到半径距离，",
  "so it will be 0 when the entity is on the point, and 1 when the entity is at the edge of the radius.": "因此当实体位于该点上时为 0，当实体位于半径边缘时为 1。",
  "Remote Destination": "远程目的地",
  "The entity specifying the point to which entities should be teleported.": "指定实体应被传送到的目标点的实体。",
  "Local Destination Landmark": "本地目的地地标",
  "If specified, then teleported entities are offset from the target by their initial offset from the landmark.": "如果指定，则被传送的实体会根据其相对地标的初始偏移量从目标产生偏移。",
  "Use Landmark Orientations": "使用地标朝向",
  "Rotate around landmark by relative landmark orientations": "根据地标的相对朝向围绕地标旋转",
  "Mirror Player": "镜像玩家",
  "Mirror the player teleport position through the plane defined by the trigger's origin and up vector": "通过由触发器的原点和向上向量定义的平面来镜像玩家的传送位置",
  "Only Spawn-Valid Destinations": "仅生成有效的目的地",
  "Only teleport if there is a clear teleport destination.": "仅在存在无阻挡的传送目的地时才传送。",
  "Start Transition to Cheap Water": "开始过渡到低精度水的距离",
  "This is the distance from the camera that water will start transitioning to cheap water, in inches.": "这是距相机开始将水过渡到低精度水的距离，单位为英寸。",
  "End Transition to Cheap Water": "结束过渡到低精度水的距离",
  "This is the distance from the camera that water will finish transitioning to cheap water, in inches.": "这是距相机完成向低精度水过渡的距离，单位为英寸。",
  "Set the distance that water starts transitioning to cheap water.": "设置水开始过渡到低精度水的距离。",
  "Set the distance that water finishes transitioning to cheap water.": "设置水完成向低精度水过渡的距离。",
  "Start Off": "起始为关闭",
  "FOV": "视野（FOV）",
  "Field of view in degrees": "视野角度（度）",
  "Distance to the near plane": "到近裁剪面的距离",
  "Distance to the far plane": "到远裁剪面的距离",
  "Screen Aspect Ratio": "屏幕纵横比",
  "Aspect Ratio": "纵横比",
  "Fog Color": "雾颜色",
  "The near fog plane.": "近雾平面。",
  "The far fog/clipping plane.": "远雾/裁剪平面。",
  "The maximum fog density. 0=no fog, 1=full fog.": "最大雾密度。0=无雾，1=全雾。",
  "HLTV Usable": "HLTV 可用",
  "Changes camera's FOV over time": "随时间改变相机的视野",
  "Turn the camera on, and turn all other cameras off.": "打开此相机，并关闭所有其他相机。",
  "Turn the camera on.": "打开相机。",
  "Turn the camera off.": "关闭相机。",
  "Enable Depth of Field.": "启用景深。",
  "Disable Depth of Field.": "禁用景深。",
  "Set DOF Near Blurry Range.": "设置景深近处模糊范围。",
  "Set DOF Near Crisp Range.": "设置景深近处清晰范围。",
  "Set DOF Far Crisp Range.": "设置景深深处清晰范围。",
  "Set DOF Far Blurry Range.": "设置景深深处模糊范围。",
  "Set DOF Tilt to Ground Amount (0..1).": "设置景深向地面倾斜量（0..1）。",
  "Which entity should I orient towards?": "应朝向哪个实体？",
  "Goal Direction Type": "目标方向类型",
  "How to determine what the goal forward direction is": "如何确定目标前向方向",
  "Point At Origin": "指向原点",
  "Point At Center": "指向中心",
  "Point At Head": "指向头部",
  "Align To Forward Direction": "对齐到前向方向",
  "Align To Look Direction": "对齐到注视方向",
  "Orientation Constraints": "朝向约束",
  "Should the orientation be constrained?": "是否应约束朝向？",
  "No constraints": "无约束",
  "Preserve Up Axis": "保持向上轴",
  "Maximum Turn Rate": "最大转动速率",
  "Max turn rate, 0 means instantaneously point toward the target": "最大转动速率，0 表示立即指向目标",
  "Inactive": "未激活",
  "Activates / deactivates orientation toward the target": "激活/停用朝向目标",
  "Sets the target to orient toward": "设置要朝向的目标",
  "VerticalFOV": "垂直视野",
  "Vertical Field of view in degrees": "垂直视野角度（度）",
  "Entity to Measure": "要测量的实体",
  "Entity whose movement you want to measure.": "要测量其移动的实体。",
  "Measure Reference": "测量参考",
  "The movement of Entity to Measure will be measured relative to this entity.": "要测量的实体的移动将相对于此实体进行测量。",
  "Entity to Move": "要移动的实体",
  "This entity will be moved to mimic the motions of Entity to Measure.": "此实体将被移动以模仿要测量的实体的动作。",
  "Movement Reference": "移动参考",
  "The Entity to Move will move relative to this entity.": "要移动的实体将相对于此实体移动。",
  "Movement scale": "移动缩放",
  "A scale to divide the measured movements by, before applying those movements to the Entity to Move. 1 = target entity moves as much as the measured entity, 2 = target entity moves half as far as the measured entity, and 0.5 = target entity moves twice as far as the measured entity.": "在将测量到的移动应用到要移动的实体之前，用于除以这些移动的缩放值。1 = 目标实体的移动量与被测实体相同，2 = 目标实体的移动量为被测实体的一半，0.5 = 目标实体的移动量为被测实体的两倍。",
  "Measurement Type": "测量类型",
  "Eye position": "眼睛位置",
  "Set the Entity to Measure, whose movement should be measured.": "设置要测量的实体，即应测量其移动的实体。",
  "Set the Measure Reference entity.": "设置测量参考实体。",
  "Set the Entity to Move, which will be moved to mimic the measured entity.": "设置要移动的实体，该实体将被移动以模仿被测实体。",
  "Set the Movement Reference entity.": "设置移动参考实体。",
  "Set the scale to divide the measured movements by.": "设置用于除以测量移动量的缩放值。",
  "Enable the logic_measure_movement.": "启用 logic_measure_movement。",
  "Disable the logic_measure_movement.": "禁用 logic_measure_movement。",
  "Start the intro credits rolling.": "开始滚动片头制作人员名单。",
  "Start the outro credits rolling.": "开始滚动片尾制作人员名单。",
  "Show the HL2 logo.": "显示 HL2 标志。",
  "Fired when the credits having finished rolling.": "当制作人员名单滚动完毕时触发。",
  "Camera Name": "相机名称",
  "Used as the name of the directory to store screenshots from this camera. Must be unique within the level.": "用作存储此相机截图的目录名称。必须在关卡内唯一。",
  "Camera FOV": "相机视野",
  "FOV of this camera.": "此相机的视野。",
  "Fired when a Portal player initiates slow time.": "当传送门玩家发起时间减缓时触发。",
  "Fired when a Portal player stops slowing time.": "当传送门玩家停止减缓时间时触发。",
  "Fired when the player turns on his flashlight. This output has the value of how much energy the player had when this happened [0..1].": "当玩家打开手电筒时触发。此输出的值为事件发生时玩家所拥有的能量 [0..1]。",
  "Fired when the player turns off his flashlight. This output has the value of how much energy the player had when this happened [0..1].": "当玩家关闭手电筒时触发。此输出的值为事件发生时玩家所拥有的能量 [0..1]。",
  "Requests the current player's health from the proxy. This will fire the PlayerHealth output with the value.": "从代理请求当前玩家的生命值。这将触发 PlayerHealth 输出并携带该值。",
  "The player's current health value.": "玩家当前的生命值。",
  "Player fired an AR2 combine ball that didn't kill any enemies.": "玩家发射了一颗未击杀任何敌人的 AR2 联合军能量球。",
  "Puts the player's flashlight in slow-power-drain mode (for Episodic darkness)": "将玩家的手电筒置于缓慢耗电模式（用于资料片黑暗场景）",
  "Puts the player's flashlight to default power drain": "将玩家的手电筒恢复为默认耗电",
  "Sets the player's health to this value.": "将玩家的生命值设置为该值。",
  "Request the ammo state of the player. It will fire PlayerHasAmmo or PlayerHasNoAmmo outputs.": "请求玩家的弹药状态。它将触发 PlayerHasAmmo 或 PlayerHasNoAmmo 输出。",
  "Fired by request if the player has any ammo.": "应请求触发，当玩家有任何弹药时。",
  "Fired by request if the player doesn't have any ammo.": "应请求触发，当玩家没有任何弹药时。",
  "Fires when the player dies.": "当玩家死亡时触发。",
  "Lowers the players weapon.": "放下玩家的武器。",
  "Cause player to take less damage from physics objects, and never more than 30 points from any individual strike.": "使玩家受到的物理物体伤害降低，且每次撞击的伤害绝不超过 30 点。",
  "Undo effects of EnableCappedPhysicsDamage": "撤销 EnableCappedPhysicsDamage 的效果",
  "Set the entity that the HUD locator should track. (Usually a vehicle)": "设置 HUD 定位器应追踪的实体。（通常是载具）",
  "Decal Material": "贴花材质",
  "Decal Width": "贴花宽度",
  "Decal Height": "贴花高度",
  "Decal Depth": "贴花深度",
  "Sequence": "序列",
  "Render Order": "渲染顺序",
  "Project on World": "投影到世界",
  "Project on Characters": "投影到角色",
  "Project on Water": "投影到水面",
  "Name of statistic counter": "统计计数器名称",
  "Changes name of statistic counter": "更改统计计数器名称",
  "Increments named statistic counter by specified value": "将指定的统计计数器增加指定值",
  "No Dynamic Light": "无动态光源",
  "Start rotation on": "开始旋转",
  "No Fog": "无雾",
  "The maximum rotation speed of the spotlight, in degrees per second.": "聚光灯的最大旋转速度，单位为度/秒。",
  "Spotlight Length": "聚光灯长度",
  "Length of the spotlight beam.": "聚光灯光束的长度。",
  "Spotlight Width": "聚光灯宽度",
  "Width of the spotlight beam.": "聚光灯光束的宽度。",
  "Turn the spotlight on.": "打开聚光灯。",
  "Turn the spotlight off": "关闭聚光灯",
  "Start the rotator rotating.": "开始旋转。",
  "Reverse the direction of rotation of the rotator.": "反转旋转器的旋转方向。",
  "Fires when light turns on.": "当灯亮起时触发。",
  "Fires when light turns off.": "当灯熄灭时触发。",
  "Fix Up Name": "修正名称",
  "The name that all entities will be fixed up with based upon the fix up style.": "根据修正样式，所有实体将被修正为的名称。",
  "VMAP Filename": "VMAP 文件名",
  "This indicates a map file relative to the map's file name": "这表示相对于地图文件名的地图文件",
  "Entity Name Fix Up": "实体名称修正",
  "Fixup style for instanced entity names.  Uses the 'Fix Up Name' field.": "实例化实体名称的修正样式。使用“修正名称”字段。",
  "Prefix": "前缀",
  "Postfix": "后缀",
  "Replace": "替换",
  "This is a replacement parameter.  It goes in the form of $variable value.  All entities inside of that instance that have $variable somewhere will be replaced with the value contents.  Example: $color 255 0 0": "这是一个替换参数。格式为 $variable value。该实例内所有在某处含有 $variable 的实体都会被替换为该值的内容。示例：$color 255 0 0",
  "Replace Key": "替换键",
  "Unique name so that messages with the same key will replace each other.": "唯一名称，使具有相同键的消息相互替换。",
  "The entity to show this hint on top of. The entity used must exist on the client, info_target_instructor_hint can be parented to server only entities for this purpose.": "要在其上方显示此提示的实体。所使用的实体必须存在于客户端，为此可将 info_target_instructor_hint 父级绑定到仅存在于服务器端的实体上。",
  "Positioning": "定位方式",
  "Either show at the position of the Target Entity. Or show the hint directly on the hud at a fixed position.": "要么显示在目标实体的位置，要么直接在 HUD 的固定位置显示提示。",
  "Follow the Target Entity": "跟随目标实体",
  "Show on the hud": "显示在 HUD 上",
  "Allow invisible target": "允许不可见目标",
  "Do we allow the hint to follow entites with nodraw set?": "是否允许提示跟随设置了 nodraw 的实体？",
  "End immediately on nodraw": "nodraw 时立即结束",
  "Caption": "字幕文本",
  "The text of your hint.": "提示的文本。",
  "Activator Caption": "激活者字幕文本",
  "The text of your hint shown to only the activating player.": "仅显示给激活玩家的提示文本。",
  "Caption Color": "字幕文本颜色",
  "The color of the caption text": "字幕文本的颜色",
  "Force caption": "强制显示字幕",
  "Do we show the caption text even if the hint is occluded by a wall?": "即使提示被墙壁遮挡，是否也显示字幕文本？",
  "Show when occluded": "被遮挡时显示",
  "Onscreen Icon": "屏幕内图标",
  "The icon to use when the hint is within the player's view.": "提示位于玩家视野内时使用的图标。",
  "show key bindings": "显示按键绑定",
  "Offscreen Icon": "屏幕外图标",
  "The icon to use when the hint is outside the player's view.": "提示位于玩家视野外时使用的图标。",
  "Show offscreen": "屏幕外时显示",
  "When the hint is offscreen, do we show an icon and arrow?": "当提示在屏幕外时，是否显示图标和箭头？",
  "Show": "显示",
  "Don't show": "不显示",
  "Bound Command": "绑定的命令",
  "If using 'show key bindings' for the onscreen icon, this field should be the command we want to show bindings for": "如果屏幕内图标使用“显示按键绑定”，则此字段应为要显示其绑定的命令",
  "Icon Height Offset": "图标高度偏移",
  "A height offset from the target entity's origin to display the hint": "从目标实体原点算起用于显示提示的高度偏移",
  "Size Pulsing": "大小脉动",
  "The icon size can pulsate": "图标大小可以脉动",
  "No Pulse": "无脉动",
  "Urgent Pulse": "紧急脉动",
  "Alpha Pulsing": "透明度脉动",
  "The icon alpha can pulsate": "图标透明度可以脉动",
  "Shaking": "抖动",
  "The icon can shake": "图标可以抖动",
  "No Shaking": "无抖动",
  "Narrow Shake": "窄幅抖动",
  "Wide Shake": "宽幅抖动",
  "Only Local Player": "仅本地玩家",
  "The hint will only be shown to the local player.": "此提示仅显示给本地玩家。",
  "The automatic timeout for the hint. 0 will persist until stopped with EndHint.": "提示的自动超时时间。0 表示持续显示，直到使用 EndHint 停止。",
  "Display Range": "显示范围",
  "The visible range of the hint. 0 will show it at any distance.": "提示的可见范围。0 表示在任何距离都显示。",
  "Show on First Sight": "首次看到时显示",
  "When the player first sees it, it will automatically show for them.": "当玩家首次看到它时，将自动为其显示。",
  "Start showing the hint. If an entity name is passed as a parameter, the hint is shown only to that entity.": "开始显示提示。如果传入实体名称作为参数，则提示仅显示给该实体。",
  "Stop showing the hint if it hasn't already timed out.": "如果提示尚未超时，则停止显示。",
  "Sound to play when the lesson starts": "课程开始时播放的声音",
  "Layout Type": "布局类型",
  "Panorama Layout file to be used.  Generic Hand, World or Custom.  Custom requires specifying .xml file": "要使用的 Panorama 布局文件。通用手部、世界或自定义。自定义需要指定 .xml 文件",
  "Custom": "自定义",
  "Custom Layout File": "自定义布局文件",
  "Panel Attach Type": "面板附加类型",
  "Attach Type for the Panorama Panel": "Panorama 面板的附加类型",
  "Dominant Hand": "主手",
  "Off Hand": "副手",
  "Entity": "实体",
  "HMD": "头戴显示器（HMD）",
  "Large Entity": "大型实体",
  "The entity to show this hint on top of. The entity used must exist on the client, info_target_instructor_hint can be parented to server only entities for this purpose. Set hint_vr_panel_type": "要在其上方显示此提示的实体。所使用的实体必须存在于客户端，为此可将 info_target_instructor_hint 父级绑定到仅存在于服务器端的实体上。设置 hint_vr_panel_type",
  "Height Offset": "高度偏移",
  "Height offset from the target entities root the panel should be displayed at.": "面板应在目标实体根部之上的高度偏移处显示。",
  "Lesson Name": "课程名称",
  "Name of the lesson to fire.  Matches name in instructor_lessons.txt.": "要触发的课程名称。与 instructor_lessons.txt 中的名称匹配。",
  "Entity to attach this hint to if required by lesson": "如果课程需要，此提示要附加到的实体",
  "Set the player that should receive this hint to the activator of this input. Only necessary to use this if the player isn't the activator of the ShowHint input. You shouldn't use !player for this, because that only works in singleplayer, and the point of this is to handle multiple players. Instead, fire this input from an output of the entity that the target player activated to initiate the series of events that caused you to want to show them this hint.": "将应接收此提示的玩家设置为此输入的激活者。仅当玩家不是 ShowHint 输入的激活者时才需要使用此输入。不应为此使用 !player，因为它仅在单人游戏中有效，而此功能的意义在于处理多个玩家。应改为从目标玩家激活的实体的输出触发此输入，该实体引发了使你想向其显示此提示的一系列事件。",
  "Desired timescale.": "期望的时间缩放。",
  "Time scale to blend towards, this is a multiplicative value where 1.0 is normal time, 0.5 is half speed, 2.0 is double speed.": "要过渡到的时间缩放，这是一个乘数值，其中 1.0 为正常时间，0.5 为半速，2.0 为双倍速。",
  "Acceleration per second": "每秒加速度",
  "How quickly the change per second goes up to the max.": "每秒变化速度提升到最大值的快慢。",
  "Minimum blend per second": "每秒最小过渡量",
  "Minimum change per second when blending from the current timescale to the desired.": "从当前时间缩放过渡到期望值时的每秒最小变化量。",
  "Perframe delta multiplier": "每帧增量倍数",
  "The per frame delta between desired and current is multiplied by this to get the maximum change per second.": "期望值与当前值之间的每帧增量乘以该值即得到每秒最大变化量。",
  "Start blending to the desired timescale.": "开始过渡到期望的时间缩放。",
  "Stop and blend back to the default timescale (1.0f).": "停止并过渡回默认时间缩放 (1.0f)。",
  "Reset immediately to normal timescale (1.0f).": "立即重置为正常时间缩放 (1.0f)。",
