  "Master Fog Controller": "主雾控制器",
  "Use this as the active fog if there are more than one": "如果存在多个，则将此作为活动雾",
  "Fog strength": "雾强度",
  "Technically the scattering value. Higher values make denser fog.": "技术上是散射值。数值越高雾越浓。",
  "Tint color for fog.": "雾的着色颜色。",
  "Draw distance": "绘制距离",
  "Maximum distance to draw fog - WARNING! Changing from default will make fog blockier.": "绘制雾的最大距离 - 警告！偏离默认值会使雾更呈块状。",
  "Resolution": "分辨率",
  "Volume Depth": "体积深度",
  "Sets the number of slices in the fog volume.  Increasing from default (128) will increase resolution at the expense of GPU time and memory": "设置雾体积中的切片数量。从默认值 (128) 增加会提高分辨率，但会消耗更多 GPU 时间和内存",
  "Resolution at Camera": "相机处分辨率",
  "Thickness of the first slice in the volume at the camera.  The remaining slices will be warped to maintain this resolution as the draw distance is increased": "体积中相机处第一个切片的厚度。随着绘制距离增加，其余切片将被变形以保持此分辨率",
  "Fade-in start": "淡入起点",
  "Distance from the eye at which fog starts to fade in.": "距眼睛多远处雾开始淡入。",
  "Fade-in end": "淡入终点",
  "Distance from the eye at which fog finishes fading in and is at full strength.": "距眼睛多远处雾完成淡入并达到全强度。",
  "Fade time": "淡入淡出时间",
  "Sets fade in or out time (in seconds).": "设置淡入或淡出时间（秒）。",
  "Indirect Lighting": "间接光照",
