  "Box Size": "盒体大小",
  "Mode": "模式",
  "Should the box hide objects inside or outside of its bounds. If inside is selected, any objects fully inside the box will be hidden. If outside is selected, all active visibility boxes are considered, and objects not intersecting any visibility boxes will be hidden.": "盒体应隐藏其边界内还是边界外的对象。如果选择内部，则完全位于盒体内的任何对象都将被隐藏。如果选择外部，则会考虑所有活动的可见性盒体，不与任何可见性盒体相交的对象将被隐藏。",
  "Hide objects inside": "隐藏内部对象",
  "Hide objects outside": "隐藏外部对象",
  "Limit to Prefab": "限制为 Prefab",
  "Limit the box to culling triangles objects in the prefab to which it belongs.": "将盒体限制为剔除其所属 Prefab 中对象的三角形。",
  "Target Objects": "目标对象",
  "Limit the box to culling triangles from the specified target objects.": "将盒体限制为剔除指定目标对象的三角形。",
  "Apply To": "应用于",
  "Spcifies the type of geometry which can be culled by the box": "指定盒体可剔除的几何体类型",
  "Everything": "全部",
  "Only Static Props": "仅静态模型",
  "Only World Geometry": "仅世界几何体",
  "Node Name": "节点名称",
  "A name to assign to the node that can be used to refer to the node on the path to toggle pinning on specific path nodes via entity I/O.": "分配给节点的名称，可用于在路径上引用该节点，以通过实体 I/O 切换特定路径节点的固定。",
  "Radius Scale": "半径缩放",
  "Radius multiplier value": "半径乘数值",
  "Color Tint": "颜色着色",
  "Pin Enabled": "固定已启用",
  "If enabled, the rope simulation treats this node a locaiton to which the rope is attached.": "如果启用，绳索模拟会将此节点视为绳索的附着位置。",
  "Will the particle system be visible on spawn": "粒子系统在生成时是否可见",
  "Max Time To Simulate": "最大模拟时间",
  "Max number of seconds to run the particle simulation for. A value of 0 means run the simulation indefinitely.": "运行粒子模拟的最大秒数。值为 0 表示无限期运行模拟。",
  "Spacing": "间距",
  "Units between the individual partcles in the rope simulation.": "绳索模拟中各粒子之间的单位距离。",
  "Controls the amount the rope will drop between path nodes. Generally between 0.0 and 1.0, the value is a multiplier on the distance that particles on path can seperate relative to their initial distance.": "控制绳索在路径节点之间的下垂量。通常在 0.0 到 1.0 之间，该值是路径上的粒子相对其初始距离可分离的距离的乘数。",
  "Radius of the rope.": "绳索的半径。",
  "Create Static Collision": "创建静态碰撞",
  "Create a static physics representation of the path. Note the collision is generated based on the path, movement applied by the particle system will not be included.": "创建路径的静态物理表示。注意碰撞是根据路径生成的，粒子系统施加的移动不会包含在内。",
  "Surface Properties": "表面属性",
  "Surface properties to apply to the static collision if generated": "如果生成了静态碰撞，要应用到其上的表面属性",
  "Set the radius parameter provided the particle system": "设置提供给粒子系统的半径参数",
  "Set the slack parameter which may be used by the particle system to determine how much the rope droops.": "设置松弛参数，粒子系统可用它来确定绳索的下垂程度。",
  "Disable the contraint which pins a particle to the specified path node.": "禁用将粒子固定到指定路径节点的约束。",
  "Secondary Material": "次级材质",
  "Optional secondary material, can be selected using Skin(1)": "可选的次级材质，可通过 Skin(1) 选择",
  "Frequency of the Haptic pulse (0 - 100)": "触觉脉冲的频率（0 - 100）",
  "Amplitude": "振幅",
  "Amplitude of haptic pulse (0.0 - 1.0)": "触觉脉冲的振幅（0.0 - 1.0）",
  "Duration of the haptic pulse in seconds": "触觉脉冲的持续时间（秒）",
  "Trigger the relay with an input that has the player as activator and HandID as value": "以玩家为激活者、HandID 为值的输入触发中继器",
  "Fired when the map was loaded in commentary mode.": "当地图以解说模式加载时触发。",
  "Fired when commentary mode was turned on mid-way through a map.": "当解说模式在地图进行过程中被开启时触发。",
  "Model to use.": "要使用的模型。",
  "Commentary Audio": "解说音频",
  "Name of the sound event that contains the commentary audio for this node.": "包含此节点解说音频的声音事件名称。",
  "Title": "标题",
  "Title of this commentary node.": "此解说节点的标题。",
  "Speaker(s) Names": "说话者姓名",
  "Name(s) of the speaker(s) in the commentary audio for this node.": "此节点解说音频中说话者的姓名。",
  "The unique number of this node in the current level. If left at 0, the first unused Node ID will be calculated at runtime.": "此节点在当前关卡中的唯一编号。如果保持为 0，将在运行时计算第一个未使用的节点 ID。",
  "Pre Commands": "前置命令",
  "A set of console commands, separated by semi-colon, that should be issued when this node starts playing.": "一组以分号分隔的控制台命令，在此节点开始播放时应执行。",
  "Post Commands": "后置命令",
  "A set of console commands, separated by semi-colon, that should be issued when this node stops playing (due to completion or interruption).": "一组以分号分隔的控制台命令，在此节点停止播放（因完成或中断）时应执行。",
  "View Target Entity": "视图目标实体",
  "Optional name of an entity that the player's view will be forced to look at when listening to this node.": "可选实体名称，收听此节点时玩家视角将被强制看向它。",
  "View Origin Entity": "视图原点实体",
  "Optional name of an entity that the player's view should move to when listening to this node.": "可选实体名称，收听此节点时玩家视角应移动到它。",
  "Teleport Target": "传送目标",
  "Teleport position associated with this node. If players use Mouse2 to jump to the next node, they'll be moved to that node's corresponding teleport position.": "与此节点关联的传送位置。如果玩家使用鼠标右键跳到下一个节点，他们将被移动到该节点对应的传送位置。",
  "Prevent Movement?": "禁止移动？",
  "If set, the player will be unable to move while this node is playing.": "如果设置，玩家在此节点播放期间将无法移动。",
  "Start Disabled?": "起始为禁用？",
  "If set, this node will be disabled on startup, and will require the Enable input to be fired before it will be visible to the player.": "如果设置，此节点在启动时将被禁用，需要触发 Enable 输入后才会对玩家可见。",
  "Forces a node to start playing.": "强制节点开始播放。",
  "Forces a node to start playing, and prevents the player from stopping the playback until it has completed.": "强制节点开始播放，并防止玩家在播放完成前停止播放。",
  "Enable this node, making it visible to the player.": "启用此节点，使其对玩家可见。",
  "Disable this node, making it invisible to the player.": "禁用此节点，使其对玩家不可见。",
  "Set a new origin for this commentary node. If it's not in use, it'll teleport to this location immediately. If it's currently being listened to, it'll return to this location when it finishes playing.": "为此解说节点设置新原点。如果它未被使用，将立即传送到此位置。如果它当前正被收听，将在播放结束后返回此位置。",
  "Fired when this node starts playback.": "当此节点开始播放时触发。",
  "Fired when this node stops playback.": "当此节点停止播放时触发。",
  "If multiple volumes contain an object, the highest priority volume takes precedence.": "如果多个体积包含同一对象，则优先级最高的体积生效。",
  "Lowest": "最低",
  "Highest": "最高",
  "Set color": "设置颜色",
  "Set brightness": "设置亮度",
  "Lightprobes": "光照探针",
  "Light Probe Texture": "光照探针纹理",
  "Name of the light probe texture": "光照探针纹理的名称",
  "Bounds": "边界",
  "Voxel Size": "体素大小",
  "Very High Resolution": "超高分辨率",
  "High Resolution": "高分辨率",
  "Medium Resolution": "中分辨率",
  "Low Resolution": "低分辨率",
  "Ignore Unreachable Space": "忽略不可到达空间",
  "Ignore Voxelized Solid Space": "忽略体素化的实体空间",
  "Calculate Diffuse Lighting Using Cubemap": "使用立方体贴图计算漫反射光照",
  "Moveable": "可移动",
  "Can be moved, parented, enabled, or disabled at runtime.": "可在运行时移动、父级绑定、启用或禁用。",
  "Storage": "存储",
  "AmbientCube RGBM8888 Uncompressed": "AmbientCube RGBM8888 未压缩",
  "AmbientCube RGBMDXT5 Compressed": "AmbientCube RGBMDXT5 压缩",
  "Cubemap": "立方体贴图",
  "Cubemap Texture": "立方体贴图纹理",
  "Name of the cubemap texture": "立方体贴图纹理的名称",
  "Bake Near Z": "烘焙近裁剪面",
  "Near clip plane used for the camera when baking the cube map": "烘焙立方体贴图时相机使用的近裁剪面",
  "Bake Far Z": "烘焙远裁剪面",
  "Far clip plane used for the camera when baking the cube map": "烘焙立方体贴图时相机使用的远裁剪面",
  "Box Projection Mins": "盒体投影最小值",
  "Box Projection Maxs": "盒体投影最大值",
  "Edge Fade Dist": "边缘淡出距离",
  "Turn on the light.": "打开灯。",
  "Turn off the light.": "关闭灯。",
  "Toggle the light.": "切换灯。",
  "Set the light's color.": "设置灯的颜色。",
  "Set the light's color temperature in Kelvin.": "设置灯的色温（开尔文）。",
  "Set the light's brightness in EV.": "设置灯的亮度（EV）。",
  "Set the light's brightness multiplier, which defaults to 1.": "设置灯的亮度倍数，默认为 1。",
  "',' separated list of styles from light_styles.vdata to play in sequence. The last entry will loop. The last style can be 'on'/'off' to enable/disable the light with no light style.": "以“,”分隔的 light_styles.vdata 中样式的列表，将按顺序播放。最后一项将循环。最后一个样式可以是 'on'/'off'，以在无灯光样式的情况下启用/禁用灯。",
  "Set the fog strength.": "设置雾强度。",
  "Set the fog multiplier, which defaults to 1.": "设置雾倍数，默认为 1。",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 0.": "当当前灯光样式播放由“样式输出事件 0”指定类型的事件时触发。",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 1.": "当当前灯光样式播放由“样式输出事件 1”指定类型的事件时触发。",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 2.": "当当前灯光样式播放由“样式输出事件 2”指定类型的事件时触发。",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 3.": "当当前灯光样式播放由“样式输出事件 3”指定类型的事件时触发。",
  "How direct lighting should be represented": "直接光照应如何表现",
  "If disabled, direct lighting will not render into cubemaps. Not that this only works when Direct Lighting Type is set to Stationary or Dynamic.": "如果禁用，直接光照将不会渲染到立方体贴图中。注意这仅在“直接光照类型”设置为固定或动态时有效。",
  "Dynamic & Baked": "动态与烘焙",
  "Shadow Softness / Sun Spread Angle": "阴影柔和度 / 太阳扩散角度",
  "Defines the shadow softness. Higher numbers produce more diffuse/softer shadows. 1 is a good starting value.": "定义阴影柔和度。数值越高产生越漫射/越柔和的阴影。1 是一个不错的起始值。",
  "Priority for the lights shadowmap": "灯光阴影贴图的优先级",
  "Cascade Shadow Maps": "级联阴影贴图",
  "Shadow Near Clip Plane": "阴影近裁剪面",
  "Distance for near clip plane for shadow map": "阴影贴图近裁剪面的距离",
  "Cascade Count": "级联数量",
  "Number of shadow cascades to use.": "要使用的阴影级联数量。",
  "Cascade Distance 0": "级联距离 0",
  "Cascade Distance 1": "级联距离 1",
  "Cascade Distance 2": "级联距离 2",
  "Cascade Distance 3": "级联距离 3",
  "Cascade Resolution 0": "级联分辨率 0",
  "Cascade Resolution 1": "级联分辨率 1",
  "Cascade Resolution 2": "级联分辨率 2",
  "Cascade Resolution 3": "级联分辨率 3",
  "Cascade Cross Fade Size": "级联交叉淡入淡出大小",
  "Size of the region at the edge of the cascade that will be crossfaded to the next (to hide resolution changes)": "级联边缘将被交叉淡入淡出到下一级联的区域大小（用于隐藏分辨率变化）",
  "Cascade Distance Fade Out Size": "级联距离淡出大小",
  "Size of the region where shadows are faded out at the end of the cascades": "级联末端阴影淡出的区域大小",
  "Render Static Objects To Cascades": "将静态对象渲染到级联",
  "Renders static objects to cascades <= this cascade when using mixed shadows (Stationary / Indexed lights)": "使用混合阴影（固定/索引光源）时，将静态对象渲染到 <= 此级联的级联中",
  "Sky": "天空",
  "Simple Sky Color": "简单天空颜色",
  "Uses a flat color for the sky lighting. Can be a good starting point but you can get much higher quality lighting by using an IBL/env_sky.": "使用单一纯色作为天空光照。可以作为不错的起点，但使用 IBL/env_sky 可以获得质量高得多的光照。",
  "Simple Sky Intensity": "简单天空强度",
  "Scales the intensity of the Simple Sky Color.": "缩放简单天空颜色的强度。",
  "IBL Sky Source": "IBL 天空来源",
  "Here you can assign any env_sky entity for sky lighting. env_sky supports HDR/EXR high dynamic range lat-long/h-cross/v-cross skybox images is recommended for sky lighting for the best quality results. If you want to use a custom env_sky that is explicitly for sky lighting, you can use an env_sky with 'Start Disabled'.": "在此可为天空光照指定任意 env_sky 实体。env_sky 支持 HDR/EXR 高动态范围的经纬/h-cross/v-cross 天空盒图像，推荐用于天空光照以获得最佳质量效果。如果要使用专门用于天空光照的自定义 env_sky，可以使用带有“起始为禁用”的 env_sky。",
  "IBL Sky Scale": "IBL 天空缩放",
  "Scale value for IBL intensity fine-tuning": "用于 IBL 强度微调的缩放值",
  "Sky Indirect Light Multiplier": "天空间接光倍数",
  "Sky Ground Albedo": "天空地面反照率",
  "This is the color of the virtual ground plane used for skybox IBL / color ambient lighting": "这是用于天空盒 IBL / 颜色环境光照的虚拟地面的颜色",
  "IBL Sky Minimum Brightness Threshold": "IBL 天空最小亮度阈值",
  "This can be used to prevent the sun in your env_sky/IBL from casting light into your scene, so you can instead use a light_environment; This sets a brightness threshold beyond which light from the IBL is clamped.": "这可用于防止 env_sky/IBL 中的太阳向场景投射光，以便改用 light_environment；它设置一个亮度阈值，超过该阈值的 IBL 光将被钳制。",
  "Ambient Occlusion": "环境光遮蔽",
  "Ambient Occlusion Max Distance": "环境光遮蔽最大距离",
  "Ambient Occlusion Fully Occluded Fraction": "环境光遮蔽完全遮蔽比例",
  "Ambient Occlusion Exponent": "环境光遮蔽指数",
  "Distance range for light. 0=infinite": "光照的距离范围。0=无限",
  "Changes the entity's parent in the movement hierarchy.": "更改实体在移动层级中的父级。",
  "Fired when the entity is killed and removed from the game.": "当实体被杀死并从游戏中移除时触发。",
  "Sets whether the light is enabled (takes parameter of 0 or 1)": "设置灯是否启用（参数为 0 或 1）",
  "Set light color": "设置灯光颜色",
  "Set light brightness": "设置灯光亮度",
  "Set appearance 0=Normal 1=Flicker A, 2=Slow, strong pulse 3=Candle A ...": "设置外观 0=正常 1=闪烁 A，2=缓慢强脉冲 3=烛光 A ...",
  "Markup Groups": "标记组",
  "Ref Pos": "参考位置",
  "Reference position.": "参考位置。",
  "Use Reference Position": "使用参考位置",
  "Use the reference position when calculating validity of query positions.": "在计算查询位置的有效性时使用参考位置。",
  "Auto Group By Volume": "按体积自动分组",
  "Automatically add any markup entities to this group that overlap this volume": "自动将与此体积重叠的任何标记实体添加到此组",
  "Auto Group Other Groups": "自动组包含其他组",
  "When auto-grouping (by prefab or by volume), include other markup_group entities in this group. By default this does not happen.": "自动分组时（按 Prefab 或按体积），将其他 markup_group 实体包含在此组中。默认情况下不会这样做。",
