  "Cloth Effect": "布料效果",
  "Auto start cloth effect": "自动启动布料效果",
  "Offset for the influence point (in the space of the model or attachment)": "影响点的偏移（在模型或附加点的空间中）",
  "Attachment Point": "附加点",
  "Offset the influence point from the named attachment rather than the root of the model": "将影响点相对于指定附加点而非模型根节点进行偏移",
  "Center on Damage Point": "以伤害点为中心",
  "Center the influence point (will ignore cause attachment to be ignored, but still honor offset)": "将影响点居中（将忽略原因附加点，但仍遵循偏移）",
  "Limit to piece": "限定到碎片",
  "Limit this effect to the named piece": "将此效果限定到指定碎片",
  "Burst Scale": "爆裂强度",
  "Velocity added to each piece (radially away from the influence point)": "添加到每个碎片的速度（沿远离影响点的径向）",
  "Burst Randomize": "爆裂随机化",
  "Magnitude of random vector that will be added to the burst velocity": "将添加到爆裂速度的随机向量大小",
  "Flip Scale": "翻转强度",
  "Angular velocity added to each piece (Positive value will cause pieces to flip 'head-first' away from the influence point, negative is 'feet-first')": "添加到每个碎片的角速度（正值使碎片“头朝前”远离影响点翻转，负值为“脚朝前”）",
  "Flip Randomize": "翻转随机化",
  "Largest possible value that will be randomly added/removed to Flip Scale for each piece": "每个碎片将被随机加/减到翻转强度上的最大可能值",
  "Twist Scale": "扭转强度",
  "Angular velocity added to each piece": "添加到每个碎片的角速度",
  "Twist Randomize": "扭转随机化",
  "Largest possible value that will be randomly added/removed to Twist Scale for each piece": "每个碎片将被随机加/减到扭转强度上的最大可能值",
  "Material group name to switch to": "要切换到的材质组名称",
  "If set, only apply this command to a particular piece": "若设置，此命令仅应用于特定碎片",
  "Limit to instances using material group": "限定到使用该材质组的实例",
  "If set, only apply this command if the parent model had a particular materialgroup active": "若设置，仅当父模型启用了特定材质组时才应用此命令",
  "Part Name Match Required": "需要匹配部件名称",
  "If set, the particle system will only be created if the break matches the specified part name": "若设置，仅当断裂匹配指定部件名称时才会创建粒子系统",
  "Part Name": "部件名称",
  "(Optional) part name this is relevant to, for filtering": "（可选）相关的部件名称，用于筛选",
  "Attachment Entity": "附加实体",
  "(Optional) which entity to attach to, if the attachment name is also specified.": "（可选）要附加到的实体，如果同时指定了附加点名称。",
  "Original Entity": "原始实体",
  "First Spawned Breakpiece": "首个生成的碎片",
  "Attachment Name": "附加点名称",
  "(Optional) attachment to attach this particle to.": "（可选）此粒子要附加到的附加点。",
  "CP 0 Model": "控制点 0 模型",
  "(Optional) Set the particle control point #0 to the specified model": "（可选）将粒子控制点 #0 设为指定模型",
  "CP 0 Snapshot": "控制点 0 快照",
  "(Optional) Set the particle control point #0 to the specified snapshot": "（可选）将粒子控制点 #0 设为指定快照",
  "CP To Set To Skin": "设为皮肤的控制点",
  "(Optional) Set this control point to the parent model's active materialgroup name": "（可选）将此控制点设为父模型当前启用的材质组名称",
  "CP To Set To Damage Position": "设为伤害位置的控制点",
  "(Optional) Set this control point the position of the break damage": "（可选）将此控制点设为断裂伤害的位置",
  "CP To Set To Damage Direction": "设为伤害方向的控制点",
  "(Optional) Set this control point the direction of the break damage": "（可选）将此控制点设为断裂伤害的方向",
  "CP To Set To Status Effect": "设为状态效果的控制点",
  "(Optional) Set this control point to pass through any status effects from the parent object.": "（可选）将此控制点设为传递父对象的任何状态效果。",
  "CP To Set To Additional Data": "设为附加数据的控制点",
  "(Optional) Add additional data to a control Point from this break command.": "（可选）从此断裂命令向控制点添加附加数据。",
  "additional vector data x y z": "附加向量数据 x y z",
  "Break Radius": "断裂半径",
  "Radius within which we break nested pieces": "在其范围内断裂嵌套碎片的半径",
  "Parent Piece": "父碎片",
  "Child Piece": "子碎片",
  "Anchor Position (relative to model)": "锚点位置（相对于模型）",
  "Anchor Angles (relative to model)": "锚点角度（相对于模型）",
  "Min Angle": "最小角度",
  "Max Angle": "最大角度",
  "Min Offset": "最小偏移",
  "Max Offset": "最大偏移",
  "Use Block Solver": "使用块求解器",
  "Uses a slower, but higher quality, solver method": "使用较慢但质量更高的求解方法",
  "Stage Health": "阶段生命值",
  "How much health this stage has before it breaks (-1 to disable damage)": "此阶段在断裂前拥有的生命值（-1 表示免受伤害）",
  "+Stage Start": "+阶段开始",
  "When this stage starts, optionally set a materialgroup": "此阶段开始时，可选地设置一个材质组",
  "Set Bodygroup?": "设置身体组？",
  "When this stage is entered, set a bodygroup?": "进入此阶段时，是否设置身体组？",
  "Stage Bodygroup": "阶段身体组",
  "Stage Bodygroup Choice": "阶段身体组选项",
  "Sequence Name": "序列名称",
  "Play this sequence when the stage starts": "阶段开始时播放此序列",
  "Sequence Loops?": "序列是否循环？",
  "Should the sequence loop?": "该序列是否循环播放？",
  "+Stage End": "+阶段结束",
  "Spawn Breakpices?": "生成碎片？",
  "Breakpiece Substring": "碎片子字符串",
  "Broken Particle Effect": "断裂粒子效果",
  "When this stage breaks, spawn this particle": "此阶段断裂时，生成此粒子",
  "Particle Configuration Name": "粒子配置名称",
  "Broken Sound": "断裂声音",
  "When this stage breaks, play this sound": "此阶段断裂时，播放此声音",
  "Name of the modifier to add": "要添加的修改器名称",
  "How long should the modifier last, in seconds? (-1: Infinite)": "修改器应持续多久（秒）？（-1：无限）",
  "Postprocessing Resource Name": "后处理资源名称",
  "Fade Time": "淡入时间",
  "Time to fade to these postprocessing settings in seconds": "淡入到这些后处理设置所需的时间（秒）",
  "Exposure Control": "曝光控制",
  "Use exposure settings for this volume?": "此体积是否使用曝光设置？",
  "Min Exposure Brightness": "最小曝光亮度",
  "Minimum autoexposure scale": "最小自动曝光缩放",
  "Max Exposure Brightness": "最大曝光亮度",
  "Maximum autoexposure scale": "最大自动曝光缩放",
  "Exposure Compensation": "曝光补偿",
  "Number of stops to adjust auto-exposure by": "自动曝光调整的档位数",
  "Exposure Adjustment Speed Up": "曝光上调速度",
  "Exposure Adjustment Speed Down": "曝光下调速度",
  "Range between target exposure and current exposure where we switch to logarithmic approach": "目标曝光与当前曝光之间切换为对数逼近的区间",
  "Master Volume": "主体积",
  "Is this volume active by default even when not touched by the player? (Master)": "即使玩家未接触时此体积是否默认激活？（主体积）",
  "Playable Maps": "可玩地图",
  "A list of maps in your addon that will be presented to the player.<br>The format of entries is identical to the 'map' console command, ie. for a map <font color='cyan'><tt>maps/my_map.vmap</tt></font> you should add <font color='cyan'><tt>my_map</tt></font>": "在附加包中呈现给玩家的地图列表。<br>条目格式与 'map' 控制台命令相同，例如地图 <font color='cyan'><tt>maps/my_map.vmap</tt></font> 应添加 <font color='cyan'><tt>my_map</tt></font>",
  "Event": "事件",
  "Fire At (seconds)": "触发时间（秒）",
  "Dimmer": "调光器",
  "X is seconds, Y is brightness multiplier (1 = 100%)": "X 为秒数，Y 为亮度倍数（1 = 100%）",
  "Events": "事件",
  "Blocks LOS": "阻挡视线",
  "Override whether this prop should block NPC's Line-Of-Sight.": "覆盖此 Prop 是否应阻挡 NPC 的视线。",
  "AI Walkable": "AI 可行走",
  "Override whether AI should consider this prop as walkable on.": "覆盖 AI 是否应视此 Prop 为可行走。",
  "Bullet Dmg Mult": "子弹伤害倍率",
  "Mod damage done by bullets to this prop.": "调整子弹对此 Prop 造成的伤害。",
  "Club Dmg Mult": "棍棒伤害倍率",
  "Mod damage done by clubs to this prop.": "调整棍棒对此 Prop 造成的伤害。",
  "Explosive Dmg Mult": "爆炸伤害倍率",
  "Mod damage done by explosives to this prop.": "调整爆炸物对此 Prop 造成的伤害。",
  "Fire Dmg Mult": "火焰伤害倍率",
  "Mod damage done by fire to this prop.": "调整火焰对此 Prop 造成的伤害。",
  "Enable Glow": "启用发光",
  "Enable glow": "启用发光",
  "Spawn Motion-Disabled": "以禁用运动状态生成",
  "Allow physics props to spawn motion-disabled": "允许物理 Prop 以禁用运动的状态生成",
  "Allow Player Push": "允许玩家推动",
  "Allow this object to be pushed by the player capsule if it's light enough": "如果足够轻，允许此对象被玩家胶囊体推动",
  "Allow Grav Pull": "允许重力拉取",
  "Allow pullable from the gravity glove/cannon": "允许通过重力手套/重力炮拉取",
  "Custom Impact Table": "自定义冲击表",
  "Specify a custom physics impact damage table for this prop.": "为此 Prop 指定自定义物理冲击伤害表。",
  "Amount of damage this prop should take before breaking.": "此 Prop 断裂前应承受的伤害量。",
  "Type of explosion to create": "要产生的爆炸类型",
  "Explosive Damage": "爆炸伤害",
  "Explosive damage done by this prop.": "此 Prop 造成的爆炸伤害。",
  "Explosive Radius": "爆炸半径",
  "Radius of the explosion caused by this prop when it breaks.": "此 Prop 断裂时引发爆炸的半径。",
  "Explosive Delay": "爆炸延迟",
  "Delay before the explosion happens.": "爆炸发生前的延迟。",
  "Explosive Buildup Sound": "爆炸蓄力声音",
  "Sound to play before the explosion happens.": "爆炸发生前播放的声音。",
  "Allow Static": "允许静态",
  "Allow this prop to be static as well as physically simulated.": "允许此 Prop 在物理模拟的同时也可为静态。",
  "Shader Index": "着色器索引",
  "Red Near Scattering Variance": "红色近散射方差",
  "Green Near Scattering Variance": "绿色近散射方差",
  "Blue Near Scattering Variance ": "蓝色近散射方差 ",
  "Red Far Scattering Variance": "红色远散射方差",
  "Green Far Scattering Variance": "绿色远散射方差",
  "Blue Far Scattering Variance": "蓝色远散射方差",
  "Near Scattering Weight": "近散射权重",
  "Controls relative weighting of near and far scattering components": "控制近散射与远散射分量的相对权重",
  "Dual Lobe Roughness 0": "双瓣粗糙度 0",
  "Roughness multiplier for first lobe of dual-lobe specular": "双瓣高光第一瓣的粗糙度倍数",
  "Dual Lobe Roughness 1": "双瓣粗糙度 1",
  "Dual Lobe Mix": "双瓣混合",
  "Mix between the two roughness lobes": "两个粗糙度瓣之间的混合",
  "Transmissive Color": "透射颜色",
  "Transmissive Saturation": "透射饱和度",
  "How much the transmissive color gets more saturated with distance": "透射颜色随距离增加而变得更饱和的程度",
  "Fresnel Exponent": "菲涅尔指数",
  "Allows modifying the specular component's falloff": "允许修改高光分量的衰减",
  "Target Camera Name": "目标摄像机名称",
  "Select a camera name to override a specific camera's CSM FOV.  Target 'default' applies to all cameras not otherwise specified.": "选择摄像机名称以覆盖特定摄像机的 CSM 视场角。目标 'default' 适用于所有未另行指定的摄像机。",
  "CSM FOV Override value": "CSM 视场角覆盖值",
  "This value will be used to override the FOV for cascading shadow maps only.  Actual camera FOV remains unchanged.": "此值仅用于覆盖级联阴影贴图的视场角。实际摄像机视场角保持不变。",
  "Maximum Lightmap Resolution": "最大光照贴图分辨率",
  "No Maximum": "无上限",
  "Lightmap Queries": "光照贴图查询",
  "Generates data which can be used to lookup lightmap UVs at a given position, useful for high-fidelity illumination of bullet decals on lightmapped geometry.": "生成可用于在给定位置查询光照贴图 UV 的数据，适用于对光照贴图几何体上的子弹贴花进行高保真照明。",
  "Steam Audio Reverb Settings": "Steam音频混响设置",
  "Rebake Option": "重新烘焙选项",
  "<b>Cleanup</b>: Reverb bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Reverb needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Reverb is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.": "<b>清理</b>：禁用混响烘焙。烘焙数据将在 Hammer 或 mapbuilder 编译地图时被清理。<br /><b>手动</b>：需手动烘焙混响。烘焙数据在 Hammer 编译地图时添加或更新，但 mapbuilder 不会改动。<br /><b>自动</b>：编译地图时自动烘焙混响。烘焙数据在 Hammer 或 mapbuilder 编译地图时添加或更新。",
  "Cleanup": "清理",
  "Manual": "手动",
  "Generation Type": "生成类型",
  "<b>Automatic, Everywhere</b>: When baking, probes will be generated to cover the entire map.<br/><b>Automatic, Use Probe Generation Volumes</b>: When baking, probes will only be generated within Probe Generation Volumes that have been explicitly placed in the map.<br/><b>Manual</b>: When baking, probes will not be generated. Only probes that have been manually placed in the map will be used.": "<b>自动，全图</b>：烘焙时将生成覆盖整个地图的探针。<br/><b>自动，使用探针生成体积</b>：烘焙时仅在地图中显式放置的探针生成体积内生成探针。<br/><b>手动</b>：烘焙时不生成探针。仅使用手动放置在地图中的探针。",
  "Automatic, Everywhere": "自动，全图",
  "Automatic, Use Probe Generation Volumes": "自动，使用探针生成体积",
  "Filter Using Probe Exclusion Volumes": "使用探针排除体积过滤",
  "Don't generate probes inside Probe Exclusion Volumes that have been placed in the map.<br/>(Only used if Generation Type is set to Automatic, Everywhere.)": "不在已放置的探针排除体积内生成探针。<br/>（仅在生成类型设为“自动，全图”时使用。）",
  "Filter Using NavMesh": "使用导航网格过滤",
  "Only generate probes that are near the nav mesh.<br/>(Only used if Generation Type is set to Automatic, Everywhere.)": "仅生成靠近导航网格的探针。<br/>（仅在生成类型设为“自动，全图”时使用。）",
  "Grid Spacing": "网格间距",
  "The horizontal distance (in meters) between adjacent probes.": "相邻探针之间的水平距离（米）。",
  "Height Above Floor": "高于地板的高度",
  "The height (in meters) above the floor at which probes should be placed..": "探针应放置在地板上方的高度（米）。",
  "Baking Rays": "烘焙射线数",
  "The number of rays traced from the listener when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in more accurate reflections, at the cost of increased bake times.": "烘焙反射或混响时从听者投射的射线数量。增大此值可获得更精确的反射，但烘焙时间增加。",
  "Baking Bounces": "烘焙反弹次数",
  "The number of times each ray traced from the listener is reflected when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in longer, more accurate reverb tails, at the cost of increased bake times.": "烘焙反射或混响时，从听者投射的每条射线的反射次数。增大此值可获得更长、更精确的混响尾音，但烘焙时间增加。",
  "Baking Duration": "烘焙时长",
  "The duration (in seconds) of the IRs generated when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in longer, more accurate reverb tails, at the cost of increased disk space usage.": "烘焙反射或混响时生成的脉冲响应（IR）时长（秒）。增大此值可获得更长、更精确的混响尾音，但磁盘占用增加。",
  "Baking Ambisonic Order": "烘焙环境声阶数",
  "The Ambisonic order of the IRs generated when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in more accurate directional variation of reflected sound, at the cost of increased disk space usage.": "烘焙反射或混响时生成的脉冲响应的环境声阶数。增大此值可获得更精确的反射声方向变化，但磁盘占用增加。",
  "Enable Clustering": "启用聚类",
  "Reduces the number of probes generated by combining nearby probes that are likely to have similar reverbs.": "通过合并可能具有相似混响的邻近探针来减少生成的探针数量。",
  "Cube Map Resolution": "立方体贴图分辨率",
  "Number of rays traced per side for each face of the depth cube map computed for each probe.": "为每个探针计算的深度立方体贴图的每个面每侧投射的射线数量。",
  "Depth Similarity Threshold": "深度相似阈值",
  "If average depth map values at two probes are within this distance (in meters), then the probes are considered similar.": "如果两个探针的平均深度图值在此距离（米）内，则认为这两个探针相似。",
  "Steam Audio Pathing Settings": "Steam音频寻路设置",
  "<b>Cleanup</b>: Pathing bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Pathing needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Pathing is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.": "<b>清理</b>：禁用寻路烘焙。烘焙数据将在 Hammer 或 mapbuilder 编译地图时被清理。<br /><b>手动</b>：需手动烘焙寻路。烘焙数据在 Hammer 编译地图时添加或更新，但 mapbuilder 不会改动。<br /><b>自动</b>：编译地图时自动烘焙寻路。烘焙数据在 Hammer 或 mapbuilder 编译地图时添加或更新。",
  "Baking Visibilty Samples": "烘焙可见性采样数",
  "Number of point samples to use around each probe when testing whether one probe can see another. To determine if two probes are mutually visible, rays are traced from each point sample of the first probe, to every other point sample of the second probe. Increasing this value prevents paths from being considered occluded by small objects, at the cost of increased bake times.": "测试一个探针能否看到另一个探针时，在每个探针周围使用的点采样数量。为确定两个探针是否相互可见，将从第一个探针的每个点采样向第二个探针的每个其他点采样投射射线。增大此值可防止路径被小物体视为遮挡，但烘焙时间增加。",
  "Baking Visibility Radius": "烘焙可见性半径",
  "When testing for mutual visibility between a pair of probes, each probe is treated as a sphere of this radius (in meters), and point samples are generated within this sphere.": "测试一对探针之间的相互可见性时，每个探针被视为具有此半径（米）的球体，并在此球体内生成点采样。",
  "Baking Visibility Threshold": "烘焙可见性阈值",
  "When tracing rays to test for mutual visibility between a pair of probes, the fraction of rays that are unoccluded must be greater than this threshold for the pair of probes to be considered mutually visible.": "投射射线测试一对探针的相互可见性时，未遮挡射线的比例必须大于此阈值，这对探针才被视为相互可见。",
  "Baking Path Range": "烘焙路径范围",
  "If the distance (in meters) between two probes is greater than this value, the probes are considered to not have any path between them. Increasing this value allows sound to propagate over greater distances, at the cost of increased bake times and memory usage.": "如果两个探针之间的距离（米）大于此值，则认为它们之间不存在任何路径。增大此值允许声音传播更远的距离，但烘焙时间和内存占用增加。",
  "Steam Audio Custom Data Settings": "Steam音频自定义数据设置",
  "<b>Cleanup</b>: Custom bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Custom data needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Custom data is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.": "<b>清理</b>：禁用自定义烘焙。烘焙数据将在 Hammer 或 mapbuilder 编译地图时被清理。<br /><b>手动</b>：需手动烘焙自定义数据。烘焙数据在 Hammer 编译地图时添加或更新，但 mapbuilder 不会改动。<br /><b>自动</b>：编译地图时自动烘焙自定义数据。烘焙数据在 Hammer 或 mapbuilder 编译地图时添加或更新。",
  "Bake Occlusion": "烘焙遮挡",
  "Bake custom occlusion data between probe pairs.": "烘焙探针对之间的自定义遮挡数据。",
  "Bake Dimensions": "烘焙尺寸数据",
  "Bake occlusion dimensions data (size and inside outside) per probe.": "为每个探针烘焙遮挡尺寸数据（大小和内外）。",
  "Bake Materials": "烘焙材质数据",
  "Bake custom materials data (top 3 nearby materials) per probe.": "为每个探针烘焙自定义材质数据（最近的 3 种材质）。",
  "Occlusion: Simulate Pathing": "遮挡：模拟寻路",
  "Simulate pathing when computing baked occlusion.": "计算烘焙遮挡时模拟寻路。",
  "Occlusion: Simulate Reflection": "遮挡：模拟反射",
  "Simulate reflections when computing baked occlusion.": "计算烘焙遮挡时模拟反射。",
  "Occlusion: Reflection Num Rays": "遮挡：反射射线数量",
  "Number of rays to simulate reflections.": "用于模拟反射的射线数量。",
  "Occlusion: Reflection Bounces": "遮挡：反射反弹次数",
  "Number of bounces to simulate reflections.": "用于模拟反射的反弹次数。",
  "This entity's orientation in the world. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, ": "此实体在世界中的朝向。俯仰是绕 Y 轴的旋转，",
  "yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, roll is the rotation around the X axis.": "偏航是绕 Z 轴的旋转，翻滚是绕 X 轴的旋转。",
  "Team Number (int)": "队伍编号（整数）",
  "All Teams": "所有队伍",
  "Terrorist": "恐怖分子",
  "Changes the entity's team": "更改实体的队伍",
  "Start constrained": "初始约束",
  "Is this weapon allowed to be picked up?": "是否允许拾取此武器？",
  "Fires when the player +uses this weapon": "当玩家 +使用 此武器时触发",
  "Fires when the player picks up this weapon": "当玩家拾取此武器时触发",
  "Set the reserve ammo on this weapon": "设置此武器的备弹",
  "Set the ammo on this weapon": "设置此武器的弹药",
  "Toggle CanBePickedUp": "切换 CanBePickedUp",
  "End the multiplayer game.": "结束多人游戏。",
  "Fog Cubemap": "雾立方体贴图",
  "Cubemap Source": "立方体贴图来源",
  "Which field to use to select the cubemap and its parameters.": "使用哪个字段来选择立方体贴图及其参数。",
  "Cubemap From Env_Sky": "来自 Env_Sky 的立方体贴图",
  "Cubemap From Material": "来自材质的立方体贴图",
  "Env_Sky Target": "Env_Sky 目标",
  "Cubemap Blur / Mip Bias (0-1)": "立方体贴图模糊 / Mip 偏置（0-1）",
  "Adjust how blurry the cubemap should be. Lower values are more blurry (0-1) ": "调整立方体贴图的模糊程度。值越低越模糊（0-1） ",
  "Fog Distance": "雾距离",
  "Fog Start Distance": "雾起始距离",
  "Fog End Distance": "雾结束距离",
  "Distance Falloff Exponent": "距离衰减指数",
  "Exponent for distance falloff. For example, 2.0 = proportional to square of distance": "距离衰减的指数。例如 2.0 = 与距离的平方成正比",
  "Maximum Fog Opacity (0-1)": "最大雾不透明度（0-1）",
  "Set the maximum opacity of the cubemap fog. (0-1)": "设置立方体贴图雾的最大不透明度。（0-1）",
  "Fog Height": "雾高度",
  "Height Fog Enabled?": "启用高度雾？",
  "Height Fog Start": "高度雾起始",
  "Height Fog End": "高度雾结束",
  "Height Fog Exponent": "高度雾指数",
  "Set the gradient fog color.": "设置渐变雾颜色。",
  "Fog Color Multiplier": "雾颜色倍数",
  "For HDR color values": "用于 HDR 颜色值",
  "Fog Maximum Opacity": "雾最大不透明度",
  "Set the maximum opacity of the gradient fog.": "设置渐变雾的最大不透明度。",
  "Exponent for distance falloff.": "距离衰减的指数。",
  "Fog Start Height": "雾起始高度",
  "Fog End Height": "雾结束高度",
  "Height Falloff Exponent": "高度衰减指数",
  "Exponent for height falloff.": "高度衰减的指数。",
  "How much time it takes to fade in new values.": "淡入新值所需的时间。",
  "Controls the Far Z distance clipping plane, beyond which geometry will be culled.": "控制远裁剪平面（Far Z）距离，超出该距离的几何体将被剔除。",
  "Set Fog Start Distance": "设置雾起始距离",
  "Set Fog End Distance": "设置雾结束距离",
  "Set Fog Start Height": "设置雾起始高度",
  "Set Fog End Height": "设置雾结束高度",
  "Set Fog Max Opacity": "设置雾最大不透明度",
  "Set Fog Falloff Exponent": "设置雾衰减指数",
  "Set Fog Vertical Exponent": "设置雾垂直指数",
  "Set Fog Color": "设置雾颜色",
  "Set Fog Strength": "设置雾强度",
  "Player Visibility Postprocessing Strength": "玩家可见性后处理强度",
  "Set the strength of the player visibility postprocessing effect": "设置玩家可见性后处理效果的强度",
  "Player Fog Distance Multiplier": "玩家雾距离倍数",
  "Set a multiplier on the distance used to calculate fog for players. Higher values mean the fog is pushed further away.": "设置用于计算玩家雾的距离倍数。值越高雾被推得越远。",
  "Player Fog Max Density Multiplier": "玩家雾最大密度倍数",
  "Set a multiplier on the maximum density of fog for players. Lower values mean less opaque fog.": "设置玩家雾最大密度的倍数。值越低雾越透明。",
  "Set Player Visibility Postprocessing Strength": "设置玩家可见性后处理强度",
  "Set Player Fog Distance Multiplier": "设置玩家雾距离倍数",
  "Set Player Fog Max Density Multiplier": "设置玩家雾最大密度倍数",
  "Skybox Material": "天空盒材质",
  "Sky Tint Color": "天空着色颜色",
  "Hint Text (localized)": "提示文本（已本地化）",
  "This should be set to match the desired HUD hint entry in the hl2\\resource\\valve_english.txt.": "此项应设置为与 hl2\\resource\\valve_english.txt 中所需的 HUD 提示条目匹配。",
  "Shows the hint message.": "显示提示消息。",
  "Hides the hint message.": "隐藏提示消息。",
  "Spawn Priority (int)": "生成优先级（整数）",
  "Determines which spawn points get used first.  Smaller numbers are used before larger numbers.": "决定优先使用哪些生成点。数字越小越先使用。",
  "Enabled by default?": "默认启用？",
  "Sets this spawn point as enabled.": "将此生成点设为启用。",
  "Sets this spawn point as disabled.": "将此生成点设为禁用。",
  "Toggle the enabled/disabled state of this spawn point.": "切换此生成点的启用/禁用状态。",
  "Override player model": "覆盖玩家模型",
  "Select a model to override the model used for enemies spawned at this spawn point.": "选择一个模型，覆盖在此生成点生成的敌人所用的模型。",
  "Weapons to spawn with": "生成时携带的武器",
  "Weapons and items to give to the bot on spawn. Ex. 'vesthelm, usp, awp, smokegreande, hegrenade'": "机器人生成时获得的武器和物品。例如 'vesthelm, usp, awp, smokegreande, hegrenade'",
  "Armor": "护甲",
  "What armor should the bot spawn with.": "机器人生成时应拥有的护甲。",
  "Vest and Helmet": "防弹衣和头盔",
  "Heavy Armor": "重型护甲",
  "Spawn alseep?": "生成时入睡？",
  "Do the bots that spawn here start alseep? If so, they will wait until they see or hear the player to move.": "在此生成的机器人是否一开始处于入睡状态？如果是，它们会等到看到或听到玩家才移动。",
  "Default Behavior": "默认行为",
  "What behavior the bot should have when idle.": "机器人空闲时应有的行为。",
  "Defend Camp": "防守营地",
  "Hunt": "追猎",
  "Charge Enemy": "冲锋敌人",
  "Defend Investigate": "防守调查",
  "Bot Difficulty (int)": "机器人难度（整数）",
  "How hard the bot is to fight and what his skill level is. [0-7] (0 = super easy, 7 = super human).": "机器人战斗的难易程度及其技能水平。[0-7]（0 = 极易，7 = 超人）。",
  "Is agressive?": "是否好斗？",
  "Is the bot agreesive for his difficulty level?": "该机器人在其难度水平下是否好斗？",
  "Hide Radius": "躲藏半径",
  "Range around the spawn spot the bot will try to hide. Set to 0 to hold position and never try to hide.": "生成点周围机器人会尝试躲藏的范围。设为 0 表示坚守位置且从不尝试躲藏。",
  "Hostage Model (int)": "人质模型（整数）",
  "Not used. Hostage models are chosen randomly by the game.": "未使用。人质模型由游戏随机选择。",
  "Hostage Spawn Random Factor (int)": "人质生成随机因子（整数）",
  "Allows to increase probability of this hostage being picked during random spawn selection process, essentially considering this spawn point specified number of times.": "允许提高此人质在随机生成选择过程中被选中的概率，相当于将此生成点按指定次数重复计入。",
  "Hostage Spawn Exclusion Group 1": "人质生成互斥组 1",
  "Hostages sharing same spawn exclusion group will never spawn together.": "共享同一生成互斥组的人质绝不会一起生成。",
  "Do not spawn together": "不一起生成",
