  "Fires when a player starts to use a hostage": "当玩家开始使用人质时触发",
  "Fires when the hostage is first picked up": "当人质首次被拾取时触发",
  "Fires when the hostage is dropped, but not rescued": "当人质被放下但未获救时触发",
  "Fires when the hostage is rescued": "当人质获救时触发",
  "Stationary Light Shadows": "固定光源阴影",
  "Allows mixed dynamic cascade shadow maps with Baked shadows.": "允许将动态级联阴影贴图与烘焙阴影混合使用。",
  "Allow SST Generation": "允许生成 SST",
  "Allows SST generation for this (sun) light.": "允许为此（太阳）光源生成 SST。",
  "Ambient Occlusion Proxies": "环境光遮蔽代理体",
  "Custom AO Proxies": "自定义 AO 代理体",
  "Custom AO Proxy Position 0": "自定义 AO 代理体位置 0",
  "Relative to origin of the light_environment.": "相对于 light_environment 的原点。",
  "Custom AO Proxy Position 1": "自定义 AO 代理体位置 1",
  "Custom AO Proxy Position 2": "自定义 AO 代理体位置 2",
  "Custom AO Proxy Position 3": "自定义 AO 代理体位置 3",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Softness 0": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体柔和度 0",
  "Softness of Imaginary Shadowing Light.": "虚拟遮蔽光源的柔和度。",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Softness 1": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体柔和度 1",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Softness 2": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体柔和度 2",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Softness 3": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体柔和度 3",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Strength 0": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体强度 0",
  "Relative Strength of Imaginary Shadowing Light.": "虚拟遮蔽光源的相对强度。",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Strength 1": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体强度 1",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Strength 2": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体强度 2",
  "Custom AO Proxy Cone Strength 3": "自定义 AO 代理体锥体强度 3",
  "AO Proxy Ambient Strength": "AO 代理体环境强度",
  "Relative Strength of Ambient/Unshadowed term. Lower values make darker shadows.": "环境/无阴影项的相对强度。值越低阴影越暗。",
  "Baked & Dynamic": "烘焙与动态",
  "Baked Only": "仅烘焙",
  "Force Shadows Enabled": "强制启用阴影",
  "Always enable shadows for this light, regardless of any global settings.": "无论任何全局设置如何，始终为此光源启用阴影。",
  "Whether this light casts shadow. ": "此光源是否投射阴影。 ",
  "How direct lighting should be represented: Static=Fully baked into lightmap (cheapest), Stationary=Dynamic direct light with baked shadows, Dynamic=Fully dynamic (Most expensive). NOTE: Stationary and Dynamic omni2's take up 6 dynamic shadow slots, and will likely not cast shadows if you have CSM shadows enabled in a light_environment.": "直接光照的表示方式：静态=完全烘焙进光照贴图（开销最低），固定=带烘焙阴影的动态直接光，动态=完全动态（开销最高）。注意：固定和动态的 omni2 会占用 6 个动态阴影槽位，如果您在 light_environment 中启用了 CSM 阴影，它们很可能无法投射阴影。",
  "Very Very High Resolution": "极高分辨率",
  "Depth Of Field": "景深",
  "Depth of Field Enabled": "启用景深",
  "Depth of Field Near Blurry Distance": "景深近处模糊距离",
  "Depth of Field Near Crisp Distance": "景深近处清晰距离",
  "Depth of Field Far Crisp Distance": "景深深处清晰距离",
  "Depth of Field Far Blurry Distance": "景深深处模糊距离",
  "Depth of Field Tilt Lens to Align With Ground Plane": "景深倾斜镜头以对齐地面平面",
  "Map Name": "地图名称",
  "Fixup Entity Names": "修正实体名称",
  "Texture Override": "纹理覆盖",
  "You can replace the texture of any particle system specified above with a vtex. if empty the default particle behavior will happen.": "您可以用 vtex 替换上述指定的任何粒子系统的纹理。留空则使用默认粒子行为。",
  "Scale multiplier of the glow. Used to remap the radius of the particle system. Written to Control Point 17 Y Value": "发光的缩放倍数。用于重映射粒子系统的半径。写入控制点 17 的 Y 值",
  "Set the light's render color (R G B). Written to Control Point 16": "设置光源的渲染颜色（R G B）。写入控制点 16",
  "Self illum Scalar": "自发光标量",
  "float value to multiply sprite self illum by. this will affect things like bloom contribution. Written to Control Point 17 Z Value": "与精灵自发光相乘的浮点值。这将影响泛光贡献等。写入控制点 17 的 Z 值",
  "Alpha Scale": "透明度缩放",
  "Alpha Multiplier on particle system. Written to Control Point 17 X Value": "粒子系统的透明度倍数。写入控制点 17 的 X 值",
  "Advanced Properties": "高级属性",
  "Parent (Control Point 0)": "父级（控制点 0）",
  "If set, control point 0 of the effect will be at this entity's location. (Otherwise it is at the env_particle_glow origin)": "若设置，效果的控制点 0 将位于此实体的位置。（否则位于 env_particle_glow 的原点）",
  "Name of .vsnap (Particle Snapshot File) to be loaded and used by this particle system (e.g. 'smoke_snapshot1.vsnap')": "此粒子系统要加载并使用的 .vsnap（粒子快照文件）名称（例如 'smoke_snapshot1.vsnap'）",
  "Spawns a glow particle at each mesh vertex. Id of a node in the map to be used to generate a particle snapshot, if specified Particle Snapshot File is ignored. A Particle system that is setup for snapshots must be used. eg : glow01_snapshot.vpcf": "在每个网格顶点处生成发光粒子。地图中用于生成粒子快照的节点 ID，若指定则忽略粒子快照文件。必须使用为快照设置的粒子系统，例如：glow01_snapshot.vpcf",
  "Set the glow scale multiplier (0 - 8.0).": "设置发光缩放倍数（0 - 8.0）。",
  "Set the Alpha scale multiplier (0 - 1.0).": "设置透明度缩放倍数（0 - 1.0）。",
  "Layout File": "布局文件",
  "Entity (or entities) whose material should be overridden with this texture": "其材质应被此纹理覆盖的实体（或多个实体）",
  "Target Render Attribute": "目标渲染属性",
  "Attribute name to hook to the texture (Add dynamic expression with the same string in your VMAT)": "要挂接到纹理的属性名称（在您的 VMAT 中添加具有相同字符串的动态表达式）",
  "Texture Resolution (X)": "纹理分辨率（X）",
  "Offscreen texture width": "屏幕外纹理宽度",
  "Texture Resolution (Y)": "纹理分辨率（Y）",
  "Offscreen texture height": "屏幕外纹理高度",
  "Hardware Type": "硬件类型",
  "<None>": "<无>",
  "Lever": "操纵杆",
  "Push bar": "推杆",
  "Keypad": "键盘面板",
  "Disable breaking.": "禁用断裂。",
  "Reenable breaking.": "重新启用断裂。",
  "The damage filter associated with this place.": "与此地点关联的伤害过滤器。",
  "Secure a spawn point": "确保一个生成点",
  "Specify how many seconds before it explodes.": "指定爆炸前还有多少秒。",
  "Spawn weight": "生成权重",
  "How likely it is to spawn at this location, default 100.": "在此位置生成的可能性，默认 100。",
  "Region Radius": "区域半径",
  "How far the named region extends.": "命名区域延伸的范围。",
  "Localization token": "本地化令牌",
  "Localization string token.": "本地化字符串令牌。",
  "Explosion radius.": "爆炸半径。",
  "Group Radius": "组半径",
  "Spawn Automatically": "自动生成",
  "Denial Radius": "拒止半径",
  "Event Name": "事件名称",
  "The name of the event that you want to listen for.": "您要监听的事件的名称。",
  "Team Number": "队伍编号",
  "If set, will only fire its output if the event is generated from someone of the specified team.": "若设置，仅当事件由指定队伍的成员产生时才触发其输出。",
  "Terrorists": "恐怖分子",
  "Enable the logic_eventlistener.": "启用 logic_eventlistener。",
  "Disable the logic_eventlistener.": "禁用 logic_eventlistener。",
  "Fired when the event has been detected.": "当检测到事件时触发。",
  "Place Name": "地点名称",
  "The name associated with this place.": "与此地点关联的名称。",
  "Starts blocking nav areas.": "开始阻挡导航区域。",
  "Stops blocking nav areas.": "停止阻挡导航区域。",
  "Team Num": "队伍编号",
  "Team number associated with this buyzone.": "与此购买区关联的队伍编号。",
  "Filter to use to see if activator collides with me. See filter_activator_name for more explanation. Allow means 'Allow to Block' for this entity.": "用于判断激活者是否与我碰撞的过滤器。详见 filter_activator_name 的说明。Allow 表示此实体的“允许阻挡”。",
  "Fires when C4 explodes": "当 C4 爆炸时触发",
  "Fires when a C4 is planted": "当 C4 被安放时触发",
  "Fires when a C4 is defused": "当 C4 被拆除时触发",
  "Heist Mode bomb target": "劫案模式炸弹目标",
  "This is a Bomb Target designed for the Heist game mode.": "这是为劫案游戏模式设计的炸弹目标。",
  "Bomb Mount Target": "炸弹安装目标",
  "Bomb Site": "炸弹地点",
  "Bomb Power": "炸弹威力",
  "Explicit Cubemap": "显式立方体贴图",
  "Used to manually assign a named env_cubemap, env_cubemap_box or env_combined_light_probe_volume to a mesh. Note: This forces the mesh into a slower rendering path and does not support the explicit assignment of lightprobes. Use with caution.": "用于手动将指定的 env_cubemap、env_cubemap_box 或 env_combined_light_probe_volume 分配给网格。注意：这会强制网格进入较慢的渲染路径，且不支持显式指定光照探针。请谨慎使用。",
  "Teams that can buy": "可购买的队伍",
  "Everyone": "所有人",
  "Only Counter-Terrorists": "仅反恐精英",
  "Only Terrorists": "仅恐怖分子",
  "Nobody": "无人",
  "C4 Explosion Radius": "C4 爆炸半径",
  "Overrides the default radius of the explosion when the C4 bomb explodes. Max range is 2048": "覆盖 C4 炸弹爆炸时的默认半径。最大范围为 2048",
  "Pet Population": "宠物数量",
  "Determines the target population of pets.": "决定宠物的目标数量。",
  "Use Normal Spawns in Deathmatch?": "死亡竞赛中使用常规生成点？",
  "Set to true if the map should use the mapper-placed spawn points instead of generating random ones.": "若设为 true，地图将使用映射器放置的生成点而非随机生成的。",
  "Disable Autogenerated DM Spawns?": "禁用自动生成的死亡竞赛生成点？",
  "Set to true if you want to manually place info_deathmatch_spawns and not have the engine generate them.": "若您想手动放置 info_deathmatch_spawns 而不让引擎生成它们，则设为 true。",
  "Bot max vision distance": "机器人最大视野距离",
  "Sets the maximum distance bots can see enemies. Default is -1, unlimited.": "设置机器人能看到敌人的最大距离。默认为 -1，无限制。",
  "GPU Cull Skybox": "GPU 剔除天空盒",
  "Enable or disable GPU Culling of the Skybox (required for clutter in skybox).": "启用或禁用天空盒的 GPU 剔除（天空盒中的杂物需要此项）。",
  "Rain trace-to-sky enabled": "启用雨水天空检测",
  "Enable or disable traces for rain droplet effects.": "启用或禁用雨滴效果的射线检测。",
  "Environment Rain Strength": "环境雨强度",
  "Controls the amount of rain splashes.": "控制雨花飞溅的数量。",
  "Environment Puddle Ripple Strength": "环境水坑涟漪强度",
  "Strength of the puddle ripples.": "水坑涟漪的强度。",
  "Environment Puddle Ripple Direction": "环境水坑涟漪方向",
  "Rotates the puddle ripples (0 to 1, i.e. 0.5 is reversed, 0.25 is 90 degrees).": "旋转水坑涟漪（0 到 1，即 0.5 为反向，0.25 为 90 度）。",
  "Environment Wetness Coverage": "环境湿润覆盖",
  "How wet the environment was before drying.": "干燥前环境的湿润程度。",
  "Environment Wetness Drying Amount": "环境干燥量",
  "How much the environment dried out.": "环境干燥的程度。",
  "Fires win conditions for the win.": "为获胜方触发胜利条件。",
  "Frustum": "视锥体",
  "Distance to the near plane for preview of the frustum in hammer.": "Hammer 中预览视锥体的近平面距离。",
  "Distance to the far plane for preview of the frustum in hammer.": "Hammer 中预览视锥体的远平面距离。",
  "Render color for preview of the frustum in hammer.": "Hammer 中预览视锥体的渲染颜色。",
  "Aspect ratio of the camera for preview of the frustum in hammer. ": "Hammer 中预览视锥体的摄像机宽高比。 ",
  "This is the horizontal field of view.": "这是水平视场角。",
  "If the path is not constant speed, this specifies the speed of this segment.  The segment is defined as the line from this node to the next node in the direction of camera travel.\nThis value is ignored if the path is constant speed.": "如果路径不是恒定速度，则指定此段的速度。该段定义为此节点到摄像机行进方向上下一节点之间的连线。\n如果路径为恒定速度，则忽略此值。",
  "Ease In Percent": "缓入百分比",
  "Percentage of the segment used to ease the speed from the previous segment to the speed of this segment.\nIf Ease In & Ease Out total to more than 100%, their values will be normalized to total 100%.\nThis value is ignored if the path is constant speed.": "该段中用于从前一段速度缓入到本段速度的百分比。\n如果缓入与缓出之和超过 100%，它们的值将被归一化为总计 100%。\n如果路径为恒定速度，则忽略此值。",
  "Ease Out Percent": "缓出百分比",
  "Percentage of the segment used to ease the speed from this segment to the speed of the next segment.\nIf Ease In & Ease Out total to more than 100%, their values will be normalized to total 100%.\nThis value is ignored if the path is constant speed.": "该段中用于从本段速度缓出到下一段速度的百分比。\n如果缓入与缓出之和超过 100%，它们的值将被归一化为总计 100%。\n如果路径为恒定速度，则忽略此值。",
  "Aspect ratio of the camera.": "摄像机的宽高比。",
  "Vertical FOV": "垂直视场角",
  "Set to true if the camera should use vertical FOV (Default false)": "如果摄像机应使用垂直视场角则设为 true（默认 false）",
  "Constant Speed": "恒定速度",
  "Controls the timing of the camera.  If true the duration value on the path is used, otherwise the individual time values on the nodes are used.  (Default true)": "控制摄像机的计时。若为 true，则使用路径上的时长值，否则使用各节点上的单独时间值。（默认 true）",
  "Constant Speed Duration": "恒定速度时长",
  "The amount of time in seconds the camera will take to traverse the path.  Ignored if Constant Speed is false. (Default 5)": "摄像机走完路径所需的时间（秒）。恒定速度为 false 时忽略。（默认 5）",
  "Set to true if the camera animation should loop when reaching the end of the path. By default, the camera animation will hold the last frame.": "如果摄像机动画应在到达路径末端时循环，则设为 true。默认情况下，摄像机动画将保持最后一帧。",
  "Models": "模型",
  "Name of the conveyor models that will animate along with the conveyor.": "将随传送带一起运动的传送带模型名称。",
  "The direction conveyor moves.": "传送带移动的方向。",
  "Conveyor Speed, , in inches / second.": "传送带速度，单位为英寸/秒。",
  "Transition Duration (seconds)": "过渡时长（秒）",
  "How long it will take to transition to the new speed.": "过渡到新速度所需的时间。",
  "Toggle the direction": "切换方向",
  "Set the speed in inches per second,": "以英寸/秒设置速度，",
  "Set the duration in seconds to transition to the new speed,": "以秒设置过渡到新速度的时长，",
  "Amount of money to add (+/-)": "要增加的金额（+/-）",
  "Award Text": "奖励文本",
  "The text that will print in the chat next to the award amount.  Will look like this:\t'1000: <Award Text>'": "将打印在聊天中奖励金额旁边的文本。样式如下：\t'1000: <奖励文本>'",
  "Set the money value that will be awarded. (without awarding it)": "设置将发放的金钱数值。（不实际发放）",
  "Add money to players on team TERRORIST.": "为恐怖分子队伍的玩家增加金钱。",
  "Add money to players on team COUNTER TERRORIST.": "为反恐精英队伍的玩家增加金钱。",
  "Add money directly to the player activating this entity. (no chat description)": "直接为激活此实体的玩家增加金钱。（无聊天描述）",
  "If the player has [money amount] or more, take [money amount] away.": "如果玩家拥有 [金额] 或更多，则扣除 [金额]。",
  "Fires when input SpendMoneyFromPlayer succeeded.": "当输入 SpendMoneyFromPlayer 成功时触发。",
  "Fires when input SpendMoneyFromPlayer failed. (Player didn't have enough money)": "当输入 SpendMoneyFromPlayer 失败时触发。（玩家金钱不足）",
  "Run callback registered using OnScriptInput.": "运行使用 OnScriptInput 注册的回调。",
  "Layout": "布局",
  "A panorama layout file. A limited set of panel types and attributes are supported.": "Panorama 布局文件。仅支持有限的面板类型和属性。",
  "Filter Team": "过滤队伍",
  "The team to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要按其过滤的队伍。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有……的实体 ",
  "Remove paint from the brush entity.": "从画刷实体移除涂鸦。",
  "Origin (X Y Z)": "原点（X Y Z）",
  "The position of this entity's center in the world. Rotating entities typically rotate around their origin.": "此实体中心在世界中的位置。旋转实体通常绕其原点旋转。",
  "Render in Fast Reflections": "在快速反射中渲染",
  "If enabled, causes this entity/prop to to render in fast water reflections (i.e. when a water material specifies $reflectonlymarkedentities) and in the world impostor pass.": "如果启用，会使此实体/Prop 在快速水面反射（即水面材质指定 $reflectonlymarkedentities 时）以及世界 impostor 通道中渲染。",
  "Turns off rendering of this entity in reflections when using $reflectonlymarkedentities in water material.": "当水面材质使用 $reflectonlymarkedentities 时，关闭此实体在反射中的渲染。",
  "Turn on rendering of this entity in reflections when using $reflectonlymarkedentities in water material.": "当水面材质使用 $reflectonlymarkedentities 时，开启此实体在反射中的渲染。",
  "Add the EF_NODRAW flag to this entity. Some entities manage this on their own so be aware you can override that value.": "为此实体添加 EF_NODRAW 标记。某些实体会自行管理此标记，请注意您可能会覆盖该值。",
  "Remove the EF_NODRAW flag to this entity. Some entities manage this on their own so be aware you can override that value.": "从此实体移除 EF_NODRAW 标记。某些实体会自行管理此标记，请注意您可能会覆盖该值。",
  "Disable shadows": "禁用阴影",
  "Disable ShadowDepth": "禁用阴影深度",
  "Used to disable rendering into shadow depth (for flashlight) for this entity.": "用于禁用此实体渲染到阴影深度（手电筒）。",
  "Projected Texture Cache": "投影纹理缓存",
  "Used to hint projected texture system whether it is sufficient to cache shadow volume of this entity or to force render it every frame instead.": "用于提示投影纹理系统：缓存此实体的阴影体积即可，还是必须每帧强制渲染。",
  "No cache = render every frame": "不缓存 = 每帧渲染",
  "Cache it = render only once": "缓存 = 仅渲染一次",
  "Disable flashlight": "禁用手电筒",
  "Used to disable flashlight (env_projectedtexture) lighting and shadows on this entity.": "用于禁用此实体上的手电筒（env_projectedtexture）光照和阴影。",
  "This object will not recieve light or shadows from projected textures (flashlights).": "此对象不会接收投影纹理（手电筒）的光照或阴影。",
  "This object may recieve light or shadows from projected textures (flashlights).": "此对象可能接收投影纹理（手电筒）的光照或阴影。",
  "Some models have multiple versions of their textures, called skins. Set this to a number other than 0 to use that skin instead of the default.": "某些模型具有多个纹理版本，称为皮肤。将此项设为 0 以外的数字以使用该皮肤而非默认皮肤。",
  "Body": "身体组",
  "Some models have multiple bodygroups. Set this to a number other than 0 to use that bodygroup instead of the default.": "某些模型具有多个身体组。将此项设为 0 以外的数字以使用该身体组而非默认身体组。",
  "Disable Shadows": "禁用阴影",
  "Used to disable dynamic shadows on this entity.": "用于禁用此实体上的动态阴影。",
  "Script think function": "脚本思考函数",
  "Name of a function in this entity's script scope which will be called automatically.": "此实体脚本作用域中的函数名称，将被自动调用。",
  "Execute a game script file from disk": "从磁盘执行游戏脚本文件",
  "Execute a string of script source code": "执行一段脚本源代码",
  "Adds an entity I/O connection to this entity. Format: <output name> <targetname>:<inputname>:<parameter>:<delay>:<max times to fire (-1 == infinite)>. Very dangerous, use with care.": "为此实体添加实体 I/O 连接。格式：<输出名称> <targetname>:<输入名>:<参数>:<延迟>:<最大触发次数（-1 == 无限）>。非常危险，请谨慎使用。",
  "Used by HL1Port. Sets the brush texture index. Use a material_modify_control entity instead.": "由 HL1Port 使用。设置画刷纹理索引。请改用 material_modify_control 实体。",
  "Used by HL1Port. Increments the brush texture index. Use a material_modify_control entity instead.": "由 HL1Port 使用。递增画刷纹理索引。请改用 material_modify_control 实体。",
  "Distance at which the overlay starts to fade (<0 = subtract from fademaxdist).": "叠加层开始淡出的距离（<0 = 从 fademaxdist 中减去）。",
  "Fade Scale": "淡出缩放",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under low end/medium end/XBox360,": "如果您在 worldspawn 中指定了淡出，或者引擎运行在低端/中端/XBox360 配置下，",
  " then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": " 则即使未指定 fademindist/fademaxdist，引擎也会强制淡出 Prop。",
  " This scale factor gives you some control over the fade. Using 0 here turns off the forcible fades.": " 此缩放系数让您对淡出有一定的控制。此处设为 0 可关闭强制淡出。",
  " Numbers smaller than 1 cause the prop to fade out at further distances, and greater than 1 cause it to fade out at closer distances.": " 小于 1 的数字使 Prop 在更远处淡出，大于 1 则使其在更近处淡出。",
  "Minimum CPU Level": "最低 CPU 级别",
  "default (low)": "默认（低）",
  "low": "低",
  "medium": "中",
  "high": "高",
  "Maximum CPU Level": "最高 CPU 级别",
  "default (high)": "默认（高）",
  "Minimum GPU Level": "最低 GPU 级别",
  "default (very low)": "默认（极低）",
  "very low": "极低",
  "Maximum GPU Level": "最高 GPU 级别",
  "Disable X360": "禁用 X360",
  "Full Gibs on All Platforms": "所有平台上完整碎块",
  "Reduced gibs": "减少碎块",
  "Makes the breakable able to picked up by the physcannon.": "使该可破坏物能被物理引力枪拾取。",
  "Makes the breakable not able to picked up by the physcannon.": "使该可破坏物无法被物理引力枪拾取。",
  "Fired when the physcannon has ripped this breakable off of the wall. Only fired if ACT_PHYSCANNON_DETACH is defined in the model this breakable is using.": "当物理引力枪将此可破坏物从墙上扯下时触发。仅当此可破坏物所用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_DETACH 时才会触发。",
  "Fired when this prop starts playing the Pre physcannon-pull activity, caused by the player trying to grab this prop with the physcannon. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_PRE activity is defined in the model this breakable is using.": "当此道具开始播放物理引力枪拉取前（Pre）动作时触发，由玩家试图用物理引力枪抓取此道具引起。仅当此可破坏物所用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_PRE 动作时才会触发。",
  "Fired when this prop starts playing the physcannon-pull activity, caused by the player trying to grab this prop with the physcannon. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE activity is defined in the model this breakable is using. If the prop has Pre pull anim, this will be fired after the Pre anim has finished playing.": "当此道具开始播放物理引力枪拉取动作时触发，由玩家试图用物理引力枪抓取此道具引起。仅当此可破坏物所用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE 动作时才会触发。如果该道具具有拉取前动画，则将在前动画播放完毕后触发此输出。",
  "Fired when this prop has finished playing the physcannon-pull activity, caused by the player trying to grab this prop with the physcannon. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE activity is defined in the model this breakable is using. If the prop has Pre & Post pull anims, this will be fired after the Post anim has finished playing.": "当此道具完成物理引力枪拉取动作时触发，由玩家试图用物理引力枪抓取此道具引起。仅当此可破坏物所用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE 动作时才会触发。如果该道具具有拉取前和拉取后动画，则将在后动画播放完毕后触发此输出。",
  "Fired when this prop starts playing the Post physcannon-pull activity. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_POST activity is defined in the model this breakable is using.": "当此道具开始播放物理引力枪拉取后（Post）动作时触发。仅当此可破坏物所用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_POST 动作时才会触发。",
  "Metal Panel": "金属面板",
  "Precise Gib Direction": "精确碎块方向",
  "Specifies the direction to throw gibs when this breakable breaks. Be sure to select Use Precise Gib Dir in the Gibs Direction field!": "指定此可破坏物破碎时抛出碎块的方向。请务必在“碎块方向”字段中选择“使用精确碎块方向”！",
  "Gib Model": "碎块模型",
  "Used by HL1Port to specify a custom gib model to break into, overriding the 'Material Type'.": "由 HL1Port 使用，指定破碎而成的自定义碎块模型，覆盖“材质类型”。",
  "Target Path Corner": "目标路径拐点",
  "If set, the name of a path corner entity that this NPC will walk to, after spawning.": "如果设置，此 NPC 生成后将走向该路径拐点实体的名称。",
  "Hint groups are used by NPCs to restrict their hint-node searching to a subset of the map's hint nodes. Only hint nodes with matching hint group names will be considered by this NPC.": "提示组用于让 NPC 将其提示节点搜索限制在地图提示节点的子集内。此 NPC 只会考虑具有匹配提示组名称的提示节点。",
  "Hint Limit Nav": "提示限制导航",
  "Limits NPC to using specified hint group for navigation requests, but does not limit local navigation.": "限制 NPC 在导航请求时使用指定提示组，但不限制局部导航。",
  "Wait Till Seen": "等到被看见",
  "Drop Healthkit": "掉落医疗包",
  "Template NPC (used by npc_maker, will not spawn)": "模板 NPC（由 npc_maker 使用，不会生成）",
  "Sleep State": "睡眠状态",
  "Holds the NPC in stasis until specified condition. See also 'Wake Radius' and 'Wake Squad'.": "使 NPC 保持停滞，直到满足指定条件。另请参见“唤醒半径”和“唤醒小队”。",
  "Waiting for threat": "等待威胁",
  "Waiting for PVS": "等待 PVS",
  "Waiting for input, ignore PVS": "等待输入，忽略 PVS",
  "Auto PVS": "自动 PVS",
  "Auto PVS after PVS": "PVS 后自动 PVS",
  "Wake Radius": "唤醒半径",
  "Auto-wake if player within this distance": "如果玩家在此距离内则自动唤醒",
  "Wake Squad": "唤醒小队",
  "Wake all of the NPCs squadmates if the NPC is woken": "如果该 NPC 被唤醒，则唤醒其小队的所有队友",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches half of its maximum health.": "当此 NPC 生命值降至最大值一半时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC hears a sound (other than combat or the player).": "当此 NPC 听到声音（战斗或玩家以外的声音）时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC enters a sleep state.": "当此 NPC 进入睡眠状态时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC comes out of a sleep state.": "当此 NPC 从睡眠状态中醒来时触发。",
  "Fired when the NPC starts a forced interaction.": "当 NPC 开始强制互动时触发。",
  "Fired when the NPC aborts a forced interaction for some reason (target NPC died, couldn't be pathed to, etc)": "当 NPC 因某种原因中止强制互动时触发（目标 NPC 死亡、无法寻路等）",
  "NPCs in actbusies can no longer perform dynamic interactions.": "处于行动忙碌状态的 NPC 无法再执行动态互动。",
  "HACK: Sets this NPC's body group (from 0 - n). You'd better know what you are doing!": "HACK：设置此 NPC 的身体组（0 到 n）。你最好清楚自己在做什么！",
  "Wakes up the NPC if it is sleeping.": "如果 NPC 正在睡眠则将其唤醒。",
  "Force the NPC to use a dynamic interaction with another NPC. Parameter format: <target NPC name> <dynamic interaction name>": "强制该 NPC 与另一 NPC 进行动态互动。参数格式：<目标 NPC 名称> <动态互动名称>",
  "This NPC will instantly become a ragdoll with ZERO force (just go limp). OnDeath, OnHalfHealth, etc. Outputs will **NOT** BE FIRED.": "此 NPC 将立即变为零作用力的布娃娃（只是瘫软倒下）。OnDeath、OnHalfHealth 等输出将**不会**被触发。",
  "Always use radius spawn": "始终使用半径生成",
  "World: Act Busy Hint": "世界：行动忙碌提示",
  "Hint Activity": "提示动作",
  "Activity associated with this hint node. Various parts of the NPC AI play this activity at times. i.e. Actbusy nodes will play this activity when an NPC acts busy on the node.": "与此提示节点关联的动作。NPC AI 的各部分会在特定时间播放此动作。例如，当 NPC 在行动忙碌节点上忙碌时，会播放此动作。",
  "Target node": "目标节点",
  "The node ID of an associated target node, if any.": "关联目标节点的节点 ID（如有）。",
  "Map Description / Title": "地图描述/标题",
  "Chapter Title Message": "章节标题消息",
  "Chapter Title that appears onscreen when this level starts.": "此关卡开始时显示在屏幕上的章节标题。",
  "Display Game Title": "显示游戏标题",
  "Game Title that appears onscreen when this level starts.": "此关卡开始时显示在屏幕上的游戏标题。",
  "Max occludee area": "最大被遮挡体面积",
  "[Used on PC] Prevents occlusion testing for entities that take up more than X% of the screen.": "[用于 PC] 阻止对占用屏幕面积超过 X% 的实体进行遮挡测试。",
  "Min occluder area": "最小遮挡体面积",
  "[Used on PC] Prevents occluders from being used if they take up less than X% of the screen.": "[用于 PC] 阻止使用占用屏幕面积不足 X% 的遮挡体。",
  "Max occludee area (Xbox)": "最大被遮挡体面积（Xbox）",
  "[Used on 360] Prevents occlusion testing for entities that take up more than X% of the screen.": "[用于 360] 阻止对占用屏幕面积超过 X% 的实体进行遮挡测试。",
  "Min occluder area (Xbox)": "最小遮挡体面积（Xbox）",
  "[Used on 360] Prevents occluders from being used if they take up less than X% of the screen.": "[用于 360] 阻止使用占用屏幕面积不足 X% 的遮挡体。",
  "Detail.vbsp file": "Detail.vbsp 文件",
  "Detail.vbsp file to use for emitting detail props (found in directory <root>/modname)": "用于生成细节道具的 Detail.vbsp 文件（位于目录 <root>/modname 中）",
  "Detail material file": "细节材质文件",
  "Material for detail sprites to use for drawing detail props": "细节精灵用于绘制细节道具的材质",
  "World is cold": "世界为冷色调",
  "Disappear Distance": "消失距离",
  "Distance at which these brushes should fade out.": "这些画刷淡出的距离。",
  "Set whether or not these brushes should collide with other entities.": "设置这些画刷是否与其他实体碰撞。",
  "Nonsolid": "非固体",
  "Overlay Name 1": "覆盖层名称 1",
  "Name of the first overlay material to display.": "显示的第一个覆盖层材质的名称。",
  "Overlay Duration 1": "覆盖层持续时间 1",
  "Amount of time that the first overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the second overlay.": "第一个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第二个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 2": "覆盖层名称 2",
  "Name of the second overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第二个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 2": "覆盖层持续时间 2",
  "Amount of time that the second overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the third overlay.": "第二个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第三个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 3": "覆盖层名称 3",
  "Name of the third overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第三个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 3": "覆盖层持续时间 3",
  "Amount of time that the third overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the fourth overlay.": "第三个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第四个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 4": "覆盖层名称 4",
  "Name of the fourth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第四个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 4": "覆盖层持续时间 4",
  "Amount of time that the fourth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the fifth overlay.": "第四个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第五个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 5": "覆盖层名称 5",
  "Name of the fifth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第五个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 5": "覆盖层持续时间 5",
  "Amount of time that the fifth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the sixth overlay.": "第五个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第六个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 6": "覆盖层名称 6",
  "Name of the sixth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第六个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 6": "覆盖层持续时间 6",
  "Amount of time that the sixth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the seventh overlay.": "第六个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第七个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 7": "覆盖层名称 7",
  "Name of the seventh overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第七个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 7": "覆盖层持续时间 7",
  "Amount of time that the seventh overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the eighth overlay.": "第七个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第八个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 8": "覆盖层名称 8",
  "Name of the eighth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第八个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 8": "覆盖层持续时间 8",
  "Amount of time that the eighth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the ninth overlay.": "第八个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第九个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 9": "覆盖层名称 9",
  "Name of the ninth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第九个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 9": "覆盖层持续时间 9",
  "Amount of time that the ninth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the tenth overlay.": "第九个覆盖层的显示时长，之后将开始显示第十个覆盖层。",
  "Overlay Name 10": "覆盖层名称 10",
  "Name of the tenth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "显示的第十个覆盖层材质的名称。如果留空，覆盖层显示将结束，该实体会认为自己已完成。",
  "Overlay Duration 10": "覆盖层持续时间 10",
  "Amount of time that the tenth overlay should be displayed for, after which this entity will stop displaying overlays.": "第十个覆盖层的显示时长，之后该实体将停止显示覆盖层。",
  "Start displaying the first overlay.": "开始显示第一个覆盖层。",
  "Stop displaying any overlays.": "停止显示所有覆盖层。",
  "Switch to displaying a specific overlay. Pass in the desired overlay number in the parameter.": "切换为显示指定覆盖层。在参数中传入所需的覆盖层编号。",
  "Effect Type": "效果类型",
  "Which effect to use.": "使用哪种效果。",
  "Advisor Stun": "顾问眩晕",
  "Intro Blur": "开场模糊",
  "Groggy Vision": "昏眩视野",
  "Start the effect with the duration in seconds as the passed parameter.": "以传入的参数作为持续秒数来启动该效果。",
  "Stop the effect.": "停止该效果。",
  "Color emitted by this light.": "此灯发出的颜色。",
  "Intensity": "强度",
  "If this is specified, then this light will use the bump map on the particles. Each particle system can have one ambient and one directional light.": "如果指定此项，则此灯将使用粒子上的凹凸贴图。每个粒子系统可有一个环境光和一个方向光。",
  "Particle System Entity": "粒子系统实体",
  "Set this to the name of the env_smokestack that you want this light to affect.": "将此设置为你希望此灯影响的 env_smokestack 的名称。",
  "Viewer entity": "观察者实体",
  "Name of an entity used to determine where the sun is in the skybox. The sun should be lined up on a line from this entity to the env_sun entity.": "用于确定太阳在天空盒中位置的实体名称。太阳应位于从此实体到 env_sun 实体的连线上。",
  "The old way to orient env_sun is to point it at a target. The new way is to specify the angles. If you use the new way, set this property to YES.": "旧的对准 env_sun 的方式是将其指向一个目标。新方式是指定角度。如果使用新方式，请将此属性设为 YES。",
  "Sun Color (R G B)": "太阳颜色 (R G B)",
  "Overlay Color (R G B)": "覆盖层颜色 (R G B)",
  "A value of 0 0 0 will act the old way.": "值为 0 0 0 时将按旧方式工作。",
  "Overlay Size": "覆盖层大小",
  "A value of -1 means the overlay will act the old way.": "值为 -1 表示覆盖层将按旧方式工作。",
  "Material Name": "材质名称",
  "Material of the inner glow.": "内部发光的材质。",
  "Overlay Material Name": "覆盖层材质名称",
  "Material of the overlay glow.": "覆盖层发光的材质。",
  "Glow Distance Scale": "发光距离缩放",
  "Scales the distance used to test for sun glow occlusion, 0.99 will act the old way.": "缩放用于测试太阳发光遮挡的距离，0.99 将按旧方式工作。",
  "Enable sun rendering.": "启用太阳渲染。",
  "Disable sun rendering.": "禁用太阳渲染。",
  "Change the sun's color. Format: <Red 0-255> <Green 0-255> <Blue 0-255>": "更改太阳的颜色。格式：<红 0-255> <绿 0-255> <蓝 0-255>",
  "Max Ragdoll Count DX8": "DX8 最大布娃娃数量",
  "Sets the max number of ragdolls that can be in the world at a time on DX8 hardware (if they are flagged to fade). Set to -1 if you want to use the 'Max Ragdoll Count' value.": "设置 DX8 硬件上同一时间世界中最多的布娃娃数量（如果它们被标记为淡出）。若想使用“最大布娃娃数量”的值，请设为 -1。",
  "Set the Max Ragdoll Count on DX8 hardware.": "设置 DX8 硬件上的最大布娃娃数量。",
  "Max Gib Count On DX8": "DX8 最大碎块数量",
  "Sets the max number of gib that can be spawned at a time under DX8. (-1=use Max Gib Count setting)": "设置 DX8 下同一时间可生成的最大碎块数量。(-1=使用“最大碎块数量”设置)",
  "Set the max gib count under DX8.": "设置 DX8 下的最大碎块数量。",
  "Whether the effect should be active": "该效果是否应处于激活状态",
  "Near blur depth": "近处模糊深度",
  "Distance that the blurriness is at its peak near the viewpoint.": "视点附近模糊度达到峰值的距离。",
  "Near focus depth": "近处聚焦深度",
  "Distance that the focus is in full effect near the viewpoint.": "视点附近焦点完全生效的距离。",
  "Near blur radius": "近处模糊半径",
  "Radius (in pixels) to blur the surrounding pixels.": "用于模糊周围像素的半径（以像素为单位）。",
  "Far blur depth": "远处模糊深度",
  "Distance where blurriness is at its peak far from the viewpoint.": "视点远处模糊度达到峰值的距离。",
  "Far focus depth": "远处聚焦深度",
  "Distance that the focus is in full effect far from the viewpoint.": "视点远处焦点完全生效的距离。",
  "Far blur radius": "远处模糊半径",
  "Focus target": "焦点目标",
  "Entity to use as a focal point.": "用作焦点的实体。",
  "Focus target range": "焦点目标范围",
  "Distance behind the focal plane to remain in focus.": "焦平面之后保持清晰的距离。",
  "Set the distance in front of the focus region at which the scene will be completely blurred using the near blur radius. Must be smaller than NearFocusDepth.": "设置聚焦区域前方场景将使用近处模糊半径完全模糊的距离。必须小于 NearFocusDepth。",
  "The area between the near focus and far focus distances is perfectly in focus. Must be smaller than FarFocusDepth.": "近处焦点与远处焦点距离之间的区域完全清晰。必须小于 FarFocusDepth。",
  "The area between the near focus and far focus distances is perfectly in focus. Must be smaller than FarBlurDepth.": "近处焦点与远处焦点距离之间的区域完全清晰。必须小于 FarBlurDepth。",
  "Set the distance beyond the focus region at which the scene will be completely blurred using the far blur radius. Must be larger than FarFocusDepth.": "设置聚焦区域后方场景将使用远处模糊半径完全模糊的距离。必须大于 FarFocusDepth。",
  "Set the blur radius (in pixels) to use at the near blur distance. Set to 0 to disable near blur.": "设置在近处模糊距离使用的模糊半径（以像素为单位）。设为 0 可禁用近处模糊。",
  "Set the blur radius (in pixels) to use at the far blur distance. Set to 0 to disable far blur.": "设置在远处模糊距离使用的模糊半径（以像素为单位）。设为 0 可禁用远处模糊。",
  "Set the focal target for the effect.": "设置该效果的焦点目标。",
  "Set the distance behind the focal point that will remain in focus.": "设置焦点之后保持清晰的距离。",
  "Vertical Size": "垂直大小",
  "Horizontal Size": "水平大小",
  "The distance at which this effect will be fully translucent.": "此效果完全半透明的距离。",
  "The distance at which this effect will be at full intensity.": "此效果达到完全强度的距离。",
  "Outer Maximum Distance": "外部最大距离",
  "If larger than the maximum distance, this is the length at which the glow will fade completely out, between the span of the maximum distance and this length.": "如果大于最大距离，则这是发光完全淡出的长度，介于最大距离与此长度之间。",
  "Glow Proxy Geometry Size": "发光代理几何体大小",
  "Size of the glow to be rendered for visibility testing. Must be larger than the distance from the sprite center to empty space. So if this glow is inside geometry (like a light bulb), set this value to be bigger than the bulb's radius. Any time a sphere of this radius would be visible (poking through any nearby geometry), the glow will be rendered.": "为可见性测试而渲染的发光大小。必须大于从精灵中心到空白空间的距离。因此，如果此发光位于几何体内部（如灯泡），请将此值设置为大于灯泡半径。任何时候，只要这个半径的球体可见（从附近几何体中穿出），就会渲染发光。",
  "Change the render color of the glow. Format: <Red 0-255> <Green 0-255> <Blue 0-255>": "更改发光的渲染颜色。格式：<红 0-255> <绿 0-255> <蓝 0-255>",
  "Visible only from front": "仅从正面可见",
  "Reverse Fade Duration (seconds)": "反向淡出持续时间（秒）",
  "The duration of the reverse fade.": "反向淡出的持续时间。",
  "Begin doing the reverse of the current fade.": "开始执行当前淡出的反向操作。",
  "Game Material to Watch": "要监视的游戏材质",
  "The material to watch. When the player stands on/off this material, this entity's outputs will be fired.": "要监视的材质。当玩家站上/离开此材质时，将触发此实体的输出。",
  "None (player's in the air)": "无（玩家在空中）",
  "Dirt": "泥土",
  "Vent": "通风口",
  "Grate": "格栅",
  "Tile": "瓷砖",
  "Slosh": "泥水",
  "Clip": "夹层",
  "Foliage": "植物",
  "Sand": "沙子",
  "Start watching the player's surface.": "开始监视玩家所在的表面。",
  "Stop watching the player's surface.": "停止监视玩家所在的表面。",
  "Fired when the player moves onto the specified game material.": "当玩家移动到指定游戏材质上时触发。",
  "Fired when the player moves off the specified game material.": "当玩家离开指定游戏材质时触发。",
  "Revert to using the default tonemap auto exposure.": "恢复使用默认的色调映射自动曝光。",
  "Set a custom tonemap auto exposure minimum.": "设置自定义色调映射自动曝光最小值。",
  "Set a custom tonemap auto exposure maximum.": "设置自定义色调映射自动曝光最大值。",
  "Set a custom bloom scale.": "设置自定义泛光缩放。",
  "Set the rate for autoexposure adjustment.": "设置自动曝光调整速率。",
  "Set a custom bloom exponent.": "设置自定义泛光指数。",
  "Set a custom bloom saturation.": "设置自定义泛光饱和度。",
  "Set a target for percentage of pixels above a certain brightness. (default: 2)": "设置高于特定亮度的像素百分比目标。(默认：2)",
  "Set a custom brightness target for SetTonemapPercentBrightPixels. (default: 60)": "为 SetTonemapPercentBrightPixels 设置自定义亮度目标。(默认：60)",
  "Sets custom tonemapping param (ask Alex for details; default: 3).": "设置自定义色调映射参数（详情请询问 Alex；默认：3）。",
  "Start": "开始",
  "Other": "其他",
  "A ladder goes between any two func_ladderendpoints pointing at each other.": "梯子由任意两个彼此指向的 func_ladderendpoint 之间构成。",
  "Rendered Window": "渲染窗口",
  "The name of a brush model to render as the window.": "用作窗口渲染的画刷模型名称。",
  "Fade Start Distance": "淡出开始距离",
  "When the viewer is closer than this distance, the alpha is set to 'TranslucencyLimit'.": "当观察者比此距离更近时，透明度将被设为“透明度上限”。",
  "Fade End Distance": "淡出结束距离",
  "When the viewer is at this distance, the portal becomes solid and closes off.": "当观察者处于此距离时，传送门变为实体并关闭。",
  "Translucency limit": "透明度上限",
  "This value limits the translucency of the bmodel and prevents it from becoming invisible when the viewer is right on top of it.": "此值限制 bmodel 的透明度，防止当观察者紧贴其上时它变为完全不可见。",
  "Foreground bmodel": "前景 bmodel",
  "(Optional) brush model that is drawn after the fading brush model. This model should have alpha in its textures so you can see through it.": "（可选）在淡出画刷模型之后绘制的画刷模型。此模型的纹理应带有 Alpha 通道，以便能看透它。",
  "Portal Version": "传送门版本",
  "(Don't change). Differentiates between shipping HL2 maps and maps using new engine features.": "（请勿更改）。区分发行版 HL2 地图和使用新引擎特性的地图。",
  "Set fade start distance.": "设置淡出开始距离。",
  "Set fade end distance.": "设置淡出结束距离。",
  "Set this if this brush is in heirarchy with a moving object of some kind, and the player can stand on this brush.": "如果此画刷位于某种移动物体的层级结构中，且玩家可以站在此画刷上，则设置此项。",
  "Set this if this brush casts lightmap shadows.": "如果此画刷投射光照贴图阴影，则设置此项。",
  "Is Transparent?": "是否透明？",
  "Set this to true if you would like your background to be invisible instead of a black fill.": "如果希望背景不可见而非黑色填充，请将此项设为 true。",
  "Stretch to Fill": "拉伸以填满",
  "Forced slave": "强制从属",
  "Sets the movie to display.": "设置要显示的影片。",
  "Use custom UVs.": "使用自定义 UV。",
  "Start using this video as the master of it's group.": "开始将此视频用作其所在组的主控。",
  "Set the minimum U.": "设置最小 U。",
  "Set the maximum U.": "设置最大 U。",
  "Set the minimum V.": "设置最小 V。",
  "Set the maximum V.": "设置最大 V。",
  "Default animation sequence for the model to be playing after spawning.": "模型生成后播放的默认动画序列。",
  "Sets the cycler's sequence.": "设置循环展示器的序列。",
  "Select an info_lighting to specify a location to sample lighting from for all gibs spawned by this shooter, instead of their own origins.": "选择一个 info_lighting，为此发射器生成的所有碎块指定采样光照的位置，而不是使用它们各自的原点。",
  "Ember type": "火星类型",
  "Smooth Fade": "平滑淡出",
  "Pulled": "已拉动",
  "Density (particles per second)": "密度（每秒粒子数）",
  "Particle Lifetime (seconds)": "粒子寿命（秒）",
  "Particle Speed (units per second)": "粒子速度（单位/秒）",
  "Ember Color (R G B)": "火星颜色 (R G B)",
  "Reverse": "反向",
  "Bubble density": "气泡密度",
  "Bubble frequency": "气泡频率",
  "Speed of Current": "水流速度",
  "The speed of the water current in the volume, used to move the bubbles.": "体积中水流的速度，用于移动气泡。",
  "Activates the bubbles.": "激活气泡。",
  "Deactivates the bubbles.": "停用气泡。",
  "Toggles the bubbles on and off.": "切换气泡的开启与关闭。",
  "Sets the bubble density.": "设置气泡密度。",
  "Sets bubble emission rate in bubbles per second.": "设置气泡发射速率（每秒气泡数）。",
  "Sets current speed in inches per second.": "设置水流速度（英寸/秒）。",
  "Fireball Sprite": "火球精灵",
  "No Fireball": "无火球",
  "No Smoke": "无烟雾",
  "No Sparks": "无火花",
  "Random Orientation": "随机朝向",
  "No Fireball Smoke": "无火球烟雾",
  "No particles": "无粒子",
  "No DLights": "无动态光源",
  "Don't clamp Min": "不限制最小值",
  "Don't clamp Max": "不限制最大值",
  "Damage above surface only": "仅伤害表面以上部分",
  "Set max density lerp to.": "设置最大密度插值目标。",
  "Set the value the fog will scale the default value by when players are zoomed in (scoped).": "设置玩家开镜（瞄准）时雾按默认值缩放的值。",
  "Zoom Fog Scale": "开镜雾缩放",
  "How much the fog min/max values will scale the default value by when players are zoomed in (scoped).": "玩家开镜（瞄准）时雾最小/最大值按默认值缩放的程度。",
  "Particle Type": "粒子类型",
  "Heat Wave": "热浪",
  "The amount of random spread in the particle's velocity after they spawn.": "粒子生成后速度的随机散布量。",
  "The default speed at which the particles move after they spawn.": "粒子生成后移动的默认速度。",
  "The initial size of the particles after they spawn.": "粒子生成后的初始大小。",
  "The size of the particles at the point at which they are removed.": "粒子被移除时的大小。",
  "The rate of particle emission. i.e. particles per second.": "粒子发射速率，即每秒粒子数。",
  "Length of steam jet": "蒸汽喷射长度",
  "The length of the jet determines the lifetime of each particle.": "喷射长度决定了每个粒子的寿命。",
  "How fast does the particles spin": "粒子旋转的速度有多快",
  "Turns the steam jet on.": "开启蒸汽喷射。",
  "Turns the steam jet off.": "关闭蒸汽喷射。",
  "Toggles the steam jet between on and off.": "在开与关之间切换蒸汽喷射。",
  "Sets the length of steam jet.": "设置蒸汽喷射的长度。",
  "Sets the particle emission rate in particles per second.": "设置粒子发射速率（每秒粒子数）。",
  "Sets the default speed of the particles in units per second.": "设置粒子的默认速度（单位/秒）。",
  "Sets the spread speed in units per second.": "设置散布速度（单位/秒）。",
  "Thing to shoot out. Can be a .mdl or a .vmt.": "要发射的物体。可以是 .mdl 或 .vmt。",
  "Thing to shoot out.  Can be a .mdl or a .vmt.": "要发射的物体。可以是 .mdl 或 .vmt。",
  "The name of the soundscape to use. Corresponds to an entry in the soundscapes*.txt file in the hl2\\scripts directory.": "要使用的音景名称。对应 hl2\\scripts 目录下 soundscapes*.txt 文件中的条目。",
  "Automatic": "自动",
  "Automatic (dialog)": "自动（对话）",
  "Indoor": "室内",
  "Outdoor": "室外",
  "Enable the soundscape.": "启用音景。",
  "Disable the soundscape.": "禁用音景。",
  "Max gust dir change (degrees)": "最大阵风方向变化（度）",
  "Strip All Weapons First": "先移除所有武器",
  "Only Strip Same Weapon Type": "仅移除同类型武器",
  "Remove On fire": "开火时移除",
  "Kill Player": "杀死玩家",
  "Gib Player": "碎裂玩家",
  "game_team_master to use": "要使用的 game_team_master",
  "Allow Negative": "允许负值",
  "Team Points": "队伍分数",
  "Points to add (+/-)": "要增加的分数（+/-）",
  "Add score to player.": "为玩家增加分数。",
  "Text Size": "文本大小",
  "Text Size.": "文本大小。",
  "Set the message text.": "设置消息文本。",
  "Change the color of the spotlight": "更改聚光灯的颜色",
  "Force an update of the spotlight position and orientation": "强制更新聚光灯的位置和朝向",
  "Source Entity": "源实体",
  "If specified, tesla lightning will originate from the specified entity. Otherwise, they originate from this entity.": "如果指定，特斯拉闪电将从指定实体发出。否则将从该实体发出。",
  "Sound to be played whenever lightning is created.": "每次产生闪电时播放的声音。",
  "Material to use for the tesla lightning beams.": "用于特斯拉闪电光束的材质。",
  "Radius around the origin to find a point to strike with a tesla lightning beam.": "围绕原点搜索特斯拉闪电光束打击点的半径。",
  "Min # of Beams": "最小光束数",
  "Minimum number of tesla lightning beams to create when creating an arc.": "产生电弧时创建的特斯拉闪电光束的最小数量。",
  "Max # of Beams": "最大光束数",
  "Maximum number of tesla lightning beams to create when creating an arc.": "产生电弧时创建的特斯拉闪电光束的最大数量。",
  "Min Beam Width": "最小光束宽度",
  "Minimum width of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电光束的最小宽度。",
  "Max Beam Width": "最大光束宽度",
  "Maximum width of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电光束的最大宽度。",
  "Min Time Visible": "最小可见时间",
  "Minimum lifetime of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电光束的最短存在时间。",
  "Max Time Visible": "最大可见时间",
  "Maximum lifetime of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电光束的最长存在时间。",
  "Min Time Between Arcs": "两次电弧之间的最小时间",
  "Minimum time delay between random arcing.": "随机电弧之间的最小时间延迟。",
  "Max Time Between Arcs": "两次电弧之间的最大时间",
  "Maximum time delay between random arcing.": "随机电弧之间的最大时间延迟。",
  "Turn emitter on.": "开启发射器。",
  "Turn emitter off.": "关闭发射器。",
  "Force a single arc.": "强制产生一次电弧。",
  "File Name": "文件名",
  "Unlocks the filename/map combination.": "解锁该文件名/地图组合。",
  "Completes the filename/map combination.": "完成该文件名/地图组合。",
  "Saves bonus map data.": "保存奖励地图数据。",
  "Freeze Player": "冻结玩家",
  "Hide Weapon": "隐藏武器",
  "+Use Deactivates": "使用键（+Use）停用",
  "Jump Deactivates": "跳跃停用",
  "The amount of tolerance in the view checking when determining whether the player's input is still under control. 1.0 = straight ahead, 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees, -1.0 = all directions. If the player isn't within the tolerance, the player regains control.": "在判断玩家输入是否仍受控制时视线检查的容差。1.0 = 正前方，0.0 = ±90 度，-1.0 = 所有方向。如果玩家不在容差范围内，玩家将重新获得控制权。",
  "Return Player Control.": "归还玩家控制权。",
  "Take Player Control.": "取得玩家控制权。",
  "Fired whenever this entity starts controlling the player's input.": "当该实体开始控制玩家输入时触发。",
  "Fired whenever this entity stops controlling the player's input.": "当该实体停止控制玩家输入时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the moveleft key.": "当玩家按下左移键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the moveright key.": "当玩家按下右移键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the forward key.": "当玩家按下前进键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the backward key.": "当玩家按下后退键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the attack key.": "当玩家按下攻击键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the secondary attack key.": "当玩家按下次要攻击键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the moveleft key.": "当玩家松开左移键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the moveright key.": "当玩家松开右移键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the forward key.": "当玩家松开前进键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the backward key.": "当玩家松开后退键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the attack key.": "当玩家松开攻击键时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the secondary attack key.": "当玩家松开次要攻击键时触发。",
  "An output that fires whenever the X axis of the player's input changes. i.e. -1 when the player has moveleft key down, 1 when the player has moveright key down, and 0 if neither.": "每当玩家输入的 X 轴发生变化时触发的输出。例如：玩家按住左移键时为 -1，按住右移键时为 1，两者都不按则为 0。",
  "An output that fires whenever the Y axis of the player's input changes. i.e. -1 when the player has backward key down, 1 when the player has forward key down, and 0 if neither.": "每当玩家输入的 Y 轴发生变化时触发的输出。例如：玩家按住后退键时为 -1，按住前进键时为 1，两者都不按则为 0。",
  "An output that fires whenever the state of the player's attack key changes. i.e. 1 when the player has the attack key down, 0 otherwise.": "每当玩家攻击键状态变化时触发的输出。例如：玩家按住攻击键时为 1，否则为 0。",
  "An output that fires whenever the state of the player's secondary attack key changes. i.e. 1 when the player has the secondary attack key down, 0 otherwise.": "每当玩家次要攻击键状态变化时触发的输出。例如：玩家按住次要攻击键时为 1，否则为 0。",
  "Low Priority (can be replaced)": "低优先级（可被替换）",
  "Force the decal to apply itself to the world.": "强制将贴花应用到世界。",
  "Distance from the origin to project the decal.": "从原点投射贴花的距离。",
  "Brush faces": "画刷面",
  "Master (Has priority if multiple info_player_starts exist)": "主控（如果存在多个 info_player_start 则具有优先权）",
  "Material": "材质",
  "Higher values render after lower values. This value can be 0-3.": "值越高越晚渲染。此值可为 0 到 3。",
  "U Start": "U 起点",
  "U End": "U 终点",
  "V Start": "V 起点",
  "V End": "V 终点",
  "Overlay Basis Origin(Read-Only)": "覆盖层基准原点（只读）",
  "Overlay Basis U(Read-Only)": "覆盖层基准 U（只读）",
  "Overlay Basis V(Read-Only)": "覆盖层基准 V（只读）",
  "Overlay Basis Normal(Read-Only)": "覆盖层基准法线（只读）",
  "Overlay Point 1(Read-Only)": "覆盖层点 1（只读）",
  "Overlay Point 2(Read-Only)": "覆盖层点 2（只读）",
  "Overlay Point 3(Read-Only)": "覆盖层点 3（只读）",
  "Overlay Point 4(Read-Only)": "覆盖层点 4（只读）",
  "Distance at which the overlay starts to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist).": "覆盖层开始淡出的距离（<0 = 使用 fademaxdist）。",
  "Water faces": "水面",
  "Texcoord Length Start": "纹理坐标长度起点",
  "Texcoord Length End": "纹理坐标长度终点",
  "Texcoord Width Start": "纹理坐标宽度起点",
  "Texcoord Width End": "纹理坐标宽度终点",
  "Width Land": "地面宽度",
  "Width Water": "水面宽度",
  "Show Debug": "显示调试",
  "Boolean value (0 or 1).": "布尔值（0 或 1）。",
  "Force human permission": "强制人类通行权限",
  "Force small_centered permission": "强制 small_centered 通行权限",
  "Force wide_human permission": "强制 wide_human 通行权限",
  "Force tiny permissiont": "强制 tiny 通行权限",
  "Force wide_short permission": "强制 wide_short 通行权限",
  "Force medium permission": "强制 medium 通行权限",
  "Force tiny_centered permission": "强制 tiny_centered 通行权限",
  "Force large permission": "强制 large 通行权限",
  "Force large_centered permission": "强制 large_centered 通行权限",
  "Start node ID": "起始节点 ID",
  "The node ID of one end of the node connection.": "节点连接一端的节点 ID。",
  "End node ID": "结束节点 ID",
  "Type of Connection": "连接类型",
  "Jump": "跳跃",
  "Fly": "飞行",
  "Climb": "攀爬",
  "Crawl": "爬行",
  "Entity or class to allow passage even when node is off": "即使节点关闭也允许通行的实体或类名",
  "Allowed entity is the only entity NOT allowed when this is set to 'yes'": "如果设为“是”，允许的实体反而是唯一不允许通行的实体",
  "Precise Movement": "精确移动",
  "Movement through this link must be precise. Used for NPCs ": "通过此连接的移动必须精确。用于移动不够精确的 NPC ",
  "that have sloppy movement characteristics to move through things like doors or windows": "使其能够穿过门或窗户之类的东西",
  "Force human connect": "强制人类连接",
  "Force small_centered connect": "强制 small_centered 连接",
  "Force wide_human connect": "强制 wide_human 连接",
  "Force tiny connect": "强制 tiny 连接",
  "Force wide_short connect": "强制 wide_short 连接",
  "Force medium connect": "强制 medium 连接",
  "Force tiny_centered connect": "强制 tiny_centered 连接",
  "Force large connect": "强制 large 连接",
  "Force large_centered connect": "强制 large_centered 连接",
  "Force medium_tall connect": "强制 medium_tall 连接",
  "Force tiny_fluid connect": "强制 tiny_fluid 连接",
  "Turn the link on.": "开启此连接。",
  "Turn the link off.": "关闭此连接。",
  "Set this to 'Yes' if this controller is intended to control air links. ": "如果此控制器旨在控制空中连接，请将此项设为“是”。 ",
  "Air links connect using a larger search radius so leaving this at 'No' might miss some air links.": "空中连接使用更大的搜索半径进行连接，因此如果保持为“否”，可能会遗漏一些空中连接。",
  "Entity To Point At": "指向的实体",
  "The name of an entity in the map that the spotlight will point at. This will override the spotlight's angles.": "地图中聚光灯要指向的实体名称。这将覆盖聚光灯的角度。",
  "Initially dark": "初始为暗",
  "The downward pitch of the light from the sun. 0 is horizontal, -90 is straight down.": "来自太阳的光线的向下俯仰角。0 为水平，-90 为垂直向下。",
  "Ambient": "环境光",
  "Amount to scale the ambient light by when compiling for hdr.": "为 HDR 编译时环境光的缩放倍数。",
  "The angular extent of the sun for casting soft shadows. Higher numbers are more diffuse. 5 is a good starting value.": "太阳投射柔和阴影的角度范围。数值越高越漫射。5 是一个不错的起始值。",
  "Focus": "聚焦",
  "This is the shadow direction. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, and roll is the rotation around the X axis.": "这是阴影方向。Pitch 是绕 Y 轴的旋转，yaw 是绕 Z 轴的旋转，roll 是绕 X 轴的旋转。",
  "Shadow Color": "阴影颜色",
  "This is the color of the shadows.": "这是阴影的颜色。",
  "This is the maximum distance the shadow is allowed to cast, in inches.": "这是允许阴影投射的最大距离，以英寸为单位。",
  "All Shadows Disabled": "所有阴影已禁用",
  "Set the shadow color.": "设置阴影颜色。",
  "Set the shadow direction.": "设置阴影方向。",
  "Set the maximum shadow cast distance.": "设置最大阴影投射距离。",
  "Set shadows disabled state.": "设置阴影禁用状态。",
  "This is the light cast direction. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, and roll is the rotation around the X axis.": "这是光的投射方向。Pitch 是绕 Y 轴的旋转，yaw 是绕 Z 轴的旋转，roll 是绕 X 轴的旋转。",
  "Light Color": "光照颜色",
  "This is the color of the sunlight.": "这是阳光的颜色。",
  "Color Transition Time": "颜色过渡时间",
  "This is the number of seconds it takes to get from 0 to 255.": "这是从 0 到 255 所需的秒数。",
  "This is the distance of the sun, greater distances produce more orthogonal shadows.": "这是太阳的距离，距离越大产生的阴影越接近平行。",
  "This is the field of view that the sunlight casts in. Use lower values for more distant sun and sharper shadows.": "这是阳光投射的视场。太阳越远、阴影越锐利时请使用较低的值。",
  "NearZ Distance": "近 Z 距离",
  "This controls the near clipping plane's distance from the player.": "这控制近裁剪平面与玩家的距离。",
  "North Offset": "北向偏移",
  "This offsets the from the player position where the sun is attached.": "这会偏移太阳所附着的玩家位置。",
  "Texture Name": "纹理名称",
  "Enable Shadows": "启用阴影",
  "Set the light color.": "设置光照颜色。",
  "Set the sun direction.": "设置太阳方向。",
  "Set the distance of the sun.": "设置太阳的距离。",
  "Set the field of view the sun casts.": "设置太阳投射的视场。",
  "Set the near z distance.": "设置近 Z 距离。",
  "Sets the north offset.": "设置北向偏移。",
  "Set the texture cookie of the sunlight.": "设置阳光的纹理滤镜（纹理 cookie）。",
  "Set the if shadows are enabled": "设置是否启用阴影",
  "This is the shadow casting direction. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, and roll is the rotation around the X axis. (Note that pitch is negated vs. light_environment's pitch.)": "这是阴影投射方向。Pitch 是绕 Y 轴的旋转，yaw 是绕 Z 轴的旋转，roll 是绕 X 轴的旋转。（注意 pitch 与 light_environment 的 pitch 相反。）",
  "Max Shadow Distance": "最大阴影距离",
  "Maximum dynamic shadow distance. Higher values are slower, default on PC is 400 units.": "最大动态阴影距离。数值越高越慢，PC 上默认为 400 单位。",
  "Use light_environment's angles": "使用 light_environment 的角度",
  "If true, the CSM shadow angles are automatically harvested from the light_environment's angles. If false, this entity's angles are used.": "如果为 true，CSM 阴影角度将自动取自 light_environment 的角度。如果为 false，则使用该实体的角度。",
  "Sets the color.": "设置颜色。",
  "Client-side simulation": "客户端模拟",
  "The direction the water will move, when told to 'Open'.": "当被告知“打开”时水的移动方向。",
  "Position of the water brush when spawned. The range is a value between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "水画刷生成时的位置。范围为 0.0 到 1.0 之间的值，其中 0 是起始位置，1 是起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离）。",
  "The speed that the water brush moves, in inches per second.": "水画刷移动的速度，以英寸/秒为单位。",
  "The distance from the starting point that the water brush should move, in inches.": "水画刷应从起始点移动的距离，以英寸为单位。",
  "Sound played when the water brush starts moving.": "水画刷开始移动时播放的声音。",
  "Sound played when the water brush stops moving.": "水画刷停止移动时播放的声音。",
  "Wave Height": "波浪高度",
  "Move the water brush to the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "将水画刷移动到结束位置（起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离））。",
  "Move the water brush to the starting position.": "将水画刷移动到起始位置。",
  "Move the water brush to a specific position between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "将水画刷移动到 0.0 到 1.0 之间的指定位置，其中 0 是起始位置，1 是起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离）。",
  "Fired when the water brush reaches the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "当水画刷到达结束位置（起始位置 +（移动方向 * 移动距离））时触发。",
  "Fired when the water brush reaches the starting position.": "当水画刷到达起始位置时触发。",
  "Set the speed as a ratio of the specified Max Rotation Speed, where 0 is stopped and 1 is the Max Rotation Speed. Negative values rotate backwards.": "将速度设置为指定最大旋转速度的比率，其中 0 为停止，1 为最大旋转速度。负值反向旋转。",
  "Causes the func_rotating to fire its OnGetSpeed output with its current speed.": "使 func_rotating 通过其 OnGetSpeed 输出报告其当前速度。",
  "Fired when the GetSpeed input is called.  The current speed of the func_rotating is passed with this output.": "当调用 GetSpeed 输入时触发。func_rotating 的当前速度将随此输出传递。",
  "When set to Yes, the rope starts out detached from its target endpoint.": "如果设为“是”，绳子开始时与其目标端点分离。",
  "When set to yes, the rope can be detached from either endpoint when shot.": "如果设为“是”，绳子在受到射击时可从任一端点脱离。",
  "None (Silent)": "无（静音）",
  "Buzz": "嗡嗡声",
  "Buzz Off": "嗡嗡声（关闭）",
  "latch locked": "闩锁锁定",
  "Latch Unlocked": "闩锁解锁",
  "Lightswitch": "灯光开关",
  "small bleek": "短促哔声",
  "small deny": "短促拒绝声",
  "small doop": "短促嘟声",
  "small tech deny": "短促科技拒绝声",
  "click and combine screen fuzz": "点击与联合军屏幕杂音",
  "roomy beep": "宽敞哔声",
  "lever or wheel: turn + move sqeek": "杆或轮：转动 + 移动吱声",
  "lever or wheel: latch + release gas": "杆或轮：闩锁 + 释放气体",
  "lever or wheel: ratchet + sqeek": "杆或轮：棘轮 + 吱声",
  "lever or wheel: large ratchet": "杆或轮：大棘轮",
  "lever or wheel: clanky + gas release": "杆或轮：哐当声 + 气体释放",
  "lever or wheel: latch + large metal thud": "杆或轮：闩锁 + 大金属闷响",
  "lever or wheel: smaller ratchet": "杆或轮：小棘轮",
  "lever or wheel: smaller lever move": "杆或轮：小杆移动",
  "shock buzz": "电击嗡嗡声",
  "clickbeep": "点击哔声",
  "tech blip": "科技哔声",
  "clickbeepbeep open": "双击哔声（开启）",
  "small high blip": "短促高音哔声",
  "small tech fuzz blip": "短促科技杂音哔声",
  "small click bleep (change to lightswitch)": "短促点击哔声（切换为灯光开关）",
  "combine door lock - locked": "联合军门锁 - 已锁定",
  "combine blip growl": "联合军哔声低吼",
  "combine squick growl": "联合军短促低吼",
  "combine whine purr": "联合军呜咽呼噜",
  "combine click talk": "联合军点击对话",
  "combine click growl fizz": "联合军点击低吼嘶声",
  "combine click fizz (deny)": "联合军点击嘶声（拒绝）",
  "combine click talker": "联合军点击对话者",
  "Latch Locked": "闩锁已锁定",
  "Locked Sentence": "锁定语句",
  "A sentence played when the player tries to use the button, and fails because it's locked.": "当玩家尝试使用按钮但因锁定而失败时播放的语句。",
  "Gen. Access Denied": "通用拒绝访问",
  "Security Lockout": "安保锁定",
  "Blast Door": "防爆门",
  "Fire Door": "防火门",
  "Chemical Door": "化学品门",
  "Radiation Door": "辐射门",
  "Gen. Containment": "通用隔离区",
  "Maintenance Door": "维护门",
  "Broken Shut Door": "损坏关闭的门",
  "Unlocked Sentence": "解锁语句",
  "A sentence played when the button is unlocked.": "按钮解锁时播放的语句。",
  "Gen. Access Granted": "通用允许访问",
  "Security Disengaged": "安保已解除",
  "Maintenance area": "维护区域",
  "Use Look-At Limit": "使用注视限制",
  "Limit the usable look-at-angle. -1 is looking directly away, 0 is looking perpendicular, 1 is looking directly at.": "限制可用的注视角度。-1 为正对后方，0 为垂直方向，1 为正对目标。",
  "Sound played when the button is door.": "当按钮为门时播放的声音。",
  "NPCs Can't": "NPC 不可用",
  "A sentence played when the player tries to use the door, and fails because it's locked.": "当玩家尝试使用门但因锁定而失败时播放的语句。",
  "A sentence played when the door is unlocked.": "门解锁时播放的语句。",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under low end/medium end/XBox360, then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": "如果在 worldspawn 中指定了淡出，或者引擎运行在低端/中端/XBox360 配置下，则即使未指定 fademindist/fademaxdist，引擎也会强制淡出模型。",
  "Ajar Angles (Pitch Yaw Roll)": "半开角度（Pitch Yaw Roll）",
  "If the door 'Spawn Position' is set to Ajar, these are the angles to spawn at, instead of being open or closed.": "如果门的“生成位置”设置为半开，这些是生成时的角度，而不是打开或关闭状态。",
  "Ajar (use Ajar Angles)": "半开（使用半开角度）",
  "Start Breakable": "初始可破坏",
  "Glow Distance": "发光距离",
  "Does the prop glow by default?": "该道具默认是否发光？",
  "Glow Color (R G B)": "发光颜色 (R G B)",
  "The color of the glow (if enabled).": "发光的颜色（如果启用）。",
  "Fired when the door arrives at it's goal angle.": "当门到达目标角度时触发。",
  "Sets the open distance (in degrees) and moves there.": "设置打开距离（以度为单位）并移动到该位置。",
  "Starts the glow.": "开始发光。",
  "Stops the glow.": "停止发光。",
  "Cubemap Size": "立方体贴图大小",
  "(Optional) Brushes faces to directly attach to the env_cubemap. Press Pick then click on faces in the 3D View to select them. Use CTRL while clicking to add or remove from the selection.": "（可选）要直接附加到 env_cubemap 的画刷面。按下“选取”然后在 3D 视图中点击面来选择它们。点击时按住 CTRL 可添加或移除选择。",
  "Maximum number of seconds until each particle dies. Particles live for a random duration between 'Minimum Particle Lifetime' and this. Will be clamped to a max of 15.": "每个粒子死亡前的最大秒数。粒子的存活时间为“最小粒子寿命”与此值之间的随机时长。将被限制为最多 15。",
  "Minimum Particle Size": "最小粒子大小",
  "Maximum Particle Size": "最大粒子大小",
  "Affected By Wind": "受风影响",
  "When set, the dust will be affected by any env_wind entity settings in the map.": "设置后，灰尘将受地图中任何 env_wind 实体设置的影响。",
  "Particle Color1 (R G B)": "粒子颜色 1 (R G B)",
  "Particle Color2 (R G B)": "粒子颜色 2 (R G B)",
  "The material to use for the particles": "用于粒子的材质",
  "Particle Draw Width (units)": "粒子绘制宽度（单位）",
  "The size of the particles, in units/inches.": "粒子的大小，以单位/英寸为单位。",
  "Particle Spacing Distance (units)": "粒子间距（单位）",
  "The distance between the particles inside the volume. The lower the number, the denser the particles, and the more overdraw there will be. It is best to keep it as high as you can without it looking bad.": "体积内粒子之间的距离。数值越低，粒子越密集，过度绘制也越多。最好在视觉效果可接受的前提下尽可能设高。",
  "Density Ramp Speed (seconds)": "密度渐变速率（秒）",
  "Time to go from density 0 to density 1, in seconds.": "从密度 0 到密度 1 所需的时间，以秒为单位。",
  "Rotation Speed (degrees/sec)": "旋转速度（度/秒）",
  "The speed that the particles should rotate, in degrees per second.": "粒子应旋转的速度，以度/秒为单位。",
  "Movement Speed (units/sec)": "移动速度（单位/秒）",
  "The speed that the particles should move around, in units/inches per second.": "粒子应四处移动的速度，以单位/英寸每秒为单位。",
  "Density [0..1]": "密度 [0..1]",
  "Set the particle rotation speed (in degrees per second).": "设置粒子旋转速度（以度/秒为单位）。",
  "Set the particle movement speed (in inches per second).": "设置粒子移动速度（以英寸/秒为单位）。",
  "Set the particle density. It should be a range from 0 to 1.": "设置粒子密度。应在 0 到 1 的范围内。",
  "Size of the dust puff.": "灰尘团的大小。",
  "Speed at which the dust particles should move.": "灰尘粒子应移动的速度。",
  "Dust color": "灰尘颜色",
  "Spawn a dust puff.": "生成一团灰尘。",
  "Script File": "脚本文件",
  "Name of the script to use for this model.": "此模型使用的脚本名称。",
  "Entity to Look At": "注视实体",
  "Name of the entity that the camera should point at and track while active.": "相机激活时应指向并跟踪的实体名称。",
  "Target Attachment Name": "目标附件名称",
  "If set, the camera will focus on the specified attachment on the 'Entity to Look At'.": "如果设置，相机将聚焦在“注视实体”上的指定附件。",
  "The amount of time the camera should control the player's view for, after which it deactivates itself. If the camera should stay active until told to deactive, set the 'Infinite Hold Time' spawnflag.": "相机应控制玩家视角的时间，之后将自行停用。如果相机应保持激活直到被告知停用，请设置“无限保持时间”生成标记。",
  "Path Corner": "路径拐点",
  "The first path corner in a track that the camera should move along once it's activated. If not specified, the camera won't move.": "相机激活后应沿其移动的轨道上的第一个路径拐点。如果未指定，相机将不会移动。",
  "Interpolate Position To Player": "插值移动到玩家位置",
  "Gradually interpolate player's position to here on start. (Episodic only)": "开始时将玩家的位置逐渐插值到此。（仅限章节版）",
  "Start At Player": "从玩家处开始",
  "Follow Player": "跟随玩家",
  "Infinite Hold Time": "无限保持时间",
  "Snap to goal angles": "吸附到目标角度",
  "Make Player non-solid": "使玩家变为非固体",
  "Interruptable by Player": "可被玩家打断",
  "Set Fov": "设置 FOV",
  "Tracking Speed of the camera": "相机跟踪速度",
  "The speed that the camera tries to follow it's look target.": "相机尝试跟随其注视目标的速度。",
  "The FOV when using this camera.": "使用此相机时的 FOV。",
  "FOV rate": "FOV 变化速率",
  "How fast we change to the new fov.": "变更到新 FOV 的速度。",
  "The starting speed that the camera moves at, if it's on a path track.": "相机沿路径轨道移动时的起始速度。",
  "Acceleration units/sec^2": "加速度（单位/秒^2）",
  "The speed at which the camera accelerates to path corner's desired speeds.": "相机加速到路径拐点所需速度的快慢。",
  "Stop Deceleration units/sec^2": "停止减速度（单位/秒^2）",
  "The speed at which the camera decelerates to path corner's desired speeds.": "相机减速到路径拐点所需速度的快慢。",
  "Enable the point_viewcontrol, and start controlling the player's view.": "启用 point_viewcontrol，并开始控制玩家的视角。",
  "Disable the point_viewcontrol, and stop controlling the player's view.": "禁用 point_viewcontrol，并停止控制玩家的视角。",
  "Set a new target for the camera to point at.": "为相机设置新的指向目标。",
  "Set a new attachment on the target for the camera to point at.": "为相机的指向目标设置新的附件。",
  "Return the camera view to the player's eyes.": "将相机视野归还给玩家的眼睛。",
  "Teleport the player to the current position of the camera.": "将玩家传送到相机的当前位置。",
  "Set the speed that the camera will try to track it's target.": "设置相机尝试跟踪其目标的速度。",
  "Have the camera start following a new path.": "让相机开始跟随一条新路径。",
  "Fired when the point_viewcontrol deactivates, due to the Disable input being received, the Entity to Look At being destroyed, or the Hold Time expiring.": "当 point_viewcontrol 因收到 Disable 输入、“注视实体”被摧毁或保持时间到期而停用时触发。",
  "Field of view": "视场",
  "Player FOV": "玩家 FOV",
  "Seconds to reach FOV target": "达到 FOV 目标所需秒数",
  "Amount of time it should take to reach the specified FOV": "达到指定 FOV 所需的时间",
  "Entity to move to. (End of move will match origin and angles).": "要移动到的实体。（移动结束时原点和角度将与目标一致。）",
  "Target Attachment": "目标附件",
  "Optional attachment point on the entity to move to.": "目标实体上可选的附件点。",
  "Seconds to reach target entity": "到达目标实体所需秒数",
  "Amount of time it should take to reach the target entity's origin and angles.": "到达目标实体原点和角度所需的时间。",
  "Target Team": "目标队伍",
  "Which team (or all) to allow to touch this trigger.": "允许触碰此触发器的队伍（或所有队伍）。",
  "0 (Spectators)": "0（观察者）",
  "2 (T / Orange)": "2（T / 橙色）",
  "3 (CT / Blue)": "3（CT / 蓝色）",
  "Disable when move finished": "移动完成后禁用",
  "Set FOV": "设置 FOV",
  "Enable the point_viewcontrol_multiplayer, and start controlling the players' view.": "启用 point_viewcontrol_multiplayer，并开始控制玩家的视角。",
  "Disable the point_viewcontrol_multiplayer, and stop controlling the players' view.": "禁用 point_viewcontrol_multiplayer，并停止控制玩家的视角。",
  "Start the movement to the target entity.": "开始向目标实体移动。",
  "Starts the unstoppable outtro movement per each player.": "为每个玩家开始不可阻挡的片尾移动。",
  "Offset type ": "偏移类型 ",
  "How the player's view moves to the view of the camera.": "玩家视角如何移动到相机的视角。",
  "Snap to camera": "吸附到相机",
  "Ease to camera": "平滑过渡到相机",
  "Keep offset": "保持偏移",
  "Proxy Entity": "代理实体",
  "Name of the entity that the camera uses to translate the view.": "摄像机用于平移视野的实体名称。",
  "Use this attachment on the proxy's parent for position and orientation.": "使用代理父级上的此附加点来确定位置和朝向。",
  "Tilt Fraction": "倾斜比例",
  "How much the angle of the proxy affects the angle of the view. 0.0 will keep the players view angles unmodified. 1.0 will add in the whole tilt from the proxy.": "代理的角度对视角角度的影响程度。0.0 将保持玩家视角角度不变。1.0 将加入代理的全部倾斜。",
  "Use Fake Acceleration": "使用伪加速度",
  "If the player maintains an offset from the proxy apply fake acceleration on the player based on the movement of the proxy.": "如果玩家与代理保持偏移，则根据代理的移动对玩家施加伪加速度。",
  "Skew Acceleration Forward": "使加速度向前偏移",
  "If this is set fake acceleration will be more noticeable in the direction of the proxy.": "设置后，伪加速度在代理方向上会更明显。",
  "Acceleration Scalar": "加速度系数",
  "Multiply the fake acceleration by this ammount.": "将伪加速度乘以此数值。",
  "Ease Angles To Camera": "角度缓动至摄像机",
  "Move the player's angles to the camera - this will stop them from looking around.": "将玩家的角度移向摄像机——这将阻止他们四处张望。",
  "Enable the view proxy, and start modifying the player's view.": "启用视角代理，并开始修改玩家的视角。",
  "Disable the view proxy, and start modifying the player's view.": "禁用视角代理，并开始修改玩家的视角。",
  "Move the player to the view proxy.": "将玩家移动到视角代理处。",
  "Prop Name": "模型名称",
  "Name of the prop to control.": "要控制的模型名称。",
  "Pose Parameter Name": "姿势参数名称",
  "Name of the pose parameter to control.": "要控制的姿势参数名称。",
  "Pose Parameter Value": "姿势参数值",
  "Normalized value for the pose parameter from 0.0 and 1.0 (maps to min and max range).": "姿势参数的归一化数值，介于 0.0 到 1.0（映射到最小和最大范围）。",
  "Interpolation Time": "插值时间",
  "Number of seconds (0.0 to 10.0) for client to match absolue pose values.": "客户端匹配绝对姿势值所需的秒数（0.0 到 10.0）。",
  "Should wrap from 0.0 to 1.0 when interpolating.": "插值时应从 0.0 到 1.0 循环。",
  "Cycle Frequency": "循环频率",
  "Base cycles per second from -10.0 to 10.0.": "每秒基础循环次数，从 -10.0 到 10.0。",
  "Frequency Modulation Type": "频率调制类型",
  "Sine": "正弦",
  "Square": "方波",
  "Triangle": "三角波",
  "Sawtooth": "锯齿波",
  "Frequency Modulation Time Offset": "频率调制时间偏移",
  "Modulation time offset from -1.0f to 1.0.": "调制时间偏移，从 -1.0f 到 1.0。",
  "Frequency Modulation Rate": "频率调制速率",
  "Modulation cycles per second from -10.0f to 10.0.": "每秒调制循环次数，从 -10.0f 到 10.0。",
  "Frequency Modulation Amplitude": "频率调制幅度",
  "Modulation extents from 0.0f to 10.0.": "调制范围，从 0.0f 到 10.0。",
  "Sets the pose parameter to control.": "设置要控制的姿势参数。",
  "Set the pose parameter to a normalized value between 0.0 and 1.0 (maps to min and max range).": "将姿势参数设置为介于 0.0 和 1.0 之间的归一化数值（映射到最小和最大范围）。",
  "Set the interpolation time to a number of seconds between 0.0 and 10.0.": "将插值时间设置为 0.0 到 10.0 之间的秒数。",
  "Set the pose parameter's base cycles per second from -10.0f to 10.0.": "将姿势参数的每秒基础循环次数设置为 -10.0f 到 10.0。",
  "Set the type of frequency modulation.": "设置频率调制的类型。",
  "Set the modulation time offset from -1.0f to 1.0.": "将调制时间偏移设置为 -1.0f 到 1.0。",
  "Set the modulation cycles per second from -10.0f to 10.0.": "将每秒调制循环次数设置为 -10.0f 到 10.0。",
  "Set the modulation extents from 0.0f to 10.0.": "将调制范围设置为 0.0f 到 10.0。",
  "Randomize the frequency modulation by an extremeness of 0.0 to 1.0.": "以 0.0 到 1.0 的强度随机化频率调制。",
  "Only trigger once": "仅触发一次",
  "Allow fast retrigger": "允许快速重复触发",
  "Trigger the relay, causing its OnTrigger output to fire if it is enabled.": "触发此中继器，若其已启用则使其 OnTrigger 输出触发。",
  "Toggle the relay between enabled and disabled.": "在中继器的启用与禁用状态之间切换。",
  "Cancel any events fired by this relay that are currently pending in the I/O event queue.": "取消此中继器已发出且当前仍在 I/O 事件队列中等待的事件。",
  "Fired when the relay is spawned. If the relay is set to only trigger once, it will ": "在中继器生成时触发。如果中继器被设为仅触发一次，它将 ",
  "delete itself after firing this output.": "在触发此输出后删除自身。",
  "Fired when the relay is triggered. If the relay is set to only trigger once, it will ": "在中继器被触发时触发。如果中继器被设为仅触发一次，它将 ",
  "Toggle between enabled and disabled.": "在启用与禁用之间切换。",
  "Start a message from this entity using the matching OnRegisteredActivating - but the activator is the registered entity.": "使用匹配的 OnRegisteredActivating 从此实体发送消息——但激活者是已注册的实体。",
  "Stores an entity to later be used as an activator.": "存储一个实体以供稍后用作激活者。",
  "Fired to send a message using the registered as the activator.": "触发以发送消息，使用已注册的实体作为激活者。",
  "OnTrigger1 Chance": "OnTrigger1 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger1 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger1 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger2 Chance": "OnTrigger2 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger2 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger2 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger3 Chance": "OnTrigger3 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger3 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger3 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger4 Chance": "OnTrigger4 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger4 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger4 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger5 Chance": "OnTrigger5 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger5 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger5 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger6 Chance": "OnTrigger6 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger6 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger6 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger7 Chance": "OnTrigger7 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger7 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger7 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "OnTrigger8 Chance": "OnTrigger8 触发几率",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger8 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时 OnTrigger8 输出触发的几率（从 0 到 1）。",
  "Trigger this entity, causing its OnTrigger outputs to fire if it is enabled.": "触发此实体，若其已启用则使其 OnTrigger 输出触发。",
  "Toggle this entity between enabled and disabled.": "在启用与禁用状态之间切换此实体。",
  "Cancel any events fired by this entity that are currently pending in the I/O event queue.": "取消此实体已发出且当前仍在 I/O 事件队列中等待的事件。",
  "Fired when this entity is spawned. If this entity is set to only trigger once, it will ": "在此实体生成时触发。如果此实体被设为仅触发一次，它将 ",
  "This output has a chance to fire when the entity is triggered.": "实体被触发时，此输出有几率触发。",
  "Enable the timer.": "启用计时器。",
  "Disable the timer.": "禁用计时器。",
  "The first entity.": "第一个实体。",
  "The second entity.": "第二个实体。",
  "Measure target": "测量目标",
  "If the speaker is in Measuring mode, this is the name of the entity where the sound level is to be measured.": "如果扬声器处于测量模式，这是要测量声级的实体名称。",
  "Speaker target": "扬声器目标",
  "The name of an info_target entity through which to play any sounds heard by this microphone. If specified, the microphone will consider itself in Speaker mode.": "一个 info_target 实体的名称，此麦克风听到的任何声音都将通过它播放。如果指定，麦克风将认为自己处于扬声器模式。",
  "Speaker DSP Preset": "扬声器 DSP 预设",
  "Only useful in Speaker mode. If specified, when the microphone is enabled, it'll set the global dsp_speaker preset to this value. Sounds played back through speakers will then be affected by the selected DSP.": "仅在扬声器模式下有用。如果指定，当麦克风启用时，会将全局 dsp_speaker 预设设置为此值。通过扬声器播放的声音将受所选 DSP 影响。",
  "Use Default": "使用默认值",
  "1 NO EFFECT": "1 无效果",
  "2 (DUPLICATE OF 1)": "2（与 1 重复）",
  "3 (DUPLICATE OF 1)": "3（与 1 重复）",
  "4 (DUPLICATE OF 1)": "4（与 1 重复）",
  "5 (DUPLICATE OF 1)": "5（与 1 重复）",
  "6 SPEAKER, LOUDER": "6 扬声器，更响",
  "7 SPEAKER VERY SMALL": "7 非常小的扬声器",
  "8 LOUDSPEAKER, ECHO": "8 扩音器，回声",
  "9 SPEAKER SMALL": "9 小扬声器",
  "10 SPEAKER TINY": "10 微型扬声器",
  "Hears combat sounds": "听到战斗声音",
  "Hears world sounds": "听到世界声音",
  "Hears player sounds": "听到玩家声音",
  "Hears bullet impacts": "听到子弹撞击",
  "Swallows sounds routed through speakers": "吞没通过扬声器路由的声音",
  "Hears explosions": "听到爆炸声",
  "Ignores non-attenuated sounds": "忽略未衰减的声音",
  "Sensitivity (0 - 10)": "灵敏度（0 - 10）",
  "Microphone sensitivity, 0=deaf, 1=default, 10=extremely sensitive). Only applicable in Measuring mode.": "麦克风灵敏度，0=失聪，1=默认，10=极其灵敏）。仅适用于测量模式。",
  "Smoothing (0 - 1)": "平滑（0 - 1）",
  "Smoothing factor, 0=no smoothing, 1=maximum smoothing). Only applicable in Measuring mode.": "平滑系数，0=无平滑，1=最大平滑）。仅适用于测量模式。",
  "Sounds beyond this range won't be heard, irrelevant of attenuation. ": "超出此范围的声音将无法听到，与衰减无关。 ",
  "WARNING: setting this to zero (or a value > 1024) when the microphone is in Speaker mode can be very bad for performance!!": "警告：当麦克风处于扬声器模式时将其设为零（或大于 1024 的值）可能对性能非常不利！！",
  "Set the microphone to output through a different speaker entity.": "将麦克风设置为通过另一个扬声器实体输出。",
  "Fired in Measuring mode whenever the sound level changes.": "在测量模式下，每当声级变化时触发。",
  "Fired whenever a sound is routed out through the specified speaker (if any).": "每当声音通过指定的扬声器（如果有）播出时触发。",
  "Fired whenever this microphone hears any sound it cares about.": "每当此麦克风听到它关心的任何声音时触发。",
  "Set the MaxValue without firing any outputs.": "在不触发任何输出的情况下设置 MaxValue。",
  "Set the MinValue without firing any outputs.": "在不触发任何输出的情况下设置 MinValue。",
  "Movie to play": "要播放的电影",
  "Filename of the movie to play": "要播放的电影的文件名",
  "Allow User to Skip": "允许用户跳过",
  "Whether or not the user may skip the video with common keys": "用户是否可以用常用按键跳过视频",
  "Loop Video": "循环视频",
  "If set to true, the movie will loop forever": "如果设为 true，电影将无限循环",
  "Fade In Time": "淡入时间",
  "Time it takes for the video to fade in": "视频淡入所需的时间",
  "Play the movie.": "播放电影。",
  "Play the movie for all connected players.": "为所有已连接的玩家播放电影。",
  "Plays a movie with specific settings used for level transitions.  Pass the name of the movie in the parameters.  To be fired at the end of a level.": "播放一个使用关卡过渡专用设置的电影。在参数中传入电影名称。应在关卡结束时触发。",
  "Fade movies out for all players connected.": "为所有已连接的玩家淡出电影。",
  "Fired when the movie has completed playing back or was skipped by the user.": "在电影播放完成或被用户跳过时触发。",
  "Spawn an instance of the template at the original position.": "在原始位置生成模板的一个实例。",
  "Fired after spawning an instance of this template.": "在生成此模板的实例后触发。",
  "Name of the point_template to spawn here.": "要在此处生成的 point_template 的名称。",
  "If a PostSpawn Movement Speed is specified, all the entities created in the template will move in this direction.": "如果指定了生成后移动速度，模板中创建的所有实体将朝此方向移动。",
  "If in hierarchy, is spawn direction in world space, or object local space of parent": "如果在层级中，生成方向是世界空间还是父对象的局部空间",
  "Whether to negate the result of the subfilters, after combining them using the Logic Type chosen.\n": "在使用所选逻辑类型组合子过滤器后，是否取反其结果。\n",
  "Negating the outcome using the AND logic type means that any subfilter must fail for this filter to pass.\n": "使用 AND 逻辑类型取反结果意味着任何子过滤器都必须失败，此过滤器才能通过。\n",
  "Teleport the target entity.": "传送目标实体。",
  "Teleport the target entity to wherever the point_teleport entity is currently. ": "将目标实体传送到 point_teleport 实体当前所在的位置。 ",
  "The Teleport input teleports to the initial position of the point_teleport, so this input was added to avoid breaking old content.": "传送输入会传送到 point_teleport 的初始位置，因此添加此输入是为了避免破坏旧内容。",
  "Teleport the entity specified by the parameter override. Use this to teleport an entity other than the one specified in the Entity To Teleport field.": "传送由参数覆盖指定的实体。使用此输入可传送除“要传送的实体”字段中指定的实体以外的实体。",
  "Radius to constrain players to.": "将玩家约束在此半径内。",
  "Constraint Width": "约束宽度",
  "Width of the constraint edge. This is the distance in which to start slowing players down as they approach the edge of the radius.": "约束边缘的宽度。这是玩家接近半径边缘时开始减速的距离。",
  "Speed Factor": "速度系数",
  "Factor applied to the player's max speed as they approach the radius edge.": "玩家接近半径边缘时应用到其最大速度的系数。",
  "Start constraining any players within the radius.": "开始约束半径内的任何玩家。",
  "Stop constraining any players previously constrained.": "停止约束之前被约束的任何玩家。",
  "Fired when a player breaks through the constraint.": "当玩家突破约束时触发。",
  "Ignore +USE for Pickup": "拾取时忽略 +USE",
  "Use Preferred Carry Angles": "使用首选携带角度",
  "Enable motion on Physcannon grab": "Physcannon 抓取时启用运动",
  "Not affected by rotor wash": "不受旋翼气流影响",
  "Generate output on +USE ": "+USE 时产生输出 ",
  "Physgun can ALWAYS pick up. No matter what.": "Physgun 总是可以拾取。无论如何。",
  "Physgun is NOT allowed to pick this up.": "Physgun 不允许拾取此物体。",
  "Physgun is NOT allowed to punt this object.": "Physgun 不允许弹射此物体。",
  "Override Parameters": "覆盖参数",
  "A list of physics key/value pairs that are usually in a physics prop .qc file. Format is 'key,value,key,value,etc'.": "通常位于物理模型 .qc 文件中的物理键/值对列表。格式为 'key,value,key,value,etc'。",
  "Preferred Player-carry Angles": "玩家首选携带角度",
  "If the 'Use Preferred Carry Angles' spawnflag is set, this angle is the angle which the object should orient to when the player picks it up, with the physgun or +USE.": "如果设置了“使用首选携带角度”生成标记，此角度是玩家用 physgun 或 +USE 拾起物体时物体应朝向的角度。",
  "Exploitable by Player": "可被玩家利用",
  "Show this object and allow it to collide, doesn't override notsolid": "显示此物体并允许其碰撞，不会覆盖非固体设置",
  "Hide this object and stop collisions": "隐藏此物体并停止碰撞",
  "Change the collision to act like debris": "将碰撞更改为如碎屑",
  "Fired when a player picks this object up, either with the physgun or +USE.": "当玩家用 physgun 或 +USE 拾起此物体时触发。",
  "Fired when a player punts this object with the physgun.": "当玩家用 physgun 弹射此物体时触发。",
  "Fired when a player picks this object up WITH THE PHYSGUN. +USE pickups do not fire this output.": "当玩家用 PHYSGUN 拾起此物体时触发。+USE 拾取不触发此输出。",
  "Fired when a player drops this object.": "当玩家放下此物体时触发。",
  "Change mass to keep stable attachment to world": "改变质量以保持与世界的稳定连接",
  "Constraint System Manager": "约束系统管理器",
  "The name of a phys_constraintsystem that this constraint should be a part of. All constraints on a set of entities should be placed in the same system, or they will fight each other during simulation.": "此约束应属于的 phys_constraintsystem 的名称。一组实体上的所有约束应放在同一系统中，否则它们会在模拟中相互冲突。",
  "Force Limit to Break (lbs)": "断裂力限制（磅）",
  "The amount of force an impact must apply to the constraint to break it. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the constrainted objects.": "撞击必须施加到此约束上才能将其破坏的力。一种计算方法是将它设为如果静止在受约束物体上就会破坏此约束的物体的质量。",
  "Torque Limit to Break (lbs * distance)": "断裂扭矩限制（磅 × 距离）",
  "The amount of torque required to break the constraint. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "破坏此约束所需的扭矩。一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以破坏该约束所需的静力距离（距物体质心）。",
  "Additional System Iterations": "附加系统迭代次数",
  "Adding iterations makes the interactions among constraints in a system tighter.  It will not compensate for errors due to collision, but will help in cases where objects of disparate mass are constrained to each other.": "增加迭代次数可让系统中约束之间的交互更紧密。它不会补偿由碰撞导致的误差，但在质量差异悬殊的物体相互约束时会有帮助。",
  "Explodes": "爆炸",
  "The amount of damage done by the explosion created when the cannister blows up.": "罐体爆炸时产生的爆炸造成的伤害量。",
  "The radius of the explosion to create when the cannister blows up.": "罐体爆炸时产生的爆炸半径。",
  "The amount of damage the cannister takes before exploding.": "罐体在爆炸前能承受的伤害量。",
  "Thrust": "推力",
  "When the cap has been blown off, and the escaping gas is thrusting the cannister about, this is the amount of thrust generated.": "当盖子被炸飞、逸出气体推动罐体四处乱撞时，这是产生的推力大小。",
  "Fuel Seconds": "燃料秒数",
  "The amount of time that gas leaks from the cannister before being considered empty.": "气体从罐体泄漏到被视为耗尽的时间量。",
  "Smoke Color (R G B)": "烟雾颜色（R G B）",
  "Smoke Alpha (0 - 255)": "烟雾透明度（0 - 255）",
  "Thruster Sound": "推进器声音",
  "The sound played when the gas is escaping from the cannister.": "气体从罐体逸出时播放的声音。",
  "Start gas escaping from the cannister.": "开始让气体从罐体逸出。",
  "Stop gas escaping from the cannister.": "停止气体从罐体逸出。",
  "Force the cannister to explode.": "强制罐体爆炸。",
  "Wakes up the cannister, if it is sleeping.": "如果罐体正在休眠，将其唤醒。",
  "Fired when gas starts to escape from the cannister.": "当气体开始从罐体逸出时触发。",
  "Target object": "目标物体",
  "The entity whose mass center will be overridden.": "其质心将被覆盖的实体。",
  "Spring Length": "弹簧长度",
  "How long the spring would be if it was at rest (nothing hanging on it or attached). 0 means the length of the brush.": "弹簧在静止状态下（没有悬挂或连接任何东西）的长度。0 表示画刷的长度。",
  "Spring Constant": "弹簧常数",
  "Stiffness of the spring.  The larger the number the less the spring will stretch.": "弹簧的刚度。数值越大，弹簧拉伸越小。",
  "Damping Constant": "阻尼常数",
  "How much energy the spring loses.  The larger the number, the less bouncy the spring.": "弹簧损失的能量。数值越大，弹簧弹性越小。",
  "Relative Damping Constant": "相对阻尼常数",
  "The amount of energy the spring loses proportional to the relative velocity of the two objects the spring is attached to.": "弹簧损失的能量，与弹簧连接的两个物体的相对速度成正比。",
  "Break on Length": "长度断裂",
  "If the spring's length ever exceeds this length, the spring breaks.": "如果弹簧的长度超过此值，弹簧断裂。",
  "Set the Spring Constant.": "设置弹簧常数。",
  "Set the Spring Length.": "设置弹簧长度。",
  "Set the Spring Damping.": "设置弹簧阻尼。",
  "Convert Asleep": "以休眠状态转换",
  "Convert As Debris": "转换为碎屑",
  "Entity to convert": "要转换的实体",
  "Name of the entity that will be converted to a physics object when the ConvertTarget input is fired.": "当 ConvertTarget 输入触发时将被转换为物理物体的实体名称。",
  "Model Swap Entity": "模型替换实体",
  "Sets the mass when the object(s) are converted (0 means auto-calculate)": "物体被转换时设置质量（0 表示自动计算）",
  "Fires after the conversion has taken place.": "在转换完成后触发。",
  "Converts this entity's target to a physically simulated object.": "将此实体的目标转换为物理模拟物体。",
  "The amount of force necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the magnet.": "将卡住的物体从磁铁上扯下所需的力。一种计算方法是将它设为如果静止在磁铁上就会破坏此约束的物体的质量。",
  "The amount of torque necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "将卡住的物体从磁铁上扯下所需的扭矩。一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以破坏该约束所需的静力距离（距物体质心）。",
  "Override parameters": "覆盖参数",
  "Use Bounding Box": "使用边界框",
  "Screen Space Fade": "屏幕空间淡出",
  "The method by which the fading distance should be determined. If 'No', the fade distances is the distance from the player's view to the object, in inches. If 'Yes', the fade distance is the size of the object onscreen, in pixels.": "确定淡出距离的方法。如果为“否”，淡出距离是玩家视野到物体的距离（英寸）。如果为“是”，淡出距离是物体在屏幕上的大小（像素）。",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist). If 'Screen Space Fade' is selected, this represents the number of pixels wide covered by the prop when it starts to fade.": "模型开始淡出的距离（<0 = 使用 fademaxdist）。如果选择“屏幕空间淡出”，这表示模型开始淡出时覆盖的像素宽度。",
  "Maximum distance at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out). If 'Screen Space Fade' is selected, this represents the *minimum* number of pixels wide covered by the prop when it fades.": "模型可见的最大距离（0 = 不淡出）。如果选择“屏幕空间淡出”，这表示模型淡出时覆盖的*最小*像素宽度。",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under dx7 [hl2/ep1/portal] or dx8 [ep2/tf], then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": "如果你在 worldspawn 中指定了淡出，或者引擎运行在 dx7 [hl2/ep1/portal] 或 dx8 [ep2/tf] 下，即使未指定 fademindist/fademaxdist，引擎也会强制淡出模型。",
  " Numbers smaller than 1 cause the prop to fade out at further distances,": " 小于 1 的数值会使模型在更远处淡出，",
  "and greater than 1 cause it to fade out at closer distances.": "大于 1 的数值会使模型在更近处淡出。",
  "Select an info_lighting to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's origin.": "选择一个 info_lighting 来指定采样光照的位置，而不是使用此实体的原点。",
  "Disable Vertex lighting": "禁用顶点光照",
  "Disable per-vertex lighting on this object.": "禁用此物体上的逐顶点光照。",
  "Disable Self-Shadowing": "禁用自阴影",
  "When vertex lighting is enabled, prevent the geometry from self-shadowing -- casting shadows onto itself.": "启用顶点光照时，防止几何体自阴影——即向自身投射阴影。",
  "Ignore Surface Normal": "忽略表面法线",
  "When vertex lighting is enabled, ignore the surface normal of faces when calculating the vertex lighting.": "启用顶点光照时，计算顶点光照时忽略面的表面法线。",
  " Useful for thin, translucent objects such as leaves on foliage props.": " 对植物模型上叶片等细薄的半透明物体很有用。",
  "Enable Bounced Lighting": "启用反弹光照",
  "Whether VRAD should create indirect lighting from this prop.": "VRAD 是否应从此模型创建间接光照。",
  "Disable Prop Combine": "禁用模型合并",
  "Prevent this static prop from combining with any other static props in vbsp.": "防止此静态模型在 vbsp 中与任何其他静态模型合并。",
  "Uniform Scale Override": "统一缩放覆盖",
  "Resize the static prop.": "调整静态模型的大小。",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist).": "模型开始淡出的距离（<0 = 使用 fademaxdist）。",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under dx7, then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": "如果你在 worldspawn 中指定了淡出，或引擎运行在 dx7 下，即使未指定 fademindist/fademaxdist，引擎也会强制淡出模型。",
  "Default Animation": "默认动画",
  "The name of the idle animation that this prop will revert to whenever it finishes a random or forced animation.": "此模型在完成随机或强制动画后恢复到的待机动画名称。",
  "Randomly Animate": "随机动画",
  "If set, this prop will randomly choose and play animations, based upon the times specified in 'Min/Max Random Anim Time'. Inbetween the random animations, it will revert to playing the 'Default Animation'.": "如果设置，此模型将根据“最小/最大随机动画时间”中指定的时间随机选择并播放动画。在随机动画之间，它会恢复播放“默认动画”。",
  "Disable Bone Followers": "禁用骨骼跟随器",
  "If set, the prop will not use bone followers, even if it has them defined.": "如果设置，即使定义了骨骼跟随器，模型也不会使用它们。",
  "Is Autoaim Target": "是否为自动瞄准目标",
  "If set, this prop will use the autoaim feature on consoles (slower look movement when this prop is directly under the crosshair).": "如果设置，此模型将在主机上使用自动瞄准功能（当此模型位于准星正下方时，视角移动变慢）。",
  "Hold Animation": "保持动画",
  "If set, the prop will not loop its animation, but hold the last frame.": "如果设置，模型不会循环其动画，而是保持最后一帧。",
  "Min Random Anim Time": "最小随机动画时间",
  "Minimum time between random animations.": "随机动画之间的最小时间。",
  "Max Random Anim Time": "最大随机动画时间",
  "Maximum time between random animations.": "随机动画之间的最大时间。",
  "Force the prop to play an animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制模型播放一个动画。参数应为动画名称。",
  "Force the prop to play an animation unless the prop is already playing the animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制模型播放一个动画，除非模型已经在播放该动画。参数应为动画名称。",
  "Set the Default Animation to the one specified in the parameter.": "将默认动画设置为参数中指定的动画。",
  "Set the visible bodygroup, by index.": "按索引设置可见的身体组。",
  "Change into a ragdoll immediately.": "立即变为布娃娃。",
  "Fade out then remove this prop.": "淡出并移除此模型。",
  "Select a path_corner entity to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's origin.": "选择一个 path_corner 实体来指定采样光照的位置，而不是使用此实体的原点。",
  "Animate Every Frame": "每帧动画",
  "Force this prop to animate every frame. Don't use this unless you know what you are doing.": "强制此模型每帧都播放动画。除非你知道自己在做什么，否则不要使用。",
  "Prevent pickup": "禁止拾取",
  "Force server-side (Multiplayer only)": "强制服务器端（仅多人游戏）",
  "Scales damage energy when this object is hit by a physics object. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.\nSet to 1.0 for materials as strong as flesh, smaller numbers indicate stronger materials.": "当此物体被物理物体撞击时缩放伤害能量。注意：0 表示出于向后兼容性禁用此功能。\n设为 1.0 可获得与肉体一样强的材质，数值越小表示材质越强。",
  "Disable fluid/floating simulation to reduce cost.": "禁用流体/漂浮模拟以降低开销。",
  "Set this prop's body group (from 0 - n).": "设置此模型的身体组（从 0 - n）。",
  "Allow this prop to play its own sound when punted": "允许此模型在被弹射时播放自己的声音",
  "Prevent this prop from playing its own sound when punted": "禁止此模型在被弹射时播放自己的声音",
  "Fired when the player picks up the prop with the physcannon or +USE.": "当玩家用 physcannon 或 +USE 拾起模型时触发。",
  "Fired when the player drops the prop with the physcannon or USE.": "当玩家用 physcannon 或 USE 放下模型时触发。",
  "Fired whenever the player picks up this prop (with the physcannon or with +USE).": "每当玩家拾起此模型（用 physcannon 或 +USE）时触发。",
  "Allow stretch": "允许拉伸",
  "Begins ragdoll boogie effect. Parameter override = number of seconds to boogie.": "开始布娃娃扭动效果。参数覆盖 = 扭动的秒数。",
  "Name of Linked Door": "链接的门的名称",
  "(Optional) The name of a door whose open/closed state controls the on/off state of this area portal.": "（可选）一个门的名称，其开/关状态控制此区域门户的开/关状态。",
  "Open the portal. When the portal is open is can be seen through.": "打开门户。门户打开时可以透过它看到对面。",
  "Close the portal. When the portal is closed it cannot be seen through.": "关闭门户。门户关闭时无法透过它看到。",
  "Toggle the open/closed state of the portal.": "切换门户的开/关状态。",
  "Deactivate the occluder, When inactive, it can be seen through.": "停用遮挡器。停用时，可以透过它看到。",
  "Activate the occluder. When active, it cannot be seen through.": "启用遮挡器。启用时，无法透过它看到。",
  "Toggle the active/inactive state of the occluder.": "切换遮挡器的启用/停用状态。",
  "Physics damage decals": "物理伤害贴花",
  "Take damage from held objects": "承受被持物体的伤害",
  "The amount of damage the surface takes before breaking.": "表面在破碎前能承受的伤害量。",
  "Fragility": "易碎度",
  "If the 'Surface Type' is set to Glass, this value sets how fragile the glass pieces are after the surface has been broken.": "如果“表面类型”设为玻璃，此值设定表面破碎后玻璃碎片的易碎程度。",
  "Surface Type": "表面类型",
  "Shatter the window. Input a vector. First two coordinates are the X,Y center of the shattering (as values from from 0-1). The third coordinate is the radius of the shatter, in inches.": "击碎窗户。输入一个向量。前两个坐标是击碎中心的 X,Y（取值 0-1）。第三个坐标是击碎半径（英寸）。",
  "No Push": "无推动",
  "Conveyor Speed": "传送带速度",
  "Precipitation Type": "降水类型",
  "Rain": "雨",
  "Snow": "雪",
  "Ash": "灰烬",
  "Snowfall": "降雪",
  "Particle Rain": "粒子雨",
  "Particle Ash": "粒子灰烬",
  "Particle Rainstorm": "粒子暴雨",
  "Particle Snow": "粒子雪",
  "Minimum speed (snowfall only)": "最小速度（仅降雪）",
  "Maximum speed (snowfall only)": "最大速度（仅降雪）",
  "Allow Roll (Z-rot)": "允许翻滚（Z 轴旋转）",
  "(OBSOLETE, Uncheck me)": "（已废弃，取消勾选）",
  "Disable auto player movement": "禁用自动玩家移动",
  "Auto-duck while in trigger": "在触发区内自动下蹲",
  "Auto-walk while in trigger": "在触发区内自动行走",
  "Disable jump while in trigger": "在触发区内禁止跳跃",
  "Sound Operator": "声音操作器",
  "Custom Sound Volume 1": "自定义声音音量 1",
  "Custom Sound Volume 2": "自定义声音音量 2",
  "How close the player has to be looking at the target. 1.0 = straight ahead\n 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees\n -1.0 = all directions).": "玩家必须多近距离注视目标。1.0 = 正对前方\n 0.0 = +/- 90 度\n -1.0 = 所有方向）。",
  "The time, in seconds, to wait after player enters the trigger before firing the OnTimeout output, 0 = never.": "玩家进入触发区后等待的秒数，超过后触发 OnTimeout 输出，0 = 从不。",
  "Fired when the trigger is activated.": "触发器被激活时触发。",
  "Fired after the timeout interval expires if the player never looked at the target.": "如果玩家从未注视目标，超时时间过后触发。",
  "Scale force for alternate ticks": "为交替 tick 缩放作用力",
  "If nonzero, scale the force by this amount when running with alternate ticks. This fixes problems with an overly large force due to the longer frametime on when running with sv_alternateticks 1.": "如果非零，以交替 tick 运行时按此数量缩放作用力。这修复了使用 sv_alternateticks 1 运行时因更长帧时间导致作用力过大的问题。",
  "Only Falling Players": "仅限下落的玩家",
  "Only affect players if they are falling (and not pressing jump)": "仅当玩家正在下落（且未按跳跃键）时影响他们",
  "Player fall speed": "玩家下落速度",
  "Player must be falling this fast for push to happen": "玩家必须以这个速度下落推动才会发生",
  "Child Filter Name": "子过滤器名称",
  "Filter to use to see if activator's children trigger me. See filter_activator_name for more explanation.": "用于判断激活者的子实体是否触发我的过滤器。详见 filter_activator_name。",
  "Use Landmark Angles": "使用地标角度",
  "Forces the teleported object to snap to the angles of the destination landmark.": "强制被传送的物体对齐到目标地标的角度。",
  "Set a new target to teleport to.": "设置一个新的传送目标。",
  "Host NPC": "宿主 NPC",
  "Install this AddOn to the specified NPC": "将此附加组件安装到指定的 NPC",
  "Remove this AddOn from the NPC it is attached to": "从其附属的 NPC 上移除此附加组件",
  "NPC name": "NPC 名称",
  "Name to give built NPCs": "生成的 NPC 的名称",
  "Add on name": "附加组件名称",
  "Name to give built addons": "生成的附加组件的名称",
  "NPC Points": "NPC 点数",
  "Points available to spend for NPCs": "可供 NPC 消费的点数",
  "Addon Points": "附加组件点数",
  "Points available to spend for addons": "可供附加组件消费的点数",
  "Fires when an NPC is created.": "NPC 创建时触发。",
  "Fires when an NPC fails to be created.": "NPC 创建失败时触发。",
  "Fires when an Addon is created.": "附加组件创建时触发。",
  "Fires when an Addon fails to be created.": "附加组件创建失败时触发。",
  "Entity Whose Material Uses _rt_camera": "材质使用 _rt_camera 的实体",
  "The name of a point_camera entity in the map that the material should be rendered from.": "地图中一个 point_camera 实体的名称，材质将从它进行渲染。",
  "Set the camera to use. The parameter should be the name of a point_camera entity in the map.": "设置要使用的摄像机。参数应为地图中一个 point_camera 实体的名称。",
  "Fetch Event Data": "获取事件数据",
  "If set, will write the data from the event into the table 'event_data' on this entity.": "如果设置，将把事件数据写入此实体上的 'event_data' 表中。",
  "Weapon Type": "武器类型",
  "Pistol": "手枪",
  "Submachinegun": "冲锋枪",
  "Rifle": "步枪",
  "Shotgun": "霰弹枪",
  "Sniper Rifle": "狙击步枪",
  "Machinegun": "机枪",
  "C4": "C4",
  "Grenade": "手榴弹",
  "The exact weapon class name you want to check for.  i.e. weapon_deagle, weapon_awp, weapon_knife, etc.": "你要检查的确切武器类名，例如 weapon_deagle、weapon_awp、weapon_knife 等。",
  "Team 1": "队伍 1",
  "Team 2 (ORANGE)": "队伍 2（橙色）",
  "Team 3 (BLUE)": "队伍 3（蓝色）",
  "Material to modify.": "要修改的材质。",
  "Material variable to modify.": "要修改的材质变量。",
  "Fire to modify a material variable. The argument is the value to set the variable to.": "触发以修改材质变量。参数是要设置的变量值。",
  "This sets the material variable to the current time on the server.": "将材质变量设置为服务器上的当前时间。",
  "Force an animated material with the MaterialModifyAnimated proxy to play a set of animation frames. Format is: <Frame Start> <Frame End> <Frame Rate> <Loop>\nSetting <Frame End> to -1 uses the last frame of the texture. <Loop> should be 1 or 0.": "强制带 MaterialModifyAnimated 代理的动画材质播放一组动画帧。格式为：<起始帧> <结束帧> <帧率> <循环>\n将<结束帧>设为 -1 使用纹理的最后一帧。<循环>应为 1 或 0。",
  "Force a material with the MaterialModifyAnimated proxy to lerp a material var between two floating point values. Format is: <Start Value> <End Value> <Transition Time> <Loop>\n<Loop> should be 1 or 0.": "强制带 MaterialModifyAnimated 代理的材质在两个浮点值之间插值一个材质变量。格式为：<起始值> <结束值> <过渡时间> <循环>\n<循环>应为 1 或 0。",
  "Fired when a Portal player successfully places the primary portal.": "当传送门玩家成功放置主传送门时触发。",
  "Fired when a Portal player successfully places the secondary portal.": "当传送门玩家成功放置副传送门时触发。",
  "Fired when a player starts to duck.": "当玩家开始下蹲时触发。",
  "Fired when a player releases the duck button.": "当玩家松开下蹲键时触发。",
  "Fired when a player jumps.": "当玩家跳跃时触发。",
  "Change portalgun bodygroup to show potatos.": "将传送门枪身体组改为显示土豆。",
  "Change portalgun bodygroup to not show potatos.": "将传送门枪身体组改为不显示土豆。",
  "Set wether the player is allowed to drop a carried object.": "设置是否允许玩家放下携带的物体。",
  "Force the player to use the view model grab controller for all objects that are picked up.": "强制玩家对所有拾取的物体使用视图模型抓取控制器。",
  "Force the player to use the physics grab controller for all objects that are picked up.": "强制玩家对所有拾取的物体使用物理抓取控制器。",
  "Resets the grab controller used by the player to its default behavior.": "将玩家使用的抓取控制器重置为默认行为。",
  "Forces the motion blur effect on the player. Set to < 0 to disable this override.": "对玩家强制动态模糊效果。设为 < 0 可禁用此覆盖。",
  "Lifetime": "生命周期",
  "Start Width": "起始宽度",
  "End Width": "结束宽度",
  "Always Update (moving light)": "始终更新（移动光源）",
  "Near Z for projected texture": "投影纹理的近 Z 值",
  "Far Z for projected texture": "投影纹理的远 Z 值",
  "Shadow Quality": "阴影质量",
  "Quality of shadows.": "阴影的质量。",
  "Light Only Target": "仅照亮目标",
  "Limit flashlight effect to only effect target entity.": "限制手电筒效果只影响目标实体。",
  "Light World": "照亮世界",
  "Control whether flashlight effects static world geometry.": "控制手电筒是否影响静态世界几何体。",
  "Simple Projection": "简单投影",
  "Indicates if this is a simple, non-light casting texture projection": "指示这是否为简单的、不投射光照的纹理投影",
  "Scale the light color by this brightness": "按此亮度缩放光照颜色",
  "Light Color RGB-Intensity": "光照颜色 RGB-强度",
  "Amount of time it takes for a color change to occur.": "颜色变化所需的时间。",
  "Camera Space": "摄像机空间",
  "Angles are interpreted as being relative to camera.": "角度被解释为相对于摄像机。",
  "Turn on the texture": "打开纹理",
  "Turn off the texture": "关闭纹理",
  "Turn on per frame updating (for moving lights)": "开启每帧更新（用于移动光源）",
  "Turn off per frame updating (for moving lights)": "关闭每帧更新（用于移动光源）",
  "Change the light color/brightness": "更改光照颜色/亮度",
  "Turn on display of particle simulation benchmark": "开启粒子模拟基准测试的显示",
  "Turn off display of particle simulation benchmark": "关闭粒子模拟基准测试的显示",
  "Start measuring particle simulation speed": "开始测量粒子模拟速度",
  "Stop measuring particle simulation speed": "停止测量粒子模拟速度",
  "VMF Filename": "VMF 文件名",
  "Parm": "参数",
  "This is a parameter.  It goes in the form of $variable type [default value].": "这是一个参数。格式为 $变量 类型 [默认值]。",
  "This message will get relayed and will be available from the instance.": "此消息将被中继，并可从实例中访问。",
  "A message from outside can trigger this to cause something to happen in the instance.": "来自外部的消息可以触发此输出，使实例内部发生某些事情。",
  "Gamepad Bound Command": "手柄绑定命令",
  "If using 'show key bindings' for the onscreen icon, this field should be the command we want to show bindings for when gamepad is enabled (and PS3/X360)": "如果为屏幕图标使用“显示按键绑定”，此字段应是启用手柄（以及 PS3/X360）时想要显示绑定的命令",
  "The visible range of the hint.": "提示的可见范围。",
  "The event to trigger by name from modevents.res": "要按名称从 modevents.res 触发的事件",
  "Distance that the player must be before the event is generated.": "生成事件前玩家必须达到的距离。",
  "Automatically detect visibility": "自动检测可见性",
  "Generate the event on input.": "通过输入生成事件。",
  "Enabled Chance": "启用几率",
  "Percentage chance the hallucination starts enabled. 0 is always off, 100 is always on": "幻觉开始时处于启用状态的百分比几率。0 为总是关闭，100 为总是开启",
  "Visible Time": "可见时间",
  "Number of seconds the hallucination stays visible from the first frame it can be seen": "幻觉从第一帧可见起保持可见的秒数",
  "Recharge Time": "充能时间",
  "Number of seconds the hallucination stays invisible before it can be seen again. 0 to disable recharging": "幻觉保持不可见、之后才能再次被看到的秒数。0 为禁用充能",
  "Enable the hallucination algorithm": "启用幻觉算法",
  "Disable the hallucination algorithm": "禁用幻觉算法",
  "Set Visible Time": "设置可见时间",
  "Set Recharge Time": "设置充能时间",
  "The angular extent of the light for casting soft shadows. Higher numbers are more diffuse. 5 is a good starting value.": "用于投射柔和阴影的光照角度范围。数值越高越发散。5 是一个不错的起始值。",
  "Set the focal distance of the depth blur effect (in the range [0,1]).": "设置景深模糊效果的焦距（范围 [0,1]）。",
  "Set the depth blur effect strength.": "设置景深模糊效果强度。",
  "Set the screen blur effect strength.": "设置屏幕模糊效果强度。",
  "Set the film grain effect strength.": "设置胶片颗粒效果强度。",
  "Depth-blur focal plane distance [0..1]": "景深模糊焦平面距离 [0..1]",
  "Depth-blur effect strength [0..x]": "景深模糊效果强度 [0..x]",
  "Full-screen blur strength [0..1]": "全屏模糊强度 [0..1]",
  "Film grain strength [0..x]": "胶片颗粒强度 [0..x]",
  "Only Direct": "仅直接",
  "Controllable": "可控制",
  "Damage Kick": "伤害顿挫",
  "NPC Controllable": "NPC 可控制",
  "NPC Set Controller": "NPC 设置控制器",
  "Allow friendlies to hit player": "允许友军击中玩家",
  "Non-solid.": "非固体。",
  "Perfect accuracy every 3rd shot at player": "每第 3 次向玩家射击时完美命中",
  "Control Volume": "控制体积",
  "Name of a trigger the specifies the volume in which a player must be to control this tank.": "一个触发器的名称，指定玩家必须处于其中才能控制此炮塔的体积。",
  "(Team) Master": "（队伍）主机",
  "Yaw rate": "偏航速率",
  "Yaw range": "偏航范围",
  "Yaw tolerance": "偏航容差",
  "Pitch rate": "俯仰速率",
  "Pitch range": "俯仰范围",
  "Pitch tolerance": "俯仰容差",
  "Barrel Length": "炮管长度",
  "Barrel Horizontal": "炮管水平偏移",
  "Barrel Vertical": "炮管垂直偏移",
  "Smoke Sprite": "烟雾精灵图",
  "Flash Sprite": "闪光精灵图",
  "Sprite scale": "精灵图缩放",
  "Rotate Start Sound": "旋转开始声音",
  "Rotate Loop Sound": "旋转循环声音",
  "Rotate Stop Sound": "旋转停止声音",
  "Rate of Fire": "射速",
  "Damage Per Bullet": "每颗子弹伤害",
  "If set to 0, it'll use the base weapon bullet's damage.": "如果设为 0，将使用基础武器子弹的伤害。",
  "Damage Per Bullet Vs Player": "对玩家的每颗子弹伤害",
  "If set to 0, it'll use the Damage Per Bullet value.": "如果设为 0，将使用“每颗子弹伤害”的值。",
  "Firing persistence": "射击持续性",
  "(Seconds) How long to keep firing at last known position after lose sight of target": "（秒）失去目标视线后，在最后已知位置继续射击的时长",
  "Firing persistence2": "射击持续性 2",
  "(Seconds) After lost enemy and persistence time has passed, how long to occasionally fire at enemy's last known position": "（秒）失去敌人且持续时间过后，偶尔向敌人最后已知位置射击的时长",
  "Bullet accuracy": "子弹精度",
  "Perfect Shot": "完美射击",
  "Small cone": "小锥体",
  "Medium cone": "中锥体",
  "Large cone": "大锥体",
  "Extra-large cone": "特大锥体",
  "Minmum target range": "最小目标距离",
  "Maximum target range": "最大目标距离",
  "Minimum light level": "最小光照等级",
  "Gun Base Attachment": "炮基附加点",
  "If Parent is specified, this is the attachment point on the parent to aim from.": "如果指定了父级，这是父级上用于瞄准的附加点。",
  "Gun Barrel Attachment": "炮管附加点",
  "If Parent is specified, this is the attachment point on the parent to fire from. If you specify this, you'll want to specify the Gun Base Attachment too.": "如果指定了父级，这是父级上用于开火的附加点。如果指定此项，还需要同时指定炮基附加点。",
  "Gun Yaw Pose Param": "火炮偏航姿势参数",
  "If Parent + the Gun Pitch Pose Param is specified, then the gun itself will be invisible and the func_tank will steer a gun on the parent using the pose parameters.": "如果指定了父级 + 火炮俯仰姿势参数，则火炮本身将不可见，func_tank 将使用姿势参数控制父级上的火炮。",
  "Gun Yaw Pose Center": "火炮偏航姿势中心",
  "The center yaw pose parameter of the gun on the parent": "父级上火炮的中心偏航姿势参数",
  "Gun Pitch Pose Param": "火炮俯仰姿势参数",
  "If Parent + the Gun Yaw Pose Param is specified, then the gun itself will be invisible and the func_tank will steer a gun on the parent using the pose parameters.": "如果指定了父级 + 火炮偏航姿势参数，则火炮本身将不可见，func_tank 将使用姿势参数控制父级上的火炮。",
  "Gun Pitch Pose Center": "火炮俯仰姿势中心",
  "The center pitch pose parameter of the gun on the parent": "父级上火炮的中心俯仰姿势参数",
  "Ammunition Count": "弹药数量",
  "Only applies to player use. -1 = unlimited ammo.": "仅适用于玩家使用。-1 = 无限弹药。",
  "Lead Target": "预判目标",
  "NPC Man Point": "NPC 操作点",
  "Point where NPC must stand to man this func_tank.": "NPC 必须站立以操作此 func_tank 的点。",
  "Post-NPC Attack Grace Period": "NPC 攻击后宽限期",
  "If specified, NPC's manning this func tank won't fire at the player, after firing at a non-player, for this amount of time.": "如果指定，操作此炮塔的 NPC 在攻击非玩家目标后的这段时间内不会向玩家开火。",
  "Ignore Grace Upto": "忽略宽限距离",
  "The player grace period is ignored if the player's under this distance from the func_tank.": "如果玩家距炮塔小于此距离，则忽略玩家宽限期。",
  "Player Lock Time": "玩家锁定时间",
  "The tank must have the player as a target for this amount of time before it's allowed to fire.": "炮塔必须将玩家作为目标保持这段时间后才允许开火。",
  "Effect Handling": "效果处理",
  "Use Individual Settings.": "使用单独设置。",
  "AR2": "AR2",
  "Combine Cannon": "联合军加农炮",
  "Turn the tank on": "开启炮塔",
  "Turn the tank off (go dormant)": "关闭炮塔（进入休眠）",
  "How fast to fire (0 = don't fire)": "射击速度（0 = 不射击）",
  "Set the Damage Per Bullet": "设置每颗子弹伤害",
  "World position that I should aim at": "我应瞄准的世界位置",
  "Direction to aim at.": "瞄准方向。",
  "Name of entity I should follow/attack": "我应跟随/攻击的实体名称",
