  "Clear the entity I should be attacking.": "清除我应攻击的实体。",
  "Find a nearby NPC to man this func_tank.": "寻找附近的 NPC 来操作此 func_tank。",
  "Start searching for NPCs to man this func_tank.": "开始搜索可操作此 func_tank 的 NPC。",
