  "Force the NPC manning this func_tank (if any) to leave.": "强制操作此 func_tank 的 NPC（如有）离开。",
  "Set the max range of the func_tank.": "设置 func_tank 的最大射程。",
  "Fires when the tank fires its bullets": "炮塔射击子弹时触发",
