  "Fires when when target goes out of range": "当目标离开射程时触发",
  "Fires when tank runs out of ammo": "炮塔弹药耗尽时触发",
  "Fires when an NPC starts to control this tank. Players do NOT fire this input.": "当 NPC 开始控制此炮塔时触发。玩家不会触发此输入。",
  "Fires when the NPC controller of the tank stops controlling it. Players do NOT fire this input.": "当炮塔的 NPC 控制者停止控制时触发。玩家不会触发此输入。",
  "Fires when a Player starts to control this tank. NPCs do NOT fire this input.": "当玩家开始控制此炮塔时触发。NPC 不会触发此输入。",
  "Fires when the Player controller of the tank stops controlling it. NPCs do NOT fire this input.": "当炮塔的玩家控制者停止控制时触发。NPC 不会触发此输入。",
  "Fires once when the tank is done waiting to fire between rounds": "炮塔在两轮射击间隔等待结束时触发一次",
  "Ammo type": "弹药类型",
  "SMG1": "SMG1",
  "Combine Heavy Cannon": "联合军重型加农炮",
  "Ignore range when making viewcone checks": "进行视野锥检查时忽略距离",
  "Aiming Assistance (Player Only)": "瞄准辅助（仅玩家）",
  "Filter Team Number": "过滤队伍编号",
  "The team number to filter by.  If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要过滤的队伍编号。如果过滤模式为 Allow，只有队伍编号",
  "team number matches the given team will pass the filter. If the filter mode is Disallow, ": "与指定队伍匹配的实体才能通过过滤器。如果过滤模式为 Disallow，",
  "all entities EXCEPT those whose team number matches the given team will pass the filter.": "则除队伍编号与指定队伍匹配的实体之外，所有实体都能通过过滤器。",
  "Glow Style": "发光样式",
  "What style of glow should be used.": "应使用哪种发光样式。",
  "Default (through walls)": "默认（可透过墙壁）",
  "Shimmer (doesn't glow through walls)": "微光（不能透过墙壁发光）",
  "Outline (doesn't glow through walls)": "轮廓（不能透过墙壁发光）",
  "Outline Pulse (doesn't glow through walls)": "轮廓脉冲（不能透过墙壁发光）",
  "Change the glow's color. Format: <Red 0-255> <Green 0-255> <Blue 0-255>": "更改发光颜色。格式：<红 0-255> <绿 0-255> <蓝 0-255>",
  "Sets the glow red color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置发光红色通道的值（0 - 255）。",
  "Sets the glow green color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置发光绿色通道的值（0 - 255）。",
  "Sets the glow blue color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置发光蓝色通道的值（0 - 255）。",
  "Behavior Tree File": "行为树文件",
  "The behavior tree file to use for this bot ( empty = classic AI ).": "此机器人使用的行为树文件（空 = 经典 AI）。",
  "Bonus Crate?": "奖励箱？",
  "Bonus crates spawn loot that is higher than default and will not be included in the initial spawn wave collection..": "奖励箱生成的战利品高于默认值，并且不会包含在初始生成波次集合中。",
  "Forces a bonus crate to spawn on intput.": "通过输入强制生成一个奖励箱。",
  "View Mode": "视图模式",
  "Old": "旧",
  "New": "新",
  "Overrides the default radius of the c4 bomb explosion. Effective radius is 3.5x this. Max value is 2048": "覆盖 C4 炸弹爆炸的默认半径。有效半径为该值的 3.5 倍。最大值为 2048",
  "C4 Explosion Radius, Bombsite A": "C4 爆炸半径，炸弹点 A",
  "Overrides the radius of the c4 bomb explosion at bomb site A. Effective radius is this value x 3.5 units. Set to -1 to ignore.": "覆盖炸弹点 A 的 C4 炸弹爆炸半径。有效半径为该值 × 3.5 单位。设为 -1 表示忽略。",
  "C4 Explosion Radius, Bombsite B": "C4 爆炸半径，炸弹点 B",
  "Overrides the radius of the c4 bomb explosion at bomb site B. Effective radius is this value x 3.5 units. Set to -1 to ignore.": "覆盖炸弹点 B 的 C4 炸弹爆炸半径。有效半径为该值 × 3.5 单位。设为 -1 表示忽略。",
  "Fade Player Visibility Far Z": "玩家可见性淡出远 Z",
  "Fade player visibility beyond far z distance.": "在远 Z 距离之外淡出玩家可见性。",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade.": "模型开始淡出的距离。",
  "Maximum distance at which the prop is visible.": "模型可见的最大距离。",
  "If spawned from a env_entity_maker, you need to call this after spawn for it to work properly.": "如果由 env_entity_maker 生成，你需要在生成后调用此输出才能正常工作。",
  "If spawned from a env_entity_maker, you NEED to call this after spawn for it to work properly.": "如果由 env_entity_maker 生成，你必须（NEED）在生成后调用此输出才能正常工作。",
  "Activate the bomb and specify how many seconds before it explodes.": "激活炸弹并指定多少秒后爆炸。",
  "Fired when C4 is defused by a player": "当 C4 被玩家拆除时触发",
  "Fired when a player successfully begins to defuse the bomb": "当玩家成功开始拆除炸弹时触发",
  "Fired when a player starts defusing and then stops": "当玩家开始拆除然后停止时触发",
  "Sets this buyzone as enabled.": "将此购买区设置为启用。",
  "Sets this buyzone as disabled.": "将此购买区设置为禁用。",
  "Make it so only terrorist can buy from this buyzone.": "使只有恐怖分子能从此购买区购买。",
  "Make it so only CT's can buy from this buyzone.": "使只有 CT 能从此购买区购买。",
