  "Make it so no teams can buy from this buyzone (this essentially disables the buyzone).": "使所有队伍都无法从此购买区购买（这实际上会禁用购买区）。",
  "Fire output based on snd_surround_speaker cvar value": "根据 snd_surround_speaker cvar 值触发输出",
