  "Preferred Holster Attachment": "首选收枪挂接附件",
  "Fallback Holster Attachment": "后备收枪挂接附件",
  "Magazine Model": "弹匣模型",
  "Material Param Name": "材质参数名称",
  "Seed Generation Value": "种子生成值",
  "Material Groups": "材质组",
  "Material Params": "材质参数",
  "Material 0": "材质 0",
  "Material 1": "材质 1",
  "Material 2": "材质 2",
  "Material 3": "材质 3",
  "Material 4": "材质 4",
  "Inspect Model": "检视模型",

  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // 9. 按钮与组件说明 (Button & Metadata Descriptions) (共 470 条)
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  "Unit Name": "单位名称",
  "Name of the NPC Unit.": "NPC 单位的名称。",
  "NPC Properties": "NPC 属性",
  "Squad Name": "小队名称",
  "NPCs that are in the same squad (i.e. have matching squad names) will share information about enemies, and will take turns attacking and covering each other.": "处于同一小队（即小队名称相同）的 NPC 会共享敌人信息，并轮流攻击和互相掩护。",
  "Hint Groups": "提示组",
  "Comma-separated list of hint groups. Hint groups are used by NPCs to restrict their hint-node searching to a subset of the map's hint nodes. Only hint nodes with matching hint group names will be considered by this NPC. If this is empty, the NPC will only be able to use hint nodes that do not have a group.": "以逗号分隔的提示组列表。提示组用于让 NPC 将其提示节点搜索范围限制在地图提示节点的一个子集中。该 NPC 只会考虑具有匹配提示组名称的提示节点。如果留空，该 NPC 将只能使用没有组名的提示节点。",
  "Gag (No IDLE sounds until angry)": "静默（发怒前不发出待机音效）",
  "Fall to ground (unchecked means *teleport* to ground)": "落到地面（未勾选则为*传送*到地面）",
  "Efficient - Don't acquire enemies or avoid obstacles": "高效 - 不获取敌人信息，不躲避障碍物",
  "Spawn Upright - Remove any pitch / roll from the initial transform": "直立生成 - 从初始变换中移除所有俯仰/翻滚",
  "Wait For Script": "等待脚本",
  "Long Visibility/Shoot": "长视距/射击",
  "Fade Corpse": "淡出尸体",
  "Think outside PVS": "在 PVS 之外思考",
  "Do Alternate collision for this NPC (player avoidance)": "为此 NPC 使用交替碰撞（玩家避让）",
  "Don't drop weapons": "不丢弃武器",
  "Ignore player push (dont give way to player)": "忽略玩家推挤（不为玩家让路）",
  "Physics Properties": "物理属性",
  "Force Dynamic Hull": "强制动态包围盒",
  "Force this NPC to use a dynamic hull even if its vdata doesn't request it": "强制此 NPC 使用动态包围盒，即使其 vdata 未要求",
  "Physics Impact Damage Scale": "物理冲击伤害缩放",
  "Scales damage energy when this character is hit by a physics object. With a value of 0 the NPC will take no damage from physics.": "当此角色被物理对象撞击时缩放伤害能量。值为 0 时 NPC 不会受到物理伤害。",
  "Nav Restriction Volume": "导航限制体积",
  "Markup volume entity to restrict unit navigation": "用于限制单位导航的标记体积实体",
  "Preview Animation": "预览动画",
  "Name of an animation to preview in Hammer, does not do anything in game.": "在 Hammer 中预览的动画名称，在游戏中无效。",
  "AI LOD": "AI LOD",
  "Determines what AI features are enabled/disabled for performance reasons": "出于性能原因决定启用/禁用哪些 AI 功能",
  "Auto": "自动",
  "Very Low": "极低",
  "Initially Destroyed Destructible Parts": "初始即被破坏的可破坏部件",
  "Hit Group 1": "命中组 1",
  "Parts assigned to this hit group will be initialized as destructed.": "分配到此命中组的部件将被初始化为已破坏状态。",
  "Damage Level 1": "伤害等级 1",
  "Damage level to be set as fully destructed.": "被设置为完全破坏的伤害等级。",
  "Hit Group 2": "命中组 2",
  "Damage Level 2": "伤害等级 2",
  "Damage level to fully destroy.": "完全摧毁的伤害等级。",
  "Hit Group 3": "命中组 3",
  "Damage Level 3": "伤害等级 3",
  "Hit Group 4": "命中组 4",
  "Damage Level 4": "伤害等级 4",
  "Hit Group 5": "命中组 5",
  "Damage Level 5": "伤害等级 5",
  "Fired when this NPC takes damage.": "当此 NPC 受到伤害时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC has begun dying before other death-related callbacks.": "当此 NPC 开始死亡时、在其他死亡相关回调之前触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC is killed.": "当此 NPC 被击杀时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches 75% of its maximum health (even if they die).": "当此 NPC 生命值达到最大值的 75% 时触发（即使其死亡）。",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches half of its maximum health (even if they die).": "当此 NPC 生命值达到最大值的一半时触发（即使其死亡）。",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches 25% of its maximum health (even if they die).": "当此 NPC 生命值达到最大值的 25% 时触发（即使其死亡）。",
  "Fired when this NPC establishes line of sight to its enemy (outputs entity).": "当此 NPC 与其敌人建立视线时触发（输出实体）。",
  "Fired when this NPC loses line of sight to its enemy.": "当此 NPC 失去与其敌人的视线时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC loses its enemy. Usually due to the enemy being killed/removed, or because this NPC has selected a newer, more dangerous enemy.": "当此 NPC 失去其敌人时触发。通常是由于敌人被击杀/移除，或此 NPC 选择了更新的、更危险的敌人。",
  "Fired when this NPC loses line of sight to its enemy, and that enemy is a player.": "当此 NPC 失去与其敌人的视线且该敌人是玩家时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC loses its enemy, and that enemy was a player. Usually due to the enemy being killed/removed, or because this NPC has selected a newer, more dangerous enemy.": "当此 NPC 失去其敌人且该敌人是玩家时触发。通常是由于敌人被击杀/移除，或此 NPC 选择了更新的、更危险的敌人。",
  "Fired when this NPC is hurt by a player.": "当此 NPC 被玩家伤害时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC is hurt by a player OR by one of the player's squadmates.": "当此 NPC 被玩家或玩家小队成员伤害时触发。",
  "Fired when this NPC has refused to join the player's squad.": "当此 NPC 拒绝加入玩家小队时触发。",
  "Fired when a player +Uses this npc.": "当玩家 +使用（+Use）此 NPC 时触发。",
  "Fired when ANYTHING calls Use on this npc (such as other NPCs).": "当任何对象对此 NPC 调用使用（Use）时触发（例如其他 NPC）。",
  "Overrides this entity's health, ignoring max health constraints. This is for prototyping only and all uses of this input should be audited before shipping! Values <=0 are ignored.": "覆盖此实体的生命值，忽略最大生命值限制。此功能仅用于原型制作，发布前应审查此输入的所有用法！小于等于 0 的值将被忽略。",
  "Changes this entity's relationship with another entity or class. Format: <entityname/classname> <D_HT/D_FR/D_LI/D_NU> <priority>": "更改此实体与另一个实体或类的关系。格式：<entityname/classname> <D_HT/D_FR/D_LI/D_NU> <priority>",
  "Set this NPC's health.": "设置此 NPC 的生命值。",
  "Sets NPC bodygroup. Format is <BodygroupName,index> ": "设置 NPC 主体组。格式为 <BodygroupName,index> ",
  "Sets the value that scales damage energy when this character is hit by a physics object. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.": "设置当此角色被物理对象撞击时缩放伤害能量的值。注意：0 表示此功能被禁用（为向后兼容）。",
  "Ignite, burst into flames": "点燃，燃起火焰",
  "Ignite, with a parameter lifetime.": "点燃，参数为持续时间。",
  "Ignite, with a parameter number of hitbox fires.": "点燃，参数为点燃的命中盒数量。",
  "Ignite, with a parameter hitbox fire scale.": "点燃，参数为命中盒火焰缩放。",
  "Extinguish ourself if we're on fire": "如果我们在燃烧则熄灭自己",
  "Break, smash into pieces": "破碎，碎裂成碎片",
  "Set the name of this NPC's squad. It will be removed from any existing squad automatically. Leaving the parameter blank will remove the NPC from any existing squad.": "设置此 NPC 小队的名称。它将自动从任何现有小队中移除。参数留空将把该 NPC 从任何现有小队中移除。",
  "Set an easing parameter Format: <name=value>": "设置缓动参数，格式：<name=value>",
  "Set the nav restriction volume. Parameter is the name of the target markup volume. Empty parameter will clear the nav restriction.": "设置导航限制体积。参数为目标标记体积的名称。参数为空将清除导航限制。",
  "An entity that creates NPCs. The NPCs it creates are clones of a template NPC. NPCs are spawned around this maker's origin, or at specified destination points.": "一个创建 NPC 的实体。它创建的 NPC 是模板 NPC 的克隆。NPC 在此生成器的原点周围生成，或在指定的目标点生成。",
  "Don't preload template models": "不预加载模板模型",
  "Name of template NPC": "模板 NPC 的名称",
  "Template NPC that this maker should be creating clones of.": "此生成器应克隆的模板 NPC。",
  "Use Sentence": "使用语句",
  "Un-Use Sentence": "停止使用语句",
  "Don't Use Speech Semaphore": "不使用语音信号量",
  "Friendly NPCs are not allowed to speak if another friendly NPC is speaking. In some cases we don't want speaking NPCs to prevent other NPCs from speaking (for instance, if there is a friendly NPC speaking for a long time on a monitor). To make this NPC not prevent other NPCs from talking, make it not grab the semaphore when it speaks.": "当另一个友方 NPC 正在说话时，友方 NPC 不允许说话。在某些情况下，我们不希望正在说话的 NPC 阻止其他 NPC 说话（例如，某个友方 NPC 长时间在监视器上说话）。要让此 NPC 不阻止其他 NPC 说话，请让它在说话时不占用信号量。",
  "No (Use speech semaphore)": "否（使用语音信号量）",
  "Yes (Don't use speech semaphore)": "是（不使用语音信号量）",
  "Cancel any speech that the NPC is currently speaking.": "取消该 NPC 当前正在说的任何语音。",
  "Generic Actor NPC": "通用角色 NPC",
  "Hull type": "包围盒类型",
  "Human": "人类",
  "Wide": "宽",
  "Tiny": "微小",
  "Large": "大型",
  "Act as a Flyer?": "作为飞行单位？",
  "No, obey gravity": "否，遵循重力",
  "Yes, don't apply gravity on spawn": "是，生成时不施加重力",
  "Friendly NPC? (Prevent Player Attacking)": "友方 NPC？（阻止玩家攻击）",
  "Set for the NPC to notify the game is it friendly and players should not be allowed to attack it": "设置后该 NPC 会通知游戏它是友方，且不允许玩家攻击它",
  "An entity used for non-NPCs that need to synchronise their animation with an NPC in a scripted_sequence. Usually a piece": "一个供非 NPC 实体使用的实体，需要在 scripted_sequence 中与 NPC 同步动画。通常是一段",
  "of furniture or door that an NPC needs to manipulate within a scripted_sequence.": "NPC 需要在 scripted_sequence 中操作的家具或门。",
  "Model": "模型",
  "Disable collisions against the player.": "禁用与玩家的碰撞。",
  "Enable collisions against the player.": "启用与玩家的碰撞。",
  "Has Animated Face": "具有动画面部",
  "Does this entity have an animated face?": "此实体是否有动画面部？",
  "Furniture Physics": "家具物理",
  "Create (kinematic) physics for the furniture. (By default npc_furniture is nonsolid to avoid unintentional interactions with any co-actors.)": "为家具创建（运动学）物理。默认情况下 npc_furniture 是非实心的，以避免与任何协同实体产生意外的交互。",
  "Lighting Origin": "光照原点",
  "Select an entity to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's origin.": "选择一个实体来指定采样光照的位置，而不是使用此实体的原点。",
  "Invulnerable": "无敌",
  "If enabled, this will have a ton of health and will not allow damage.": "如果启用，它将拥有大量生命值并且不允许受到伤害。",
  "Hierarchy": "层级",
  "Parent": "父级",
  "The name of this entity's parent in the movement hierarchy. Entities with parents move with their parent.": "此实体在移动层级中的父级名称。有父级的实体会随其父级移动。",
  "Parent Bone/Attachment Name": "父级骨骼/挂点名称",
  "The name of the bone or attachment to attach to on the entity's parent in the movement hierarchy. Use !bonemerge to use bone-merge style attachment. NOTE: If this is specified the Hammer transform will be disregarded, even if 'Use Local Transform' is NOT specified (in that case local transform will be identity)": "在移动层级中要附加到实体父级上的骨骼或挂点名称。使用 !bonemerge 可进行骨骼合并式附加。注意：如果指定了此项，即使未指定“使用局部变换”，Hammer 变换也会被忽略（此时局部变换将为单位变换）",
  "Reposition the entity's Hammer transform to match its local offset hierarchy keys": "将实体的 Hammer 变换重新定位以匹配其局部偏移层级键值",
  "Update the local offset hierarchy keys based on the entity's current Hammer transform": "根据实体当前的 Hammer 变换更新局部偏移层级键值",
  "Use Local Transform": "使用局部变换",
  "Whether to respect the specified local offset when doing the initial hierarchical attachment to its parent.": "在初始附加到父级时是否遵循指定的局部偏移。",
  "Local Origin": "局部原点",
  "Offset in the local space of the parent model's attachment/bone to use in hierarchy. Not used if you are not using parent attachment.": "在层级中使用的父级模型挂点/骨骼局部空间中的偏移。未使用父级挂点时无效。",
  "Local Angles": "局部角度",
  "Angular offset in the local space of the parent model's attachment/bone to use in hierarchy. Not used if you are not using parent attachment.": "在层级中使用的父级模型挂点/骨骼局部空间中的角度偏移。未使用父级挂点时无效。",
  "Local Scale": "局部缩放",
  "Scale in the local space of the parent model's attachment/bone to use in hierarchy. Not used if you are not using parent attachment.": "在层级中使用的父级模型挂点/骨骼局部空间中的缩放。未使用父级挂点时无效。",
  "Change this entity to attach to a specific attachment point on its parent. Entities must be parented before being sent this input. The parameter passed in should be the name of the attachment.": "更改此实体以附加到其父级上的特定挂点。实体在被发送此输入前必须已被父级化。传入的参数应为挂点名称。",
  "Change this entity to attach to a specific attachment point on it's parent. Entities must be parented before being sent this input. The parameter passed in should be the name of the attachment. The entity will maintain it's position relative to the parent at the time it is attached.": "更改此实体以附加到其父级上的特定挂点。实体在被发送此输入前必须已被父级化。传入的参数应为挂点名称。实体将保持附加时相对于父级的位置。",
  "Removes this entity from the the movement hierarchy, leaving it free to move independently.": "将此实体从移动层级中移除，使其可以独立移动。",
  "Bone merges this entity to a parent entity. Call again passing nothing to end the bone merge.": "将此实体骨骼合并到父级实体。再次调用且不传参数可结束骨骼合并。",
  "World Model": "世界模型",
  "Render Properties": "渲染属性",
  "Skin": "皮肤",
  "Some models have multiple versions of their textures, called skins.": "一些模型有多种纹理版本，称为皮肤。",
  "Body Groups": "主体组",
  "Cast Shadows": "投射阴影",
  "Used to disable shadow casting from this entity.": "用于禁用此实体的阴影投射。",
  "Enabled": "启用",
  "No Shadows": "无阴影",
  "Only Realtime Shadows": "仅实时阴影",
  "Only Baked Shadows": "仅烘焙阴影",
  "Changes the model skin to the specified number.": "将模型皮肤更改为指定编号。",
  "Turn shadow off.": "关闭阴影。",
  "Turn shadow on.": "开启阴影。",
  "Used to attempt to fix sorting problems when rendering. True activates, false deactivates": "用于尝试修复渲染时的排序问题。true 为激活，false 为停用",
  "Set the value of a render attribute used in material dynamic expressions. Examples: $myfloat=0.25 $myfloat4=1.0,0.0,1.0,1.0": "设置材质动态表达式中使用的渲染属性的值。示例：$myfloat=0.25 $myfloat4=1.0,0.0,1.0,1.0",
  "Remove a render attribute previously set by SetRenderAttribute, restoring it to its previous value.": "移除之前由 SetRenderAttribute 设置的渲染属性，将其恢复为之前的值。",
  "Fired when this object catches fire.": "当此对象着火时触发。",
  "Add Attribute": "添加属性",
  "Will add an additional attribute that AI/player entities can query when checking props for information (ex: 'DogToy' or 'GrabbableResource')": "将添加一个额外属性，AI/玩家实体在检查 Prop 信息时可以查询（例如：“DogToy”或“GrabbableResource”）",
  "Add Modifier": "添加修改器",
  "Will add this modifier when the entity spawns.": "实体生成时将添加此修改器。",
  "A very simple model entity that has animations and response rules.": "一个非常简单的模型实体，具有动画和响应规则。",
  "Max Followup Dist": "最大后续距离",
  "A 'then ANY' followup on a response from this orator will dispatch to characters up to this many units away. Leave 0 to mean that even an infinitely distant character may respond.": "此演说者响应的“then ANY”后续会分发到此距离单位数以内的角色。留 0 表示即使距离无限远的角色也可以响应。",
  "Turns an entity, or set of entities, into a single template that can be instanced anywhere, and multiple times. ": "将一个或一组实体转换为单个模板，可在任意位置实例化，且可多次实例化。 ",
  "If there are interdependencies (entity I/O, hierarchy, or other name references) between the entities ": "如果模板中的实体之间存在相互依赖（实体 I/O、层级或其他名称引用），",
  "in the template, the entities in the template will have their names changed and the interdependencies will ": "模板中的实体名称将被更改，相互依赖关系将",
  "be reconnected to the changes names. The name change format is as follows: '<original name>&0000', where the 0000 ": "重新连接到更改后的名称。名称更改格式如下：“<original name>&0000”，其中 0000 ",
  "will be replaced with the current global template instance, so wildcard searches for '<original name>*' will still find them.<br><br>": "将被替换为当前全局模板实例编号，因此通配符搜索“<original name>*”仍能找到它们。<br><br>",
  "If you don't want the name fixup to happen because you're only spawning the template once, or you want inputs to ": "如果你不希望进行名称修正（例如你只生成该模板一次，或你希望输入触发模板的所有实例），",
  "trigger all instances of the template, check the 'Preserve entity names' spawnflag.<br><br>": "请勾选“保留实体名称”生成标记。<br><br>",
  "To spawn the template in other places, use an env_entity_maker.": "要在其他位置生成模板，请使用 env_entity_maker。",
  "Don't remove template entities": "不移除模板实体",
  "Preserve entity names (Don't do name fixup)": "保留实体名称（不进行名称修正）",
  "Asynchronous Spawn": "异步生成",
  "Allows you to asynchronously spawn the entities referred to by the point_template, which will happen at some point later after all dependent resources are downlaoded from UGC servers + asynch streamed in. Asynch point templates have the benefit that they don't precache resources that we never spawn.": "允许你异步生成 point_template 引用的实体，这将在所有依赖资源从 UGC 服务器下载完成并异步流入之后的某个时刻发生。异步点模板的好处是不会预缓存从未生成的资源。",
  "The amount of seconds after which, if any client hasn't finished streaming the necessary assets, that client is disconnected and the template spawns anyways. Only used in asynchronous point_templates. 0 means use some reasonable default set in the code.": "如果任何客户端未完成流式加载必要资源，经过此秒数后该客户端将被断开连接，模板仍然生成。仅用于异步点模板。0 表示使用代码中设置的合理默认值。",
  "Entity Filter Name": "实体过滤器名称",
  "Name of an entity filter that can be run on the entities in the template to modify, add, or remove the entities. These filters can be defined in code or in script.": "可对模板中的实体运行以修改、添加或移除实体的实体过滤器名称。这些过滤器可以在代码或脚本中定义。",
  "Spawn Group Type": "生成组类型",
  "Spawn into point_template's spawn group": "生成到 point_template 的生成组中",
  "Spawn into the currently active spawn group": "生成到当前激活的生成组中",
  "Spawn into a newly created spawn group": "生成到新建的生成组中",
  "Client Only Entity Behavior": "仅客户端实体行为",
  "This controls the behavior of client only entities spawned by the point_template. Either you can create them only for clients that are currently connected at the point the point_template is spawned (good for transient things like explosions), or you can create them for clients who connect after the point_template is spawned. This behavior only affects point_templates that create their own spawn groups.": "控制 point_template 生成的仅客户端实体的行为。你可以只为在 point_template 生成时已连接的客户端创建它们（适合爆炸等瞬态效果），也可以为在 point_template 生成之后连接的客户端创建它们。此行为仅影响创建自己生成组的 point_template。",
  "Only create for clients connected at the time at which point_template spawns its contents": "只为在 point_template 生成其内容时已连接的客户端创建",
  "Create for clients who connect after the point_template spawns its contents": "为在 point_template 生成其内容之后连接的客户端创建",
  "Template 1": "模板 1",
  "Template 2": "模板 2",
  "Template 3": "模板 3",
  "Template 4": "模板 4",
  "Template 5": "模板 5",
  "Template 6": "模板 6",
  "Template 7": "模板 7",
