  "Static Prop": "静态 Prop",
  "Content": "内容",
  "Adds a static model": "添加一个静态模型",
  "Tint Color": "着色颜色",
  "Material Group": "材质组",
  "Some props have multiple matieral variations called Material Groups, here you can see what material groups are available for selection.": "一些 Prop 有多种材质变体，称为材质组。在这里你可以看到该模型有哪些可选的材质组。",
  "Collision": "碰撞",
  "Collision Type": "碰撞类型",
  "Override Collision Property": "覆盖碰撞属性",
  "If a value is selected, it will be applied as the collision property to all of the phsyics shapes generated by this instance of the model, overriding any values specified in the model.": "如果选择了某个值，它将作为碰撞属性应用于此模型实例生成的所有物理形状，覆盖模型中指定的任何值。",
  "Lighting Type": "光照类型",
  "Selects whether to use lightmapping or lightprobes for this mesh. Note: Selecting light probes will disable mesh merging/batching, creating extra draw calls. To merge lightprobed meshes, enable the Bake to World parameter.": "选择此网格使用光照贴图还是光照探针。注意：选择光照探针将禁用网格合并/批处理，产生额外的绘制调用。要合并使用光照探针的网格，请启用 Bake to World 参数。",
  "Lightmapped": "光照贴图",
  "Lightprobed": "光照探针",
  "Selects the type of shadows that should be cast from this prop_static.": "选择此 prop_static 应投射的阴影类型。",
  "Prop will cast static shadows, unless something forces dynamic shadows (eg Render With Dynamic)": "Prop 将投射静态阴影，除非有东西强制使用动态阴影（例如 Render With Dynamic）",
  "Prop will cast no shadows": "Prop 将不投射任何阴影",
  "Only Baked": "仅烘焙",
  "Prop will only cast shadows into the lightmap, it will not cast dynamic shadows": "Prop 只会将阴影投射到光照贴图中，不会投射动态阴影",
  "Only Dynamic": "仅动态",
  "Prop will only cast dynamic shadows, it will not cast shadows into the lightmap": "Prop 只会投射动态阴影，不会将阴影投射到光照贴图中",
  "Emissive": "自发光",
  "Allow this prop to emit lighting. Note that this only works on materials with Self Illum parameters, and is only visible in the GPU Path Tracing Preview and in the final lightmap bake.": "允许此 Prop 发射光照。注意：这仅对带有自发光（Self Illum）参数的材质有效，且仅在 GPU 路径追踪预览和最终光照贴图烘焙中可见。",
  "Emissive Boost": "自发光增强",
  "Used to boost emissive lighting from a mesh. Note that boosting emissive on smaller meshes can create more lighting artifacts/noise.": "用于增强网格的自发光照明。注意：在较小的网格上增强自发光可能产生更多光照瑕疵/噪点。",
  "Lightmap Scale Bias": "光照贴图缩放偏差",
  "Used to scale the resolution of the lightmap for this mesh.": "用于缩放此网格光照贴图的分辨率。",
  "Scale down by 8": "缩小 8 倍",
  "Scale down by 4": "缩小 4 倍",
  "Scale down by 2": "缩小 2 倍",
  "Default (no scale)": "默认（不缩放）",
  "Scale up by 2": "放大 2 倍",
  "Scale up by 4": "放大 4 倍",
  "Scale up by 8": "放大 8 倍",
  "Bake As Double-Sided": "按双面烘焙",
  "Bakes the mesh as if it were double-sided geometry in the lightmapper. Useful on geometry with 'Render Backfaces' enabled via it's material (such as foliage). When the lightmapper sees many and/or large backfaces it will invalidate lightmap samples as an optimization, which can lead to lightmap errors/reduced quality in some circumstances.": "在光照贴图烘焙器中将此网格按双面几何体烘焙。对通过材质启用了“渲染背面”的几何体（如植被）很有用。当光照贴图烘焙器看到较多和/或较大的背面时，会作为优化使光照贴图采样失效，这在某些情况下可能导致光照贴图错误/质量下降。",
  "If true this geometry is used as an occluder for precomputed visibility. As a rule this geometry should be as simplistic as possible": "如果为 true，此几何体将用作预计算可见性的遮挡体。通常此几何体应尽可能简单",
  "Material Override ": "材质覆盖 ",
  "This will override all materials on a selected mesh with a specific material": "这将用特定材质覆盖所选网格上的所有材质",
  "Render LOD": "渲染 LOD",
  "Auto for standard LOD behaviour, or select an explicit LOD to use. Note that LODs take up more room in the lightmap and do not merge, potentially making them less performant if used on many objects (Set to Auto).": "Auto 为标准 LOD 行为，或选择要使用的显式 LOD。注意：LOD 在光照贴图中占用更多空间且不会合并，如果在许多对象上使用（设为 Auto），可能会降低性能。",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (-1 = use fademaxdist).": "Prop 开始淡出的距离（-1 = 使用 fademaxdist）。",
  "Build Settings": "构建设置",
  "Force Bake To World": "强制烘焙到世界",
  "If true mesh will be baked/merged into the world geometry of the map so that the model is not referenced at runtime. Use this if you want light probed static meshes to merge": "如果为 true，网格将被烘焙/合并到地图的世界几何体中，运行时不再引用该模型。如果你想让使用光照探针的静态网格合并，请使用此项",
  "Disable Mesh Merging": "禁用网格合并",
  "If true this will not be merged with other geometry during map compile (reduces rendering efficiency).": "如果为 true，在地图编译期间将不会与其他几何体合并（降低渲染效率）。",
  "Render with Dynamic Objects": "与动态对象一起渲染",
  "Render this object with other dynamic objects": "将此对象与其他动态对象一起渲染",
  "Dynamic Prop": "动态 Prop",
  "Adds a dynamic model - use this for models that have animation or movement": "添加一个动态模型——对具有动画或移动的模型使用此项",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations and/or simulate cloth. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage. ": "一种可放置在层级中的 Prop，可以播放动画和/或模拟布料。它还可以配置为在受到足够伤害时破碎。 ",
  "Note that the health of the object will be overridden by the health inside the model, to ensure consistent health game-wide. ": "注意，对象的生命值将被模型内部的生命值覆盖，以确保全游戏生命值一致。 ",
  "If the model used by the prop is configured to be used as a prop_physics (i.e. it should be physically simulated) then it CANNOT be ": "如果该 Prop 使用的模型被配置为 prop_physics（即应进行物理模拟），则它不能",
  "used as a prop_dynamic. Upon level load it will display a warning in the console and remove itself. Use a prop_physics instead.": "用作 prop_dynamic。在关卡加载时它将在控制台显示警告并自行移除。请改用 prop_physics。",
  "Cloth Scale": "布料缩放",
  "Cloth scale (stretch) relative to model scale. Use to stretch (not scale) the model, e.g. to reuse a single rope model when different lengths of the rope needed.": "布料缩放（拉伸）相对于模型缩放。用于拉伸（而非缩放）模型，例如在需要不同长度的绳索时复用单个绳索模型。",
  "or other constraints. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage. ": "或其他约束。它还可以配置为在受到足够伤害时破碎。 ",
  "If the model used by the prop is configured to be used as a prop_dynamic (i.e. it should not be physically simulated) then it CANNOT be ": "如果该 Prop 使用的模型被配置为 prop_dynamic（即不应进行物理模拟），则它不能",
  "used as a prop_physics. Upon level load it will display a warning in the console and remove itself. Use a prop_dynamic instead.": "用作 prop_physics。在关卡加载时它将在控制台显示警告并自行移除。请改用 prop_dynamic。",
  "Cubemap for sampling indirect specular reflection.": "用于采样间接镜面反射的立方体贴图。",
  "Influence Radius": "影响半径",
  "The radius of influence for this cubemap": "此立方体贴图的影响半径",
  "Edge Fade": "边缘淡出",
  "Light Units": "光照单位",
  "Units": "单位",
  "Brightness Units": "亮度单位",
  "Lumens": "流明",
  "Legacy": "旧版",
  "Brightness (EV)": "亮度 (EV)",
  "Legacy brightness value": "旧版亮度值",
  "Direct Light": "直接光照",
  "Direct Lighting Type": "直接光照类型",
  "How direct lighting should be represented: Static=Fully baked into lightmap (cheapest), Stationary=Dynamic direct light with baked shadows, Dynamic=Fully dynamic (Most expensive)": "直接光照的表示方式：Static=完全烘焙到光照贴图（最省），Stationary=带烘焙阴影的动态直接光，Dynamic=完全动态（开销最大）",
  "Static": "静态",
  "Stationary": "固定",
  "Dynamic": "动态",
  "Color Mode": "颜色模式",
  "How to calculate the light's color": "如何计算光的颜色",
  "Color Temperature": "色温",
  "Color Temperature (K)": "色温 (K)",
  "Brightness (Lumens)": "亮度（流明）",
  "Brightness in lumens. (See Light Units group for alternative units of measurement).": "以流明为单位的亮度。（其他测量单位请参见光照单位组。）",
  "Range": "范围",
  "Clamps the distance that a light can reach.": "限制光照可以到达的距离。",
  "Far Falloff": "远端衰减",
  "Controls the light falloff based on the set Range.": "基于设定的范围控制光照衰减。",
  "Near Falloff": "近端衰减",
  "Controls the light falloff from the light source.": "控制从光源处开始的光照衰减。",
  "Indirect Light": "间接光照",
  "Indirect Light Type": "间接光照类型",
  "How indirect (bounce) light should be computed": "间接（反弹）光的计算方式",
  "Baked": "烘焙",
  "Indirect Light Multiplier": "间接光照倍增",
  "Increases the intensity of indirect (bounce) light": "增加间接（反弹）光的强度",
  "Light Source": "光源",
  "Light Source Type": "光源类型",
  "Point or area light shapes. Point produces sharp shadows whereas Disk and Rectangle are area lights, with shadow softness/falloff influenced by the Area Light Size/Width.": "点光源或面光源形状。点光源产生锐利的阴影，而圆盘和矩形是面光源，其阴影柔和度/衰减受面光源尺寸/宽度影响。",
  "Disk (Area Light)": "圆盘（面光源）",
  "Rectangle (Area Light)": "矩形（面光源）",
  "Area Light Size": "面光源尺寸",
  "Light source area size, this affects how light/shadows are diffused as they falloff from the light source - Larger sizes produce softer lighting. NOTE: Light Source Type: Point ignores this setting as it is not an area light": "光源区域大小，这会影响光/阴影从光源衰减时的扩散程度——尺寸越大光照越柔和。注意：光源类型为点光源时忽略此设置，因为它不是面光源",
  "Area Light Width": "面光源宽度",
  "Scales the light source shape non-uniformly in x/y. NOTE: Light Source Type: Point ignores this setting as it is not an area light": "在 x/y 方向非均匀缩放光源形状。注意：光源类型为点光源时忽略此设置，因为它不是面光源",
  "Light Shape": "光源形状",
  "Aperture Size(x,y,angle)": "孔径尺寸(x,y,角度)",
  "Controls the size & shape of the barn light's aperture, allowing for emulation of many different light types.": "控制泛光灯孔径的大小和形状，可用于模拟多种不同的灯具类型。",
  "Aperture Shape": "孔径形状",
  "Blends between a circular or rectangular aperture": "在圆形或矩形孔径之间混合",
  "Aperture Softness X": "孔径柔和度 X",
  "Aperture Softness Y": "孔径柔和度 Y",
  "Angle Shear": "角度剪切",
  "Skews the light angle in x/y.": "在 x/y 方向偏斜光照角度。",
  "Cookie": "光斑遮罩",
  "Choose a light cookie texture (.vtex) to represent your light shape.": "选择一个光斑遮罩纹理 (.vtex) 来表示你的光照形状。",
  "Specular": "镜面反射",
  "Bake Specular to Cubemaps": "将镜面反射烘焙到立方体贴图",
  "Bake specular into cubemaps. Only works when Direct Lighting Type is set to Baked.": "将镜面反射烘焙到立方体贴图中。仅在直接光照类型设置为烘焙时有效。",
  "Disk": "圆盘",
  "Rectangle": "矩形",
  "Bake Specular to Cubemaps Size": "将镜面反射烘焙到立方体贴图的尺寸",
  "Bake Specular to Cubemaps Scale": "将镜面反射烘焙到立方体贴图的缩放",
  "Specular Softness": "镜面反射柔和度",
  "USE WITH CAUTION: Artificially softens direct specular (not cubemaps) to simulate cheap, soft area lights. Note: Direct Lighting must be set to Stationary or Dynamic for this to have an effect.": "谨慎使用：人为柔化直接镜面反射（非立方体贴图），以模拟廉价的柔和面光源。注意：必须将直接光照设置为固定或动态，此项才会生效。",
  "Shadows": "阴影",
  "Whether this light casts shadow": "此光照是否投射阴影",
  "Static & Dynamic": "静态与动态",
  "Static Only": "仅静态",
  "Shadow Map Resolution": "阴影贴图分辨率",
  "Shadow Priority": "阴影优先级",
  "Transmit Shadow Casters to Client": "将阴影投射者传输给客户端",
  "When this light is visible to a player, add its shadow casters to the player's PVS.": "当此光照对玩家可见时，将其阴影投射者添加到玩家的 PVS。",
  "Shadow Fade Out Start Size": "阴影淡出开始尺寸",
  "Screen size where the shadows will begin fading out": "阴影开始淡出的屏幕尺寸",
  "Shadow Fade Out End Size": "阴影淡出结束尺寸",
  "Screen size where the shadows will be fully faded out": "阴影完全淡出的屏幕尺寸",
  "Render": "渲染",
  "Render Light in Cubemaps": "在立方体贴图中渲染光照",
  "If true, illumination from this light renders into baked cube maps.": "如果为 true，此光照的照明将渲染到烘焙的立方体贴图中。",
  "Scale brightness by this amount, used for scripting direct light behaviour. NOTE: Only works on lights with Direct Lighting type set to Dynamic or Stationary.": "按此数量缩放亮度，用于脚本控制直接光照行为。注意：仅对直接光照类型设置为动态或固定的光照有效。",
  "Light Fade Out Start Size": "光照淡出开始尺寸",
  "Screen size where the light will begin fading out": "光照开始淡出的屏幕尺寸",
  "Light Fade Out End Size": "光照淡出结束尺寸",
  "Screen size where the light will be fully faded out": "光照完全淡出的屏幕尺寸",
  "Always Transmit to Clients": "始终传输给客户端",
  "Allows large lights to transmit to clients as a workaround for going out of PVS due to sv_pvs_max_distance being set too close.": "允许大型光照传输到客户端，作为因 sv_pvs_max_distance 设置过近而超出 PVS 的临时解决方案。",
  "Style": "样式",
  "Light Style": "光照样式",
  "Style Output Event 0": "样式输出事件 0",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent0 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent0 输出的事件名称。",
  "Style Output Event 1": "样式输出事件 1",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent1 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent1 输出的事件名称。",
  "Style Output Event 2": "样式输出事件 2",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent2 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent2 输出的事件名称。",
  "Style Output Event 3": "样式输出事件 3",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent3 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent3 输出的事件名称。",
  "Style Target 0": "样式目标 0",
  "Sets $light_emissive for use in material expressions. The emissive geometry's surface area should be approximately equal to the area light's surface area.": "设置 $light_emissive 以供材质表达式使用。自发光几何体的表面积应大致等于面光源的表面积。",
  "Style Target 1": "样式目标 1",
  "Style Target 2": "样式目标 2",
  "Style Target 3": "样式目标 3",
  "Volumetric": "体积",
  "Volumetric Lighting": "体积光照",
  "Volumetric Shadows": "体积阴影",
  "Volumetric Shadow Mode": "体积阴影模式",
  "Use \"Cast Shadows\" Setting": "使用“投射阴影”设置",
  "No Volumetric Shadows": "无体积阴影",
  "Static & Dynamic Volumetric Shadows": "静态与动态体积阴影",
  "Static Volumetric Shadows": "静态体积阴影",
  "Fog Strength Multiplier": "雾强度倍增",
  "Logarithmic Fog Brightness Multiplier": "对数雾亮度倍增",
  "Candelas": "坎德拉",
  "Nits": "尼特",
  "Brightness in candelas": "以坎德拉为单位的亮度",
  "Brightness in nits": "以尼特为单位的亮度",
  "Logarithmic Brightness": "对数亮度",
  "Falloff": "衰减",
  "Light Falloff based on set range.": "基于设定范围的光照衰减。",
  "Increases the intensity of a lights' Indirect (bounce) light": "增加光照的间接（反弹）光强度",
  "Shape of the light": "光照的形状",
  "Light Size": "光照尺寸",
  "Note: Larger sizes produce more diffuse light/shadows.": "注意：尺寸越大，光/阴影越漫射。",
  "Artificially softens direct specular (not cubemaps) to simulate cheap, soft area lights. Note: Direct Lighting must be set to Stationary or Dynamic for this to have an effect.": "人为柔化直接镜面反射（非立方体贴图），以模拟廉价的柔和面光源。注意：必须将直接光照设置为固定或动态，此项才会生效。",
  "Render Light Geometry": "渲染光照几何体",
  "Render the light geometry in the world": "在世界中渲染光照几何体",
  "A sphere or tube shaped light": "球形或管状光源",
  "Increases the intensity of a lights' Indirect (bounce) light.": "增加光照的间接（反弹）光强度。",
  "Sphere": "球形",
  "Tube": "管状",
  "Tube with end caps": "带端盖的管状",
  "Outer Angle": "外角度",
  "Used to creat hemispherical light shapes.": "用于创建半球形光照形状。",
  "Inner Angle": "内角度",
  "In-map team select position.": "地图内队伍选择位置。",
  "In-map terrorist team intro variant #1.": "地图内恐怖分子队伍介绍变体 #1。",
  "In-map terrorist team intro variant #2.": "地图内恐怖分子队伍介绍变体 #2。",
  "In-map counter-terrorist team intro variant #1.": "地图内反恐精英队伍介绍变体 #1。",
  "In-map counter-terrorist team intro variant #2.": "地图内反恐精英队伍介绍变体 #2。",
  "In-map terrorist wingman intro.": "地图内恐怖分子搭档模式介绍。",
  "In-map counter-terrorist wingman intro.": "地图内反恐精英搭档模式介绍。",
  "In-map end-of-match position.": "地图内比赛结束位置。",
  "Solid Color Extended": "纯色（扩展）",
  "Solid Color Case Hardening": "纯色淬火",
  "HydroGraphic Extended": "水转印（扩展）",
